hadiths[2809]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main qayamat ke din jannat ke darwaze par aaunga aur darwaza khulwaunga to khazin puchega ke aap kaun hain? Main kahunga: Muhammad. Wo kahega ke mujhe aap hi ke baare mein hukm diya gaya tha ke aap se pehle kisi ke liye darwaza na kholun."
"2","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ne pehli nabuwat ke kalaam mein se jo aakhri baat payi wo ye hai ke jab tujh mein haya na rahe to jo chahe kar."
"3","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se aakhir mein hashr mein Muzaina qabile ke do charwahe uthenge jo apni bakriyon ko hankte hue Madina ka qasd karenge aur use ujra hua payenge, yahan tak ke jab Saniyyat-ul-Wida par pahunchenge to apne munhon ke bal gir padenge."
"4","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein sab se aakhir mein dakhil hone wala wo shakhs hoga jo pul-sirat par chalega; kabhi chalega, kabhi thokar khayega aur kabhi aag use jhulas degi. Phir jab us se paar ho jayega to us ki taraf mur kar kahega: Paak hai wo zaat jis ne mujhe tujh se nijaat di, beshak Allah ne mujhe aisi cheez ata ki hai jo awwalin o aakhirin mein se kisi ko ata nahi ki. Phir us ke saamne aik darakht zahir kiya jayega to wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe is darakht ke qareeb kar de taake main us ke saye mein aaraam karun aur us ke pani se piyun. Allah farmayega: Ae ibn Adam, shayad agar main tujhe ye de dun to tu mujh se is ke siwa aur mange? Wo kahega: Nahi ae mere Rab. Aur us se ehad karega ke is ke siwa aur kuch na mange ga, aur us ka Rab use uzr par samjhega kyunke wo aisi cheez dekh raha hoga jis par sabr na kar sakega. Pas Allah use us ke qareeb kar dega aur wo us ke saye mein aaraam karega aur us ke pani se piyega. Phir us ke saamne aik aur darakht zahir kiya jayega jo pehle se zyada khubsurat hoga to wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe is ke qareeb kar de taake main us ke pani se piyun aur us ke saye mein aaraam karun, is ke siwa tujh se kuch na mangun ga. Allah farmayega: Ae ibn Adam, kiya tune mujh se ehad nahi kiya tha ke is ke siwa mujh se kuch na mange ga? Wo kahega ke shayad agar main tujhe is ke qareeb kar dun to tu mujh se is ke siwa aur mange? Pas wo us se ehad karega ke is ke siwa aur kuch na mange ga, aur us ka Rab use uzr par samjhega kyunke wo aisi cheez dekh raha hoga jis par sabr na kar sakega. Pas Allah use us ke qareeb kar dega aur wo us ke saye mein aaraam karega aur us ke pani se piyega. Phir us ke saamne jannat ke darwaze ke paas aik darakht zahir kiya jayega jo pehle donon se zyada khubsurat hoga to wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe is ke qareeb kar de taake main us ke saye mein aaraam karun aur us ke pani se piyun, is ke siwa tujh se kuch na mangun ga. Allah farmayega: Ae ibn Adam, kiya tune mujh se ehad nahi kiya tha ke is ke siwa mujh se kuch na mange ga? Wo kahega: Kyun nahi ae mere Rab, mujhe is ke qareeb kar de, is ke siwa tujh se kuch na mangun ga. Aur us ka Rab use uzr par samjhega kyunke wo aisi cheez dekh raha hoga jis par sabr na kar sakega. Pas Allah use us ke qareeb kar dega, aur jab use us ke qareeb karega to wo jannat walon ki aawazein sunega aur kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe is mein dakhil kar de. Allah farmayega: Ae ibn Adam, tujh se mera khulasa kiya cheez karayegi? Kiya tu is par raazi hai ke main tujhe duniya aur us ke saath us jaisi aur dun? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, kiya Tu mujh se mazaq karta hai halanke Tu Rabbul Aalamin hai? Allah farmayega: Main tujh se mazaq nahi karta lekin main jo chahun us par qadir hun."
"5","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood khane wala aur khilane wala aur us ka likhne wala aur us ke donon gawah jabke wo ye jaante hon, aur husn ke liye godne wali aur godwane wali, aur sadqe ko rok-phair karne wala, aur hijrat ke baad dehat ki taraf laut jane wala murtad, ye sab qayamat ke din Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki zaban se maloon hain."
"6","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aise khata hun jaise banda khata hai. Pas qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar duniya Allah ke nazdeek machchar ke par ke barabar bhi wazn rakhti to wo us mein se kafir ko aik ghoont bhi na pilata."
"7","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aise khata hun jaise banda khata hai aur aise baithta hun jaise banda baithta hai."
"8","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aise khata hun jaise banda khata hai aur aise baithta hun jaise banda baithta hai, kyunke main sirf aik banda hun."
"9","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum faqr se darte ho? Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, tum par duniya khoob undeli jayegi yahan tak ke tum mein se kisi ka dil na dagmagayega magar usi ki wajah se jo dagmagaye, aur Allah ki qasam maine tumhein aisi roshan raah par chhora hai jis ki raat aur din barabar hain."
"10","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein chaar baaton ka hukm deta hun aur chaar se mana karta hun: Allah wahdah par iman ka hukm deta hun, kiya tum jaante ho Allah wahdah par iman kiya hai? Gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, namaz qaim karna, zakaat dena, Ramazan ke roze rakhna aur ghanimat mein se panchwan hissa ada karna; aur tumhein duba, naqeer, hantam aur muzaffat se mana karta hun. Inhein yaad rakho aur apne peeche walon ko in ki khabar do."
"11","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein chaar baaton ka hukm deta hun aur chaar se mana karta hun: Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, namaz qaim karo, zakaat do, Ramazan ke roze rakho aur ghanimat mein se panchwan hissa do; aur chaar cheezon se mana karta hun: duba, hantam, muzaffat aur naqeer se."
"12","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein teen baaton ka hukm deta hun aur teen se mana karta hun: hukm deta hun ke Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, sab mil kar Allah ki rassi ko mazboot thaame raho aur tafarraqa na karo, aur us ki suno aur itaat karo jise Allah ne tumhare muamle ka zimmedar banaya ho; aur mana karta hun qeel o qaal se, kasrat-e-sawal se aur maal zaya karne se."
"13","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton se un ke apne muamle mein mashwara karo, kyunke sayyiba apne baare mein khul kar baat karti hai aur kunwari ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai."
"14","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yateem ladki se us ke apne baare mein ijazat lo, aur us ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai."
"15","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman ki nishani Ansar se mohabbat hai aur nifaq ki nishani Ansar se bughz hai."
"16","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Munafiq ki teen nishaniyan hain: jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab wada kare to khilaf-warzi kare aur jab amanat supurd ki jaye to khayanat kare."
"17","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni kheti mein jahan se chahe aa, aur jab khud khaye to use khila, jab khud pehne to use pehna, chehre ko bura na kah aur mat maar."
"18","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zaitun ke tail ko salan banao aur use lagao, kyunke wo mubarak darakht se nikalta hai."
"19","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is darakht yani zaitun ko salan banao, aur jise khushbu pesh ki jaye to us mein se le."
"20","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dawat par bulaye jao to dawat qabool karo."
"21","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton ko ijazat do ke raat ko masjid mein namaz parhne aayen."
"22","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton ko raat ko masjdon mein aane ki ijazat do."
"23","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne inkar farmaya hai ke momin ke qatil ke liye tauba rakhe."
"24","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur mominon ko ye gawara nahi ke ae Abu Bakr tumhari mukhalifat ki jaye."
"25","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tujh se is par baiat leta hun ke tu Allah ki ibadat kare, us ke saath kisi ko shareek na kare, farz namaz qaim kare, zakaat de, har Musalman ki khair-khwahi kare aur shirk se bezaari ikhtiyar kare."
"26","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tum se is par baiat leta hun ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, chori na karo, zina na karo, apni auladon ko qatl na karo, apne haathon aur pairon ke darmiyan gharr kar koi buhtan na lao, aur maroof mein meri nafarmani na karo. Pas tum mein se jis ne wafa ki us ka ajr Allah par hai, aur jis ne in mein se koi gunah kiya phir duniya mein us par saza jari ho gayi to wo us ke liye kaffara aur taharat hai, aur jise Allah ne chhupa liya to us ka muamla ¤ Allah azza wa jal ki taraf hai, agar chahe use azab de aur agar chahe use bakhsh de."
"27","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us se shuru karo jis ki parwarish tumhare zimme hai."
"28","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne aap se shuru karo aur apne upar sadqa karo, phir jo bach rahe to apne ghar walon par, phir jo ghar walon se bach rahe to apne rishtedaron par, phir jo rishtedaron se bach rahe to aise hi aage barhte jao."
"29","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zuhar ko thanda karke parho."
"30","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zuhar ko thanda karke parho, kyunke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai."
"31","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khushkhabri ho ae Ammar, tumhein baaghi giroh qatl karega."
"32","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush raho, kyunke Allah taala farmata hai: Ye meri aag hai jise main duniya mein apne momin bande par musallat karta hun taake qayamat ke din wo aag mein se us ka hissa ban jaye."
"33","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khushkhabriyan hasil karo, kyunke Allah ki tum par naimaton mein se ye hai ke is waqt tumhare siwa logon mein se koi ye namaz nahi parh raha."
"34","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush raho, kyunke ye Quran, us ka aik sira Allah ke haath mein hai aur aik sira tumhare haathon mein, pas use mazboot thaame raho, kyunke tum us ke baad na halak hoge na gumrah hoge."
"35","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khushkhabri do aur apne peeche walon ko khushkhabri do ke jo sachche dil se gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"36","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush raho, ye tumhara Rab hai jis ne aasman ke darwazon mein se aik darwaza khol diya hai aur farishton ke saamne tum par fakhr kar raha hai, farmata hai: Mere bandon ko dekho, unhon ne aik farz ada kar liya hai aur doosre ka intezar kar rahe hain."
"37","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush raho ae Ummul Ala, kyunke Musalman ki beemari us ke gunahon ko aise door kar deti hai jaise aag lohe ke zang ko door kar deti hai."
"38","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush raho ae Ayesha, raha Allah to us ne tumhein bari kar diya hai."
"39","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se na-pasandida mard wo hai jo sakht jhagralu ho."
"40","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se na-pasandida teen qism ke log hain: haram mein ilhad karne wala, Islam mein jahiliyyat ka tareeqa talash karne wala, aur kisi shakhs ke khoon ka nahaq mutalaba karne wala taake us ka khoon bahaye."
"41","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye kamzoron ko talash karo, kyunke tumhein rizq aur nusrat tumhare kamzoron ki wajah se milti hai."
"42","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam mein teen sau saath jor hain, un mein se har aik par har din sadqa hai: achi baat jo aadmi kahe sadqa hai, aadmi ka apne bhai ki kisi kaam mein madad karna sadqa hai, pani ka ghoont jo pilaye sadqa hai, aur raaste se takleef-deh cheez hatana sadqa hai."
"43","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qaum ka bhanja unhi mein se hai."
"44","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musafir sab se pehle peene wala hai, yani Zamzam mein se."
"45","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aas ke donon bete momin hain: Hisham aur Amr."
"46","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pyale ko apne munh se hata kar phir saans lo."
"47","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere ye donon bete Hasan aur Husain jannati jawano ke sardar hain, aur un ke walid un se behtar hain."
"48","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Sumayya ke saamne jab bhi do muamle pesh kiye gaye to unhon ne un mein se zyada durust ko ikhtiyar kiya."
"49","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae mere bete, suraj tuloo hone se pehle Jamra-tul-Aqaba ko kankariyan na marna."
"50","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abu Bakr jannat mein hain, Umar jannat mein hain, Usman jannat mein hain, Ali jannat mein hain, Talha jannat mein hain, Zubair jannat mein hain, Abdur Rahman bin Auf jannat mein hain, Saad bin Abi Waqqas jannat mein hain, Saeed bin Zaid jannat mein hain aur Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarrah jannat mein hain."
"51","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abu Bakr aur Umar awwalin o aakhirin se jannat walon ke burhon ke sardar hain, siwaye nabiyon aur rasoolon ke."
"52","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abu Sufyan bin Haris mere ghar walon mein sab se behtar hain."
"53","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare paas ahle Yaman aaye, wo narm dil aur mulaim qalb wale hain; iman Yamani hai aur hikmat Yamani hai, aur fakhr o ghamand unt walon mein hai jabke sukoon o waqar bakri walon mein hai."
"54","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare paas ahle Yaman aaye, wo kamzor dil aur narm tabiyat wale hain; fiqh Yamani hai aur hikmat Yamani hai."
"55","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare paas Ramazan ka mahina aaya, mubarak mahina, Allah ne tum par us ke roze farz kiye hain; us mein jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, jahannam ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain, sarkash shayateen jakar diye jate hain, aur us mein aik raat hai jo hazaar mahinon se behtar hai; jo us ki bhalayi se mehrum raha wo yaqinan mehrum raha."
"56","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere Rab ke paas se aik aane wala mere paas aaya aur mujhe ikhtiyar diya ke meri aadhi ummat jannat mein dakhil ho ya shafaat mile, to maine shafaat ko ikhtiyar kiya jo us ke liye hai jo is haal mein mara ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karta tha."
"57","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere Rab azza wa jal ke paas se aik aane wala mere paas aaya aur kaha ke tumhari ummat mein se jo tum par aik durood bheje Allah us ke liye us par das nekiyan likhega, us se das gunah mitayega, us ke liye das darje buland karega aur usi jaisa us ki taraf lautayega."
"58","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaj raat mere paas mere Rab ki taraf se aik aane wala aaya aur kaha ke is mubarak wadi yani Aqeeq mein namaz parho aur kaho ke hajj mein umrah hai."
"59","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaj raat mera Rab tabarak wa taala mere paas behtareen surat mein aaya aur farmaya: Ae Muhammad, kiya tum jaante ho mala-e-aala kis baare mein jhagarte hain? Maine kaha nahi. Pas us ne apna haath mere kandhon ke darmiyan rakha yahan tak ke maine us ki thandak apne seene mein mehsoos ki aur jo kuch aasmanon aur zameen mein hai use jaan liya. Phir farmaya: Ae Muhammad, kiya tum jaante ho mala-e-aala kis baare mein jhagarte hain? Maine kaha: Haan, kaffaron aur darjon ke baare mein. Kaffare ye hain: namazon ke baad masjdon mein theharna, jamaaton ki taraf qadam chal kar jana, aur na-pasandida haalaton mein wuzu mukammal karna. Farmaya: Ae Muhammad tum ne sach kaha, aur jo aisa kare wo bhalayi ke saath jiye ga, bhalayi ke saath marega aur apne gunah se aisa hoga jaise us din tha jab us ki maan ne use jana tha. Aur farmaya: Ae Muhammad, jab namaz parho to kaho: Ae Allah, main tujh se nekiyon ke karne, burayion ke chhorne aur miskeenon se mohabbat ka sawal karta hun, aur ke tu mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rehem kar aur meri tauba qabool kar; aur jab tu apne bandon ke liye fitne ka irada kare to mujhe baghair fitne mein mubtala kiye apni taraf utha le. Aur darje ye hain: salam phelana, khana khilana aur raat ko namaz parhna jab log so rahe hon."
"60","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel bukhar aur taaoon lekar aaye, to maine bukhar Madina mein rok liya aur taaoon Shaam ki taraf bhej diya; pas taaoon meri ummat ke liye shahadat aur rehmat hai aur kafiron ke liye azab hai."
"61","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur unhon ne mujhe bataya ke meri ummat mere is bete yani Husain ko qatl karegi, aur wo un ki mitti mein se surkh mitti lekar mere paas aaye."
"62","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur unhon ne mujhe hukm diya ke main apne sahaba aur jo mere saath hain unhein hukm dun ke apni aawazein talbiya mein buland karein."
"63","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur unhon ne mujhe khushkhabri di ke Hasan aur Husain jannati jawano ke sardar hain."
"64","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur unhon ne mujhe khushkhabri di ke tumhari ummat mein se jo is haal mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karta ho wo jannat mein dakhil hoga. Maine kaha: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho? Unhon ne kaha: Agarche us ne zina kiya ho aur chori ki ho."
"65","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha ke Allah tumhein hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko Quran aik harf par parhao. Maine kaha: Main Allah se afiyat aur maghfirat mangta hun, kyunke meri ummat is ki taqat nahi rakhti. Phir wo doosri baar aaye aur kaha ke Allah tumhein hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko Quran do harfon par parhao. Maine kaha: Main Allah se afiyat aur maghfirat mangta hun, kyunke meri ummat is ki taqat nahi rakhti. Phir wo teesri baar aaye aur kaha ke Allah tumhein hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko Quran teen harfon par parhao. Maine kaha: Main Allah se afiyat aur maghfirat mangta hun, aur meri ummat is ki taqat nahi rakhti. Phir wo chauthi baar aaye aur kaha ke Allah azza wa jal tumhein hukm deta hai ke apni ummat ko Quran saat harfon par parhao, pas wo jis harf par parhein ge durust hoga."
"66","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha ke apni ummat ko khushkhabri do ke jo is haal mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karta ho wo jannat mein dakhil hoga. Maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, agarche us ne chori ki ho aur zina kiya ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Maine kaha: Agarche us ne chori ki ho aur zina kiya ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Maine kaha: Agarche us ne chori ki ho aur zina kiya ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, agarche us ne sharab pi ho."
"67","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur unhon ne mujh se kaha ke Allah tumhein hukm deta hai ke apne sahaba ko hukm do ke apni aawazein talbiya mein buland karein, kyunke ye hajj ke shaair mein se hai."
"68","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha ke main kal raat tumhare paas aaya tha, mujhe tum par us ghar mein dakhil hone se sirf is ne roka ke darwaze par ¤ tasweerain thin aur ghar mein parda tha jis mein tasweerain thin aur ghar mein kutta tha. Pas ghar mein jo tasweer ka sar hai us ke baare mein hukm do ke kaat diya jaye to wo darakht ki shakal jaisa ho jayega, aur parde ke baare mein hukm do ke kaat diya jaye aur us se do bichhaye jane wale takiye bana liye jayen, aur kutte ke baare mein hukm do ke nikaal diya jaye."
"69","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, ye Khadija aap ke paas aayi hain, un ke paas bartan hai jis mein salan ya khana ya mashroob hai; pas jab wo aap ke paas aayen to unhein un ke Rab ki taraf se aur meri taraf se salam kaho aur unhein jannat mein moti ke ghar ki khushkhabri do jis mein na shor hoga na takleef."
"70","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, kiya aap beemar hue? Maine kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Bismillah, main aap par dam karta hun, har us cheez se jo aap ko takleef de, har jaan ke shar se aur hasad karne wali aankh se; Bismillah main aap par dam karta hun aur Allah aap ko shifa dega."
"71","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, kiya ye baat aap ko khush nahi karti ke aap ka Rab azza wa jal farmata hai ke aap ki ummat mein se jo aap par aik durood bheje main us par us ke badle das rehmatein bhejunga, aur aap ki ummat mein se jo aap par aik salam bheje main us par das salam bhejunga? Maine kaha: Kyun nahi, ae mere Rab."
"72","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, beshak Allah azza wa jal ne sharab par lanat ki hai aur us ke nichorne wale par, nichorwane wale par, peene wale par, uthane wale par, jis ke liye uthayi jaye us par, bechne wale par, kharidne wale par, pilane wale par aur piye jane wale par."
"73","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, jitna chahe jiyo beshak tum marne wale ho, jis se chahe mohabbat karo beshak tum us se juda hone wale ho, jo chahe amal karo beshak tumhein us ka badla diya jayega, aur jaan lo ke momin ki izzat raat ko qiyam mein hai aur us ki bulandi logon se be-niyazi mein hai."
"74","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, kaho. Maine kaha: Main kiya kahun? Unhon ne kaha: Kaho: Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah mangta hun jin se na koi naik guzar sakta hai na badkar, us har cheez ke shar se jo us ne paida ki, phelayi aur banayi, aur us ke shar se jo aasman se utarta hai aur jo us mein charhta hai, aur us ke shar se jo us ne zameen mein phelaya aur banaya, aur us ke shar se jo us se nikalta hai, aur raat din ke fitnon ke shar se, aur har raat aane wale ke shar se siwaye us aane wale ke jo bhalayi lekar aaye, ae Rehman."
"75","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, jo apne walidain mein se kisi aik ko paye phir mare aur aag mein dakhil ho to Allah use door kare; kaho aameen, to maine kaha aameen. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, jo Ramazan ka mahina paye phir mare aur use bakhsha na gaya ho aur aag mein dakhil ho to Allah use door kare; kaho aameen, to maine kaha aameen. Unhon ne kaha: Aur jis ke saamne tumhara zikr kiya jaye aur wo tum par durood na bheje phir mare aur aag mein dakhil ho to Allah use door kare; kaho aameen, to maine kaha aameen."
"76","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibtida-e-wahi mein sab se pehle Jibreel mere paas aaye aur unhon ne mujhe wuzu aur namaz sikhayi. Phir jab wuzu se farigh hue to paani ka aik chullu liya aur us se apni sharmgah par chheente mare."
"77","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel Allah tabarak wa taala ki taraf se aaye aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, beshak Allah azza wa jal farmata hai ke maine tumhari ummat par paanch namazein farz ki hain; pas jo un par un ke wuzu, auqaat, ruku aur sajdon ke saath pabandi karega to mere zimme us se ehad hai ke main use un ki wajah se jannat mein dakhil karunga, aur jo mujh se is haal mein mile ke us ne us mein se kuch kami ki ho to mere zimme us se koi ehad nahi, agar chahun use azab dun aur agar chahun us par rehem karun."
"78","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Jibreel aur Mikaeel aaye; Jibreel meri dayen taraf baithe aur Mikaeel meri bayen taraf. Jibreel ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, Quran aik harf par parho. Mikaeel ne kaha: Zyada mango. Maine kaha: Mujhe zyada do. Unhon ne kaha: Use teen harfon par parho. Mikaeel ne kaha: Zyada mango. Maine kaha: Mujhe zyada do. Isi tarah yahan tak ke saat harfon tak pahuncha, phir kaha: Use saat harfon par parho, sab ke sab shafi aur kafi hain."
"79","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas aik farishta aaya aur mujhe salam kiya jo aasman se utra tha aur is se pehle kabhi nahi utra tha; us ne mujhe khushkhabri di ke Hasan aur Husain jannati jawano ke sardar hain aur Fatima jannati auraton ki sardar hain."
"80","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum chahte ho ke tumhara dil narm ho aur tumhari hajat puri ho? Yateem par rehem karo, us ke sar par haath phero aur use apne khane mein se khilao, tumhara dil narm hoga aur tumhari hajat puri hogi."
"81","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logon, kiya tum chahte ho ke dua mein khoob koshish karo? Kaho: Ae Allah, apne shukr, apne zikr aur apni achi ibadat par hamari madad farma."
"82","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyan rakho, kyunke in mein barkat hai."
"83","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyan rakho, kyunke wo shaam ko bhalayi lekar lautti hain aur subah bhalayi lekar nikalti hain."
"84","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum jaante ho ye suraj kahan jata hai? Ye chalta hai yahan tak ke Arsh ke neeche apne thikane par pahunchta hai aur sajde mein gir padta hai, aur isi haal mein rehta hai yahan tak ke use kaha jata hai: Utho, jahan se aaye ho wapas laut jao. Pas wo lautta hai aur apni tuloo ki jagah se tuloo hota hai. Phir chalta hai yahan tak ke Arsh ke neeche apne thikane par pahunchta hai aur sajde mein gir padta hai, aur isi haal mein rehta hai yahan tak ke use kaha jata hai: Utho, jahan se aaye ho wapas laut jao. Pas wo lautta hai aur apni tuloo ki jagah se tuloo hota hai. Phir chalta hai aur logon ko us se koi gair-mamooli baat mehsoos nahi hoti yahan tak ke Arsh ke neeche apne us thikane par pahunchta hai, to use kaha jata hai: Utho, maghrib se tuloo hote hue subah karo. Pas wo maghrib se tuloo hota hai. Kiya tum jaante ho ye kab hoga? Jab is aayat ke mutabiq waqt aayega ke us jaan ko us ka iman faida na dega jo pehle iman na layi ho ya apne iman mein bhalayi na kamayi ho."
"85","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum jaante ho azah kiya hai? Baaz logon ki baat baaz tak naql karna taake un ke darmiyan fasad dalen."
"86","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum jaante ho ghibat kiya hai? Apne bhai ka us tareeqe se zikr karna jo use na-pasand ho; agar us mein wo baat ho jo tum kehte ho to tum ne us ki ghibat ki, aur agar us mein wo baat na ho to tum ne us par buhtan bandha."
"87","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum jaante ho muflis kaun hai? Meri ummat mein muflis wo hai jo qayamat ke din namaz, roze aur zakaat lekar aayega, lekin is haal mein aayega ke us ne is ko gali di thi, is par tuhmat lagayi thi, is ka maal khaya tha, is ka khoon bahaya tha aur is ko mara tha; pas is ko us ki nekiyon mein se diya jayega aur us ko us ki nekiyon mein se diya jayega. Phir agar us ke zimme ka hisab pura hone se pehle us ki nekiyan khatm ho gayin to un ke gunahon mein se lekar us par daal diye jayenge phir use aag mein phenk diya jayega."
"88","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum jaante ho ye donon kitabain kiya hain? Phir us kitab ke baare mein jo un ke dayen haath mein thi farmaya: Ye Rabbul Aalamin ki taraf se kitab hai jis mein jannat walon ke naam, un ke baapon ke naam aur un ke qabilon ke naam hain; phir un mein se aakhri par jama kar di gayi, pas un mein na kabhi izafa hoga na kami. Phir us kitab ke baare mein jo un ke bayen haath mein thi farmaya: Ye Rabbul Aalamin ki taraf se kitab hai jis mein aag walon ke naam, un ke baapon ke naam aur un ke qabilon ke naam hain; phir un mein se aakhri par jama kar di gayi, pas un mein na kabhi izafa hoga na kami. Durust raho aur darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo, kyunke jannat wale ka khatima jannat walon ke amal par hoga agarche wo koi bhi amal kare, aur aag wale ka khatima aag walon ke amal par hoga agarche wo koi bhi amal kare; tumhare Rab ne bandon se faraghat pa li hai: aik giroh jannat mein hoga aur aik giroh bharakti aag mein."
"89","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum is par raazi ho ke jannat walon ka chautha hissa ho? Kiya tum is par raazi ho ke jannat walon ka teesra hissa ho? Kiya tum is par raazi ho ke jannat walon ka aadha hissa ho? Jannat mein sirf Musalman jaan dakhil hogi, aur mushrikeen ke muqable mein tumhari misaal aisi hai jaise kaale bail ki khaal mein safed baal ya surkh bail ki khaal mein kaala baal."
"90","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Habsha walon ko chhor do jab tak wo tumhein chhore rakhein, kyunke Kaaba ke khazane ko Habsha ke suwaiqatayn wale ke siwa koi nahi nikalega."
"91","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe chhor do jab tak main tumhein chhore rakhun; pas jab main tumhein hadees sunaun to mujh se le lo, kyunke tum se pehle log sirf apne kasrat-e-sawal aur apne nabiyon se ikhtilaf ki wajah se halak hue."
"92","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Muaz, kiya tum fitna dalne wale banna chahte ho? Jab logon ko namaz parhao to Surah Shams, Surah Aala, Surah Lail aur Surah Iqra parho."
"93","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum use kai mautein marna chahte ho? Use litane se pehle apni chhuri tez kyun na ki?"
"94","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum samajhte ho ke main tum mein sab se aakhir mein marne wala hun? Khabardar, main tum mein sab se pehle marne wala hun, aur tum giroh dar giroh mere peeche aaoge, tum mein se baaz baaz ko qatl karenge."
"95","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum wo sunte ho jo main sunta hun? Main aasman ki charcharahat sunta hun, aur use charcharane ka haq hai; us mein baalisht bhar jagah bhi aisi nahi jahan koi farishta sajda ya qiyam mein na ho."
"96","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum jaante ho? Meri ummat mein se jannat mein dakhil hone wali pehli jamaat muhajir faqeer honge; wo qayamat ke din jannat ke darwaze par aayenge aur darwaza khulwayenge to khazin un se kahenge: Kiya tumhara hisab ho chuka? Wo kahenge: Ham kis cheez ka hisab dein, hamari talwarein to Allah ki raah mein hamare kandhon par thin yahan tak ke ham isi haal mein mar gaye? Pas un ke liye darwaza khol diya jayega aur wo logon ke dakhil hone se chalis saal pehle us mein aaraam karenge."
"97","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahan bhi ho Allah se daro, burayi ke peeche neki karo wo use mita degi, aur logon se achche akhlaq ke saath pesh aao."
"98","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se daro aur neki mein se kisi cheez ko haqeer na samjho, agarche apne dol mein se pani mangne wale ke bartan mein pani dalna ho, aur apne bhai se is haal mein milna ho ke tumhara chehra us ki taraf khila hua ho; aur tehband latkane se bacho, kyunke tehband latkana takabbur mein se hai aur Allah use pasand nahi karta; aur agar koi shakhs tumhein gali de aur tumhein aisi baat ka taana de jo tum mein nahi hai to tum use aisi baat ka taana na do jo us mein hai, use chhor do, us ka wabal usi par hoga aur us ka ajr tumhare liye hoga; aur kisi ko gali na do."
"99","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se daro ae Abul Waleed, qayamat ke din aisa unt lekar na aana jise uthaye hue ho aur wo ruka raha ho, ya aisi gaaye jis ki dakaar ho, ya aisi bakri jis ki mimmiyana ho."
"100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haram cheezon se bacho tum sab se zyada ibadat-guzar ban jaoge, jo Allah ne tumhare liye taqseem kiya hai us par raazi raho tum sab se zyada ghani ban jaoge, apne hamsaye se ehsan karo tum momin ban jaoge, logon ke liye wahi pasand karo jo apne liye pasand karte ho tum Musalman ban jaoge, aur zyada na hansa karo kyunke zyada hansna dil ko murda kar deta hai."
"101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho, kyunke zulm qayamat ke din andhere honge."
"102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho kyunke zulm qayamat ke din andhere honge, aur bukhl se bacho kyunke bukhl ne tum se pehle logon ko halak kiya aur unhein is par ubhara ke unhon ne apne khoon bahaye aur apni hurmaton ko halal kar liya."
"103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se daro, kyunke hamare nazdeek tum mein sab se zyada khain wo hai jo ohda talab kare."
"104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Goong janwaron ke baare mein Allah se daro; un par durust haal mein sawaar ho aur unhein durust haal mein khao."
"105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz ke baare mein Allah se daro aur un ke baare mein jinke tumhare dayen haath malik hue."
"106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ke baare mein Allah se daro jinke tumhare dayen haath malik hue."
"107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se daro aur apni aulad mein insaf karo."
"108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se daro aur apne rishtedaron se sulook karo."
"109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se daro, apni paanch namazein parho, apne mahine ke roze rakho, apne maalon ki zakaat khush dili se ada karo aur apne zimmedar ki itaat karo, tum apne Rab ki jannat mein dakhil hoge."
"110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do lanat lane walon se bacho: wo jo logon ke raaste mein ya un ke saye mein qaza-e-hajat kare."
"111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Korhi se aise bacho jaise sher se bacha jata hai."
"112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen lanat wali jaghon se bacho: ghaton par pakhana karna, aam guzargah aur saya."
"113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen lanat wali jaghon se bacho: ke tum mein se koi aise saye mein baithe jis mein saya liya jata ho, ya raaste mein, ya pani ke ghat par."
"114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag se bacho agarche khajoor ke aadhe tukre se ho."
"115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag se bacho agarche khajoor ke aadhe tukre se ho, phir agar na pao to achi baat se."
"116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ghar se bacho jise hammam kaha jata hai; pas jo us mein dakhil ho wo parda kare."
"117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazloom ki bad-dua se bacho, kyunke wo badalon par uthayi jati hai; Allah farmata hai: Meri izzat aur jalal ki qasam, main tumhari madad karunga agarche kuch waqt baad ho."
"118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazloom ki bad-dua se bacho, kyunke wo aasman ki taraf aise charhti hai jaise chingari ho."
"119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazloom ki bad-dua se bacho agarche wo kafir ho, kyunke us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan koi parda nahi."
"120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In qatal-gahon se bacho, yani mehraabon se."
"121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ruku aur sajde mukammal karo; pas qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhein apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun jab tum ruku karte ho aur jab tum sajda karte ho."
"122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli saff mukammal karo phir us ke baad wali, pas jo kami ho wo aakhri saff mein ho."
"123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saffein mukammal karo, kyunke main tumhein apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun."
"124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu mukammal karo; aag ho eriyon ke liye."
"125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jal apne bandon mein se aik bande ko layega jise Allah ne maal diya tha, aur us se kahega: Tune duniya mein kiya amal kiya? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, maine kuch amal nahi kiya siwaye is ke ke tune mujhe maal diya tha aur main logon se khareed o farokht karta tha, aur mera khulq tha ke khush-haal par aasani karta aur tang-dast ko mohlat deta. Allah taala farmayega: Main is ka tujh se zyada haqdar hun; mere bande se darguzar karo."
"126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton ke paas un ki pichhli raah se aana haram hai."
"127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Buraq laya gaya jo gadhay se uncha aur khachchar se nicha aik safed lamba janwar hai, wo apna khur apni nazar ke aakhri kinare par rakhta hai. Pas main us par sawaar hua yahan tak ke Bait-ul-Maqdis pahuncha aur use us halqe se bandha jis se ambiya bandhte thay. Phir main masjid mein dakhil hua aur us mein do rakatein parhein. Phir bahar nikla to Jibreel mere paas sharab ka bartan aur doodh ka bartan lekar aaye, to maine doodh ko ikhtiyar kiya. Jibreel ne kaha: Tum ne fitrat ko ikhtiyar kiya. Phir hamein aasman ki taraf charhaya gaya, Jibreel ne darwaza khulwaya to kaha gaya: Tum kaun ho? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumhare saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya hai. Pas hamare liye khol diya gaya to main Adam ke paas tha, unhon ne mujhe khush-aamdeed kaha aur mere liye bhalayi ki dua ki. Phir hamein doosre aasman ki taraf charhaya gaya, Jibreel ne darwaza khulwaya to kaha gaya: Tum kaun ho? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumhare saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya hai. Pas hamare liye khol diya gaya to main apne donon khala-zad bhaiyon Isa bin Maryam aur Yahya bin Zakariya ke paas tha, un donon ne mujhe khush-aamdeed kaha aur mere liye bhalayi ki dua ki. Phir hamein teesre aasman ki taraf charhaya gaya, Jibreel ne darwaza khulwaya to kaha gaya: Tum kaun ho? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumhare saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya hai. Pas hamare liye khol diya gaya to main Yusuf ke paas tha, unhein aadha husn diya gaya tha; unhon ne mujhe khush-aamdeed kaha aur mere liye bhalayi ki dua ki. Phir hamein chauthe aasman ki taraf charhaya gaya, Jibreel ne darwaza khulwaya to kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumhare saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya hai. Pas hamare liye khol diya gaya to main Idrees ke paas tha, unhon ne mujhe khush-aamdeed kaha aur mere liye bhalayi ki dua ki. Allah taala ne farmaya ke aur ham ne use buland muqam par uthaya. ¤ Phir hamein panchwen aasman ki taraf charhaya gaya, Jibreel ne darwaza khulwaya to kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumhare saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya hai. Pas hamare liye khol diya gaya to main Haroon ke paas tha, unhon ne mujhe khush-aamdeed kaha aur mere liye bhalayi ki dua ki. Phir hamein chhathe aasman ki taraf charhaya gaya, Jibreel ne darwaza khulwaya to kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumhare saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya hai. Pas hamare liye khol diya gaya to main Musa ke paas tha, unhon ne mujhe khush-aamdeed kaha aur mere liye bhalayi ki dua ki. Phir hamein saatwen aasman ki taraf charhaya gaya, Jibreel ne darwaza khulwaya to kaha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel. Kaha gaya: Tumhare saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad. Kaha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya hai. Pas hamare liye khol diya gaya to main Ibrahim ke paas tha jo Bait-ul-Mamoor se peeth lagaye hue thay, aur us mein har din sattar hazaar farishte dakhil hote hain jo phir kabhi us ki taraf nahi lautte. Phir mujhe Sidra-tul-Muntaha tak le jaya gaya, us ke patte haathiyon ke kaanon jaise aur us ke phal matkon jaise thay; jab use Allah ke hukm se jis cheez ne dhanpa us ne dhanpa to wo badal gayi, aur Allah ki makhlooq mein se koi us ke husn ko bayan karne ki taqat nahi rakhta. Pas Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki jo wahi ki aur mujh par din raat mein pachaas namazein farz kein. ¤ Phir main Musa ki taraf utra to unhon ne kaha: Tumhare Rab ne tumhari ummat par kiya farz kiya? Maine kaha: Pachaas namazein. Unhon ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf laut jao aur us se takhfeef mango, kyunke tumhari ummat is ki taqat nahi rakhti; maine Bani Israel ko aazmaya hai aur unhein jaan liya hai. Pas main apne Rab ki taraf lauta aur kaha: Ae mere Rab, meri ummat par takhfeef farma, to us ne mujh se paanch kam kar din. ¤ Phir main Musa ki taraf lauta aur kaha: Us ne mujh se paanch kam kar din. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhari ummat is ki taqat nahi rakhti, apne Rab ki taraf laut jao aur us se takhfeef mango. ¤ Pas main barabar apne Rab aur Musa ke darmiyan aata jata raha yahan tak ke Allah ne farmaya: Ae Muhammad, ye har din raat mein paanch ¤ namazein hain, har namaz ke liye das hain, pas ye pachaas namazein hain. Aur jo neki ka irada kare phir use na kare to us ke liye aik neki likhi jayegi, phir agar use kare to us ke liye das likhi jayengi; aur jo burayi ka irada kare phir use na kare to kuch na likha jayega, phir agar use kare to aik burayi likhi jayegi. Pas main utra yahan tak ke Musa par pahuncha aur unhein khabar di to unhon ne kaha: Apne Rab ki taraf laut jao aur us se takhfeef mango. Maine kaha: Main apne Rab ki taraf itna lauta ke mujhe us se haya aane lagi."
"128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere paas Buraq laya gaya jo aik safed lamba janwar hai aur apna khur apni nazar ke aakhri kinare par rakhta hai; main aur Jibreel us ki peeth se juda na hue yahan tak ke main Bait-ul-Maqdis pahuncha, mere liye aasman ke darwaze khol diye gaye aur maine jannat aur aag dekhi."
"129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi main aik qaum par aaya jin ke hont aag ki qainchiyon se kaate ja rahe thay, jab bhi kaate jate phir jud jate. Maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Tumhari ummat ke khateeb jo wo kehte hain jo karte nahi aur Allah ki kitab parhte hain lekin us par amal nahi karte."
"130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis raat mujhe sairaan karayi gayi mujhe Zamzam ki taraf le jaya gaya, mera seena khol diya gaya phir Zamzam ke pani se dhoya gaya phir utar diya gaya."
"131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Thehar ja ae Uhud, kyunke tujh par sirf aik Nabi, aik Siddiq aur do shaheed hain."
"132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Thehar ja ae Hira, kyunke tujh par sirf Nabi ya Siddiq ya shaheed hai."
"133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Munafiqon par sab se bhari namaz Isha ki namaz aur Fajr ki namaz hai; agar wo jaante ke un mein kiya hai to ghisat-te hue bhi aate. Aur maine irada kiya ke namaz ka hukm dun aur wo qaim ki jaye, phir aik aadmi ko hukm dun ke logon ko namaz parhaye, phir apne saath lakriyon ke gathay liye hue kuch aadmiyon ke saath un logon ki taraf niklun jo namaz mein hazir nahi hote aur un par un ke gharon ko aag se jala dun."
"134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meezan mein sab se bhari cheez achcha akhlaq hai."
"135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ke meezan mein sab se bhari cheez achcha khulq hai; beshak Allah behuda-go aur fahhash bad-zaban se bughz rakhta hai."
"136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do shakhs aise hain jin ki namaz un ke saron se upar nahi jati: wo ghulam jo apne aaqaon se bhaag jaye yahan tak ke laut aaye, aur wo aurat jo apne shohar ki nafarmani kare yahan tak ke laut aaye."
"137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do gunahon ki saza Allah duniya mein jaldi deta hai: zulm aur walidain ki nafarmani."
"138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein do baatein hain jo un mein kufr hain: nasbon mein taan karna aur mayyat par nauha karna."
"139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do cheezein hain jinhein Ibn Adam na-pasand karta hai: maut ko na-pasand karta hai halanke maut us ke liye fitne se behtar hai, aur maal ki kami ko na-pasand karta hai halanke maal ki kami hisab mein kam hai."
"140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do cheezein jannat mein dakhil karti hain: jo apne donon jabron aur apni donon tangon ke darmiyan ki hifazat kare wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahiliyyat mein gyarah auratein jama huin aur unhon ne ehad kiya ke aapas mein sach bolengi aur apne shoharon ki khabron mein se kuch na chhupayengi. Pehli ne kaha: Mera shohar pahar ki choti par dubli oontni ke gosht jaisa hai, na hamwar raasta hai ke charha jaye na mota gosht hai ke uthaya jaye. Doosri ne kaha: Main apne shohar ki khabar nahi phelaungi, mujhe darr hai ke main use na chhorun; agar main us ka zikr karun to us ke zaahir o chhupe aib bayan kar dun. Teesri ne kaha: Mera shohar lamba qad wala hai, agar bolun to talaq de de aur agar khamosh rahun to latki rahun. Chauthi ne kaha: Mera shohar agar khaye to lapet le, agar piye to nichor le, agar lete to simat jaye, aur haath dakhil nahi karta taake gham maloom kare. ¤ Panchwin ne kaha: Mera shohar na-mard hai, har aib ka majmua hai, us mein har beemari hai; tumhara sar phor de ya tumhara haath tor de ya donon jama kar de. ¤ Chhathi ne kaha: Mera shohar Tihama ki shaam jaisa hai, na garmi na sardi, na darr na uktahat. ¤ Saatwin ne kaha: Mera shohar andar aaye to tendua hai, bahar nikle to sher hai, aur jo ehad kare us ke baare mein nahi poochta. ¤ Aathwin ne kaha: Mera shohar chhune mein khargosh ke chhune jaisa hai aur khushbu mein zaramb ki khushbu jaisa hai, aur main us par ghalib hun jabke log us par ghalib hain. ¤ Nawin ne kaha: Mera shohar unche sutunon wala, lambi talwar ke niyaam wala, bare dheron raakh wala aur majlis ke qareeb ghar wala hai. ¤ Daswin ne kaha: Mera shohar Malik hai, aur Malik kiya hai? Malik is se behtar hai; us ke paas oontniyan hain jinki charagahein thori aur baithne ki jaghein bahut hain, jab wo mizmar ki aawaz sunti hain to yaqeen kar leti hain ke wo halak hone wali hain. ¤ Gyarhwin ne kaha: Mera shohar Abu Zara hai, aur Abu Zara kiya hai? Us ne mere kaan zevar se bhar diye, mere bazoo charbi se bhar diye aur mujhe khush kiya to main apne aap par khush ho gayi. Us ne mujhe bakriyon walon mein paya jo tangi mein thay, pas us ne mujhe ghoron, oonton, kheti-baari aur anaaj walon mein kar diya. Pas us ke paas main bolti hun to bura nahi kaha jata, soti hun to subah tak soti hun, peeti hun to sair ho kar peeti hun. Abu Zara ki maan, Abu Zara ki maan kiya hai? Us ke bartan bhare hue aur us ka ghar kushada hai. Abu Zara ka beta, Abu Zara ka beta kiya hai? Us ka bistar chhoti tehni jaisa hai aur bakri ke chhote bachche ki raan use sair kar deti hai. Abu Zara ki beti, Abu Zara ki beti kiya hai? Apne baap ki farmabardar, apni maan ki farmabardar, apna libas bharne wali, apni chadar jhukane wali, apne ghar walon ki zeenat aur apni parosan ka ghussa hai. Abu Zara ki laundi, Abu Zara ki laundi kiya hai? Wo hamari baat nahi phelati, hamara anaaj idhar udhar nahi karti aur hamara ghar kachre se nahi bharti. Abu Zara nikla jab mashkize biloye ja rahe thay, to aik aurat par guzra jis ke saath us ke do bete thay jo tenduon jaise thay aur us ki kamar ke neeche se do anaaron se khel rahe thay; pas us ne mujhe talaq de di aur us se nikah kar liya. Phir us ke baad maine ¤ aik shareef aadmi se nikah kiya jo tez-raftar ghore par sawaar hua, khatti talwar li, bahut se maweshi mere paas lao kar jama kiye aur mujhe har khushbu mein se jora ata kiya. Pas us ne kaha: Khao ae Umm Zara aur apne ghar walon ko khilao. Agar main har cheez jama karun jo us ne mujhe di to wo Abu Zara ke bartanon mein se sab se chhote bartan ko bhi na bharegi. To Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Ayesha, main tumhare liye aisa tha jaisa Umm Zara ke liye Abu Zara tha, siwaye is ke ke Abu Zara ne talaq de di aur main talaq nahi dunga."
"142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne khane par jama ho aur Allah ka naam lo, tumhare liye us mein barkat di jayegi."
"143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghusse se bacho."
"144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saat halak karne wali cheezon se bacho: Allah ke saath shirk, jadu, us jaan ka qatl karna jise Allah ne haram kiya hai magar haq ke saath, sood khana, yateem ka maal khana, larayi ke din peeth pherna, aur paak-daman momin ghafil auraton par tuhmat lagana."
"145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saat kabeera gunahon se bacho: Allah ke saath shirk, jaan ka qatl, larayi se bhaagna, yateem ka maal khana, sood khana, paak-daman aurat par tuhmat lagana aur hijrat ke baad dehat ki taraf laut jana."
"146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabeera gunahon se bacho, darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo aur khushkhabri hasil karo."
"147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nashawar cheez se bacho."
"148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nasha lane wali cheez se bacho."
"149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In gandagiyon se bacho jin se Allah taala ne mana kiya hai; pas jo in mein se kisi mein mubtala ho wo Allah ke parde se parda kare aur Allah ki taraf tauba kare, kyunke jo hamare saamne apna chehra zahir karega ham us par Allah ki kitab nafiz karenge."
"150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan saans ka waqfa rakho taake wuzu karne wala mohlat mein apni hajat puri kar le aur khane wala mohlat mein apne khane se farigh ho jaye."
"151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni raat ki namaz ka aakhri hissa witr banao."
"152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne aur haram ke darmiyan halal ka parda rakho; jo aisa kare us ne apni izzat aur deen ko bacha liya, aur jo us mein charne lage wo us charne wale ki tarah hai jo shahi charagah ke qareeb charta hai ke qareeb hai ke us mein pad jaye; aur har badshah ki charagah hoti hai, aur zameen mein Allah ki charagah us ki hurmatein hain."
"153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne aur aag ke darmiyan parda rakho agarche khajoor ke aadhe tukre se ho."
"154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni namazon mein se kuch apne gharon mein parho aur unhein qabrein na banao."
"155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baith jao, tum ne takleef di aur dair ki. Ye us shakhs se kaha jo juma ke din gardanen phalangta tha."
"156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baith jao ae Abu Turab. Ye Ali radiya Allahu anhu se kaha."
"157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya talab karne mein darmiyani raah ikhtiyar karo, kyunke har aik ke liye wahi aasan kiya gaya hai jo us ke liye us mein se likha gaya hai."
"158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bulane wale ki dawat qabool karo, tohfa wapas na karo aur Musalmanon ko mat maro."
"159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is dawat ko qabool karo jab us ki taraf bulaye jao."
"160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ke nazdeek sab se mehboob deen narm hanifiyyat hai."
"161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob naam Abdullah aur Abdur Rahman hain."
"162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob naam Abdullah, Abdur Rahman aur Haris hain."
"163","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob amal wo hai jo sab se zyada mudawamat wala ho agarche thora ho."
"164","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob amal waqt par namaz hai, phir walidain se neki, phir Allah ki raah mein jihad."
"165","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob amal ye hai ke tum maro aur tumhari zaban Allah ke zikr se tar ho."
"166","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob amal Allah par iman hai, phir rishtedaron se sulook, phir maroof ka hukm aur munkar se mana karna; aur Allah ke nazdeek sab se na-pasandida amal Allah ke saath shirk hai phir rishtedaron se qata-talluq."
"167","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob jaghein us ki masjidein hain aur Allah ke nazdeek sab se na-pasandida jaghein us ke bazaar hain."
"168","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob jihad zalim hukmaran se haq baat kehna hai."
"169","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere nazdeek sab se mehboob baat us ki sab se sachchi hai."
"170","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob roza Dawood ka roza tha, wo aik din roza rakhte aur aik din iftar karte thay; aur Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob namaz Dawood ki namaz thi, wo aadhi raat sote, teesra hissa qiyam karte aur chhatha hissa sote thay."
"171","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob khana wo hai jis par zyada haath hon."
"172","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ke nazdeek sab se mehboob bande wo hain jo us ke ghar walon ke liye sab se zyada nafa-mand hon."
"173","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ke nazdeek sab se mehboob kalaam chaar hain: SubhanAllah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illAllah aur Allahu Akbar; tumhein nuqsan nahi ke tum in mein se kis se shuru karo."
"174","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob kalaam ye hai ke banda kahe: SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi."
"175","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ke nazdeek sab se mehboob kalaam wo hai jo Allah ne apne farishton ke liye muntakhab kiya: Subhana Rabbi wa bihamdihi, Subhana Rabbi wa bihamdihi, Subhana Rabbi wa bihamdihi."
"176","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob log sab se zyada nafa-mand hain, aur Allah azza wa jal ke nazdeek sab se mehboob amal wo khushi hai jo tum Musalman ko do, ya us se takleef door karo, ya us ka qarz ada karo, ya us se bhook door karo. Aur mera apne Musalman bhai ke saath us ki hajat mein chalna mujhe masjid mein mahina bhar etikaf karne se zyada mehboob hai. Aur jo apna ghussa rok le Allah us ke aib chhupa lega, aur jo ghussa pi jaye halanke agar chahta to use nafiz kar sakta tha to Allah qayamat ke din us ka dil khushi se bhar dega. Aur jo apne Musalman bhai ke saath us ki hajat mein chale yahan tak ke use us ke liye sabit kar de to Allah taala us ke qadam us din sabit rakhega jis din qadam phislenge. Aur bura akhlaq amal ko aise kharab kar deta hai jaise sirka shehed ko kharab kar deta hai."
"177","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe sab se mehboob Ayesha hain aur mardon mein se un ke walid."
"178","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne mehboob se halki mohabbat rakho, ho sakta hai wo kabhi tumhara dushman ban jaye; aur apne dushman se halka bughz rakho, ho sakta hai wo kabhi tumhara mehboob ban jaye."
"179","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke bandon mein Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob wo hain jin ka akhlaq sab se achcha ho."
"180","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ke liye wahi pasand karo jo apne liye pasand karte ho."
"181","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Asl ko rok lo aur us ke phal ko sadqa kar do."
"182","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bachon ko rok kar rakho yahan tak ke isha ki sakhti jati rahe, kyunke ye wo ghari hai jis mein shayateen phelte hain."
"183","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Adam aur Musa ne bahas ki to Adam Musa par ghalib aaye."
"184","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Adam aur Musa ne bahas ki to Musa ne kaha: Tum Adam ho jinhein Allah ne apne haath se paida kiya, tum mein apni rooh phunki, tumhare liye apne farishton ko sajda karwaya aur tumhein apni jannat mein basaya; phir tum ne apne gunah se logon ko jannat se nikalwaya aur unhein musibat mein dala. Adam ne kaha: Ae Musa, tum wo ho jinhein Allah ne apni risalaton aur apne kalaam se muntakhab kiya aur tum par Tauret nazil ki; kiya tum mujhe aise muamle par malamat karte ho jo Allah ne mujhe paida karne se pehle mujh par likh diya tha? Pas Adam Musa par ghalib aaye."
"185","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat aur aag ne bahas ki; jannat ne kaha: Mujh mein kamzor aur miskeen dakhil honge, aur aag ne kaha: Mujh mein jabbar aur mutakabbir dakhil honge. Pas Allah ne aag se farmaya: Tu mera azab hai, main tere zariye jis se chahun badla lunga; aur jannat se farmaya: Tu meri rehmat hai, main tere zariye jis par chahun rehem karunga; aur tum donon mein se har aik ke liye us ka bharna hai."
"186","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tareef karne walon ke chehron par mitti dalo."
"187","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tareef karne walon ke munhon mein mitti dalo."
"188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne walid ki taraf se hajj karo aur umrah karo."
"189","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ahad, Ahad."
"190","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ahad, ae Saad."
"191","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Uhud pahar hai jo ham se mohabbat karta hai aur ham us se mohabbat karte hain."
"192","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya se bacho, kyunke wo sabz meethi hai."
"193","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se bura naam us aadmi ka hai jise malikul amlaak kaha jata ho."
"194","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se achchi qiraat us ki hai jise parhte hue dekho ke wo Allah se darta hai."
"195","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein saffon ko achchi tarah seedha karo."
"196","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar ke neki karne wale se neki karo aur un ke bura karne wale se darguzar karo."
"197","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama ho jao, main tumhein Quran ka teesra hissa parh kar sunaunga. Phir unhon ne Surah Ikhlas parhi aur farmaya: Khabardar, ye Quran ke teesre hisse ke barabar hai."
"198","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ramazan ke liye Shaban ka chand gino."
"199","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ramazan ke liye Shaban ka chand gino aur Ramazan ko kisi aur se na milao magar ye ke wo aise roze ke muwafiq ho jo tum mein se koi rakhta ho; aur us ke dekhne par roza rakho aur us ke dekhne par iftar karo, phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to ginti poori karke tees din karo, kyunke ginti tum par muchli nahi rahegi."
"200","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma mein hazir ho aur imam se qareeb ho, kyunke aadmi door hota rehta hai yahan tak ke jannat mein peeche kar diya jata hai agarche us mein dakhil ho."
"201","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma mein hazir ho aur imam se qareeb ho, kyunke aadmi juma se peeche rehta hai yahan tak ke wo jannat se peeche reh jata hai halanke wo us ke ahl mein se hoga."
"202","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khodo, gehra khodo, kushada khodo, aur do ya teen ko aik qabr mein dafan karo aur un mein se jo Quran zyada janta ho use aage rakho."
"203","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni sharmgah ki hifazat karo siwaye apni biwi se ya jis ki tumhara dayan haath malik ho. Kaha gaya: Jab log baaz baaz mein hon to? Farmaya: Agar tum is ki taqat rakho ke use koi na dekhe to na dekhe. Kaha gaya: Jab ham mein se koi akela ho to? Farmaya: Allah is ka zyada haqdar hai ke us se haya ki jaye banisbat logon ke."
"204","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni zaban ki hifazat karo."
"205","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni zaban ki hifazat karo, tumhari maan tumhein khoye ae Muaz! Logon ko un ke munhon ke bal sirf un ki zabanein girayengi?"
"206","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ke baare mein meri laaj rakho, phir un ke jo un ke baad aayen, phir un ke jo un ke baad aayen, phir jhoot phel jayega yahan tak ke aadmi gawahi dega halanke us se gawahi nahi mangi gayi aur qasam khayega halanke us se qasam nahi mangi gayi."
"207","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Moonchhen katrao aur darhiyan barhao."
"208","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Donon ko utar do ya donon ko pehan lo; jab pehno to dayen se shuru karo aur jab utaro to bayen se shuru karo."
"209","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona aur resham meri ummat ki auraton ke liye halal kiya gaya hai aur us ke mardon par haram kiya gaya hai."
"210","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamare liye do murdar aur do khoon halal kiye gaye; murdar mein machhli aur tiddi hain, aur khoon mein kaleji aur tilli hain."
"211","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam khao, neki karo aur sach bolo, kyunke Allah pasand karta hai ke us ki qasam khayi jaye."
"212","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use poora mundwa do ya poora chhor do."
"213","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kabhi mere paas wahi ghanti ki jhankar jaisi aati hai aur ye mujh par sab se sakht hoti hai, phir mujh se juda hoti hai aur main jo kaha gaya use yaad kar leta hun; aur kabhi farishta ¤ mere liye aadmi ki surat mein aata hai aur mujh se kalaam karta hai to main jo wo kehta hai use yaad kar leta hun."
"214","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe apne baad apni ummat par teen cheezon ka khauf hai: hukmaranon ki na-insafi, sitaron par iman aur taqdeer ko jhutlana."
"215","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe apne baad apni ummat par do khaslaton ka khauf hai: taqdeer ko jhutlana aur sitaron ki tasdeeq karna."
"216","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tum par chhe cheezon ka khauf hai: bewaqoofon ki hukumat, khoon bahana, faisla bechna, rishtedaron se qata-talluq, aisi nasal jo Quran ko bansriyan banaye aur sipahiyon ki kasrat."
"217","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aisa amal na bataun ke agar tum use apnao to jo tum se pehle thay unhein pa lo aur jo tumhare baad hon un se aage nikal jao, siwaye us ke jo aisa hi kare: har namaz ke peeche tayentees baar tasbeeh kaho, tayentees baar takbeer kaho aur chauntees baar hamd kaho."
"218","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Jibreel ne bataya ke hijama sab se nafa-mand cheez hai jis se log ilaj karte hain."
"219","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Jibreel ne bataya ke Husain Darya-e-Furat ke kinare qatl kiye jayenge."
"220","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe aise darakht ke baare mein batao jo Musalman aadmi jaisa ho, jis ke patte na girein, jis mein kuch na ho; har waqt apna phal deta ho? Wo khajoor ka darakht hai."
"221","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim ne khatna karwaya jabke wo assi saal ke thay, kulhare se."
"222","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un mein se chaar ko muntakhab karo aur baaqiyon se juda ho jao."
"223","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jhanda Zaid ne liya aur shaheed ho gaye, phir use Jafar ne liya aur shaheed ho gaye, phir use Abdullah bin Rawaha ne liya aur shaheed ho gaye, phir use Khalid ne baghair hukm ke liya to Allah ne un ke haath par fatah di. Aur mujhe ye pasand nahi ke wo hamare paas hon, ya farmaya ke unhein ye pasand nahi ke wo hamare paas hon."
"224","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jal ne mujh se ehad liya jaise us ne nabiyon se un ka ehad liya, aur mujh se Isa bin Maryam ne basharat di, aur meri walida ne khwab mein dekha ke un ki donon tangon ke darmiyan se aik chiragh nikla jis se Shaam ke mehal roshan ho gaye."
"225","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham ne tumhare munh se fael li."
"226","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taqdeer mein kalaam karna aakhri zamane mein meri ummat ke badtareen logon ke liye chhoda gaya hai."
"227","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se door ho jao ae Umar, mujhe ikhtiyar diya gaya to maine ikhtiyar kiya; mujh se kaha gaya hai ke in ke liye maghfirat mango ya na mango, agar tum in ke liye sattar baar maghfirat mango to bhi Allah unhein nahi bakhshega. Agar main jaanta ke sattar se zyada par us ki maghfirat ho jayegi to zyada karta."
"228","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bojh peeche karo, kyunke haath bandhe hue hain aur pair jakre hue hain."
"229","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Niklo aur logon mein elaan karo ke jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi."
"230","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mukhannason ko apne gharon se nikaal do."
"231","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushrikon ko Jazeera-tul-Arab se nikaal do aur wafdon ko is jaise tohfe do jaise main unhein diya karta tha."
"232","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahudiyon aur Nasraniyon ko Jazeera-tul-Arab se nikaal do."
"233","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hijaz ke Yahudiyon aur Najran walon ko Jazeera-tul-Arab se nikaal do, aur jaan lo ke badtareen log wo hain jinhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein banaya."
"234","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke paas niklo, kyunke wo ijazat mangna achchi tarah nahi janta; us se kaho ke kahe: Assalamu alaikum, kiya main dakhil hun?"
"235","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Niklo aur apni khajoor toro, shayad tum us mein se sadqa karo ya bhalayi karo."
"236","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Halka karo aur zyada na karo, kyunke ye chehre ke liye zyada taaza aur shohar ke nazdeek zyada pasandida hai."
"237","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se zaleel naam us aadmi ka hai jise malikul amlaak kaha jaye; Allah ke siwa koi malik nahi."
"238","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare bhai tumhare khadim hain, Allah ne unhein tumhare haathon mein qaid kar diya hai; pas jis ka bhai us ke haath ke neeche ho to use apne khane mein se khilaye, apne libas mein se pehnaye, aur use us se zyada takleef na de jo us par ghalib ho; phir agar use us se zyada takleef de jo us par ghalib ho to us ki madad kare."
"239","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe apni ummat par sab se zyada khauf har zaban-aawar munafiq se hai."
"240","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amanat us ko ada karo jis ne tumhein ameen banaya aur us se khayanat na karo jis ne tum se khayanat ki."
"241","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gehun ya gandum mein se do aadmiyon ke darmiyan aik saa ada karo, ya khajoor mein se aik saa, ya jau mein se aik saa, har aazad, ghulam, chhote aur bare par."
"242","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitr mein khane mein se aik saa ada karo."
"243","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne aik aadmi ko jannat mein dakhil kiya jo khareed o farokht, qaza aur taqaze mein narm tha."
"244","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne Rab ko pukaro jo aisa hai ke agar tumhein takleef pahunche aur tum use pukaro to wo tum se door kar de, aur jo aisa hai ke agar tum sunsaan zameen mein gum ho jao aur use pukaro to tumhein tum par lauta de, aur jo aisa hai ke agar tumhein qehet pahunche aur use pukaro to tumhare liye uga de."
"245","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah se dua karo is haal mein ke tumhein qabooliyat ka yaqeen ho, aur jaan lo ke Allah ghafil beparwah dil ki dua qabool nahi karta."
"246","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ko bulao, khushkhabri do, nafrat na dilao, aasani karo, sakhti na karo."
"247","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko bulao, apne walid aur apne bhai ko, taake main kitab likh dun; kyunke mujhe darr hai ke koi aarzu karne wala aarzu kare aur koi kehne wala kahe ke main zyada haqdar hun, lekin Allah aur momin Abu Bakr ke siwa sab ka inkar karenge."
"248","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use us ki khala ko de do, kyunke khala maan hai."
"249","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maqtoolon ko un ke marne ki jaghon mein dafan karo."
"250","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yateem ko apne qareeb karo, us se narmi karo, us ke sar par haath phero aur use apne khane mein se khilao; kyunke ye tumhara dil narm karega aur tumhari hajat puri karega."
"251","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qareeb aao ae mere bete, Allah ka naam lo, apne dayen haath se khao aur jo tumhare qareeb hai us mein se khao."
"252","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag walon mein sab se halke azab wala wo hoga jo aag ke do jootay pehne hoga jis se us ke jooton ki garmi se us ka dimagh ubal raha hoga."
"253","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj aur Umrah barabar karte raho, kyunke ye donon faqr aur gunahon ko aise door karte hain jaise bhatti lohe ke zang ko door karti hai."
"254","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah tumhein maal de to tum par Allah ki naimat aur izzat ka asar nazar aana chahiye."
"255","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah tumhein maal de to tum par nazar aana chahiye; kyunke Allah pasand karta hai ke apne bande par us ka asar achcha dekhe, aur bad-haali aur bad-haali zahir karne ko na-pasand karta hai."
"256","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala tumhein aisa maal de jo tum ne manga na ho aur tumhara nafs us ki taraf lalach na kare to use qabool kar lo; kyunke ye rizq hai jo Allah ne tumhari taraf bheja hai."
"257","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khana kharido to use na becho yahan tak ke use poora wasool kar lo."
"258","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah Musalman bande ko us ke jism mein kisi bala mein mubtala kare to Allah azza wa jal farmata hai: Us ke liye us ke naik amal likho; phir agar use shifa de to use dho kar paak kar deta hai, aur agar us ki rooh qabz kare to use bakhsh deta hai aur us par rehem karta hai."
"259","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum meri taraf qasid bhejo to khubsurat chehre aur achche naam wala bhejo."
"260","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda bhaag jaye to us ki namaz qabool nahi hoti."
"261","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein aaye aur imam kisi haal mein ho to waisa hi kare jaisa imam kar raha ho."
"262","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi qaza-e-hajat ke liye aaye to Qibla ki taraf munh na kare aur na us ki taraf peeth kare, lekin mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf rukh kare."
"263","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ke paas aaye phir dobara aana chahe to wuzu kare."
"264","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke paas us ka khadim us ka khana laye jis ki tayyari aur dhuwen ki takleef us ne uthayi ho, ¤ to use apne saath bithaye; phir agar use apne saath na bithaye to use aik ya do luqme de."
"265","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi maweshiyon par aaye, agar us mein us ka malik ho to us se ijazat mange; phir agar wo ijazat de to dohe aur piye, aur agar us mein koi na ho to teen baar aawaz de; phir agar koi jawab de to us se ijazat mange, phir agar koi jawab na de to dohe aur piye lekin saath na le jaye."
"266","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi logon ke paas aaye aur wo us se kahein khush-aamdeed, to qayamat ke din us ke liye khush-aamdeed hogi jis din wo apne Rab se milega; aur jab aadmi logon ke paas aaye aur wo us se kahein ke qehet ho, to qayamat ke din us ke liye qehet hoga."
"267","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas mangne wala aaye to us ke haath mein rakho agarche jala hua khur ho."
"268","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas sadqa lene wala aaye to wo tumhare paas se na jaye magar is haal mein ke wo raazi ho."
"269","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas kisi qaum ka shareef aaye to us ki izzat karo."
"270","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas aisa shakhs aaye jis ke akhlaq aur deen se tum raazi ho to us se nikah kar do; agar aisa na karoge to zameen mein fitna aur bara fasad hoga."
"271","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kapra kushada ho to use apne kandhon par lapet kar phir namaz parho, aur agar is se tang ho to use apni kamar se bandh lo phir baghair chadar ke namaz parho."
"272","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz mein aao to waqar aur sukoon ke saath aao; jo pao parho aur jo reh jaye use qaza karo."
"273","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apni biwi ke paas aao to danishmandana amal karo."
"274","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab oonton ke charwahe par aao to teen baar pukaro ae oonton ke charwahe; phir agar wo tumhein jawab de to theek, warna doho aur piyo baghair fasad kiye. Aur jab baagh par aao to teen baar pukaro ae baagh ke malik; phir agar wo tumhein jawab de to theek, warna baghair fasad kiye khao."
"275","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz mein aao to tum par sukoon lazim hai; daudte hue na aao, jo pao parho aur jo reh jaye use poora karo."
"276","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne bistar par aao to namaz jaisa wuzu karo, phir apni dayen karwat par leto, phir kaho: Ae Allah, maine apna chehra tere supurd kiya, apna muamla tere hawale kiya, apni peeth teri taraf lagayi, teri taraf raghbat aur khauf ke saath; tujh se bachne ki na koi panah hai na nijaat magar teri taraf; main teri kitab par iman laya jo tune nazil ki aur tere Nabi par jo tune bheja. Phir agar apni us raat mein mar jao to fitrat par ho, aur inhein apni aakhri baat banao jo tum kehte ho."
"277","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare hamsaye tumhari tareef karein ke tum naik ho to tum naik ho, aur jab tumhare hamsaye tumhari tareef karein ke tum bure ho to tum bure ho."
"278","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mayyat ko dhuni do to teen baar do."
"279","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se mohabbat kare to use bataye ke wo us se mohabbat karta hai."
"280","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Allah ke liye apne bhai se mohabbat kare to use bataye; kyunke ye ulfat mein zyada baaqi rehne wala aur muhabbat mein zyada pukhta hai."
"281","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne saathi se mohabbat kare to us ke ghar aaye aur use bataye ke wo Allah ke liye us se mohabbat karta hai."
"282","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande se mohabbat kare to use duniya mein aise bachata hai jaise tum mein se koi apne beemar ko pani se bachata hai."
"283","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande se mohabbat kare to Jibreel ko pukarta hai ke Allah falan se mohabbat karta hai pas tum us se mohabbat karo; to Jibreel us se mohabbat karte hain, phir Jibreel aasman walon mein elaan karte hain ke Allah falan se mohabbat karta hai pas tum us se mohabbat karo; to aasman wale us se mohabbat karte hain, phir us ke liye zameen mein qabooliyat rakhi jati hai."
"284","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande se mohabbat kare to Jibreel ko pukarta hai ke maine falan se mohabbat ki hai pas tum us se mohabbat karo; to wo aasman mein elaan karte hain, phir us ke liye zameen mein mohabbat utarti hai. Pas yehi Allah taala ka farman hai ke beshak jo iman laye aur naik amal kiye Rehman un ke liye mohabbat rakhega. Aur jab Allah kisi bande se bughz rakhe to Jibreel ko pukarta hai ke maine falan se bughz rakha hai; to wo aasman mein elaan karte hain, phir us ke liye zameen mein bughz utarta hai."
"285","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi qaum se mohabbat kare to unhein aazmata hai."
"286","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko namaz mein hawa kharij ho to apni naak pakar le phir wapas chala jaye."
"287","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apna Islam achcha kare to jo neki wo kare us ke liye das guna se saat sau guna tak likha jata hai, aur jo burayi wo kare us ke liye us jaisi likhi jati hai yahan tak ke wo Allah se mile."
"288","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab donon khareed o farokht karne wale ikhtilaf karein to baat bechne wale ki hogi aur kharidne wale ko ikhtiyar hoga."
"289","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab donon khareed o farokht karne wale ikhtilaf karein aur un ke darmiyan gawah na ho to wo hoga jo samaan ka malik kahe, ya donon juda ho jayen."
"290","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab donon khareed o farokht karne wale ikhtilaf karein aur un ke darmiyan gawah na ho aur becha hua samaan apni asal haalat mein maujood ho to baat wahi hogi jo bechne wala kahe, ya donon bea ko chhor dein."
"291","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raaste mein ikhtilaf karo to use saat haath rakho."
"292","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko apna bistar pakro to Surah Kafirun parho phir us ke khatime par so jao; kyunke ye shirk se bezaari hai."
"293","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne donon pair mozon mein dakhil kare aur wo paak hon to un par masah kare, musafir ke liye teen din aur muqeem ke liye aik din."
"294","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Asr ki namaz ka aik sajda suraj ¤ ghurub hone se pehle pa le to apni namaz poori kare, aur jab Fajr ki namaz ka aik sajda suraj tuloo hone se pehle pa le to apni namaz poori kare."
"295","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda Allah ka haq aur apne aaqaon ka haq ada kare to us ke liye do ajr honge."
"296","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ibn Umm Maktoom azan dein to khao aur piyo, aur jab Bilal azan dein to na khao na piyo."
"297","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muazzin azan de to koi bahar na nikle yahan tak ke namaz parh le."
"298","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Maghrib ki azan do to use suraj ke saath jaldi utaro."
"299","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi qaza-e-hajat jana chahe aur namaz khari ho jaye to qaza-e-hajat ki taraf jaye."
"300","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni beti ka nikah karna chahe to us se ijazat le."
"301","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi se apni hajat chahe to us ke paas aaye agarche wo tandoor par ho."
"302","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah hukmaran ke liye bhalayi chahe to us ke liye sachcha wazir muqarrar karta hai; agar wo bhoole to ¤ use yaad dilaye aur agar yaad kare to us ki madad kare. Aur jab us ke liye is ke siwa chahe to us ke liye bura wazir muqarrar karta hai; agar wo bhoole to use yaad na dilaye aur agar yaad kare to us ki madad na kare."
"303","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi ghar walon ke liye bhalayi chahe to un mein narmi dakhil kar deta hai."
"304","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ke liye bhalayi chahe to use kaam par lagata hai. Kaha gaya: Wo use kis kaam par lagata hai? Farmaya: Us ki maut se pehle us ke liye naik amal khol deta hai yahan tak ke us ke ird-gird walon ko us se raazi kar de."
"305","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo kisi bande ke liye bhalayi chahe to use kaam par lagata hai. Kaha gaya: Wo use kaise kaam par lagata hai? Farmaya: Use maut se pehle naik amal ki taufeeq deta hai phir use usi par qabz karta hai."
"306","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ke liye bhalayi chahe to use maut se pehle paak kar deta hai. Sahaba ne kaha: Bande ka paak hona kiya hai? Farmaya: Naik amal jis ki taraf use ilham karta hai yahan tak ke use usi par qabz kare."
"307","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ke liye bhalayi chahe to use shehed pilata hai. Kaha gaya: Use shehed pilana kiya hai? Farmaya: Us ki maut se pehle us ke liye naik amal khol deta hai phir use usi par qabz karta hai."
"308","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah apne bande ke liye bhalayi chahe to us ke liye duniya mein saza jaldi kar deta hai, aur jab apne bande ke liye burayi chahe to use us ke gunah ke saath rok rakhta hai yahan tak ke qayamat ke din us ke saath aaye."
"309","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi qaum ke liye azab chahe to azab un sab ko pahunchta hai jo un mein hon, phir wo apne aamaal par uthaye jayenge."
"310","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi cheez ko paida karna chahe to use koi cheez nahi rok sakti."
"311","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ki rooh kisi zameen mein qabz karna chahe to us ke liye us mein koi hajat bana deta hai."
"312","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab thookna chaho to apne dayen taraf na thooko lekin apne bayen taraf thooko agar khaali ho; phir agar khaali na ho to apne qadam ke neeche thooko."
"313","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne sikhaye hue kutte chhoro aur Allah ka naam lo to jo tumhare liye pakar rakhein us mein se khao agarche maar dein, siwaye is ke ke kutta kha le; kyunke mujhe darr hai ke us ne apne liye pakra ho. Aur agar un mein ghair ke kutte mil jayen to na khao, kyunke tum nahi jaante ke in mein se kis ne maara. Aur agar shikar par teer maro aur use aik ya do din baad pao aur us mein tumhare teer ke nishan ke siwa kuch na ho to khao, aur agar wo pani mein gira ho to na khao."
"314","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apna sikhaya hua kutta chhoro aur wo maar de to khao; aur agar wo kha le to na khao, kyunke us ne apne liye pakra hai. Aur agar us ke saath doosra kutta pao to na khao, kyunke tum ne apne kutte par naam liya tha aur doosre kutte par naam nahi liya tha."
"315","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apna shikari kutta chhoro aur Allah ka naam lo aur naam lekar chhoro to jo tumhara shikari kutta tumhare liye pakre us mein se khao agarche maar de. Aur agar apna kutta chhoro jo shikari na ho aur us ke zibah ko pa lo to khao, aur jo tumhara teer tumhari taraf lautaye us mein se khao agarche maar de, Allah ka naam lo."
"316","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apna kutta chhoro to Allah ka naam lo; phir agar wo tumhare liye pakre aur tum use zinda pao to zibah kar do, phir agar use is haal mein pao ke us ne maar diya ho aur us mein se na khaya ho to kha lo. Aur agar apne kutte ke saath ghair kutta pao jo maar chuka ho to na khao, kyunke tum nahi jaante ke un mein se kis ne maara. Aur agar apna teer maro to Allah ka naam lo; phir agar wo tum se aik din ghayab rahe aur tum us mein apne teer ke nishan ke siwa kuch na pao to agar chaho khao, aur agar use pani mein dooba hua pao to na khao, kyunke tum nahi jaante ke use pani ne maara ya tumhare teer ne."
"317","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bura karo to achcha karo."
"318","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi teen baar ijazat mange aur use ijazat na mile to wapas laut jaye."
"319","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ki biwi masjid jane ki ijazat mange to use na roke."
"320","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi namaz parh raha ho aur us se ijazat mangi jaye to us ki ijazat tasbeeh hai; aur jab aurat namaz parh rahi ho aur us se ijazat mangi jaye to us ki ijazat tasfeeq hai."
"321","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dhale se istinja kare to taaq adad rakhe."
"322","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi pakeezgi hasil kare to apne dayen haath se pakeezgi na hasil kare, apne bayen haath se istinja kare."
"323","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat khushbu lagaye phir logon par guzre taake wo us ki khushbu payen to wo zaniya hai."
"324","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Qibla ki taraf munh karo to takbeer kaho, phir Umm-ul-Quran parho, phir jo chaho parho. Phir jab ruku karo to apni hatheliyan apne ghutnon par rakho, apni peeth seedhi karo aur apne ruku ko pukhta karo. Phir jab apna sar uthao to apni peeth seedhi karo yahan tak ke haddiyan apne joron ki taraf laut jayen. Phir jab sajda karo to apna sajda pukhta karo, phir jab baitho to apni bayen raan par baitho, phir har rakat aur sajde mein aisa hi karo."
"325","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi qasam par israar kare to wo us kaffare se jo us ka hukm diya gaya hai Allah ke nazdeek us ke liye zyada gunah hai. Aur istijlaaj ka matlab hai qasmon ko dohrana aur pakka karna."
"326","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni peeth par leta ho to aik pair doosre par na rakhe."
"327","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab naak mein pani dalo to jhatko, aur jab dhale se istinja karo to taaq adad rakho."
"328","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bachcha cheekh kar paida ho to waris hoga."
"329","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi jaage to kahe: Sab tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne meri rooh mujh par lautayi, mere jism mein mujhe afiyat di aur mujhe apne zikr ki ijazat di."
"330","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar se jaage aur wuzu kare to teen baar naak jhatke, kyunke shaitan us ke naak ke surakhon par raat guzarta hai."
"331","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jaage to apna haath bartan mein dakhil na kare yahan tak ke use dho le."
"332","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jaage to apna haath bartan mein dakhil na kare yahan tak ke use teen baar dho le; kyunke tum mein se koi nahi janta ke us ka haath kahan raat guzar kar aaya hai."
"333","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi raat ko jaage aur apne ghar walon ko jagaye aur donon do rakatein parhein to wo Allah ka kasrat se zikr karne wale mardon aur auraton mein likhe jayenge."
"334","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jaago to namaz parho."
"335","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi Islam laye to wo apni zameen aur maal ka zyada haqdar hai."
"336","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda Islam laye aur us ka Islam achcha ho to Allah us ke liye har wo neki likhta hai jo us ne pehle ki thi aur us se har wo burayi mitayi jati hai jo us ne pehle ki thi; phir us ke baad badla hai, neki ka das guna se saat sau guna tak aur burayi ka us jaisa, siwaye is ke ke Allah darguzar kare."
"337","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda Islam laye aur us ka Islam achcha ho to Allah us se har wo burayi kaffara kar deta hai jo us ne pehle ki thi; aur us ke baad badla hai, neki ka das guna se saat sau guna tak aur burayi ka us jaisa, siwaye is ke ke Allah darguzar kare."
"338","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai par hathiyar se ishara kare to donon jahannam ke kinare par hain; phir agar wo use qatl kar de to donon us mein girenge."
"339","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab garmi sakht ho to namaz ko thanda karke parho, kyunke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai."
"340","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab garmi sakht ho to Zuhar ko thanda karke parho, kyunke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai."
"341","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi laundi kharide to kahe: Ae Allah, main tujh se us ki bhalayi aur us bhalayi ka sawal karta hun jis par tune use banaya hai, aur teri panah mangta hun us ke shar se aur us shar se jis par tune use banaya hai; aur barkat ki dua kare. Aur jab tum mein se koi unt kharide to us ke kohan ki choti pakre, barkat ki dua kare aur aisa hi kahe."
"342","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab becha hua samaan kharido to use na becho yahan tak ke use qabz kar lo."
"343","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Musalman banda beemar ho to Allah taala likhne walon se farmata hai: Us ke liye sab se afzal likho jo wo khula hone ki haalat mein karta tha, yahan tak ke main use aazad karun."
"344","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin beemar ho to use gunahon se aise khalis kiya jata hai jaise bhatti lohe ke zang ko khalis karti hai."
"345","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ehram wala apni aankhon ki shikayat kare to un par musabbar lagaye."
"346","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab takleef mehsoos karo to apna haath jahan takleef ho rakho, phir kaho: Bismillah, main Allah ki izzat aur qudrat ki panah mangta hun us shar se jo main apne is dard mein pata hun. Phir apna haath uthao phir taaq baar dobara karo."
"347","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko musibat pahunche to meri wajah se apni musibat yaad kare, kyunke ye sab se bari musibaton mein se hai."
"348","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko gham ya sakhti pahunche to kahe: Allah Allah mera Rab hai, main us ke saath kisi ko shareek nahi karta."
"349","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mukatab par hadd jari ho ya use wirasat mile to wo us miqdar par waris hoga jitna aazad hua hai, aur us par usi miqdar par hadd qaim ki jayegi jitna us mein se aazad hua hai."
"350","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke kapre ko haiz ka khoon lage to use noch le, phir use pani se dhoye, phir us mein namaz parhe."
"351","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ibn Adam subah karta hai to tamam aaza zaban ke saamne aajizi karte hain aur kehte hain: Hamare baare mein Allah se dar, kyunke ham tere saath hain; agar tu seedhi rahi to ham seedhe rahenge aur agar tu terhi hui ¤ to ham terhe honge."
"352","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi subah kare to kahe: Ham ne subah ki aur saari badshahi Allah Rabbul Aalamin ke liye subah hui; Ae Allah, main tujh se is din ki bhalayi, us ki fatah, us ki madad, us ke noor, us ki barkat aur us ki hidayat ka sawal karta hun, aur teri panah mangta hun us ke shar se, us se pehle ke shar se aur us ke baad ke shar se. Phir jab shaam kare to aisa hi kahe."
"353","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi subah kare to kahe: Ae Allah, tere saath ham ne subah ki, tere saath ham ne shaam ki, tere saath ham jeete hain, tere saath ham marte hain aur teri taraf lautna hai. Aur jab shaam kare to kahe: Ae Allah, tere saath ham ne shaam ki, tere saath ham ne subah ki, tere saath ham jeete hain, tere saath ham marte hain aur teri taraf uthna hai."
"354","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab subah karo to kaho: Ae Allah, tere saath ham ne subah ki, tere saath ham ne shaam ki, tere saath ham jeete hain, tere saath ham marte hain aur teri taraf lautna hai."
"355","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do Musalman aadmi saath chalein phir un ke darmiyan darakht, pathar ya mitti haail ho to aik doosre ko salam kare aur salam ka len-den karein."
"356","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi safar lamba kare to raat ko achanak apne ghar walon ke paas na aaye."
"357","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi kisi aadmi par bharosa kare phir us ke bharosa karne ke baad use qatl kar de to qayamat ke din us ke liye dhoke ka jhanda nasb kiya jayega."
"358","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah tum mein se kisi ko bhalayi de to apne aap se aur apne ghar walon se shuru kare."
"359","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhein baghair mange kuch diya jaye to khao aur sadqa karo."
"360","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi biwi, khadim ya janwar hasil kare to us ki peshani pakre, barkat ki dua kare aur kahe: Ae Allah, main tujh se us ki bhalayi aur us bhalayi ka sawal karta hun jis par tune use banaya hai, aur teri panah mangta hun us ke shar se aur us shar se jis par tune use banaya hai. Aur agar unt ho to us ke kohan ki choti pakre."
"361","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apna haath apni sharmgah tak pahunchaye to wuzu kare."
"362","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apna haath apni sharmgah tak pahunchaye aur us ke aur us ke darmiyan koi parda ya aar na ho to us par wuzu wajib ho gaya."
"363","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi iftar kare to khajoor se iftar kare, kyunke us mein barkat hai; phir agar khajoor na paye to pani se iftar kare, kyunke wo paak karne wala hai."
"364","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat idhar se aaye, din idhar se jaye aur suraj ghurub ho jaye to rozedar ne iftar kar liya."
"365","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab zamana qareeb ho to Musalman aadmi ka khwab shaz hi jhoota hoga, aur un mein sab se sachcha khwab us ka hoga jo baat mein sab se sachcha ho."
"366","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin ko us ki qabr mein bithaya jayega to us ke paas aaya jayega, phir wo gawahi dega ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain; pas yehi Allah ka farman hai ke Allah iman walon ko pukhta baat ke saath sabit rakhta hai."
"367","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho jaye to apne unt par logon ke peeche tawaaf karo."
"368","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho jaye to takbeer kaho, phir Quran mein se jo aasan ho parho, phir ruku karo yahan tak ke ruku mein mutmain ho jao, phir utho yahan tak ke khare seedhe ho jao, phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein mutmain ho jao, phir utho yahan tak ke baith kar mutmain ho jao, phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein mutmain ho jao, phir apni poori namaz mein aisa hi karo."
"369","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho jaye to daudte hue na aao, chalte hue aao aur tum par sukoon ho; jo pao parho aur jo reh jaye use poora karo."
"370","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho jaye to khare na ho yahan tak ke mujhe dekho."
"371","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho jaye to farz ke siwa koi namaz nahi."
"372","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho aur tum mein se koi rozedar ho to Maghrib ki namaz se pehle raat ke khane se shuru kare, aur apne raat ke khane mein jaldi na kare."
"373","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho aur aadmi qaza-e-hajat chahe to qaza-e-hajat se shuru kare."
"374","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz khari ho aur raat ka khana hazir ho to raat ke khane se shuru karo."
"375","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi surma lagaye to taaq baar lagaye, aur jab dhale se istinja kare to taaq baar kare."
"376","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo tum par kasrat karein to unhein teer maro aur apne teer bacha kar rakho."
"377","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai ko kafir kahe to wo un donon mein se aik par laut ayega."
"378","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khana khaye aur us ka luqma gir jaye to jo use shak ho use door kare phir use kha le aur use shaitan ke liye na chhore."
"379","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khana khaye to apna haath rumal se na ponchhe yahan tak ke use chaat le ya chatwa le."
"380","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khana khaye to Allah ka naam le; phir agar bhool jaye ke shuru mein Allah ka naam le to kahe: Shuru aur aakhir par Bismillah."
"381","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khana khaye to kahe: Ae Allah, hamare liye us mein barkat de aur hamein us se behtar badal de; aur jab doodh piye to kahe: Ae Allah, hamare liye us mein barkat de aur hamein us mein se zyada de; kyunke koi cheez khane aur peene ki jagah kaafi nahi hoti siwaye doodh ke."
"382","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khana khaye to apni ungliyan chaat le, kyunke wo nahi janta ke us ke khane ke kis hisse mein barkat hai."
"383","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaye to apne dayen haath se khaye aur jab piye to apne dayen haath se piye, ¤ kyunke shaitan apne bayen haath se khata hai aur apne bayen haath se peeta hai."
"384","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaye to apne dayen haath se khaye, apne dayen haath se piye, apne dayen haath se pakre aur apne dayen haath se de; kyunke shaitan apne bayen haath se khata hai, apne bayen haath se peeta hai, apne bayen haath se pakarta hai aur apne bayen haath se deta hai."
"385","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab donon khatna ki jaghein mil jayen to ghusl wajib ho gaya."
"386","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab donon khatna ki jaghein mil jayen aur hashfa ghayab ho jaye to ghusl wajib ho gaya, mani nikle ya na nikle."
"387","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do Musalman apni talwaron ke saath milein aur aik doosre ko qatl kar de to qatil aur maqtool donon aag mein honge. Kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, ye to qatil hai, maqtool ka kiya haal hai? Farmaya: Wo apne saathi ke qatl par harees tha."
"388","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do Musalman milein aur aik apne bhai par hathiyar uthaye to donon jahannam ke kinare par hain; phir jab aik doosre ko qatl kar de to donon us mein dakhil honge."
"389","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi aadmi ke dil mein kisi aurat ko paigham dene ki baat dale to use dekhne mein koi harj nahi."
"390","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko mazi aaye aur us ne biwi ko chhua na ho to apne zakar aur khusyon ko dhoye phir wuzu kare aur namaz parhe."
"391","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi logon ki imamat kare to halki parhe, kyunke un mein chhota, bara, kamzor, beemar aur hajat-mand hota hai; aur jab akele parhe to jitna chahe lambi kare."
"392","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi logon ki imamat kare to un ke muqam se unchi jagah par khara na ho."
"393","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum logon ki imamat karo to Surah Shams, Surah Aala aur Surah Lail parho."
"394","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi qaum ki imamat karo to un ke saath namaz halki parho."
"395","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam aameen kahe to aameen kaho; kyunke jis ki aameen farishton ki aameen ke muwafiq ho us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"396","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab parhne wala aameen kahe to aameen kaho; kyunke farishte aameen kehte hain, pas jis ki aameen farishton ki aameen ke muwafiq ho us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"397","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Shaban aadha ho jaye to roza na rakho yahan tak ke Ramazan ho."
"398","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi joota pehne to dayen se shuru kare aur jab utare to bayen se shuru kare, taake dayan pehna jane mein pehla aur utara jane mein aakhri ho."
"399","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi majlis tak pahunche, agar us ke liye jagah kushada ki jaye to baithe, warna sab se kushada jagah dekhe jo nazar aaye us mein baithe."
"400","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi majlis tak pahunche to salam kare; phir agar baithne ka irada ho to baithe, phir jab khara ho to salam kare; pas pehla doosre se zyada haqdar nahi."
"401","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi qaum par azab nazil kare to azab un sab ko pahunchta hai jo un mein hon, phir wo apne aamaal par uthaye jayenge."
"402","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne ghar walon par kharch kare aur us par sawab ki niyyat rakhe to wo us ke liye sadqa hoga."
"403","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne shohar ke ghar se us ke hukm ke baghair kharch kare to us ke liye us ke ajr ka aadha hoga."
"404","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne shohar ke ghar se baghair fasad ke kharch kare to jo us ne kharch kiya us par us ke liye ajr hoga, jo us ne kamaya us par us ke shohar ke liye ajr hoga, aur khazanchi ke liye aisa hi hoga; wo aik doosre ke ajr mein se kuch kami nahi karenge."
"405","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka jootay ka tasma toot jaye to aik joote mein na chale yahan tak ke apna tasma theek kar le, na aik moze mein chale, na bayen haath se khaye, na aik kapre mein guth-muth ho, na chadar ko is tarah lapete ke haath bahar na nikal saken."
"406","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke jootay ka tasma toot jaye to doosre mein na chale yahan tak ke use theek kar le."
"407","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar par aaye to use apne tehband ke andaruni hisse se jhaare, kyunke wo nahi janta ke us ke peeche us par kiya hai; phir apni dayen karwat par lete, phir kahe: Tere naam se ae mere Rab maine apna pehlu rakha aur tere saath uthata hun; agar tu meri jaan rok le to us par rehem kar, aur agar use chhor de to us ki hifazat kar jis se tu apne naik bandon ki hifazat karta hai."
"408","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne shohar ke bistar se munh pher kar raat guzare to farishte us par subah tak lanat karte hain."
"409","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi bakri ya doodh wali oontni beche to us ke than mein doodh na roke."
"410","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi peshab kare to apne zakar ko apne dayen haath se na chhue, jab qaza-e-hajat mein dakhil ho to apne dayen haath se saaf na kare, aur jab piye to bartan mein saans na le."
"411","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bea karo to kaho ke dhoka nahi."
"412","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suraj ka kinara zahir ho to namaz ko moakhkhar karo yahan tak ke nikal aaye, aur jab suraj ka kinara ghayab ho to namaz ko moakhkhar karo yahan tak ke ghayab ho jaye."
"413","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab meri taraf kisi aadmi ko bhejo to khubsurat chehre aur achche naam wala bhejo."
"414","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab meri ummat mein se aadmi saath saal ko pahunch jaye to Allah ne umar mein us par hujjat poori kar di."
"415","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah bande ko saath saal tak pahunchaye to us par hujjat poori kar di aur umar mein use poora pahuncha diya."
"416","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab pani do kulle ho jaye to gandagi nahi uthata."
"417","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab pani do kulle ho jaye to use koi cheez napak nahi karti."
"418","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare bachche saat saal ke ho jayen to un ke bistar juda kar do, aur jab das saal ke ho jayen to unhein namaz par maro."
"419","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Abul Aas ki aulad tees mard ho jayen to wo Allah ke bandon ko ghulam banayenge, Allah ke maal ko gardish wala maal banayenge aur Allah ki kitab ko kharabi banayenge."
"420","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Hayya alas-salah par pahuncho to kaho ke namaz neend se behtar hai."
"421","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do khalifaon ki baiat ki jaye to un mein se pichhle ko qatl kar do."
"422","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do aadmi bea karein to un mein se har aik ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak juda na hon aur donon jama hon, ya aik doosre ko ikhtiyar de; phir agar aik doosre ko ikhtiyar de aur us par bea karein to bea wajib ho gayi, aur agar bea karne ke baad juda hon aur un mein se kisi ne bea na chhori to bea wajib ho gayi."
"423","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum eena ke saath bea karo, gaayon ki dumein pakar lo, kheti par raazi ho jao aur jihad chhor do to Allah tum par zillat musallat kar dega jise nahi hatayega yahan tak ke tum apne deen ki taraf laut aao."
"424","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab janaze ke peeche chalo to na baitho yahan tak ke rakh diya jaye."
"425","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to jitna ho sake use roke; kyunke jab tum mein se koi haa kahe to shaitan us se hansta hai."
"426","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to apna haath apne munh par rakhe, kyunke shaitan jamahi ke saath dakhil hota hai."
"427","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein jamahi le to jitna ho sake roke, kyunke shaitan dakhil hota hai."
"428","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi nikah kare to us se kaho ke Allah tumhare liye barkat de aur tum par barkat nazil kare."
"429","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kunwari se sayyiba par nikah kare to us ke paas saat din rahe, aur jab sayyiba se kunwari par nikah kare to us ke paas teen din rahe."
"430","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda nikah kare to us ne aadha deen mukammal kar liya; pas use baaqi aadhe mein ¤ Allah se darna chahiye."
"431","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mere naam par naam rakho to meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho."
"432","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi tashahhud parhe to chaar cheezon se panah mange: jahannam ke azab se, qabr ke azab se, zindagi aur maut ke fitne se aur Maseeh Dajjal ke shar se; phir apne liye jo chahe dua kare."
"433","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do Musalman musafaha karein to un ki hatheliyan juda nahi hotin yahan tak ke un donon ko bakhsh diya jata hai."
"434","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi pakeezgi hasil kare phir namaz ki nigrani karte hue masjid ki taraf chale to us ke likhne wale ke liye har qadam par jo wo masjid ki taraf uthata hai das nekiyan likhte hain; aur baitha hua jo namaz ki nigrani kare wo qiyam karne wale jaisa hai aur namaziyon mein likha jata hai jab se apne ghar se nikle yahan tak ke us ki taraf laut aaye."
"435","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas do aadmi faisla layen to pehle ke liye faisla na karo yahan tak ke doosre ki baat sun lo; jald jaan loge ke kaisa faisla karo."
"436","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah wahi se kalaam kare to neeche wale aasman wale zanjeer ke chikni chattan par ghisatne jaisi jhankar sunte hain aur behosh ho jate hain; wo isi haal mein rehte hain yahan tak ke un ke paas Jibreel aate hain, phir jab Jibreel un ke paas aate hain to un ke dilon se ghabrahat door ho jati hai aur wo kehte hain: Ae Jibreel, tumhare Rab ne kiya kaha? Wo kehte hain: Haq. To wo kehte hain: Haq, haq."
"437","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aarzu kare to kasrat se kare, kyunke wo apne Rab se mangta hai."
"438","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi naak saaf kare to apne chehre ke saamne ya apne dayen taraf na thookay, aur apne bayen taraf ya apne bayen qadam ke neeche thookay."
"439","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein ho aur naak saaf kare to apni naak ki gandagi chhupaye, kahin momin ki khaal ya kapre ko na lage aur use takleef de."
"440","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare aur achcha wuzu kare phir namaz ki taraf nikle to wo apna dayan qadam nahi uthata magar Allah azza wa jal us ke liye neki likhta hai, aur apna bayan qadam nahi rakhta magar Allah us se burayi mitata hai; pas tum mein se koi qareeb ho ya door ho. Phir agar masjid aaye aur jamaat se namaz parhe to use bakhsh diya jayega; phir agar masjid aaye aur wo kuch parh chuke hon aur kuch baaqi ho to jo paye parhe aur jo reh jaye use poora kare; phir agar masjid aaye aur wo parh chuke hon aur namaz poori kar le to aisa hi hoga."
"441","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare aur achcha wuzu kare phir masjid ki taraf nikle ¤ jise sirf namaz nikalti ho to us ka bayan pair us se burayi mitata rahega aur dayan us ke liye neki likhta rahega yahan tak ke masjid mein dakhil ho. Aur agar log jaante ke Isha aur Fajr mein kiya hai to ghisat-te hue bhi aate."
"442","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare aur achcha wuzu kare phir masjid ka qasd karke nikle to apne haathon mein ungliyan na phansaye, kyunke wo namaz mein hai."
"443","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare to apni naak mein pani dale phir naak jhatke, aur jab dhale se istinja kare to taaq adad rakhe."
"444","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare to apni naak mein pani dale phir naak saaf kare, aur jab naak saaf kare to taaq baar saaf kare."
"445","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne ghar mein wuzu kare phir masjid aaye to wapas lautne tak namaz mein hoga; pas aisa na kahe: aur unhon ne apni ungliyon mein ungliyan phansayin."
"446","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz ke liye wuzu kare to apni ungliyon mein ungliyan na phansaye."
"447","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare aur apne moze pehan le to un mein namaz parhe aur un par masah kare, phir unhein na utare agar chahe siwaye janabat ke."
"448","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Musalman aadmi wuzu kare to us ke gunah us ke kaan, aankh, haathon aur pairon se nikal jate hain; phir agar baithe to bakhsha hua baithe."
"449","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin banda wuzu kare aur kulli kare to gunah us ke munh se nikal jate hain; phir jab naak saaf kare to gunah us ki naak se nikal jate hain; phir jab apna chehra dhoye to gunah us ke chehre se nikal jate hain yahan tak ke us ki aankhon ki palkon ke neeche se nikalte hain; phir jab apne haath dhoye to gunah us ke haathon se nikal jate hain yahan tak ke us ke haathon ke nakhunon ke neeche se nikalte hain; phir jab apne sar ka masah kare to gunah us ke sar se nikal jate hain yahan tak ke us ke kaanon se nikalte hain; phir jab apne pair dhoye to gunah us ke pairon se nikal jate hain yahan tak ke us ke pairon ke nakhunon ke neeche se nikalte hain. Phir us ka masjid ki taraf chalna aur us ki namaz us ke liye nafl hogi."
"450","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Musalman ya momin banda wuzu kare aur apna chehra dhoye to us ke chehre se har wo gunah nikal jata hai jise us ne apni aankhon se dekha tha, pani ke saath ya pani ke aakhri qatre ke saath; phir jab apne haath dhoye to us ke haathon se har wo gunah nikal jata hai jo us ke haathon ne pakra tha, pani ke saath ya pani ke aakhri qatre ke saath; phir jab apne pair dhoye to har wo gunah nikal jata hai jis par us ke pair chale thay, pani ke saath ya pani ke aakhri qatre ke saath, yahan tak ke wo gunahon se paak nikalta hai."
"451","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karo to naak jhatko, aur jab dhale se istinja karo to taaq adad rakho."
"452","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karo to apne haathon aur pairon ki ungliyon mein khilal karo."
"453","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karo to ungliyon mein khilal karo."
"454","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wuzu karo to apne dayen se shuru karo."
"455","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wafat pa jaye aur kuch paye to use dhari-daar kapre mein kafan de."
"456","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye iqamat kahi jaye to daudte hue na aao, sukoon ke saath aao; jo pao parho aur jo reh jaye use poora karo, kyunke jab tum mein se koi namaz ka qasd karke chale to wo namaz mein hai."
"457","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi juma mein aaye to kisi ko us ki jagah se na uthaye phir us mein baithe."
"458","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi juma mein aaye to ghusl kare."
"459","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein aaye to aahista ¤ chale; jo paye parhe aur jo reh jaye use qaza kare."
"460","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid aaye to baithne se pehle do sajde kare, phir us ke baad baithe agar chahe ya apni hajat ke liye chala jaye."
"461","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid aaye to dekhe; phir agar apne jooton mein gandagi ya takleef-deh cheez dekhe to ponchh de aur un mein namaz parhe."
"462","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi majlis mein aaye aur us ke liye jagah kushada ki jaye to baithe; kyunke ye izzat hai jo Allah ne use di hai aur us ke Musalman bhai ne; phir agar us ke liye jagah kushada na ki jaye to sab se kushada jagah dekhe aur us mein baithe."
"463","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aaye aur us ka bhai us ke liye jagah kushada kare to ye izzat hai jo Allah ne use di hai."
"464","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi juma ke din aaye aur imam khutba de raha ho to do rakatein parhe aur un mein ikhtisar kare."
"465","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab koi kutte ki qeemat mangne aaye to us ki hatheli mitti se bhar do."
"466","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi beemar ki iyadat ke liye aaye to kahe: Ae Allah, ¤ apne falan bande ko shifa de taake wo teri taraf se dushman ko zakhmi kare ya teri taraf se namaz ki taraf chale."
"467","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aao to logon ke saath namaz parho agarche tum parh chuke ho."
"468","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum namaz mein aao aur ham sajde mein hon to sajda karo aur use kuch na gino; aur jo rakat pa le us ne namaz pa li."
"469","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim us ka khana laye to use apne saath bithaye ya us mein se use de; kyunke usi ne us ki garmi aur dhuwen ki takleef uthayi hai."
"470","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan aaye to jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, aag ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur shayateen jakar diye jate hain."
"471","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan aaye to rehmat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, jahannam ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur shayateen zanjeeron mein jakar diye jate hain."
"472","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan aaye to tees din roza rakho siwaye is ke ke us se pehle chand dekh lo."
"473","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas is maal mein se kuch aaye aur tum lalach na karte ho na mangte ho to use le lo; aur jo na ho us ke peeche apne nafs ko na lagao."
"474","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi se mila phir sust ho jaye to jo us se aurat ko laga ho use dhoye phir wuzu kare."
"475","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khatna khatne se guzar jaye to ghusl wajib ho gaya."
"476","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne saamne oont ke paalan ki pichhli lakri jaisi cheez rakho to jo tumhare saamne se guzre wo tumhein nuqsan nahi dega."
"477","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni hajat ke liye baithe to Qibla ki taraf munh na kare aur na peeth kare."
"478","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas do jhagralu baithein aur tum aik ki sun lo to aik ke liye faisla na karo yahan tak ke doosre se sun lo jaise pehle se suna tha; kyunke jab tum aisa karoge to tum par faisla wazeh ho jayega."
"479","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab us ki chaar shakhon ke darmiyan baithe phir us par mehnat kare to us par ¤ ghusl wajib ho gaya agarche mani na nikle."
"480","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab us ki chaar shakhon ke darmiyan baithe aur khatna khatne ko chhu le to ghusl wajib ho gaya."
"481","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mayyat ko dhuni do to taaq adad rakho."
"482","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah awwalin o aakhirin ko us din ke liye jama kare jis mein koi shak nahi to pukarne wala pukarega ke jo Allah ke liye kiye hue amal mein kisi ko shareek karta tha wo us ka sawab usi se mange; kyunke Allah shirk se shareekon mein sab se zyada be-niyaz hai."
"483","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah awwalin o aakhirin ko qayamat ke din jama karega to har dhokebaz ke liye jhanda buland kiya jayega aur kaha jayega: Ye falan bin falan ki dhokebazi hai."
"484","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhare dil mein koi cheez khatke to use chhor do."
"485","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bachcha hajj kare to wo us ke liye hajj hai yahan tak ke wo aaqil ho; phir jab aaqil ho to us par doosra hajj hai. Aur jab dehati hajj kare to wo us ke liye hajj hai, phir jab hijrat kare to us par ¤ doosra hajj hai."
"486","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi koi hadees bayan kare phir tawajjuh kare to wo amanat hai."
"487","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke paas aisa muamla aaye jis ke guzar jane ka darr ho to ye namaz parhe, yani donon namazon ko jama karna."
"488","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni masjid mein namaz mein hazir ho to apne ghar ke liye apni namaz mein se hissa rakhe; kyunke Allah us ki namaz se us ke ghar mein bhalayi rakhega."
"489","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ulama qayamat ke din apne Rab ke paas hazir honge to Muaz bin Jabal un ke aage pathar phenkne ki doori par honge."
"490","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin hazir ho to us ke paas rehmat ke farishte safed resham lekar aate hain aur kehte hain: Nikal, raazi aur pasandida, rooh, khushbu aur ghair-ghazabnak Rab ki taraf. Pas wo kasturi ki behtareen khushbu ki tarah nikalta hai yahan tak ke baaz un mein se baaz ko dete hain yahan tak ke use aasman ke darwaze par le aate hain aur kehte hain: Ye khushbu kitni paakiza hai jo tumhare paas zameen se aayi hai. Phir use mominon ki roohon ke paas le aate hain aur wo us se tum mein se kisi se zyada khush hote hain jo apne ghayab ke aane par hota hai. To wo us se poochte hain: Falan ne kiya kiya? Falan ne kiya kiya? To wo kehte hain: Use chhor do, wo duniya ke gham mein tha. Phir jab wo kahe: Kiya wo tumhare paas nahi aaya? Wo kahenge: Use us ki maan Hawiya ki taraf le jaya gaya. ¤ Aur jab kafir hazir ho to us ke paas azab ke farishte taat lekar aate hain aur kehte hain: Nikal, naraz aur na-pasandida, Allah ke azab ki taraf. Pas wo murdar ki badtareen badbu ki tarah nikalta hai yahan tak ke use zameen ke darwaze par le aate hain aur kehte hain: Ye badbu kitni buri hai? Yahan tak ke use kafiron ki roohon ke paas le aate hain."
"491","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mayyat ditem paas hazir ho to bhalayi kaho, kyunke farishte jo tum kehte ho us par aameen kehte hain."
"492","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne murdon ke paas hazir ho to aankh band kar do, kyunke aankh rooh ke peeche jati hai; aur bhalayi kaho, kyunke farishte ghar walon ki baat par aameen kehte hain."
"493","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab hakim faisla kare aur ijtihad kare aur durust ho to us ke liye do ajr hain; aur jab faisla kare aur ijtihad kare aur ghalti kare to us ke liye aik ajr hai."
"494","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab faisla karo to insaf karo, aur jab qatl karo to achcha tareeqa ikhtiyar karo; kyunke Allah ehsan karne wala hai aur ehsan karne walon se mohabbat karta hai."
"495","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi qasam khaye to na kahe ke jo Allah chahe aur tum chaho, lekin kahe ke jo Allah chahe phir tum chaho."
"496","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khwab dekhe to logon ko khwab mein shaitan ke khel ki khabar na de."
"497","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko bukhar ho to subah ke waqt teen raaton tak us par thanda pani bahaye."
"498","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khatna karo to zyada na karo, kyunke ye aurat ke liye zyada ba-barkat aur shohar ke liye zyada mehboob hai."
"499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne ghar se nikle aur kahe: Allah ke naam se, maine Allah par tawakkul kiya, gunaah se bachne aur neki ki taqat sirf Allah se hai; to us se kaha jata hai: Tumhein kaafi hai, tumhein hidayat di gayi, tumhein kaafi kiya gaya aur tumhein bachaya gaya. Pas shaitan us se hat jata hai aur us se doosra shaitan kehta hai: Tumhara us aadmi se kiya kaam jisay hidayat di gayi, kaafi kiya gaya aur bachaya gaya?"
"500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab teen safar mein niklein to apne mein se aik ko ameer banayen."
"501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aurat masjid ki taraf nikle to khushbu ke qareeb na jaye."
"502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab lanat apne kehne wale ke munh se nikle to dekhti hai; phir agar us mein rasta paye jis ki taraf use bheja gaya tha to theek, warna usi ki taraf laut aati hai jis se nikli thi."
"503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat masjid ki taraf nikle to khushbu se ghusl kare jaise janabat se ghusl karti hai."
"504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin bande ki rooh nikle to do farishte use lete hain aur use lekar charhte hain; phir us ki paakiza khushbu ka zikr kiya; aur aasman wale kehte hain: Paakiza rooh jo zameen ki taraf se aayi, Allah tum par aur us jism par durood bheje jise tum aabaad karti thin. Pas use us ke Rab ki taraf le jaya jata hai, phir wo farmata hai: Use aakhri muddat tak le jao. Aur jab kafir ki rooh nikle to us ki badbu ka zikr kiya, aur aasman wale kehte hain: Khabees rooh jo zameen ki taraf se aayi; to kaha jayega: Use aakhri muddat tak le jao."
"505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne ghar se niklo to do rakatein parho jo tumhein bure nikalne se rokengi, aur jab apne ghar mein dakhil ho to do rakatein parho jo tumhein bure dakhil hone se rokengi."
"506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aurat ko paigham de aur us mein se us cheez ko dekhne ki taqat rakhe jo use us se nikah ki targheeb de to kare."
"507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aurat ko paigham de to use dekhne mein koi harj nahi agar wo use sirf apne paigham ke liye dekhta ho agarche wo na jaanti ho."
"508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khatna karo to upar se lagao aur zyada na karo, kyunke ye chehre ke liye zyada khubsurat aur shohar ke liye zyada pasandida hai."
"509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khatna karo to upar se lagao aur zyada na karo, kyunke ye chehre ke liye zyada ¤ roshan aur shohar ke nazdeek zyada pasandida hai."
"510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin aag se nijaat pa jayenge to jannat aur aag ke darmiyan pul par rok liye jayenge; pas duniya mein un ke darmiyan jo mazalim thay un ka badla liya jayega yahan tak ke jab saaf aur pakeeza ho jayenge to unhein jannat mein dakhil hone ki ijazat di jayegi. Pas qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, un mein se har aik apne jannat ke ghar ko duniya mein apne ghar se zyada pehchanega."
"511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chamra rang liya jaye to paak ho gaya."
"512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab murdar ki khaal rang li jaye to yehi kaafi hai, pas us se faida uthaya jaye."
"513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to na baithe yahan tak ke do rakatein parh le."
"514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to Nabi par salam bheje aur kahe: Ae Allah, mere liye apni rehmat ke darwaze khol de; aur jab nikle to Nabi par salam bheje aur kahe: Ae Allah, mujhe shaitan se bacha."
"515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to Nabi par salam bheje aur kahe: Ae Allah, mere liye apni rehmat ke darwaze khol de; aur jab nikle to Nabi par salam bheje aur kahe: Ae Allah, main tujh se tere fazl ka sawal karta hun."
"516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par durood bheje aur kahe: Ae Allah, mere liye apni rehmat ke darwaze khol de; aur jab nikle to Nabi par salam bheje aur kahe: Ae Allah, main tujh se tere fazl ka sawal karta hun."
"517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi logon ke paas dakhil ho aur us ke liye jagah kushada ki jaye to baithe; kyunke ye Allah ki taraf se izzat hai jo us ke Musalman bhai ne use di hai. Phir agar us ke liye jagah kushada na ki jaye to sab se kushada jagah dekhe aur us mein baithe."
"518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne Musalman bhai ke paas dakhil ho aur wo use apne khane mein se khilaye to khaye aur us ke baare mein na poochhe; aur agar use apne mashroob mein se pilaye to piye aur us ke baare mein na poochhe."
"519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne ghar mein dakhil ho aur dakhil hote waqt aur khate waqt Allah taala ka naam le to shaitan kehta hai: Yahan tumhare liye na raat guzarna hai na raat ka khana. Aur agar dakhil ho aur dakhil hote waqt Allah ka naam na le to shaitan kehta hai: Tum ne raat guzarna pa liya; aur agar apne khane par Allah ka naam na le to kehta hai: Tum ne raat guzarna aur raat ka khana pa liya."
"520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ashra dakhil ho aur tum mein se koi qurbani karna chahe to apne baal ya khaal mein se kuch na kate."
"521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jannat wale jannat mein aur aag wale aag mein dakhil honge to pukarne wala pukarega: Ae jannat walo, beshak tumhare liye Allah ke paas aik wada hai jise wo tum se poora karna chahta hai. To wo kahenge: Wo kiya hai? Kiya Allah ne hamare tarazu bhari nahi kiye, hamare chehre safed nahi kiye, hamein jannat mein dakhil nahi kiya aur hamein aag se nijaat nahi di? Pas parda hata diya jayega aur wo us ki taraf dekhenge; Allah ki qasam, Allah ne unhein us ki taraf dekhne se zyada mehboob aur un ki aankhon ke liye zyada thandak wali koi cheez nahi di."
"522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jannat wale jannat mein aur aag wale aag mein dakhil honge to maut ko safed mendhe ki tarah laya jayega aur jannat aur aag ke darmiyan khara kiya jayega. Phir kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo, kiya tum ise pehchante ho? To wo gardanen uthayenge, dekhenge aur kahenge: Haan, ye maut hai, aur un sab ne use dekha hoga. Phir pukara jayega: Ae aag walo, kiya tum ise pehchante ho? To wo gardanen uthayenge, dekhenge aur kahenge: Haan, ye maut hai, aur un sab ne use dekha hoga. Pas us ke baare mein hukm diya jayega aur wo zibah kar di jayegi, aur kaha jayega: Ae jannat walo, hamesha rehna hai, maut nahi; aur ae aag walo, hamesha rehna hai, maut nahi."
"523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jannat wale jannat mein dakhil honge to Allah taala farmayega: Kiya tum chahte ho ke main tumhein kuch zyada dun? To wo kahenge: Kiya tune hamare chehre safed nahi kiye? Kiya tune hamein jannat mein dakhil nahi kiya aur hamein aag se nijaat nahi di? Pas parda hata diya jayega aur unhein apne Rab ki taraf dekhne se zyada mehboob koi cheez nahi di jayegi."
"524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jannat wale jannat mein dakhil honge to Allah azza wa jal farmayega: Kiya tum kisi cheez ki khwahish rakhte ho ke main tumhein zyada dun? To wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, jo tune hamein diya us se upar kiya hai? To wo farmayega: Meri khushnudi sab se bari hai."
"525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko dakhil ho to apne ghar walon par dakhil na ho yahan tak ke ¤ ghayab aurat zer-naaf baal saaf kar le aur bikhre baalon wali kanghi kar le."
"526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi ghar mein dakhil ho to us ke ghar walon ko salam karo; phir jab niklo to us ke ghar walon ko salam ke saath alwida kaho."
"527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab masjid mein dakhil ho to logon ke saath namaz parho agarche tum parh chuke ho."
"528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan ka mahina dakhil ho to jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, jahannam ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur shayateen zanjeeron mein jakar diye jate hain."
"529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ko bulaye to qabool kare, shaadi ho ya us jaisa."
"530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dua kare to na kahe ke Ae Allah agar tu chahe to mujhe bakhsh de; sawal pukhta kare aur raghbat barhaye, kyunke Allah par koi cheez jo wo ata kare bari nahi."
"531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dua kare to sawal pukhta kare aur na kahe ke Ae Allah agar tu chahe to mujhe ata kar; kyunke Allah par koi majboor karne wala nahi."
"532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar par bulaye aur wo inkar kar de aur wo us par ¤ naraz raat guzare to farishte subah tak us par lanat karte hain."
"533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar par bulaye to qabool kare agarche wo kajawe ki peeth par ho."
"534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apni hajat ke liye bulaye to us ke paas aaye agarche wo tandoor par ho."
"535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ghayab ghayab ke liye dua kare to farishta us se kehta hai: Aur tumhare liye aisa hi ho."
"536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi waleeme ki taraf bulaya jaye to us mein aaye."
"537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khane ki taraf bulaya jaye to qabool kare; phir agar chahe khaye aur agar chahe na khaye."
"538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khane ki taraf bulaya jaye to qabool kare; phir agar rozedar na ho to khaye aur agar rozedar ho to barkat ki dua kare."
"539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khane ki taraf bulaya jaye to qabool kare; phir agar rozedar na ho to khaye aur agar rozedar ho to namaz parhe."
"540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khane ki taraf bulaya jaye aur wo rozedar ho to kahe ke main rozedar hun."
"541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi shaadi ke waleeme ki taraf bulaya jaye to qabool kare."
"542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi waleeme ki taraf bulaya jaye to qabool kare agarche rozedar ho."
"543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi bulaya jaye aur qasid ke saath aaye to ye us ke liye ijazat hai."
"544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dast ke gosht ki taraf bulaye jao to qabool karo."
"545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mere sahaba ka zikr kiya jaye to ruko, jab sitaron ka zikr kiya jaye to ruko, aur jab taqdeer ka zikr kiya jaye to ruko."
"546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ke zariye yaad-dihani ki jaye to ruk jao."
"547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi qaza-e-hajat ki taraf jaye to apne saath teen pathar le jaye jin se pakeezgi hasil kare; kyunke ye us ke liye kaafi honge."
"548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi achcha khwab dekhe to us ki tabeer kare aur us ki khabar de; aur jab bura khwab dekhe to us ki tabeer na kare aur us ki khabar na de."
"549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khwab dekhe jo use mehboob ho to wo sirf Allah ki taraf se hai; pas Allah ki hamd kare aur us ki khabar de. Aur jab is ke siwa dekhe jo use na-pasand ho to wo sirf shaitan ki taraf se hai; pas Allah ki panah mange aur use kisi ko na bataye, kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi dega."
"550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khwab dekhe jo use mehboob ho to wo sirf Allah ki taraf se hai; pas Allah ki hamd kare aur us ki khabar de. Aur jab is ke siwa dekhe jo use na-pasand ho to wo sirf shaitan ki taraf se hai; pas us ke shar se Allah ki panah mange aur use kisi ko na bataye, kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi dega."
"551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khwab dekhe jo use na-pasand ho to apne bayen taraf teen baar thookay, teen baar shaitan se Allah ki panah mange aur jis karwat par tha us se palat jaye."
"552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisi aurat dekhe jo use achchi lage to apne ghar walon ki taraf laut jaye yahan tak ke un se mile; kyunke wo un ke paas hai."
"553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi janaza dekhe, agar us ke saath chalne wala na ho to khara rahe yahan tak ke wo us se guzar jaye ya wo us se guzar jaye ya us ke guzarne se pehle rakh diya jaye."
"554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khwab dekhe jo use na-pasand ho to karwat badle, apne bayen taraf teen baar thookay, Allah se us ki bhalayi mange aur us ke shar se Allah ki panah mange."
"555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aazmayish wale ko dekhe aur kahe: Sab tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne mujhe us se afiyat di jis mein us ne tumhein mubtala kiya aur mujhe tum par aur apne bahut se bandon par fazilat di; to ye us naimat ka shukr hoga."
"556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne aap mein, apne maal mein ya apne bhai mein aisi cheez dekhe jo use achchi lage to us ke liye barkat ki dua kare; kyunke nazar haq hai."
"557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin dekhe ke us ki qabr mein us ke liye kushadgi ki gayi hai to kahega: Mujhe chhor do ke main apne ghar walon ko khushkhabri dun; to us se kaha jayega: Thehar ja."
"558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat dekhe aur mani nikle to us par ghusl hai."
"559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi juma ki taraf jaye to ghusl kare."
"560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dekho ke laundi ne apne aaqa ko jana, imarat walon ko imaraton mein buland hote dekho, aur nange pairon wale bhooke mohtaj logon ke sardar dekho to ye qayamat ki nishaniyon aur alamaton mein se hai."
"561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dekho ke Allah taala bande ko duniya mein se jo wo chahta hai de raha hai halanke wo apne gunahon par qaim hai to ye us ki taraf se sirf dheel hai."
"562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mazi dekho to apne zakar ko dho aur namaz ke liye wuzu karo; aur jab mani uchhle to ghusl karo."
"563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dekho ke logon ke ehad bigar gaye hain, un ki amanatein halki ho gayi hain aur wo aise ho gaye hain, aur apni ungliyon mein ungliyan phansayin; to apne ghar ko lazim pakro, apni zaban apne paas rakho, jo pehchante ho le lo aur jo na-pasand karte ho chhor do, aur apne khaas nafs ke muamle par tawajjuh do aur aam logon ka muamla chhor do."
"564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab nishani dekho to sajda karo."
"565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab janaza dekho to khare ho jao; phir jo us ke peeche chale wo na baithe yahan tak ke rakh diya jaye."
"566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab janaza dekho to us ke liye khare ho jao yahan tak ke wo tum se guzar jaye ya rakh diya jaye."
"567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dekho ke aadmi jahiliyyat ki asabiyyat zahir karta hai to use us ke baap ki sharmgah ka taana do aur kinaya na karo."
"568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dekho ke raat idhar se aa gayi hai to rozedar ne iftar kar liya."
"569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tareef karne walon ko dekho to un ke chehron par mitti dalo."
"570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dekho ke logon ke ehad bigar gaye hain, un ki amanatein halki ho gayi hain aur wo aise ho gaye hain, aur apni ungliyon mein ungliyan phansayin; to apne ghar ko lazim pakro, apni zaban apne paas rakho, jo pehchante ho le lo aur jo na-pasand karte ho chhor do, aur apne khaas nafs ke muamle par tawajjuh do aur aam logon ka muamla chhor do."
"571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chand dekho to roza rakho aur jab use dekho to iftar karo; phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to us ka andaza karo."
"572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab chand dekho to roza rakho aur jab use dekho to iftar karo; phir agar tum par ghata chha jaye to tees din gino."
"573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab dekho ke koi masjid mein bechta ya kharidta hai to kaho ke Allah tumhari tijarat mein nafa na de; aur jab dekho ke koi us mein gumshuda ka elaan karta hai to kaho ke Allah tumhari gumshuda tumhein na lautaye."
"574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Zul-Hijja ka chand dekho aur tum mein se koi qurbani karna chahe ¤ to apne baal aur nakhunon se kuch na kate."
"575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mujhe is haalat mein dekho, yani peshab karte hue, to mujhe salam na karo; kyunke agar tum aisa karoge to main tumhein jawab nahi dunga."
"576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab in goong janwaron par sawaar ho to un par nijaat ke saath chalo; phir agar qehet ho to un par chalao, aur raat ke aakhri hisse mein chalo, kyunke Allah use lapet deta hai."
"577","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ruku karo to apni hatheliyan apne ghutnon par rakho yahan tak ke mutmain ho jao; aur jab sajda karo to apni peshani zameen par jam do yahan tak ke zameen ki sakhti pao."
"578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Jamra-tul-Aqaba ko kankariyan mare to us ke liye har cheez halal ho gayi siwaye auraton ke."
"579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab shikar par teer maro aur use teen raaton baad pao aur tumhara teer us mein ho to khao jab tak badbu-daar na ho."
"580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mi'raz se shikar par maro aur wo cheed de to khao; aur agar use us ke kinare se lage to na khao, kyunke wo dab kar mara hua hai."
"581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apna teer maro aur wo teen din ghayab rahe aur use pao to khao jab tak badbu-daar na ho."
"582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab shaam ko apne ghar walon ko doodh pilao to Allah ne murdar mein se jis se mana kiya hai us se bacho."
"583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ki ziyarat kare aur us ke paas baithe to ijazat liye baghair khara na ho."
"584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi kisi qaum ki ziyarat kare to un ki imamat na kare, un mein se aik aadmi un ki imamat kare."
"585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apni masjdon ko naqsh karo aur apne mushafon ko sangharo to tum par halakat hai."
"586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda zina kare to us se iman nikal jata hai aur us ke sar par sayeban ki tarah hota hai; phir jab ruk jaye to us ki taraf laut aata hai."
"587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ki laundi zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to use kore maro aur malamat na karo; phir agar zina kare to use kore maro aur malamat na karo; phir agar teesri baar zina kare to use bech do agarche baal ki rassi ke badle ho."
"588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum donon safar karo to azan do aur iqamat kaho, aur tum donon mein bara tumhari imamat kare."
"589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khush-haali mein safar karo to oonton ko zameen mein se un ka hissa do; aur jab qehet mein safar karo to un par chalna tez karo; aur jab raat ko qiyam karo to raaste se bacho, kyunke wo raat ko janwaron ke raaste aur keere-makoron ki panah-gah hain."
"590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah tumhari taraf baghair mange aur baghair nafs ke lalach ke rizq bheje to use le lo; kyunke Allah ne tumhein diya hai."
"591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi mange to kasrat se mange, kyunke wo apne Rab se mangta hai."
"592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala se mango to us se Firdous mango, kyunke wo jannat ka darmiyan hai."
"593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala se mango to us se apni hatheliyon ke andaruni hisse se mango, un ke pusht se na mango."
"594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhein koi aadmi tumhare baare mein jo wo jaanta hai gali de to use us ke baare mein jo tum jaante ho gali na do; us ka ajr tumhare liye hoga aur us ka wabal us par hoga."
"595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi sajda kare to oont ki tarah na baithe, apne haath apne ghutnon se pehle rakhe."
"596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi sajda kare to seedha ho aur apni kalaiyan kutte ki tarah na bichhaye."
"597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda sajda karta hai to us ke saath saat haddiyan sajda karti hain: us ka chehra, us ki hatheliyan, us ke ghutne aur us ke pair."
"598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab sajda karo to apni hatheliyan rakho aur apni kohniyan uthao."
"599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab zarkhez zameen mein chalo to sawariyon ko un ka hissa do; aur jab banjar zameen mein chalo to un par chalao; aur jab raat ko qiyam karo to aam guzargah par qiyam na karo, kyunke wo har janwar ki panah-gah hai."
"600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhari neki tumhein khush kare aur tumhari burayi tumhein na-pasand ho to tum momin ho."
"601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma gir jaye to us se gandagi door kare aur use kha le, use shaitan ke liye na chhore; aur tum mein se koi pyala saaf kare, kyunke tum nahi jaante ke tumhare khane ke kis hisse mein barkat hai."
"602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma gir jaye to jo us mein gandagi ho use door kare aur use kha le, use shaitan ke liye na chhore; aur apna haath rumal se na ponchhe yahan tak ke use chaat le ya chatwa le, kyunke wo nahi janta ke us ke khane ke kis hisse mein barkat hai."
"603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi nasha kare to use kore maro, phir agar nasha kare to kore maro, phir agar nasha kare to kore maro; phir agar chauthi baar laut aaye to use qatl kar do."
"604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi talwar niyam se nikal kar use dekhna chahe aur apne bhai ko dena chahe to use niyam mein dale phir use de."
"605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhein ahl kitab mein se koi salam kare to kaho ke aur tum par."
"606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Yahudi tumhein salam karein to un mein se aik kehta hai ke tum par maut ho; to kaho ke tum par ho."
"607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi azan sune aur bartan us ke haath par ho to use na rakhe yahan tak ke us mein se apni hajat poori kar le."
"608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suno ke aadmi kehta hai ke log halak ho gaye to wo un mein sab se zyada halak karne wala hai."
"609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab azan suno to Allah ke bulane wale ko jawab do."
"610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suno ke tumhare hamsaye kehte hain ke tum ne achcha kiya to tum ne achcha kiya; aur jab suno ke wo kehte hain ke tum ne bura kiya to tum ne bura kiya."
"611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab murghon ki aawazein suno to Allah se us ke fazl ka sawal karo, kyunke unhon ne farishta dekha hai; aur jab gadhon ki cheekh suno to shaitan se Allah ki panah mango, kyunke unhon ne shaitan dekha hai."
"612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab meri taraf se hadees suno jise tumhare dil pehchanein, us se tumhare baal aur khaalein narm hon aur dekho ke wo tumhare qareeb hai to main us ka zyada haqdar hun; aur jab meri taraf se hadees suno jise tumhare dil na pehchanein, us se tumhare baal aur khaalein door bhagein aur dekho ke wo tum se door hai to main us se sab se zyada door hun."
"613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muazzin ko suno to jaisa wo kahe waisa kaho, phir mujh par durood bhejo; kyunke jo mujh par aik durood bheje Allah us par us ke badle das rehmatein bheje ga. Phir mere liye Allah se waseela mango, kyunke wo jannat mein aik darja hai jo Allah ke bandon mein se sirf aik bande ke layaq hai, aur main umeed rakhta hun ke wo main hun; pas jo mere liye waseela mange us par shafaat halal ho jayegi."
"614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muazzin ko namaz ke liye dobara pukarte suno to jaisa wo kahe waisa kaho."
"615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab azan suno to jaisa muazzin kahe waisa kaho."
"616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suno ke kisi zameen mein taaoon hai to us mein dakhil na ho; aur jab tum kisi zameen mein ho aur wo waqa ho to us se bhaag kar na niklo."
"617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suno ke kisi zameen mein taaoon hai to us mein dakhil na ho; aur jab tum kisi zameen mein ho aur wo waqa ho to us se bhaag kar na niklo."
"618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suno ke yahan qareeb kisi qaum mein dhansa diya gaya hai to qayamat saya-figan ho gayi hai."
"619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suno ke koi jahiliyyat ki asabiyyat zahir karta hai to use taana do aur kinaya na karo."
"620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ko kutton ke bhonkne aur gadhon ki cheekh suno to shaitan se Allah ki panah mango, kyunke wo wo dekhte hain jo tum nahi dekhte. Aur jab pair thehar jayen to bahar nikalna kam karo, kyunke Allah azza wa jal raat mein apni makhlooq mein se jo chahta hai phelata hai. Aur darwaze band karo aur un par Allah ka naam lo, kyunke shaitan aisa darwaza nahi kholta jo band ho aur us par Allah ka naam liya gaya ho. Aur matke dhanpo, mashkize bandho aur bartan ulta do."
"621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab nap ka naam lo to use khao."
"622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein bhoole aur na jane ke aik parhi ya do, to aik par bunyad rakhe; phir agar na jane ke teen parhi ya chaar to teen par bunyad rakhe aur salam se pehle do sajde kare."
"623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam bhoole aur khara poora ho jaye to us par sahw ke do sajde hain; aur agar khara poora na ho to us par sahw nahi."
"624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi piye to bartan mein saans na le; phir agar dobara chahne ka irada kare to bartan hataye phir dobara piye agar chahta ho."
"625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi piye to bartan mein saans na le; aur jab qaza-e-hajat mein aaye to ¤ apne zakar ko apne dayen haath se na chhue aur apne dayen haath se saaf na kare."
"626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi piye to aik saans mein na piye."
"627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein piye to use saat baar dhoye."
"628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab doodh piyo to us se kulli karo, kyunke us mein chiknayi hai."
"629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo sharab piyen to unhein kore maro, phir agar piyen to unhein kore maro, phir agar piyen to unhein kore maro, phir agar piyen to unhein qatl kar do."
"630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi do aur aik mein shak kare to use aik qarar de; aur jab do aur teen mein shak kare to use do qarar de; aur jab teen aur chaar mein shak kare to use teen qarar de, yahan tak ke wehem zyadati mein ho, phir apni baaqi namaz poori kare phir baith kar salam se pehle do sajde kare."
"631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein shak kare aur na jane ke do parhi ya teen, to shak door kare aur yaqeen par bunyad rakhe."
"632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein shak kare aur na jane ke kitni parhi teen ya chaar, to shak door kare aur jis par yaqeen ho us par bunyad rakhe, phir salam se pehle do sajde kare. Phir agar paanch parhi to wo us ki namaz ko jora kar denge, aur agar chaar poori karke parhi to wo shaitan ko ruswa karenge."
"633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein shak kare to shak door kare aur yaqeen par bunyad rakhe; phir agar tamam hone ka yaqeen kare to do sajde kare. Phir agar us ki namaz poori thi to rakat nafl hogi aur do sajde nafl honge, aur agar naqis thi to rakat namaz ka tamam hona hogi aur do sajde shaitan ki naak khaak-aalood karenge."
"634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aurat Isha mein hazir ho to khushbu na lagaye."
"635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Musalman apne bhai par hathiyar nikale to Allah ke farishte us par lanat karte rehte hain yahan tak ke use us se niyam mein kar le."
"636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab jannat wale jannat ki taraf aur aag wale aag ki taraf ho jayenge to maut ko laya jayega yahan tak ke jannat aur aag ke darmiyan rakha jayega, phir zibah kar di jayegi. Phir pukarne wala pukarega: Ae jannat walo, hamesha rehna hai, maut nahi; ae aag walo, hamesha rehna hai, maut nahi. Pas jannat walon ki khushi par khushi barhegi aur aag walon ke gham par gham barhega."
"637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi sutre ki taraf namaz parhe to us se qareeb ho taake shaitan us ke aur us ke darmiyan se na guzre."
"638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisi cheez ki taraf namaz parhe jo use logon se chhupaye aur koi us ke saamne se guzarna chahe to use roke; phir agar inkar kare to us se lare, kyunke wo shaitan hai."
"639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi juma parhe to us ke baad kuch na parhe yahan tak ke baat kare ya nikle."
"640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi juma parhe to us ke baad chaar parhe."
"641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to sutre ki taraf parhe aur us se qareeb ho, aur kisi ko apne saamne se guzarne na de; phir agar koi guzarne aaye to us se lare, kyunke wo shaitan hai."
"642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Fajr ki do rakatein parhe to apni dayen karwat par lete."
"643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe aur apne joote utare to un se kisi ko takleef na de; unhein apne pairon ke darmiyan rakhe ya un mein namaz parhe."
"644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to apne saamne ya apne dayen taraf na thookay, aur apne bayen taraf ya apne qadam ke neeche thookay."
"645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to apne joote apne dayen taraf na rakhe na apne bayen taraf taake wo ghair ke dayen taraf hon, siwaye is ke ke us ke bayen taraf koi na ho; aur unhein apne pairon ke darmiyan rakhe."
"646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe aur na jane ke kaisi parhi to baith kar do sajde kare."
"647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to tehband bandhe aur chadar orhe."
"648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to Allah taala ki hamd o sana se shuru kare, phir Nabi par durood bheje, phir us ke baad jo chahe dua kare."
"649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to apna ruku poora kare aur apne sajde mein thong na mare; kyunke is ki misaal aisi hai jaise bhooka aik ya do khajoor khaye, to wo us ke kiya kaam ayengi?"
"650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to sutre ki taraf parhe aur apne sutre se qareeb ho taake shaitan us ki namaz na kate."
"651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to sutre ki taraf parhe aur us se qareeb ho, aur kisi ko apne saamne se guzarne na de; phir agar koi guzarne aaye to us se lare, kyunke wo shaitan hai."
"652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to apne donon kapre pehne; kyunke Allah taala is ka zyada haqdar hai ke us ke liye zeenat ki jaye."
"653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhe to apne joote pehne ya unhein apne pairon ke darmiyan utare, aur un se ghair ko takleef na de."
"654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne ghar mein namaz parhe phir masjid mein dakhil ho aur log namaz parh rahe hon to un ke saath parhe, wo us ke liye nafl hogi."
"655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aik kapre mein namaz parhe to us ke donon kinaron ko apne kandhon par mukhalif karke dale."
"656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aik kapre mein namaz parhe to use apni kamar par mazboot bandhe, aur Yahudiyon ke lapetne ki tarah na lapto."
"657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne rehne ki jagah mein namaz parhe phir imam ko paye aur us ne namaz na parhi ho to us ke saath parhe, kyunke wo us ke liye nafl hogi."
"658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi logon ke liye namaz parhe to halki kare, kyunke un mein kamzor, beemar aur bara hota hai; aur jab tum mein se koi akele parhe to jitna chahe lambi kare."
"659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ameer baith kar namaz parhe to baith kar parho."
"660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat apni paanch namazein parhe, apne mahine ke roze rakhe, apni sharmgah ki hifazat kare aur apne shohar ki itaat kare to us se kaha jayega ke jannat ke darwazon mein se jis se chahe dakhil ho."
"661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat apni paanch namazein parhe, apne mahine ke roze rakhe, apni ¤ sharmgah ki hifazat kare aur apne shohar ki itaat kare to jannat mein dakhil hogi."
"662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wo janaze par namaz parhein aur bhalayi ki tareef karein to Rab farmata hai: Maine jo wo jaante hain us mein un ki gawahi qabool ki aur jo wo nahi jaante use bakhsh diya."
"663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Fajr parho to suraj tuloo hone tak namaz se ruk jao; kyunke wo shaitan ke donon seengon ke darmiyan tuloo hota hai. Phir jab tuloo ho jaye to parho, kyunke namaz hazir ki hui qabool ki hui hai yahan tak ke tumhare sar par neze ki tarah seedha ho jaye; to ruk jao, kyunke wo wo ghari hai jis mein jahannam bharhkayi jati hai aur us ke darwaze khole jate hain, yahan tak ke suraj tumhare dayan kanpatti par buland ho jaye. Phir jab tumhare dayan kanpatti se dhal jaye to parho, kyunke namaz hazir ki hui qabool ki hui hai yahan tak ke Asr parho; phir suraj ghurub hone tak namaz chhor do."
"664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz parho to apne saamne ya apne dayen taraf na thooko, lekin apne bayen taraf thooko agar khaali ho, warna apne bayen qadam ke neeche thooko aur malo."
"665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz parho to apni kalaiyan darinde ki tarah na bichhao, apni hatheliyon par sahara do aur apni kohniyan apne pehluon se juda rakho."
"666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum donon apne rehne ki jaghon mein namaz parho phir imam ke paas aao to us ke saath parho, wo tum donon ke liye nafl hogi aur jo tumhare rehne ki jaghon mein hai wo farz hogi."
"667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum donon apne rehne ki jaghon mein namaz parho phir jamaat ki masjid mein aao to un ke saath parho, kyunke wo tum donon ke liye nafl hogi."
"668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab juma parho to us ke baad chaar parho."
"669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mayyat par namaz parho to us ke liye dua mein ikhlas karo."
"670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mujh par durood bhejo to kaho: Ae Allah, Muhammad ummi Nabi par aur Aal Muhammad par durood bhej jaise tune Ibrahim par aur Aal Ibrahim par durood bheja, aur Muhammad ummi Nabi par aur Aal Muhammad par barkat nazil kar jaise tune Ibrahim par aur Aal Ibrahim par barkat nazil ki; beshak Tu hamd wala buzurg hai."
"671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz parho to tehband bandho aur chadar orho, aur Yahudiyon se mushabehat na karo."
"672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz parho to apni saffei seedhi karo, phir tum mein se aik tumhari imamat kare; phir jab wo takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho, jab wo parhe to khamosh raho, jab wo kahe ke na ghazab kiye gaye par na gumrahon par to kaho aameen, Allah tum se mohabbat karega. Aur jab takbeer kahe aur ruku kare to takbeer kaho aur ruku karo; kyunke imam tum se pehle ruku karta hai aur tum se pehle uthta hai, to ye us ke badle ye hai. Aur jab kahe ke Allah ne us ki sun li jo us ki hamd kare to kaho ke Ae Allah ae hamare Rab tere liye hamd hai, Allah tumhari sunega. Aur jab takbeer kahe aur sajda kare to takbeer kaho aur sajda karo; kyunke imam tum se pehle sajda karta hai aur tum se pehle uthta hai, to ye us ke badle ye hai. Aur jab qaada mein ho to tum mein se har aik ka pehla qaul ye ho: At-tahiyyat, at-tayyibat, as-salawat lillah; tum par salam ho ae Nabi aur Allah ki rehmat aur us ki barkatein; ham par aur Allah ke naik bandon par salam ho; main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain."
"673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mahine mein se teen roze rakho to terah, chaudah aur pandrah ko rakho."
"674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne khadim ko mare to chehre se bache."
"675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab log dinar aur dirham mein bukhl karein, eena ke saath bea karein, gaayon ki dumein pakar lein aur Allah ki raah mein jihad chhor dein to Allah taala un par zillat dakhil kar dega jise un se nahi hatayega yahan tak ke wo apne deen ki taraf laut aayen."
"676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi handi pakaye to us ka shorba zyada kare phir us mein se apne hamsaye ko de."
"677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab gosht pakao to shorba zyada karo, kyunke wo zyada kushada aur hamsayon tak ¤ zyada pahunchne wala hai."
"678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Fajr tuloo ho jaye to Fajr ki do rakaton ke siwa koi namaz nahi."
"679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kisi basti mein zina aur sood zahir ho jayen to unhon ne apne upar Allah ka azab halal kar liya."
"680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab zameen mein burayi zahir ho to Allah zameen walon par apna azab nazil karta hai, agarche un mein naik log hon; unhein wo pahunchta hai jo logon ko pahuncha, phir wo Allah ki rehmat aur maghfirat ki taraf lautte hain."
"681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi beemar ki iyadat kare to kahe: Ae Allah, apne bande ko shifa de taake wo teri taraf se dushman ko zakhmi kare ya teri taraf se namaz ki taraf chale."
"682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne Musalman bhai ki iyadat kare to jannat ke phal chun-ne mein chalta hai yahan tak ke baithe; phir jab baithe to use rehmat dhanp leti hai. Phir agar subah ho to sattar hazaar farishte shaam tak us par durood bhejte hain, aur agar shaam ho to sattar hazaar farishte subah tak us par durood bhejte hain."
"683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke aur Allah ki hamd kare to us ka jawab do; aur jab Allah ki hamd na kare to us ka jawab na do."
"684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke to us ka hamshein us ka jawab de; phir agar teen se zyada ho to wo zukam hai aur teen ke baad jawab nahi."
"685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke to apni hatheliyan apne chehre par rakhe aur apni aawaz dheemi kare."
"686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke to kahe: Sab tareef Allah Rabbul Aalamin ke liye hai; aur wo us se kahe ke Allah tum par rehem kare; aur wo kahe ke Allah hamari aur tumhari maghfirat kare."
"687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke to kahe: Har haal mein sab tareef Allah ke liye hai; aur jo us ke ird-gird hon wo us se kahein ke Allah tum par rehem kare; aur wo apne ird-gird walon se kahe ke Allah tumhein hidayat de aur tumhara haal durust kare."
"688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi chheenke to kahe Alhamdulillah; phir jab kahe to us ka bhai ya saathi us se kahe ke YarhamukAllah; phir jab us se kahe ke YarhamukAllah to kahe ke Yahdikumullah wa yuslihu balakum."
"689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab zameen mein gunah kiya jaye to jo us mein hazir tha aur use na-pasand kiya wo us ki tarah hai jo us se ghayab tha; aur jo us se ghayab tha aur us par raazi hua wo us ki tarah hai jo us mein hazir tha."
"690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab burayi karo to us ke peeche neki karo, wo use mita degi."
"691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab shorba pakao to us ka pani zyada karo aur us mein se apne hamsayon ko do."
"692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab suraj ghurub ho jaye to apne bachon ko rok lo, kyunke ye wo ghari hai jis mein shayateen phelte hain."
"693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi ghussa ho to khamosh ho jaye."
"694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi ghussa ho aur khara ho to baithe; phir agar us se ghussa jata rahe to theek, warna let jaye."
"695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi ghussa ho aur kahe ke main Allah ki panah mangta hun to us ka ghussa thehar jata hai."
"696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ghussa ho to baith jao."
"697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum par Faris aur Room fatah kiye jayenge to tum kis qaum hoge? ¤ Kaha gaya: Ham waise honge jaisa Allah ne hukm diya. Farmaya: Ya is ke siwa? Tum aik doosre se aage barhoge, phir aik doosre se hasad karoge, phir aik doosre se peeth pheroge, phir aik doosre se bughz rakhoge, phir muhajiron ke gharon mein nikaloge aur un mein se baaz ko baaz ki gardanon par kar doge."
"698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Misr fatah ho jaye to Qibtion se bhalayi ki waseeyat karo, kyunke un ke liye zimma aur rishtedari hai."
"699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aakhri tashahhud se farigh ho to chaar cheezon se Allah ki panah mange aur kahe: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun jahannam ke azab se, qabr ke azab se, zindagi aur maut ke fitne se aur Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne ke shar se."
"700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz se farigh ho to chaar ki dua kare phir us ke baad jo chahe dua kare: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun jahannam ke azab se, qabr ke azab se, zindagi aur maut ke fitne se aur Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne se."
"701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi neend se ghabra kar jaage to kahe: Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah mangta hun us ke ghazab se, us ke azab se, us ke bandon ke shar se, shayateen ke waswason se aur is se ke wo mere paas hazir hon; kyunke wo use nuqsan nahi denge."
"702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Shaam wale bigar jayen to tum mein koi bhalayi nahi; aur meri ummat ka aik giroh hamesha madad-yafta rahega, unhein ruswa karne wala unhein nuqsan nahi dega yahan tak ke qayamat qaim ho."
"703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se lare to chehre se bache."
"704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein aameen kahe aur aasman mein farishte aameen kahein aur aik doosre ke muwafiq ho jaye to us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam kahe ke Sami Allahu liman hamidah to kaho ke Ae Allah ae hamare Rab tere liye hamd hai; kyunke jis ka qaul farishton ke qaul ke muwafiq ho us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam kahe ke Sami Allahu liman hamidah to kaho ke Ae Allah ae hamare Rab aur tere liye hamd hai."
"707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam kahe ke na ghazab kiye gaye par na gumrahon par to kaho aameen; kyunke jis ka qaul farishton ke qaul ke muwafiq ho us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai se kahe ke Jazak Allahu khaira to us ne ¤ tareef mein mubalagha kiya."
"709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai se kahe ae kafir to wo un donon mein se aik par laut ayega."
"710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai se kahe ae kafir to wo us ke qatl ki tarah hai, aur momin par lanat us ke qatl ki tarah hai."
"711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi munafiq se kahe ae mere sardar to us ne apne Rab ko ghazabnak kiya."
"712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi kahe ke log halak ho gaye to wo unhein sab se zyada halak karne wala hai."
"713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda kahe ke La ilaha illAllah wallahu Akbar to Allah farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, mere siwa koi mabood nahi aur main sab se bara hun. Phir jab kahe ke La ilaha illAllah wahdah to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, mere siwa akela koi mabood nahi. Phir jab kahe ke La ilaha illAllah la shareeka lah to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, mere siwa koi mabood nahi aur mera koi shareek nahi. Phir jab kahe ke La ilaha illAllah lahul mulk wa lahul hamd to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, mere siwa koi mabood nahi, mere liye badshahi hai aur mere liye hamd hai. Phir jab kahe ke La ilaha illAllah wa la haula wa la quwwata illa billah to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, mere siwa koi mabood nahi aur gunaah se bachne aur neki ki taqat sirf mere saath hai. Jise maut ke waqt in ka rizq diya gaya use aag nahi chhuegi."
"714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muazzin kahe Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar to tum mein se koi kahe Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar; phir kahe Ashhadu alla ilaha illAllah to kahe Ashhadu alla ilaha illAllah; phir kahe Ashhadu anna Muhammadar Rasoolullah to kahe Ashhadu anna Muhammadar Rasoolullah; phir kahe Hayya alas-salah to kahe La haula wa la quwwata illa billah; phir kahe Hayya alal-falah to kahe La haula wa la quwwata illa billah; phir kahe Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar to kahe Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar; phir kahe La ilaha illAllah to kahe La ilaha illAllah apne dil se, to jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz ke liye khara ho to apne saamne na thookay; kyunke wo jab tak apni namaz ki jagah mein hai Allah tabarak wa taala se sargoshi karta hai. Aur apne dayen taraf na thookay, kyunke us ke dayen taraf farishta hai; aur apne bayen taraf ya apne qadam ke neeche thookay aur use dafan kar de."
"716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar se uthe phir us ki taraf laute to use apne tehband ke kinare se teen baar jhaare; kyunke wo nahi janta ke us ke baad us par kiya hai. Aur jab lete to kahe: Tere naam se ae mere Rab maine apna pehlu rakha aur tere saath uthata hun; phir agar tu meri jaan rok le to us par rehem kar, aur agar use chhor de to us ki hifazat kar jis se tu apne naik bandon ki hifazat karta hai. Phir jab jaage to kahe: Sab tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne mere jism mein mujhe afiyat di, meri rooh mujh par lautayi aur mujhe apne zikr ki ijazat di."
"717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi raat ko uthe aur us ki zaban par Quran mushkil ho jaye aur wo na jane ke kiya kehta hai to let jaye."
"718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi neend se uthe aur wuzu karna chahe to apna haath bartan mein dakhil na kare yahan tak ke use dho le; kyunke wo nahi janta ke us ka haath kahan raat guzar kar aaya hai aur us ne use kis par rakha tha."
"719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parhne khara ho to use parda hoga agar us ke saamne oont ke paalan ki pichhli lakri jaisi cheez ho; phir agar us ke saamne oont ke paalan ki pichhli lakri jaisi cheez na ho to us ki namaz gadha, aurat aur kaala kutta kat-te hain. Kaha gaya: Kaale kutte ko surkh kutte par kiya fazilat hai? Farmaya: Kaala kutta shaitan hai."
"720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi raat ko namaz parhne khara ho to miswak kare; kyunke jab tum mein se koi namaz mein parhta hai to farishta apna munh us ke munh par rakhta hai aur us ke munh se koi cheez nahi nikalti magar farishte ke munh mein dakhil hoti hai."
"721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam do rakaton mein khara ho, agar khara seedha hone se pehle yaad aaye to baith jaye; phir agar khara seedha ho jaye to na baithe aur sahw ke do sajde kare."
"722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni majlis se uthe phir us ki taraf laute to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai."
"723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi raat ya din mein wuzu karne uthe aur achcha wuzu kare aur miswak kare phir khara ho aur namaz parhe to farishta us ke gird ghoomta hai aur us se qareeb hota hai yahan tak ke apna munh us ke munh par rakhta hai; wo jo parhta hai sirf us ke munh mein parhta hai. Aur agar miswak na kare to us ke gird ghoomta hai lekin apna munh us ke munh par nahi rakhta."
"724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mayyat qabr mein rakha jaye to us ke paas do farishte aate hain jo kaale neeli aankhon wale hain; aik ko Munkar aur doosre ko Nakeer kaha jata hai. Wo kehte hain: Tum is aadmi ke baare mein kiya kehte thay? To wo kehta hai jo wo kehta tha: Wo Allah ke bande aur Rasool hain; main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad us ke bande aur Rasool hain. To wo kehte hain: Ham jaante thay ke tum kehte ho. Phir us ke liye us ki qabr mein sattar haath sattar mein kushada ki jati hai, phir us mein us ke liye roshni ki jati hai, phir kaha jata hai: So jao. To wo kehta hai: Main apne ghar walon ki taraf laut kar unhein khabar dun. To wo kehte hain: So jao dulhan ke sone ki tarah jise sirf us ke ghar walon mein sab se mehboob jagata hai, yahan tak ke Allah use us ke bistar se uthaye. Aur agar munafiq ho to kahega: Maine logon ko kehte suna to maine aisa hi kaha, main nahi janta. To wo kehte hain: Ham jaante thay ke tum aisa kehte ho. Phir zameen se kaha jata hai: Us par mil jao, to wo us par mil jati hai aur us ki pasliyan idhar udhar ho jati hain; wo us mein musalsal azab mein rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah use us ke bistar se uthaye."
"725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi raat ko aaye to apne ghar walon ke paas achanak na aaye; yahan tak ke ghayab aurat zer-naaf baal saaf kar le aur bikhre baalon wali kanghi kar le."
"726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khana aaye aur namaz hazir ho to us se shuru karo qabl is ke ke Maghrib ki namaz parho, aur apne raat ke khane mein jaldi na karo."
"727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ibn Adam sajde ki aayat parhe aur sajda kare to shaitan ro kar alag ho jata hai aur kehta hai: Haye afsos, Ibn Adam ko sajde ka hukm diya gaya to us ne sajda kiya aur us ke liye jannat hai; aur mujhe sajde ka hukm diya gaya to maine nafarmani ki aur mere liye aag hai."
"728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam parhe to khamosh raho."
"729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Surah Fatiha parho to Bismillahir Rahmanir Raheem parho; kyunke ye Umm-ul-Quran, Umm-ul-Kitab aur Saat dohrayi jane wali hain, aur Bismillahir Rahmanir Raheem us ki aayaton mein se aik hai."
"730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab zameen taqseem kar di jaye aur had-bandi ho jaye to us mein shufa nahi."
"731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni masjid mein namaz poori kare to apne ghar ke liye apni namaz mein se hissa rakhe; kyunke Allah taala us ki namaz se us ke ghar mein bhalayi rakhega."
"732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apna hajj poora kare to apne ghar walon ki taraf lautne mein jaldi kare; kyunke ye us ke ajr ke liye bada hai."
"733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein namaz poori kare phir apne ghar ki taraf laute to apne ghar mein do rakatein parhe aur apne ghar ke liye apni namaz mein se hissa rakhe; kyunke Allah us ki namaz se us ke ghar mein bhalayi rakhega."
"734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala aasman mein muamle ka faisla karta hai to farishte us ke qaul ke saamne aajizi se apne par marte hain jaise chikni chattan par zanjeer ho. Phir jab un ke dilon se ghabrahat door hoti hai to kehte hain ke tumhare Rab ne kiya kaha? Wo kehte hain us ne jo haq kaha, aur wo buland bara hai. Pas use chori chhupe sunne wale sunte hain, aur chori chhupe sunne wale aise hain ke aik doosre ke upar ho; kabhi shola sunne wale ko us se pehle pa leta hai ke wo use apne saathi ki taraf phenke aur use jala de, aur kabhi use nahi pata yahan tak ke wo use apne neeche wale ki taraf phenke jo us se neeche hai, yahan tak ke use zameen par phenkte hain. Pas wo jadugar ke munh par dali jati hai aur wo us ke saath sau jhoot bolta hai; to wo sach hota hai aur wo kehte hain: Kiya us ne hamein falan falan din khabar nahi di thi ke aisa aisa hoga aur ham ne use haq paya, us kalime ki wajah se jo aasman se suna gaya tha."
"735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala kisi bande ke liye faisla kare ke wo kisi zameen mein mare to Allah us ke liye us ki taraf hajat bana deta hai."
"736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab us ki chaar shakhon ke darmiyan baithe aur khatna khatne se mil jaye to ghusl wajib ho gaya."
"737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum juma ke din apne saathi se kaho aur imam khutba de raha ho ke khamosh ho ¤ to tum ne laghw kiya."
"738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye khare ho to wuzu mukammal karo, phir Qibla ki taraf munh karo, takbeer kaho, phir Quran mein se jo tumhare saath aasan ho parho, phir ruku karo yahan tak ke ruku mein mutmain ho jao, phir utho yahan tak ke khare seedhe ho jao, phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein mutmain ho jao, phir utho yahan tak ke khare seedhe ho jao, phir apni poori namaz mein aisa hi karo."
"739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye khare ho to wuzu mukammal karo aur apne haathon aur pairon ki ungliyon ke darmiyan pani dalo."
"740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye khare ho to wuzu karo jaise Allah ne tumhein hukm diya hai, phir khare ho aur Qibla ki taraf munh karo phir takbeer kaho. Phir agar tumhare saath Quran ho to use parho, aur agar tumhare saath Quran na ho to Allah ki hamd karo, us ki wahdaniyat bayan karo aur us ki takbeer kaho. Phir jab ruku karo to ruku karo yahan tak ke mutmain ho jao, phir apna sar uthao aur khare seedhe ho jao, phir sajda karo aur sajde mein seedhe ho jao, phir apna sar uthao aur baith kar seedhe ho jao yahan tak ke apni namaz poori karo. Phir jab tum aisa karoge to tumhari namaz poori ho gayi, aur agar us mein se kuch kami karoge to tum ne apni namaz mein se kami ki."
"741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye khare ho to takbeer kaho phir Quran mein se jo tumhare saath aasan ho parho, ¤ phir ruku karo yahan tak ke ruku mein mutmain ho jao, phir utho yahan tak ke khare seedhe ho jao, phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein mutmain ho jao, phir utho yahan tak ke baith kar mutmain ho jao, phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein mutmain ho jao, phir apni poori namaz mein aisa hi karo."
"742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz mein khare ho to alwida kehne wale ki namaz parho, aisi baat na kaho jis se mazirat karni pare, aur logon ke haathon mein jo hai us se na-umeed ho jao."
"743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz mein khare ho to apne parhne wale se ruku aur sajde mein aage na barho, lekin wo tum se aage rahe."
"744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do sargoshi kar rahe hon to un ke darmiyan dakhil na ho."
"745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ki maut kisi zameen mein ho to us ke liye us ki taraf hajat aati hai; phir jab apne aakhri nishan tak pahunch jaye to Allah us ki rooh us ki taraf qabz karta hai; pas zameen qayamat ke din kahegi: Ae mere Rab, ye wo hai jo tune mere paas amanat rakha tha."
"746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi rozedar ho to khajoor se iftar kare; phir agar khajoor na paye to pani se, kyunke pani paak karne wala hai."
"747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi faqeer ho to apne aap se shuru kare; phir agar bach rahe to apne ghar walon par, phir agar bach rahe to apne rishtedaron par, phir agar bach rahe to yahan aur wahan."
"748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dhoop mein ho aur us se saya simat jaye aur us ka baaz saya mein aur baaz dhoop mein ho jaye to khara ho jaye."
"749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein ho to apni nazar aasman ki taraf na uthaye ke us ki nazar uchak li jaye."
"750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein ho aur apni pichhli raah mein harkat paye ke hawa kharij hui ya nahi aur us par mushkil ho to wapas na jaye yahan tak ke aawaz sune ya badbu paye."
"751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein ho aur apne donon surainon ke darmiyan hawa paye to bahar na nikle yahan tak ke aawaz sune ya badbu paye."
"752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein ho to wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai; pas tum mein se har aik dekhe ke namaz mein kiya kehta hai, aur apni aawazein buland na karo ke mominon ko takleef do."
"753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to apne chehre ke saamne na thookay; kyunke jab wo namaz parhta hai to Allah us ke chehre ke saamne hai."
"754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to kisi ko apne saamne se guzarne na de aur use jitna ho sake roke; phir agar inkar kare to us se lare, kyunke wo shaitan hai."
"755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to kisi ko apne saamne se guzarne na de aur use jitna ho sake roke; phir agar inkar kare to us se lare, kyunke us ke saath hum-nasheen hai."
"756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz parh raha ho to apni nazar aasman ki taraf na uthaye ke uchak li jaye."
"757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab agla saal ho to ham nawen din roza rakhenge."
"758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab pani do kulle ho to wo napak nahi hota."
"759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan ke mahine ki pehli raat ho to shayateen aur sarkash ¤ jinn jakar diye jate hain, aag ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur us mein se koi darwaza nahi khulta, jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain aur us mein se koi darwaza band nahi hota. Aur har raat pukarne wala pukarta hai: Ae bhalayi ke talabgar aage barh, ae burayi ke talabgar ruk ja. Aur Allah ke liye aag se aazad kiye hue hain, aur ye har raat hota hai."
"760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Musalmanon ke darmiyan fitna ho to lakri ki talwar bana lo."
"761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi ke paas do biwiyan hon aur wo un ke darmiyan insaf na kare to qayamat ke din is haal mein aayega ke us ka aik pehlu gira hua hoga."
"762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab teen jama hon to do teesre ko chhor kar sargoshi na karein."
"763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab teen safar mein hon to apne mein se aik ko ameer banayen."
"764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab raat ka ibtidayi hissa ho to apne bachon ko rok lo, kyunke shayateen us waqt phelte hain; phir jab raat ki aik ghari guzar jaye to unhein chhor do. Aur darwaze band karo aur un par Allah ka naam lo, kyunke shaitan band darwaza nahi kholta. Aur apne mashkize bandho aur un par Allah ka naam lo, apne bartan dhanpo aur un par Allah ka naam lo agarche un par koi cheez aar kar rakho, aur apne chiragh bujha do."
"765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab haiz ka khoon ho to wo kala khoon hai jo pehchana jata hai; phir agar ¤ wo ho to namaz se ruk jao, aur agar doosra ho to wuzu karo aur namaz parho, kyunke wo rag hai."
"766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan ho to us mein umrah karo, kyunke us mein umrah hajj ke barabar hai."
"767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhari duniya ke muamle mein se koi muamla ho to tum us mein zyada janne wale ho; aur jab tumhare deen ke muamle mein se koi muamla ho to meri taraf hai."
"768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke paas do kapre hon to un mein namaz parhe; phir agar sirf aik kapra ho to tehband bandhe aur Yahudiyon ke lapetne ki tarah na lapte."
"769","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim ho jo us ki mehnat kaafi ho to use khilaye; phir agar na kare to use luqma de."
"770","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke baal hon to un ki izzat kare."
"771","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Shaban ki pandrahwin raat ho to Allah apni makhlooq ki taraf mutawajjah hota hai; pas mominon ko bakhsh deta hai, kafiron ko mohlat deta hai aur keena rakhne walon ko un ke keene ke saath chhor deta hai yahan tak ke use chhor dein."
"772","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab teen hon to do teesre ko chhor kar sargoshi na karein."
"773","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab teen hon to un mein se aik un ki imamat kare, aur imamat ka zyada haqdar un mein sab se zyada parhne wala hai."
"774","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab juma ka din ho to farishte masjid ke darwazon par baithte hain aur logon mein se jo aaye use us ke darjon ke mutabiq likhte hain: aik aadmi unt laya, aik aadmi gaaye laya, aik aadmi bakri laya, aik aadmi murgi laya, aik aadmi chidiya laya aur aik aadmi anda laya. Phir jab muazzin azan de aur imam mimbar par baithe to saheefe lapet dete hain aur masjid mein dakhil hote hain aur zikr sunte hain."
"775","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab juma ka din ho to masjid ke har darwaze par farishte hote hain jo logon ko un ke darjon ke mutabiq pehle pehle likhte hain. Phir jab imam baithe to ¤ saheefe lapet dete hain aur zikr sunne aate hain. Aur jaldi aane wale ki misaal us ki tarah hai jo unt hadiya kare, phir us ki tarah jo gaaye hadiya kare, phir us ki tarah jo mendha hadiya kare, phir us ki tarah jo murgi hadiya kare, phir us ki tarah jo anda hadiya kare."
"776","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab juma ka din aur juma ki raat ho to mujh par kasrat se durood bhejo."
"777","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din ho to suraj bandon se qareeb kar diya jayega yahan tak ke aik ya do meel ho jayega; pas suraj unhein pighlayega aur wo paseene mein apne aamaal ke mutabiq honge: un mein se baaz ko takhnon tak pakrega, baaz ko ghutnon tak pakrega, baaz ko kamar tak pakrega aur baaz ko lagam ki tarah jakar lega."
"778","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din ho to Allah taala is ummat mein se har aadmi ko kafiron mein se aik aadmi dega aur us se kaha jayega ke ye aag se tumhara fidya hai."
"779","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din ho to Allah har momin ki taraf aik farishta bhejega jis ke saath kafir hoga; pas farishta momin se kahega: Ae momin, ye kafir le lo, ye aag se tumhara fidya hai."
"780","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din ho to main shafaat karunga aur kahunga: Ae mere Rab, jannat mein dakhil kar jis ke dil mein raayi ke dane ke barabar iman ho, to wo dakhil honge. Phir kahega: Jannat mein dakhil kar jis ke dil mein sab se kam cheez ho."
"781","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din ho to main nabiyon ka imam, un ka khateeb aur un ki shafaat wala hounga, baghair fakhr ke."
"782","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din ho to pukarne wala pukarega ke jo ghair-Allah ke liye amal karta tha wo apna sawab usi se mange jis ke liye us ne amal kiya tha."
"783","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke roze ka din ho to behuda baat na kare aur jahalat na kare; phir agar koi use gali de ya us se lare to kahe ke main rozedar hun, main rozedar hun."
"784","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab imam takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho, jab ruku kare to ruku karo, jab sajda kare to sajda karo, jab ruku se apna sar uthaye to uthao, aur jab baith kar namaz parhe to sab mil kar baith kar parho."
"785","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab do qasam ko na-pasand karein ya use pasand karein to us par quraa dalen."
"786","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum teen ho to do doosre ko chhor kar sargoshi na karein yahan tak ke logon mein ghul mil jao; kyunke ye use ghamgeen karta hai."
"787","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kapre pehno aur jab wuzu karo to apne dayen se shuru karo."
"788","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab shaitan tum mein se kisi se khwab mein khele to use logon ko na bataye."
"789","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se mile to use salam kare; phir agar un ke darmiyan darakht, deewar ya pathar haail ho phir use mile to use salam kare."
"790","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne Musalman bhai se mile to kahe ke tum par salam aur Allah ki rehmat ho."
"791","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mushrikon se raaste mein milo to unhein salam mein pehal na karo aur unhein us ke sab se tang hisse ki taraf majboor karo."
"792","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi mare to us par us ka thikana subah shaam pesh kiya jata hai; agar jannat walon mein se ho to jannat walon mein se, aur agar aag walon mein se ho to aag walon mein se. Us se kaha jata hai: Ye tumhara thikana hai yahan tak ke Allah tumhein qayamat ke din us ki taraf uthaye."
"793","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab insaan mare to us ka amal kat jata hai siwaye teen ke: jari sadqa, aisa ilm jis se faida uthaya jaye, ya naik beta jo us ke liye dua kare."
"794","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tumhara saathi mare to use chhor do, us mein na paro."
"795","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bande ka beta mare to Allah taala apne farishton se farmata hai: Tum ne mere bande ke bete ki rooh qabz ki? To wo kehte hain: Haan. To farmata hai: Tum ne us ke dil ka phal qabz kiya? To wo kehte hain: Haan. To farmata hai: Mere bande ne kiya kaha? To wo kehte hain: Us ne teri hamd ki aur inna lillah parha. To Allah taala farmata hai: Mere bande ke liye jannat mein ghar banao aur us ka naam Bait-ul-Hamd rakho."
"796","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi hamari masjid ya hamare bazaar mein guzre aur us ke saath teer hon to us ke phal ko apni hatheli se pakre taake kisi Musalman ko zakhmi na kare."
"797","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab nutfe par bayalis raatein guzar jayen to Allah us ki taraf farishta bhejta hai; pas wo us ki surat banata hai, us ke kaan, aankhein, khaal, gosht aur haddiyan banata hai. Phir kehta hai: Ae mere Rab, nar ya maada? To tumhara Rab jo chahta hai faisla karta hai aur farishta likhta hai. Phir ¤ kehta hai: Ae mere Rab, us ki umar? To tumhara Rab jo chahta hai farmata hai aur farishta likhta hai. Phir kehta hai: Ae mere Rab, us ka rizq? To tumhara Rab jo chahta hai faisla karta hai aur farishta likhta hai. Phir farishta saheefa haath mein lekar nikalta hai aur hukm mein na zyada karta hai na kam."
"798","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab mardon ka guzar kisi qaum par ho aur guzarne walon mein se aik aadmi baithe huon ko salam kare aur in mein se aik jawab de to in ki taraf se aur un ki taraf se kaafi ho jayega."
"799","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda beemar ho ya safar kare to Allah taala us ke liye utna ajr likhta hai jitna wo tandrust muqeem hone ki haalat mein karta tha."
"800","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda beemar ho to Allah izzat wale likhne walon se farmata hai: Mere bande ke liye waisa hi likho jo wo karta tha yahan tak ke main use qabz karun ya use afiyat dun."
"801","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab meri ummat akad kar chale aur Faris aur Room ke badshahon ke bete un ki khidmat karein to un ke bure un ke achchon par musallat ho jayenge."
"802","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadhi raat ya do tehaayi guzar jaye to Allah neeche wale aasman ki taraf nazil hota hai aur farmata hai: Koi mangne wala hai ke use diya jaye? Koi dua karne wala hai ke us ki qabool ki jaye? Koi maghfirat mangne wala hai ke use bakhsha jaye? Yahan tak ke subah phat jaye."
"803","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab pukarne wala pukare to aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain aur dua qabool ki jati hai."
"804","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi soye aur us ke haath mein charbi ki badbu ho aur wo apna haath na dhoye aur use kuch pahunch jaye to apne aap ke siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"805","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi manzil mein utre to kahe: Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah mangta hun us har cheez ke shar se jo us ne paida ki; kyunke use koi cheez nuqsan nahi degi yahan tak ke us se kooch kare."
"806","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne khane par Allah ka naam bhool jaye to jab yaad aaye kahe ke shuru aur aakhir par Bismillah."
"807","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz bhool jaye ya us se soya rahe to jab yaad aaye use parhe."
"808","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi use dekhe jo us par maal aur shakl mein fazilat rakhta hai to use dekhe jo us se neeche hai."
"809","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein oonghe to apni us majlis se doosri taraf muntaqil ho jaye."
"810","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi oonghe aur namaz parh raha ho to let jaye yahan tak ke us se neend jati rahe; kyunke jab tum mein se koi oonghte hue namaz parhe to nahi janta ke shayad wo maghfirat mangne jaye aur apne aap ko bura kahe."
"811","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi oonghe aur namaz parh raha ho to wapas jaye aur soye yahan tak ke jane ke kiya kehta hai."
"812","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi juma ke din oonghe to apne saathi ki jagah muntaqil ho jaye aur us ka saathi us ki jagah muntaqil ho jaye."
"813","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi oonghe aur namaz parh raha ho to wapas jaye, shayad wo apne aap par bad-dua kare aur use khabar na ho."
"814","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ghulam apne aaqa ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare to us ka nikah batil hai."
"815","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab so jao to chiragh bujha do; kyunke chooha batti pakar leta hai aur ghar walon ko jala deta hai. Aur darwaze band karo, mashkize bandho aur mashroob dhanpo."
"816","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab so jao to apne chiragh bujha do; kyunke shaitan aise ko aise par dalalat karta hai aur tumhein jala deta hai."
"817","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye pukara jaye to shaitan peeth pher kar bhagta hai aur us ki hawa kharij hoti hai yahan tak ke azan na sune; phir jab azan poori ho jaye to aata hai, yahan tak ke jab namaz ke liye dobara pukara jaye to peeth pher kar bhagta hai, yahan tak ke jab dobara pukarna poora ho jaye to aata hai yahan tak ke aadmi aur us ke dil ke darmiyan waswasa dalta hai aur kehta hai: Falan yaad kar, falan yaad kar, jo wo yaad nahi karta tha, yahan tak ke aadmi nahi janta ke kitni parhi."
"818","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab namaz ke liye pukara jaye to aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain aur dua qabool ki jati hai."
"819","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab gadha cheekhe to shaitan mardood se Allah ki panah mango."
"820","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dard paye to apna haath jahan dard paye rakhe aur saat baar kahe: Main Allah ki izzat aur us ki har cheez par qudrat ki panah mangta hun us shar se jo main pata hun."
"821","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi wo paye, yani mazi, to apni sharmgah par chheente mare aur namaz ke liye wuzu kare."
"822","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne pait mein kuch paye aur us par mushkil ho ke us se ¤ kuch nikla ya nahi, to masjid se bahar na nikle yahan tak ke aawaz sune ya badbu paye."
"823","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein aawaz paye to wapas jaye aur wuzu kare."
"824","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aurat khwab mein wo dekhe jo mard dekhta hai to ghusl kare."
"825","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab wazn karo to jhuka do."
"826","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab muamla ghair-ehl ke supurd kiya jaye to qayamat ka intezar karo."
"827","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne saamne oont ke paalan ki pichhli lakri jaisi cheez rakhe to namaz parhe aur jo us ke peeche se guzre us ki parwah na kare."
"828","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab meri ummat mein talwar rakhi jayegi to qayamat ke din tak us se nahi uthayegi."
"829","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khana rakha jaye to us ke kinare se lo aur darmiyan chhor do; kyunke barkat us ke darmiyan mein utarti hai."
"830","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab janaza rakha jaye aur mard use apni gardanon par uthayen ¤ to agar naik ho to kehta hai: Mujhe aage barhao; aur agar naik na ho to apne ghar walon se kehta hai: Haye afsos, use kahan le jate ho? Us ki aawaz har cheez sunti hai siwaye insaan ke, aur agar insaan use sune to behosh ho jaye."
"831","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka raat ka khana rakha jaye aur namaz khari ho to raat ke khane se shuru karo aur jaldi na karo yahan tak ke us se farigh ho jaye."
"832","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne murdon ko un ki qabron mein rakho to kaho ke Allah ke naam se aur Rasoolullah ki sunnat par."
"833","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne joote se gandagi ronde to mitti us ke liye pakeezgi hai."
"834","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab apne mozon se gandagi ronde to un ki pakeezgi mitti hai."
"835","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab makkhi tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein gire to use dubo do; kyunke us ke aik par mein beemari hai aur doosre mein shifa hai, aur wo us par se bachta hai jis mein beemari hai; pas use poora dubo do phir nikaal do."
"836","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab makkhi tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein gire to use us mein ulta do; kyunke us ke aik par mein zeher hai aur doosre mein shifa hai, aur wo zeher aage karta hai aur shifa peeche rakhta hai."
"837","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab makkhi tum mein se kisi ke mashroob mein gire to use dubo do phir nikaal do; kyunke us ke aik par mein beemari hai aur doosre mein shifa hai."
"838","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab hudood waqa hon aur raaste pher diye jayen to shufa nahi."
"839","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne ghar mein dakhil ho to kahe: Ae Allah, main tujh se achche dakhil hone aur achche nikalne ka sawal karta hun; Allah ke naam se ham dakhil hue, Allah ke naam se ham nikle aur apne Rab Allah par ham ne tawakkul kiya. Phir apne ghar walon ko salam kare."
"840","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kutta bartan mein munh dale to use saat baar dho aur aathwin baar mitti malo."
"841","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use baha do phir use saat baar dho."
"842","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use saat baar dho."
"843","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein munh dale to use saat baar dho, pehli baar mitti se."
"844","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ka zimmedar ho to us ka kafan achcha kare."
"845","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ka zimmedar ho to us ka kafan achcha kare; kyunke wo apne kafanon mein uthaye jayenge aur apne kafanon mein mulaqat karenge."
"846","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Kisra halak ho jaye to us ke baad koi Kisra nahi; aur jab Qaisar halak ho jaye to us ke baad koi Qaisar nahi. Aur qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, un donon ke khazane Allah ki raah mein kharch kiye jayenge."
"847","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi muamle ka irada kare to farz ke siwa do rakatein parhe phir kahe: Ae Allah, main tujh se tere ilm ke saath bhalayi mangta hun, teri qudrat ke saath taqat mangta hun aur tujh se tere azeem fazl ka sawal karta hun; kyunke Tu qudrat rakhta hai aur main nahi rakhta, Tu jaanta hai aur main nahi jaanta aur Tu ghaibon ka janne wala hai. Ae Allah, agar Tu jaanta hai ke ye muamla, aur use us ke naam se pukare, mere deen, meri guzran aur mere muamle ke anjaam mein mere liye bhalayi hai to use mere liye muqaddar kar, mere liye aasan kar phir mere liye us mein barkat de. Ae Allah, aur agar Tu jaanta hai ke wo mere deen, meri guzran aur mere muamle ke anjaam mein mere liye burayi hai to mujhe us se pher de, use mujh se pher de, mere liye bhalayi muqaddar kar jahan bhi ho phir mujhe us par raazi kar."
"848","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke liye zibah karo chahe koi mahina ho, Allah ke liye neki karo aur khilao."
"849","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein maut yaad karo; kyunke jab aadmi namaz mein maut yaad kare to wo apni namaz achchi karne ke layaq hai. Aur aise aadmi ki namaz parho jo nahi samajhta ke wo us ke siwa namaz parhega; aur har aise muamle se bacho jis se mazirat karni pare."
"850","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein elaan karo ke jo kha chuka ho wo baaqi din roza rakhe, aur jo na kha chuka ho wo roza rakhe; kyunke aaj Ashura ka din hai."
"851","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein elaan karo ke jo gawahi de ke Allah akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahi, ikhlas ke saath, wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"852","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari ijazat mujh par ye hai ke parda uthaya jaye aur meri sargoshi suni jaye yahan tak ke main mana karun."
"853","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ijazat di gayi hai ke Arsh uthane walon mein se aik farishte ke baare mein bayan karun: us ke donon pair neeche wali zameen mein hain aur us ke seeng par Arsh hai, aur us ke kaan ki lau aur us ke kandhe ke darmiyan parinde ki raftaar se saat sau saal ka fasla hai. Wo farishta kehta hai ke Tu paak hai jahan bhi Tu ho."
"854","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ijazat di gayi hai ke Allah taala ke farishton mein se Arsh uthane wale aik farishte ke baare mein bayan karun: us ke kaan ki lau se us ke kandhe tak saat sau saal ki musafat hai."
"855","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Takleef door kar ae logon ke Rab, shifa de, Tu hi shifa dene wala hai; teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa jo beemari na chhore."
"856","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jao aur talash karo, phir quraa dalo, phir taqseem karo, phir tum mein se har aik apne saathi ko halal kare."
"857","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere ye donon joote le jao; pas is deewar ke peeche jis se bhi milo jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur us ka dil us par mutmain ho to use jannat ki khushkhabri do."
"858","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jao, pani aur beri se ghusl karo aur kufr ke baal utar do."
"859","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jao aur use dekho, kyunke ye tum donon ke darmiyan ulfat ke liye zyada munasib hai."
"860","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jao, kyunke ghar mein teen hain jin mein aik ladka hai jo namaz parh chuka ¤ hai; pas use pakro aur use mat maro, kyunke hamein namaz walon ko marne se mana kiya gaya hai."
"861","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jao, maine use tumhein us Quran ke badle malik bana diya jo tumhare paas hai."
"862","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne saathi ke paas jao aur use khabar do ke mere Rab ne us ke rab ko aaj raat qatl kar diya, yani Kisra ko."
"863","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is pani ko le jao; phir jab apne sheher pahuncho to apne girja ko tor do, us ki jagah is pani se chheente maro aur use masjid bana lo."
"864","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is chadar ko Abu Jahm bin Huzaifa ke paas le jao aur un ki anbijaniya mere paas lao; kyunke us ne abhi meri namaz mein mujhe mashghool kiya."
"865","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Unhein, yani Abu Quhafa ko, un ki kisi biwi ke paas le jao aur wo use kisi cheez se badle, aur use kaale se bachao."
"866","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri raye hai ke use qareebi rishtedaron mein rakho."
"867","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main dekhta hun ke tumhare khwab saat aakhri raaton mein mutafiq ho gaye hain; pas jo use talash karne wala ho wo use saat aakhri raaton mein talash kare."
"868","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein meri ummat par sab se zyada rehem karne wale Abu Bakr hain, Allah ke deen mein sab se sakht Umar hain, sab se sachchi haya wale Usman hain, sab se achcha faisla karne wale Ali hain, sab se achche faraiz janne wale Zaid bin Sabit hain, sab se achche parhne wale Ubayy hain, halal o haram ke sab se aalim Muaz bin Jabal hain. Khabardar, har ummat ka ameen hai aur is ummat ke ameen Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarrah hain."
"869","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine aaj raat Kaaba ke paas apne aap ko dekha aur aik gandumi rang ke aadmi ko dekha jo tumhare dekhe hue gandumi mardon mein sab se khubsurat tha; us ke kandhon tak baal thay jo tumhare dekhe hue baalon mein sab se khubsurat thay, us ne unhein sanwara tha aur wo pani tapka rahe thay, do aadmiyon par tek lagaye hue Baitullah ka tawaaf kar raha tha. Maine poocha ye kaun hai? To mujh se kaha gaya: Maseeh bin Maryam. Phir main achanak aik ghongharale sakht baalon wale aadmi ke paas tha jo dayen aankh se kana tha jaise ubhra hua angoor ho. Maine poocha ye kaun hai? To mujh se kaha gaya: Maseeh Dajjal."
"870","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine khwab mein dekha ke miswak se miswak kar raha hun; mere paas do aadmi aaye jin mein se aik doosre se bara tha, to maine miswak un mein se chhote ko di. Phir mujh se kaha gaya: Bara kar, to maine use un mein se bare ko de di."
"871","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum ne apni aaj ki raat dekhi? Kyunke us mein se sau saal ke sar par zameen ki peeth par jo hai us mein se koi baaqi nahi rahega."
"872","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se bara sood izzaton ko gali dena hai."
"873","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar cheezein jab tum mein hon to duniya mein se jo guzar jaye tumhein parwah nahi: sachchi baat, amanat ki hifazat, achcha akhlaq aur khane mein parhezgari."
"874","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar behtareen kalaam hain, tumhein nuqsan nahi ke tum in mein se kis se shuru karo: SubhanAllah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illAllah aur Allahu Akbar."
"875","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein jahiliyyat ke muamle mein se chaar baaqi hain jinhein wo nahi chhorenge: nasbon par fakhr, nasbon mein taan, sitaron se barish mangna aur mayyat par nauha karna. Aur nauha karne wali agar maut se pehle tauba na kare to qayamat ke din is haal mein aayegi ke us par taarkol ka kurta aur aag ke sholon ki zirah hogi."
"876","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ki nehron mein se chaar nehrein hain: Saihan, Jaihan, Neel aur Furat."
"877","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar aise hain jin par maut ke baad un ke ajr jari rehte hain: jo Allah ki raah mein ¤ sarhad par mara, aur jis ne ilm sikhaya aur jab tak us par amal kiya jaye us ke amal ka ajr us ke liye jari rahega, aur jis ne sadqa kiya aur jab tak wo maujood hai us ka ajr us ke liye jari rahega, aur wo aadmi jo naik beta chhor jaye jo us ke liye dua karta ho."
"878","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar dinar hain: aik dinar jo miskeen ko diya, aik dinar jo gardan mein diya, aik dinar jo Allah ki raah mein kharch kiya aur aik dinar jo apne ghar walon par kharch kiya; un mein afzal wo hai jo apne ghar walon par kharch kiya."
"879","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Janwaron mein se chaar aise hain jo qatl nahi kiye jate: cheonti, shehed ki makkhi, hudhud aur shrike."
"880","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar aise hain jin se Allah taala bughz rakhta hai: qasam khane wala bechne wala, takabbur karne wala faqeer, zina karne wala burha aur zalim hukmaran."
"881","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din chaar hujjat karenge: aik behra jo kuch nahi sunta, aik bewaqoof, aik burha aur aik jo fatrat mein mara. Behra kahega: Ae mere Rab, Islam aaya aur maine kuch nahi suna. Bewaqoof kahega: Ae mere Rab, Islam aaya aur main kuch nahi samajhta tha aur bachche mujh par mengniyan phenkte thay. Burha kahega: Ae mere Rab, Islam aaya aur main kuch nahi samajhta tha. Aur jo fatrat mein mara wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, tere paas se mere paas koi Rasool nahi aaya. Pas un se ehad liye jayenge ke us ki itaat karenge, phir un ki taraf bheja jayega ke aag mein dakhil ho; pas jo ¤ dakhil hua wo us par thandi aur salamti hogi, aur jo dakhil na hua wo us ki taraf ghaseeta jayega."
"882","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zuhar se pehle chaar rakatein sehri ki namaz ke barabar hain."
"883","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein jahiliyyat ke muamle mein se chaar hain jinhein wo nahi chhorenge: nasbon par fakhr, nasbon mein taan, sitaron se barish mangna aur nauha karna."
"884","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein jahiliyyat ke muamle mein se chaar hain jinhein log nahi chhorenge: nasbon mein taan, mayyat par nauha, hawaaon se barish mangna ke falan falan sitare se hamein barish mili, aur mutaadi beemari ke hum ne oont ko khujli lagayi to sau oonton ko khujli lagi, to pehle oont ko kis ne khujli lagayi?"
"885","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zuhar se pehle chaar jin mein salam nahi, un ke liye aasman ke darwaze khol diye jate hain."
"886","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qurbaniyon mein chaar jayez nahi: kani jis ka kanapan wazeh ho, beemar jis ki beemari wazeh ho, langdi jis ka langdapan wazeh ho aur kamzor jo char na sakti ho."
"887","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush-naseebi mein se chaar hain: naik biwi, kushada ghar, naik hamsaya aur aaraam-deh sawari. Aur bad-naseebi mein se chaar hain: buri biwi, bura hamsaya, buri sawari aur tang ghar."
"888","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zinda logon ke amal mein se chaar murdon ke liye jari rehte hain: wo aadmi jo naik aulad chhor jaye jo us ke liye dua kare, un ki dua use faida degi; wo aadmi jo apne baad jari sadqa kare, us ke liye us ka ajr hai jab tak wo jari rahe us ke baad; aur wo aadmi jo ilm sikhaye aur us ke baad us par amal kiya jaye, us ke liye us jaisa ajr hai jo us par amal kare, us ke amal karne wale ke ajr mein se kuch kami kiye baghair."
"889","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar jis mein hon wo khaalis munafiq hai, aur jis mein un mein se aik khaslat ho us mein nifaq ki aik khaslat hogi yahan tak ke use chhor de: jab amanat supurd ki jaye to khayanat kare, jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab ehad kare to dhoka de aur jab jhagre to bad-kalaami kare."
"890","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar jis mein hon wo khaalis munafiq hai, aur jis mein un mein se aik khaslat ho us mein nifaq ki aik khaslat hogi yahan tak ke use chhor de: jab baat kare to jhoot bole, jab wada kare to khilaf-warzi kare, jab ehad kare to dhoka de aur jab jhagre to bad-kalaami kare."
"891","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chalis khaslatein hain jin mein sab se aala bakri ka atiya hai; koi banda un mein se kisi khaslat par us ke sawab ki umeed aur us ke wade ki tasdeeq ke saath amal nahi karta magar Allah taala use us ki wajah se jannat mein dakhil karta hai."
"892","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne walidain ki taraf laut jao aur un se ijazat lo; phir agar wo tumhein ijazat dein to jihad karo, warna un se neki karo."
"893","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne ghar walon ki taraf laut jao aur un mein raho, unhein sikhao, unhein hukm do aur namaz parho jaise tum ne mujhe parhte dekha hai. Phir jab namaz hazir ho to tum mein se aik tumhare liye azan de aur tum mein bara tumhari imamat kare."
"894","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne rishtedaron se sulook karo, apne rishtedaron se sulook karo."
"895","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein meri ummat par sab se zyada rehem karne wale Abu Bakr hain, Allah ke muamle mein sab se sakht Umar hain, sab se sachchi haya wale Usman hain, Allah ki kitab ke sab se achche parhne wale Ubayy bin Kaab hain, sab se achche faraiz janne wale Zaid bin Sabit hain, halal o haram ke sab se aalim Muaz bin Jabal hain. Aur har ummat ka ameen hai aur is ummat ke ameen Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarrah hain."
"896","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo zameen mein hai us par rehem karo, jo aasman mein hai tum par rehem karega."
"897","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehem karo tum par rehem kiya jayega, bakhsh do tumhein bakhsha jayega. Halakat ho baat ke bartanon ke liye, halakat ho israar karne walon ke liye jo apne kiye par israar karte hain aur wo jaante hain."
"898","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maut ka farishta Musa ki taraf bheja gaya; phir jab us ke paas aaya to us ne us ke thappar mara aur us ki ¤ aankh phor di. Pas wo apne Rab ki taraf lauta aur kaha: Tune mujhe aise bande ki taraf bheja jo maut nahi chahta. To Allah ne us ki aankh us ki taraf lautayi aur farmaya: Us ki taraf lauto aur us se kaho ke apna haath bail ki peeth par rakhe; us ke haath ne jitne baal dhanpe hon har baal ke badle aik saal hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ae mere Rab, phir kiya? Farmaya: Phir maut hai. Unhon ne kaha: To abhi. Phir unhon ne Allah se sawal kiya ke unhein Muqaddas zameen se pathar phenkne ki doori par qareeb kar de. Agar main wahan hota to tumhein surkh teele ke neeche raaste ke kinaare un ki qabr dikhata."
"899","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ki mitti safed roti hai."
"900","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jitna ho sake kharch karo aur bartano mein rok kar na rakho ke Allah tum par rok de."
"901","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne sadqa lene walon ko raazi karo."
"902","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna tehband uthao aur Allah se daro."
"903","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Batn-e-Urna se niklo aur Batn-e-Muhassir se niklo."
"904","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Batn-e-Muhassir se niklo aur kankari marne jaisi kankariyan lo."
"905","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne ghulamon se neki karo, apne ghulamon se neki karo; unhein jo tum khate ho us mein se khilao, jo tum pehente ho us mein se pehnao. Aur agar wo aisa gunah layen jise tum bakhshna nahi chahte to Allah ke bandon ko bech do aur unhein azab na do."
"906","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dam karo jab tak Allah ke saath shirk na ho."
"907","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qurbani ke janwaron par achche tareeqe se sawaar ho yahan tak ke sawari pao."
"908","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In janwaron par tandrust sawaar ho aur unhein tandrust chhoro; unhein raaston aur bazaron mein apni baaton ke liye kursiyan na banao, kyunke kabhi sawari apne sawaar se behtar aur us se zyada zikr karne wali hoti hai."
"909","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye donon rakatein apne gharon mein parho: Maghrib ke baad nafl."
"910","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jamre ko kankari marne jaisi kankariyon se maro."
"911","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teer-andazi karo ae Bani Ismail, kyunke tumhare walid teer-andaz thay."
"912","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon ki roohein sabz parindon ke peton mein hain jo jannat ke darakhton mein khati hain, yahan tak ke Allah unhein qayamat ke din un ke jismon ki taraf lautaye."
"913","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe jannat dikhayi gayi to maine Abu Talha ki biwi ko dekha, phir apne saamne aahat suni to wo Bilal thay."
"914","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe meri ummat ki aik qaum dikhayi gayi jo samandar ki peeth par sawaar hain jaise takhton par badshah hon."
"915","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mujhe khwab mein do baar dikhayi gayin, farishta tumhein resham ke tukre mein uthaye hue tha aur kehta tha: Ye tumhari biwi hai. To maine us se khol diya to tum wohi thin. Pas maine kaha: Agar ye Allah ki taraf se ho to wo use poora karega."
"916","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Laila-tul-Qadr dikhayi gayi phir main use bhool gaya, aur maine apne aap ko us ki subah pani aur mitti mein sajda karte dekha."
"917","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Laila-tul-Qadr dikhayi gayi phir mere ghar walon mein se baaz ne mujhe jaga diya aur main use bhool gaya; pas use guzarti hui aakhri das raaton mein talash karo."
"918","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe dikhaya gaya jo meri ummat mere baad payegi aur un mein se baaz ka baaz ka khoon bahana; aur ye Allah ki taraf se pehle se tha jaise un se pehle ummaton mein pehle se tha. Pas maine us se sawal kiya ke qayamat ke din un ke baare mein mujhe shafaat ata kare, to us ne kiya."
"919","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka tehband us ki aadhi pindliyon tak hai."
"920","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka tehband us ki pindli ke gosht tak hai, phir takhnon tak; pas jo us se neeche ho wo aag mein hai."
"921","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka tehband aadhi pindli tak hai; aur us par koi harj nahi jo us ke aur takhnon ke darmiyan ho. Jo takhnon se neeche ho wo aag mein hai; jo takabbur se apna tehband ghaseete Allah us ki taraf nahi dekhega."
"922","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya se be-raghbat ho Allah tum se mohabbat karega, aur jo logon ke haathon mein hai us se be-raghbat ho log tum se mohabbat karenge."
"923","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya se be-raghbat ho Allah tum se mohabbat karega; aur logon ki baat rahi to un ki taraf ye phenk do, wo tum se mohabbat karenge."
"924","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Usama mujhe sab se mehboob hain."
"925","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu mukammal karna aadha iman hai, Alhamdulillah meezan ko bhar deti hai, tasbeeh aur takbeer aasmanon aur zameen ko bhar dete hain, namaz noor hai, zakaat daleel hai, sabr roshni hai aur Quran tumhare liye ya tum par hujjat hai. Har aadmi subah karta hai to apne aap ko bechne wala hai, ya to use aazad karne wala ya use halak karne wala."
"926","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Na-pasandida haalaton mein wuzu mukammal karna, qadam masjdon ki taraf barhana aur namaz ke baad namaz ka intezar karna gunahon ko dho kar saaf kar deta hai."
"927","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu mukammal karo, ungliyon ke darmiyan khilal karo aur naak mein khoob pani dalo siwaye is ke ke rozedar ho."
"928","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu mukammal karo."
"929","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Peeche ho jao, kyunke tumhare liye raasta rokna jayez nahi; tum par raaste ke kinare lazim hain."
"930","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton se un ki sharmgahon ke baare mein ijazat lo."
"931","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un se aik haiz se bariyat hasil karo, yani laundiyon se."
"932","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mango, kyunke qabr ka azab haq hai."
"933","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya karo, kyunke Allah haq se haya nahi karta; auraton ke paas un ki pichhli raah se na aao."
"934","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya karo, kyunke Allah haq se haya nahi karta; auraton ke paas un ki sharmgahon se aana halal nahi."
"935","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala se sachchi haya karo; jo Allah se sachchi haya kare to sar aur jo us ne jama kiya us ki hifazat kare, pait aur jo us ne sameta us ki hifazat kare, maut aur sadne ko yaad kare. Aur jo aakhirat chahe duniya ki zeenat chhor de; pas jo aisa kare us ne Allah se sachchi haya ki."
"936","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran yaad karo, kyunke wo aadmiyon ke seenon se nikalne mein ¤ bandhe hue oonton se zyada tez hai."
"937","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye dam karo, kyunke us mein nazar hai."
"938","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar se Allah ki panah mango, kyunke nazar haq hai."
"939","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Faqr aur tangi se Allah ki panah mango, aur is se ke tum zulm karo ya tum par zulm kiya jaye."
"940","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehne wale bure hamsaye se Allah ki panah mango; kyunke musafir hamsaya jab chahe juda ho jaye juda ho jata hai."
"941","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mango, jahannam ke azab se Allah ki panah mango, Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne se Allah ki panah mango, zindagi aur maut ke fitne se Allah ki panah mango."
"942","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mango; kyunke unhein un ki qabron mein azab diya jata hai jise janwar sunte hain."
"943","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajaton ke poora hone par chhupane se madad lo; kyunke har naimat wala hasad kiya jata hai."
"944","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne Rab se maghfirat mango; main Allah se maghfirat mangta hun aur har din us ki taraf sau baar tauba karta hun."
"945","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bhai ke liye maghfirat mango aur us ke liye sabit-qadmi mango; kyunke ab us se sawal kiya jata hai."
"946","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maaiz bin Malik ke liye maghfirat mango; us ne aisi tauba ki hai jo agar ummat mein taqseem ki jaye to unhein kaafi ho."
"947","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon se be-niyaz ho jao agarche miswak ke tukre se ho."
"948","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne dil se fatwa lo agarche fatwa dene wale tumhein fatwa dein."
"949","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni namaz ka isteqbal karo; us ki namaz nahi jo saff ke peeche akele parhe."
"950","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran chaar se seekho: Abdullah bin Masud, Salim maula Abu Huzaifa, Ubayy bin Kaab aur Muaz bin Jabal se."
"951","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seedhe raho aur logon ke liye tumhara akhlaq achcha ho."
"952","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seedhe raho aur tum shumar nahi kar sakoge; aur jaan lo ke tumhare aamaal mein behtareen namaz hai, aur wuzu ki hifazat sirf momin karta hai."
"953","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seedhe raho, aur kitna achcha hai agar tum seedhe raho; tumhare aamaal mein behtareen namaz hai, aur wuzu ki hifazat sirf momin karega."
"954","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Joote kasrat se rakho; kyunke aadmi jab tak joota pehne ho sawaar rehta hai."
"955","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ghar se faida uthao; kyunke wo do baar giraya gaya hai aur teesri baar uthaya jayega."
"956","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naak do baar khoob ya teen baar jhatko."
"957","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Allah ko tumhare deen, tumhari amanat aur tumhare amal ke khaatimon ka ameen banata hun."
"958","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein Allah ko saunpata hun jis ki amanatein zaya nahi hotin."
"959","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar se bhalayi ki waseeyat karo."
"960","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton se bhalayi ki waseeyat karo; kyunke aurat pasli se paida ki gayi hai, aur pasli mein sab se terha us ka upar wala hissa hai. Phir agar use seedha karne jao to tor doge, aur agar chhor do to hamesha terhi rahegi; pas auraton se bhalayi ki waseeyat karo."
"961","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Barabar ho jao aur ikhtilaf na karo ke tumhare dil mukhtalif ho jayenge; aur mujh se qareeb tum mein se aqal aur danish wale hon, phir jo un ke baad hon, phir jo un ke baad hon."
"962","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arab ke qabilon mein sab se jaldi fana hone wale Quraish hain; qareeb hai ke aurat joote par guzre aur kahe ke ye Quraishi joota hai."
"963","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se mujh se sab se jaldi milne wali wo hogi jis ke haath sab se lambe honge."
"964","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Janaze mein jaldi karo; phir agar naik ho to bhalayi hai jis ki taraf use aage barhate ho, aur agar is ke siwa ho to burayi hai jise apni gardanon se utarte ho."
"965","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne apne aap par zyada zulm kiya; phir jab us ki maut hazir hui to ¤ apne beton ko waseeyat ki aur kaha: Jab main mar jaun to mujhe jala do, phir mujhe pees do, phir mujhe samandar mein bikher do. Allah ki qasam, agar mera Rab mujh par qadir hua to mujhe aisa azab dega jo us ne kisi ko nahi diya. To unhon ne us ke saath aisa kiya. Pas Allah ne zameen se farmaya: Jo tune liya hai de de, to wo khara tha. Phir farmaya: Tumhein jo tum ne kiya us par kis ne ubhara? Unhon ne kaha: Tere khauf ne, ae mere Rab. Pas us ne use is wajah se bakhsh diya."
"966","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se bara chor wo hai jo apni namaz churaye: us ka ruku aur sajda poora na kare. Aur logon mein sab se bara bakheel wo hai jo salam mein bukhl kare."
"967","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din meri shafaat se sab se zyada khush-naseeb wo hoga jo apne dil se khaalis mukhlis ho kar kahe ke La ilaha illAllah."
"968","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Daudo, kyunke Allah ne tum par daudna likha hai."
"969","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr ki namaz roshan karke parho yahan tak ke log apne teeron ke girne ki jaghein dekhein."
"970","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr roshan karke parho, kyunke ye ajr mein bada hai."
"971","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log Islam laye aur Amr bin Al-Aas iman laye."
"972","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum jo bhalayi pehle kar chuke ho us par Islam laye ho."
"973","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam lao phir qitaal karo."
"974","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam lao agarche tum na-pasand karte ho."
"975","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aslam, Allah use salamat rakhe, aur Ghifar, Allah use bakhsh de. Khabardar, Allah ki qasam maine ye nahi kaha lekin Allah ne kaha."
"976","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aslam, Ghifar, Ashja, Muzaina, Juhaina aur jo Bani Kaab mein se hon wo logon ke muqable mein maula hain, aur Allah aur us ke Rasool un ke maula hain."
"977","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aslam, Ghifar aur Muzaina aur Juhaina mein se kuch Allah ke nazdeek Asad, Tameem, Hawazin aur Ghatfan se behtar hain."
"978","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aslam, Ghifar aur Muzaina, Tameem, Asad, Ghatfan aur Aamir bin Sa'sa'a se behtar hain."
"979","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ka azeem naam jis se dua ki jaye to qabool kare Quran ki teen suraton mein hai: Baqarah, Aal Imran aur Taha mein."
"980","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ka azeem naam in do aayaton mein hai: Tumhara mabood aik mabood hai, us ke siwa koi mabood nahi, Rehman Raheem; aur Aal Imran ke aaghaz mein: Alif Laam Meem, Allah jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi, zinda qaim rehne wala."
"981","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi karo tum se narmi ki jayegi."
"982","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Narmi kar tujh se narmi ki jayegi."
"983","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suno aur itaat karo agarche kate hue aaza wale Habshi ghulam ke liye ho."
"984","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suno aur itaat karo; kyunke un par hai jo un par dala gaya aur tum par hai jo tum par dala gaya."
"985","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suno aur itaat karo agarche tum par aisa Habshi ghulam muqarrar kiya jaye jis ka sar kishmish jaisa ho."
"986","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein chori mein badtareen wo hai jo apni namaz se churaye: us ka ruku, sajda aur khushu poora na kare."
"987","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel se sab se zyada mushabeh jo maine dekha Dihya Kalbi hain."
"988","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ka ghazab us par sakht hua jo daawa kare ke wo malikul amlaak hai; Allah ke siwa koi malik nahi."
"989","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne aik aadmi se us ki zameen kharidi aur zameen kharidne wale ne apni zameen mein matak paya jis mein sona tha. Zameen kharidne wale ne kaha: Mujh se apna sona lo, maine tum se sirf zameen kharidi hai, sona nahi kharida. Aur zameen wale ne kaha: Maine tumhein zameen aur jo us mein hai becha hai. Pas donon ne aik aadmi se faisla karwaya. Jis se donon ne faisla karwaya us ne kaha: Kiya tum donon ki aulad hai? Un mein se aik ne kaha: Mera ladka hai, aur doosre ne kaha: Meri ladki hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ladke ka ladki se nikah kar do, apne upar us mein se kharch karo aur sadqa karo."
"990","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag ne apne Rab se shikayat ki aur kaha: Ae mere Rab, mere baaz ne baaz ko kha liya. Pas use do saanson ki ijazat di: sardi mein aik saans aur garmi mein aik saans. Pas ye garmi ki sab se sakht hai jo tum pate ho aur sardi ki sab se sakht hai jo tum pate ho."
"991","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag ne apne Rab se shikayat ki aur kaha: Ae mere Rab, mere baaz ne baaz ko kha liya. Pas us ke liye do saansein rakhin: sardi mein aik saans aur garmi mein aik saans. Raha sardi mein us ka saans to wo sakht sardi hai, aur raha garmi mein us ka saans to wo garm hawa hai."
"992","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein aazmayish mein sab se sakht ambiya hain, phir jo un se zyada mushabeh hon. Aadmi apne deen ke mutabiq aazmaya jata hai; phir agar us ke deen mein mazbooti ho to us ki aazmayish sakht hoti hai, aur agar us ke deen mein narmi ho to apne deen ke mutabiq aazmaya jata hai. Banda par aazmayish musalsal rehti hai yahan tak ke use zameen ¤ par is haal mein chalte chhore ke us par koi gunah nahi hota."
"993","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein aazmayish mein sab se sakht ambiya hain, phir jo un se zyada mushabeh hon. Log apne deen ke mutabiq aazmaye jate hain; phir jis ka deen mazboot hua us ki aazmayish sakht hui, aur jis ka deen kamzor hua us ki aazmayish kamzor hui. Aur aadmi ko aazmayish pahunchti hai yahan tak ke wo logon mein is haal mein chale ke us par koi gunah nahi hota."
"994","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein aazmayish mein sab se sakht ambiya saliheen hain, phir jo un se zyada mushabeh hon."
"995","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein aazmayish mein sab se sakht ambiya hain, phir naik log. Un mein se aik faqr mein mubtala hota tha yahan tak ke sirf kambal pata tha jise kaat kar pehenta tha, aur joon mein mubtala hota tha yahan tak ke use maar deti thi. Aur un mein se aik aazmayish par tum mein se aik ke atiye par khushi se zyada khush hota tha."
"996","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein aazmayish mein sab se sakht ambiya hain, phir jo un ke baad hon, phir jo un ke baad hon."
"997","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek azab mein sab se sakht log wo honge jo Allah ki makhlooq ki mushabehat karte hain."
"998","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mein logon ko sab se sakht azab dene wale qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek azab mein sab se sakht honge."
"999","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din azab mein sab se sakht log tasweer banane wale honge; un se kaha jayega ke jo tum ne banaya use zinda karo."
"1000","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din azab mein sab se sakht aadmi wo hoga jo Nabi ko qatl kare ya Nabi use qatl kare, ya wo aadmi jo logon ko baghair ilm ke gumrah kare, ya tasweer banane wala jo tasweerain banaye."
"1001","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din azab mein sab se sakht zaalim hukmaran hoga."
"1002","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein haya ke lihaaz se sab se barh kar Usman bin Affan hain."
"1003","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein mujh se sab se zyada mohabbat karne wale wo log honge jo mere baad aayenge; un mein se har aik ye chahega ke kaash us ke ghar wale aur us ka maal jata rahe aur wo mujhe dekh le."
"1004","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Arab ne jo sab se zyada shairana kalima kaha wo Labeed ka kalima hai: Khabardar, Allah ke siwa har cheez baatil hai."
"1005","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Azaan ke kalimaat do-do baar kaho aur iqamat ke kalimaat aik-aik baar kaho."
"1006","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sifarish karo, tumhein ajr diya jayega."
"1007","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sifarish karo, tumhein ajr diya jayega, aur Allah apne Nabi ki zaban par jo chahega faisla farmayega."
"1008","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein Allah ka sab se zyada shukr karne wala wo hai jo logon ka sab se zyada shukr karta hai."
"1009","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun; jo banda in donon ke saath Allah se mile baghair is ke ke un mein shak kare, wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"1010","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah ka elaan karo."
"1011","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah ka elaan karo aur use zahir karo."
"1012","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haathon aur pairon ki ungliyan diyat mein barabar hain."
"1013","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shair ka kaha hua sab se sachcha kalima Labeed ka kalima hai: Khabardar, Allah ke siwa har cheez baatil hai."
"1014","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni nazar pher lo."
"1015","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aal Jafar ke liye khana banao, kyunke un par wo aa para hai jo unhein mashghool rakhega."
"1016","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo tumhein nazar aaye karo, pas jo Allah taala ne faisla kar diya wo ho kar rahega, aur har pani se bachcha nahi hota."
"1017","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne ham se pehle walon ko Juma se bhatka diya; pas Yahood ke liye Sanichar ka din tha aur Nasara ke liye Itwaar ka din tha. Phir Allah hamein laya aur hamein Juma ke din ki hidayat di; pas us ne Juma, Sanichar aur Itwaar banaye. Aur isi tarah wo qayamat ke din hamare taabe honge: ham duniya walon mein sab se aakhir hain aur qayamat ke din sab se awwal hain, jin ka makhlooq se pehle faisla kiya jayega."
"1018","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne nafs se mujhe chhe cheezon ki zamanat do, main tumhein jannat ki zamanat deta hun: Jab baat karo to sach bolo, jab wada karo to poora karo, jab amanat rakhi jaye to ada karo, apni sharmgahon ki hifazat karo, apni nigahein jhukao aur apne haath rok lo."
"1019","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Achchi guftagu karo, salaam phelao, rishtedaron se sil-e-rehmi karo aur ¤ raat ko namaz parho jabke log so rahe hon, phir salaamti ke saath jannat mein dakhil ho."
"1020","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aasman charcharaya aur use charcharana hi laiq hai. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, us mein baalisht bhar jagah bhi nahi magar us mein kisi farishte ki peshani sajda karti hui hai jo Allah ki hamd ke saath us ki tasbeeh karta hai."
"1021","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ko khana khilao aur achchi guftagu karo."
"1022","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khana khilao aur salaam phelao, tum jannaton ke waaris banoge."
"1023","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon ke bachche jannat mein aik pahar mein honge, jin ki parwarish Ibrahim aur Sara karenge yahan tak ke qayamat ke din unhein un ke walidain ki taraf lautayen."
"1024","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushrikon ke bachche jannat walon ke khadim honge."
"1025","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum sone lago to chiraagh bujha do, darwaze band karo, mashkon ke munh bandho aur khane-peene ko dhaanp do, chahe lakri ka aik tukra hi us par aar paar rakh kar."
"1026","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dua ki qabooliyat ko lashkaron ke aamne-saamne hone, namaz qaim hone aur barish ke nazool ke waqt talash karo."
"1027","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko aakhri ashray mein talash karo; phir agar tum maghloob ho jao to aakhri saat baaqi raaton mein maghloob na ho."
"1028","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko aakhri ashray mein talash karo: nau raatein baaqi hon, saat raatein baaqi hon, paanch raatein baaqi hon aur teen raatein baaqi hon."
"1029","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko Ramazan ke aakhri ashray mein talash karo."
"1030","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine jannat mein jhanka to us ke aksar rehne wale faqeeron ko dekha, aur aag mein jhanka to us ke aksar rehne wale auraton ko dekha."
"1031","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din sab se lambi gardano wale log muazzin honge."
"1032","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khushbuon mein sab se achchi khushbu mushk hai."
"1033","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kamaayi mein sab se achchi kamaayi aadmi ke apne haath ki kamaayi hai, aur har mubarak tijarat."
"1034","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri itaat karo jab tak main tumhare darmiyan hun, aur tum par Allah ki kitaab lazim hai: us ke halal ko halal samjho aur us ke haram ko haram samjho."
"1035","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par andheri raat ke tukron jaise fitne chha gaye hain; un se sab se zyada bachne wala pahari choti wala hoga jo apni bakriyon ke doodh par guzara kare, ya wo aadmi jo peeche raston se apne ghore ki lagaam pakre hue ho aur apni talwar ke saye se khata ho."
"1036","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mera khayal hai tum sun chuke ho ke Abu Ubaida Bahrain se kuch maal lekar aaye hain; pas khush ho jao aur jo tumhein khush kare us ki umeed rakho. Allah ki qasam, main tum par faqr se nahi darta, lekin main tum par is se darta hun ke tum par duniya kushada kar di jaye jaise tum se pehle walon par kushada ki gayi thi; pas tum us mein muqabla karoge jaise unhon ne muqabla kiya tha, to wo tumhein halak kar degi jaise us ne unhein halak kiya tha."
"1037","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki ibadat karo goya tum use dekh rahe ho; kyunke agar tum use nahi dekh rahe to wo tumhein dekh raha hai. Apne aap ko murdon mein shumar karo aur mazloom ki dua se bacho, kyunke wo qabool hoti hai."
"1038","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki ibadat karo goya tum use dekh rahe ho, apne aap ko murdon mein shumar karo, mazloom ki duaon se bacho kyunke wo qabool hoti hain, aur tum par subah ki namaz aur isha ki namaz lazim hai; pas un donon mein hazir hua karo, kyunke agar tum jaan lo ke un mein kiya hai to tum un mein zaroor aaoge chahe ghisat kar aana pare."
"1039","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki ibadat karo, us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, farz namaz qaim karo, farz zakaat do, hajj aur umrah karo, Ramazan ke roze rakho, aur dekho jo tum pasand karte ho ke ¤ log tumhare saath karein to tum un ke saath karo, aur jo tum na-pasand karte ho ke wo tumhare saath karein to unhein us se chhor do."
"1040","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, Allah ke liye aise amal karo goya tum use dekh rahe ho, apne aap ko murdon mein shumar karo, har pathar aur har darakht ke paas Allah taala ka zikr karo, aur jab bura kaam karo to us ke pehlu mein neki karo: posheeda ke saath posheeda aur elaaniya ke saath elaaniya."
"1041","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehman ki ibadat karo, salaam phelao aur khana khilao, tum jannaton mein dakhil hoge."
"1042","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sajde mein seedhe raho, aur tum mein se koi apne baazu kutte ke phelaane ki tarah na phelaye."
"1043","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is namaz ko andhera karke parho, kyunke tumhein is ke zariye baaqi ummaton par fazilat di gayi hai; tum se pehle kisi ummat ne use nahi parha."
"1044","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se aajiz wo hai jo dua se aajiz ho, aur logon mein sab se bakheel wo hai jo salaam mein bakheel ho."
"1045","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle chhe cheezein gin lo: meri maut, phir Bait-ul-Maqdis ki fatah, phir aik waba jo tum mein bakriyon ke marz qu'aas ki tarah phailegi, phir maal ki itni farawani ke aadmi ko sau deenar diye jayenge lekin wo phir bhi naraaz rahega, phir aik fitna ke Arab ka koi ghar nahi bachega magar wo us mein dakhil hoga, phir aik sulah jo tumhare aur Bani-ul-Asfar ke darmiyan hogi to wo ehd torenge aur tumhare paas assi jhandon ke neeche aayenge, har jhande ke neeche baarah hazaar honge."
"1046","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni auladon ke darmiyan atiye mein insaaf karo jaise tum pasand karte ho ke wo tumhare darmiyan neki aur narmi mein insaaf karein."
"1047","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us shakhs ka uzr khatm kar diya jis ki umr us ne lambi ki yahan tak ke wo saath saal ko pahunch gaya."
"1048","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par apne dam pesh karo; dam mein koi harj nahi jab tak us mein shirk na ho."
"1049","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ke aebon se e'raaz karo; kiya tum nahi dekhte ke agar tum logon mein bad-gumani ki khoj lagao to tum unhein bigar doge ya qareeb hai ke unhein bigar do."
"1050","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ki ginti, us ka bartan aur us ka bandhan yaad rakho, phir aik saal tak us ka elaan karo; phir agar us ka maalik aa jaye to use de do warna wo tumhare maal ki tarah hai."
"1051","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne nasab jaano taake apne rishtedaron se sil-e-rehmi karo; kyunke rishtedari ke katne par ¤ ¤ qareeb ka qareeb hona kuch kaam nahi aata chahe wo kitni qareeb ho, aur us ke jorne par door ka door hona nuqsan nahi deta chahe wo kitni door ho."
"1052","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke raaste se takleef-deh cheez hata do."
"1053","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar chaaho to azl karo, kyunke jo us ke liye muqaddar kiya gaya hai wo us tak zaroor aayega."
"1054","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har surat ko ruku aur sajde se us ka hissa do."
"1055","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazdoor ko us ki ujrat us ka paseena khushk hone se pehle de do."
"1056","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe paanch cheezein di gayin jo mujh se pehle nabiyon mein se kisi ko nahi di gayin: aik mahine ki musafat se rob ke zariye meri madad ki gayi; mere liye zameen masjid aur paak karne wali banayi gayi, pas meri ummat ka jo aadmi jahan namaz paye wo wahin namaz parh le; mere liye ghanimatein halal ki gayin jo mujh se pehle kisi ke liye halal nahi huin; mujhe shafa'at di gayi; aur Nabi apni qaum ki taraf khaas bheja jata tha jabke main tamam logon ki taraf bheja gaya hun."
"1057","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se sattar hazaar mujhe diye gaye jo baghair hisab jannat mein dakhil honge, un ke chehre chaand ki raat ke chaand jaise honge, un ke dil aik aadmi ke dil par honge. Phir maine apne ¤ Rab azza wa jal se zyada manga to us ne har aik ke saath sattar hazaar mazeed de diye."
"1058","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe kalaam ki shuruaat, us ke jaame' mukhtasar kalimaat aur us ke ikhtitam diye gaye."
"1059","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Tauret ki jagah saat lambi suratein di gayin, Zaboor ki jagah Mi'een di gayin, Injeel ki jagah dohrayi jane wali suratein di gayin, aur Mufassal suraton se mujhe fazilat di gayi."
"1060","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Surah Baqarah ki aakhri aayaat Arsh ke neeche khazane se di gayin jo mujh se pehle kisi Nabi ko nahi di gayin."
"1061","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do aur dene se haath na roko, warna tum se rok liya jayega."
"1062","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yusuf ko husn ka aadha hissa diya gaya."
"1063","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yusuf aur un ki walida ko husn ka aadha hissa diya gaya."
"1064","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek dinon mein sab se azeem din qurbani ka din hai, phir theherne ka din hai."
"1065","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein ajr ke lihaaz se sab se azeem log wo hain jo us tak chalne mein sab se door hon, phir jo door hon; aur jo shakhs namaz ka intezar kare yahan tak ke use Imam ke saath parhe wo us se ajr mein azeem hai jo use parh le phir so jaye."
"1066","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Buhtan mein sab se azeem log do hain: wo shair jo poori qabile ki hajw kare, aur wo aadmi jo apne baap ka inkar kare."
"1067","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Daarhiyan barhao, moonchhein kato, apne safed baal badal do aur Yahood o Nasara se mushabahat na karo."
"1068","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use bandho aur tawakkul karo."
"1069","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jaan lo ke tum Allah ke liye jo sajda karoge, Allah us ke zariye tumhara aik darja buland karega aur tum se aik gunah mita dega."
"1070","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jaan lo ke tum mein se har aik ke liye us ke waris ka maal us ke apne maal se zyada mehboob hai; tumhara maal wo hai jo tum ne aage bheja aur tumhare waris ka maal wo hai jo tum ne peeche chhora."
"1071","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Abu Masood, jaan lo ke Allah tum par tum se zyada qadir hai jitne tum is ghulam par ho."
"1072","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah ka elaan karo."
"1073","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki umrein saath se sattar ke darmiyan hain, aur un mein sab se kam wo hain jo is se aage barhein."
"1074","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amal karo, kyunke har aik ke liye wo aasaan kar diya gaya hai jis ke liye wo paida kiya gaya hai."
"1075","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aap ki izzat ki panah mein aata hun, jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi, is se ke aap mujhe gumrah karein; Aap wo zinda hain jo nahi marenge jabke jinn aur insaan marenge."
"1076","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din ghusl karo aur apne sar dho, chahe tum junbi na ho, aur khushbu lagao."
"1077","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch ko paanch se pehle ghanimat jano: apni zindagi ko apni maut se pehle, apni sehat ko apni bemari se pehle, apni faraghat ko apni mashghooliyat se pehle, apni jawani ko apne burhape se pehle aur apni maal-daari ko apne ¤ faqr se pehle."
"1078","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke naam se aur Allah ke raaste mein jihaad karo, aur jo Allah se kufr kare us se qitaal karo. Jihaad karo, maal mein khayanat na karo, ehd na toro, musla na karo aur bachche ko qatl na karo. Aur jab tum mushrikon mein se apne dushman se milo to unhein teen khaslaton ki dawat do; un mein se jo bhi wo qabool karein to un se qabool karo aur un se haath rok lo: unhein Islam ki dawat do, phir agar wo qabool karein to un se qabool karo aur un se haath rok lo. Phir unhein dawat do ke apne ghar se hijrat karke muhajireen ke ghar ki taraf muntaqil ho jayen, aur unhein batao ke agar wo aisa karein to un ke liye wo hai jo muhajireen ke liye hai aur un par wo hai jo muhajireen par hai. Phir agar wo muntaqil hone se inkar karein to unhein batao ke wo dehati Musalmanon jaise honge, un par Allah ka wo hukm jari hoga jo mominon par jari hota hai, aur un ke liye ghanimat aur fai mein kuch nahi hoga siwaye is ke ke wo Musalmanon ke saath jihaad karein. Phir agar wo inkar karein to un se jizya mango; phir agar wo tum se qabool karein to un se qabool karo aur un se haath rok lo. Phir agar wo inkar karein to Allah se madad mango aur un se qitaal karo. Aur jab tum qile walon ka muhasira karo aur wo chahein ke tum un ke liye Allah ka zimma aur us ke Nabi ka zimma rakho to un ke liye Allah ka zimma aur us ke Nabi ka zimma na rakho, lekin un ke liye apna zimma aur apne saathiyon ka zimma rakho; kyunke tumhara apne zimmon aur apne saathiyon ke zimmon ko torna Allah ke zimme aur us ke Rasool ke zimme ko torne se halka hai. Aur jab tum qile walon ka muhasira karo aur wo chahein ke tum unhein Allah ke hukm par utaro to unhein Allah ke hukm par na utaro, lekin unhein apne hukm par utaro; kyunke tum nahi jaante ke tum un mein Allah ke hukm ko paoge ya nahi."
"1079","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use paani aur beri ke patton se ghusl do, use us ke donon kapron mein kafan do, use ¤ khushbu na lagao, us ka sar na dhaanpo aur use hunoot na lagao, kyunke Allah use qayamat ke din talbiya kehte hue uthayega."
"1080","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne darwaze band karo, apne bartanon ko dhaanpo, apne chiraagh bujha do aur apni mashkon ke munh bandho; kyunke shaitan na band darwaza kholta hai, na dhaanpa hua bartan kholta hai, na bandhan kholta hai; aur ye chuhee ghar walon par ghar jala deti hai."
"1081","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sab se zyada ghazab wala aur sab se khabees aur us par sab se zyada ghazab wala wo aadmi hoga jo Malik-ul-Amlaak kehlata tha; Allah ke siwa koi baadshah nahi."
"1082","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahood ikhattar firqon mein bat gaye: aik jannat mein aur sattar aag mein. Nasara bahattar firqon mein bat gayin: ikhattar aag mein aur aik jannat mein. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, meri ummat tihattar firqon mein bate gi: aik jannat mein aur bahattar aag mein."
"1083","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahood ikhattar firqon mein bat gaye, Nasara bahattar firqon mein bat gayin, aur meri ummat tihattar firqon mein bate gi."
"1084","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein faraiz ka sab se aalim Zaid bin Sabit hai."
"1085","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salaam phelao, khana khilao, rishtedaron se sil-e-rehmi karo, raat ko qiyam karo jabke log so rahe hon, aur salaamti ke saath jannat mein dakhil ho."
"1086","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aapas mein salaam phelao, tum mohabbat karne lagoge."
"1087","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salaam phelao, tum salaamat rahoge."
"1088","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salaam phelao taake tum buland ho."
"1089","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salaam phelao, khana khilao aur bhai-bhai bano jaise Allah ne tumhein hukm diya hai."
"1090","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal Islam seedha aasaan deen hai."
"1091","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal mein sab se afzal Allah wahdah par iman hai, phir jihaad, phir mabrur hajj jo baaqi aamaal se aise fazilat rakhta hai jaise suraj ke tuloo se us ke ghuroob tak ka fasla hai."
"1092","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal mein sab se afzal Allah wahdah par iman hai, phir jihaad, phir maqbool hajj jo baaqi aamaal se aise fazilat rakhta hai jaise suraj ke tuloo se us ke ¤ ghuroob tak ka fasla hai."
"1093","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal mein sab se afzal namaz us ke awwal waqt mein hai."
"1094","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal mein sab se afzal namaz us ke waqt par hai aur walidain se neki hai."
"1095","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal mein sab se afzal namaz us ke waqt par hai, walidain se neki aur Allah ke raaste mein jihaad hai."
"1096","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal mein sab se afzal ye hai ke tum apne momin bhai ko khushi do, ya us ka qarz ada karo, ya use roti khilao."
"1097","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman mein sab se afzal sabr aur narmi hai."
"1098","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek dinon mein sab se afzal din Juma ka din hai."
"1099","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal jihaad ye hai ke aadmi apne nafs aur apni khwahish se jihaad kare."
"1100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal jihaad zaalim hukmaran ke saamne haq baat kehna hai."
"1101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal hajj buland aawaz se talbiya kehna aur qurbani ka khoon bahana hai."
"1102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal dua Arafa ke din ki dua hai, aur sab se afzal jo maine aur mujh se pehle nabiyon ne kaha wo ye hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo tanha hai, us ka koi shareek nahi."
"1103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deenaron mein sab se afzal deenar wo hai jo aadmi apne ghar walon par kharch kare, aur wo deenar jo aadmi Allah ke raaste mein apni sawari par kharch kare, aur wo deenar jo aadmi Allah azza wa jal ke raaste mein apne saathiyon par kharch kare."
"1104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal zikr La ilaha illallah hai aur sab se afzal dua Alhamdulillah hai."
"1105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gardanon mein sab se afzal wo hai jo qeemat mein sab se mehngi aur apne ghar walon ke nazdeek sab se nafees ho."
"1106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghariyon mein sab se afzal raat ka aakhri gehra hissa hai."
"1107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheedon mein sab se afzal wo hain jo pehli saf mein qitaal karte hain aur apne chehre nahi pherte yahan tak ke qatl ho jayen; ye jannat ke oonche kamron mein khushiyan manayenge, un ka Rab un par hansega; pas jab un ka Rab kisi bande par kisi jangah hanse to us par koi hisab nahi."
"1108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal shaheed wo hai jis ka khoon bahaya gaya aur jis ka ghora zakhmi kiya gaya."
"1109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqon mein sab se afzal Allah azza wa jal ke raaste mein khaime ka saya, ya Allah ke raaste mein khadim ka atiya, ya Allah ke raaste mein juft khane wali oontni ka atiya hai."
"1110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal sadqa bughz rakhne wale rishtedar par sadqa hai."
"1111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal sadqa ye hai ke tum sadqa do jabke tum tandrust aur hirs wale ho, maal-daari ki umeed rakhte ho aur faqr se darte ho; aur der na karo yahan tak ke jab jaan halq tak pahunch jaye to kaho: falan ke liye itna hai aur falan ke liye itna hai; khabardar, wo to pehle hi falan ka ho chuka tha."
"1112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal sadqa tang-dast ki mehnat hai, aur un se shuru karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho."
"1113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal sadqa pani pilana hai."
"1114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal sadqa wo hai jo maal-daari ke bawajood ho; ooncha haath neeche haath se behtar hai; aur un se shuru karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho. Aurat kehti hai: ya mujhe khilao ya mujhe talaq do; ghulam kehta hai: mujhe khilao aur mujh se kaam lo; beta kehta hai: mujhe khilao, tum mujhe kis ke supurd karte ho?"
"1115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal sadqa wo hai jo maal-daari ke bawajood ho; ooncha haath neeche haath se behtar hai; aur un se shuru karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho."
"1116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Farz ke baad sab se afzal namaz raat ke gehre hisse mein namaz hai, aur Ramazan ke mahine ke baad sab se afzal roza Allah ka mahina Muharram hai."
"1117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal namaz aadmi ki apne ghar mein namaz hai, siwaye farz ke."
"1118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal namaz lamba qiyam hai."
"1119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek namazon mein sab se afzal Juma ke din subah ki namaz jamaat ke saath hai."
"1120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal roza mere bhai Dawood ka roza hai: wo aik din roza rakhte aur aik din iftar karte thay, aur jab dushman se milte to peeth nahi pherte thay."
"1121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ramazan ke baad sab se afzal roza wo mahina hai jise tum Muharram kehte ho."
"1122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal ibadat dua hai."
"1123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal amal namaz us ke waqt par hai aur Allah ke raaste mein jihaad hai."
"1124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal amal Allah par iman aur Allah ke raaste mein jihaad hai."
"1125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran mein sab se afzal Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jo jahano ka Rab hai."
"1126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal kamaayi mubarak tijarat aur aadmi ke apne haath ka kaam hai."
"1127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se afzal kalaam ye hai: Allah paak hai, tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain, Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Allah sab se bara hai."
"1128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein sab se afzal wo hain jo akhlaq mein sab se achche hon."
"1129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein Islam ke lihaaz se sab se afzal wo hai jis ki zaban aur haath se Musalman mehfooz hon; mominon mein iman ke lihaaz se sab se afzal wo hai jo akhlaq mein sab se achcha ho; muhajireen mein sab se afzal wo hai jo us se hijrat kare jis se Allah taala ne mana kiya hai; aur jihaad mein sab se afzal wo hai jo Allah azza wa jal ke liye apne nafs se jihaad kare."
"1130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se afzal wo momin hai jo do shareefon ke darmiyan ho."
"1131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se afzal wo momin hai jo Allah ke raaste mein apni jaan aur maal se jihaad kare, phir wo momin jo ghatiyon mein se aik ghati mein Allah se dare aur logon ko apne shar se chhore hue ho."
"1132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do hijraton mein sab se afzal zahir hijrat hai; aur zahir hijrat ¤ ye hai ke tum Rasoolullah ke saath sabit qadam raho; aur dehati hijrat ye hai ke tum apne dehat ki taraf laut jao, aur tum par apni tangi aur kushadagi, na-pasand aur pasand mein sunna aur itaat karna lazim hai, aur tum par tarjeeh di jane par bhi."
"1133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya ke dinon mein sab se afzal ashray ke din hain."
"1134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari namazon mein sab se afzal tumhare gharon mein hai, siwaye farz ke."
"1135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat walon ki auraton mein sab se afzal Khadija bint Khuwailid, Fatima bint Muhammad, Maryam bint Imran aur Firaun ki biwi Aasiya bint Muzahim hain."
"1136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pachhne lagane wale aur lagwane wale donon ka roza toot gaya."
"1137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare paas rozedar iftar karein, tumhara khana naik log khayein aur farishte tum par durood bhejein."
"1138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kamyaab hua jo Islam ki hidayat paya aur us ki rozi guzare ke mutabiq hui aur us ne qanaat ki."
"1139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki hadon mein se aik had qaim karna Allah ke shehron mein chaalees raaton ki barish se behtar hai."
"1140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bagh qabool kar lo aur use aik talaq de do."
"1141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aage aao, peeche hato, aur peeche ke muqaam aur haiz se bacho."
"1142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad un donon ki pairvi karo: Abu Bakr aur Umar ki."
"1143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad un donon ki pairvi karo: Abu Bakr aur Umar ki; Ammar ke tareeqe par chalo; aur Ibn Masood tum se jo bayan kare use qabool karo."
"1144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad mere sahaba mein se un donon ki pairvi karo: Abu Bakr aur Umar ki; Ammar ke tareeqe par chalo; aur Ibn Masood ke ehad se mazbooti se juray raho."
"1145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qareeb aa gayi hai, aur wo un se door hone ke siwa kuch nahi barhte."
"1146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qareeb aa gayi hai; log duniya par hirs ke siwa kuch nahi barhte aur Allah se doori ke siwa kuch nahi barhte."
"1147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein donon kaalon ko qatl karo: saanp aur bichchu."
"1148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saanpon ko qatl karo, kyunke jab se ham ne un se jang ki hai ham ne un se sulah nahi ki."
"1149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tamam saanpon ko qatl karo; pas jo un ke badle se dara wo ham mein se nahi."
"1150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saanpon aur kutton ko qatl karo, aur do dhaariyon wale aur dum-kate ko qatl karo, kyunke ye nazar uchak lete hain aur hamal gira dete hain."
"1151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saanp aur bichchu ko qatl karo chahe tum namaz mein ho."
"1152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do dhaariyon wale ko qatl karo, kyunke wo nazar uchak leta hai aur hamal ko nuqsan pahunchata hai."
"1153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do dhaariyon wale aur dum-kate ko qatl karo, kyunke ye aankh ki beenayi mita dete hain ¤ aur hamal gira dete hain."
"1154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran chaalees dinon mein parho."
"1155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran teen dinon mein parho agar tum taqat rakho."
"1156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran paanch dinon mein parho."
"1157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran har mahine mein parho; use pachees dinon mein parho; use pandrah dinon mein parho; use das dinon mein parho; use saat dinon mein parho; jo teen din se kam mein use parhe wo use nahi samjhta."
"1158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran har mahine mein parho; use bees raaton mein parho; use das mein parho; use saat mein parho; aur is se zyada jaldi na karo."
"1159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har namaz ke baad Muawwizaat parho."
"1160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muawwizatain parho, kyunke tum in jaisi koi surat nahi parhoge."
"1161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne sone ke waqt Surah Kafirun parho, kyunke ye shirk se bezaari hai."
"1162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhe Quran aik harf par parhaya to maine un se ruju kiya; main un se zyada ka sawal karta raha aur wo mujhe zyada dete rahe yahan tak ke saat haroof par pahunche."
"1163","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran saat haroof par parho; tum jo bhi parhoge durust hoga; aur us mein jhagra na karo, kyunke us mein jhagra kufr hai."
"1164","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran parho, kyunke tum us par ajr diye jaoge. Khabardar, main nahi kehta ke Alif-Laam-Meem aik harf hai, lekin Alif ke das, Laam ke das aur Meem ke das hain; pas ye tees hain."
"1165","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran parho, kyunke wo qayamat ke din apne saathiyon ke liye sifarish karne wala aayega. Do roshan suratein parho: Baqarah aur Aal Imran; kyunke ye donon qayamat ke din goya donon baadal ya donon sayeban, ya goya par phelaye parindon ke do jhund, aayengi apne saathiyon ki taraf se daleel dengi. Surah Baqarah parho, kyunke us ka lena barkat hai aur us ka chhorna hasrat hai, aur jadugar us ki taqat nahi rakhte."
"1166","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran parho jab tak tumhare dil us par mutafiq hon; phir jab us mein ikhtilaaf karo to uth kharay ho."
"1167","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran parho aur us ke zariye Allah taala ko talash karo, is se pehle ke aise log aayen jo use teer ki tarah seedha qaim karein, us mein jaldi karein aur der na karein."
"1168","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran parho aur us par amal karo; us se be-raghbat na ho, us mein hadd se na barho, us ke zariye na khao aur us ke zariye maal zyada na karo."
"1169","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran parho aur us ke zariye Allah se mango, is se pehle ke aise log aayen jo Quran parhein aur us ke zariye logon se mangein."
"1170","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein Surah Baqarah parho, kyunke shaitan us ghar mein dakhil nahi hota jis mein Surah Baqarah parhi jaye."
"1171","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jaise tumhein sikhaya gaya hai parho; tum se pehle walon ko un ke apne nabiyon par ikhtilaaf ne hi halak kiya tha."
"1172","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye donon aayaat parho jo Surah Baqarah ke aakhir mein hain, kyunke mere Rab ne mujhe ye Arsh ke neeche se di hain."
"1173","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rab bande ke sab se qareeb raat ke aakhri gehre hisse mein hota hai; pas agar tum taqat rakho ke us ghari mein Allah ka zikr karne walon mein se ho to ho jao."
"1174","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda Allah ke sab se qareeb hota hai jabke wo sajde mein ho."
"1175","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda apne Rab ke sab se qareeb hota hai jabke wo sajde mein ho; pas dua kasrat se karo."
"1176","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din mujh se majlis mein sab se qareeb wo hoga jo akhlaq mein sab se achcha ho."
"1177","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Parindon ko un ke thikaanon par rehne do."
"1178","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maal ko Allah ki kitaab ke mutabiq faraiz walon mein taqseem karo; pas faraiz ke baad jo bach jaye wo sab se qareebi mard rishtedar ke liye hai."
"1179","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni dakaar kam karo, kyunke duniya mein sab se zyada pet bharne wale aakhirat mein sab se zyada bhooke honge."
"1180","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ka qarz ada karo, kyunke Allah wafa ka zyada haq rakhta hai."
"1181","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chauthayi deenar mein haath kato, aur is se kam mein haath na kato."
"1182","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein sab se kam sattar saal ke bete honge."
"1183","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein sab se kam wo hain jo sattar tak pahunchenge."
"1184","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke sone ke baad bahar nikalna kam karo, kyunke Allah taala ke kuch janwar hain jinhein wo us ghari mein zameen mein phelata hai."
"1185","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Martabe walo ki laghzishon ko muaf karo, siwaye hadon ke."
"1186","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ruku aur sajda qaim karo; pas Allah ki qasam main tumhein apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun jab tum ruku karte ho aur jab tum sajda karte ho."
"1187","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saffein seedhi karo, kyunke tum farishton ki saffon ki tarah saf-bandi karte ho; kandhon ko barabar karo, khala ko pur karo, apne bhaiyon ke haathon mein narm raho, shaitan ke liye khaali jaghein na chhoro; jo saf milaye Allah azza wa jal use milayega, aur jo saf kate Allah use katega."
"1188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz mein saffein seedhi karo, kyunke saf ka seedha karna namaz ke husn mein se hai."
"1189","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Namaz qaim karo, zakaat do, hajj aur umrah karo aur seedhe raho, tumhare zariye seedha rakha jayega."
"1190","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ki hadein door aur qareeb mein qaim karo aur Allah ke baare mein tumhein malamat karne wale ki malamat na pakre."
"1191","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni saffein seedhi karo; pas Allah ki qasam ya tum apni saffein zaroor seedhi karoge ya Allah tumhare dilon mein ikhtilaaf dal dega."
"1192","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni saffein seedhi karo; shaitan tumhare darmiyan dakhil na hon goya wo hazf ke bachche hon. Kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, hazf ke bachche kiya hain? Kaha gaya: Yaman ki zameen mein kaale be-baal bakre."
"1193","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni saffein seedhi karo aur mil kar kharay ho, kyunke main tumhein apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun."
"1194","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni saffein seedhi karo aur mil kar kharay ho; pas qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, main ¤ shayateen ko tumhari saffon ke darmiyan dekhta hun goya wo surkh maili bakriyan hon."
"1195","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se bare kabeera gunah Allah ke saath shirk karna, jaan ko qatl karna, walidain ki nafarmani aur jhooti gawahi hain."
"1196","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Likho; pas qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, is se haq ke siwa kuch nahi nikalta."
"1197","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ismid se surma lagao, kyunke wo beenayi tez karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"1198","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aafiyat ki dua kasrat se karo."
"1199","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mein sab se zyada pet bharne wale aakhirat mein sab se zyada bhooke honge."
"1200","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tum par miswaak ke baare mein bahut zor diya hai."
"1201","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ke gunahon mein sab se zyada us ki zaban mein hain."
"1202","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabr ka aksar azab peshaab se hai."
"1203","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke munafiqon mein sab se zyada qari honge."
"1204","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sajda kasrat se karo, kyunke jo Musalman Allah taala ke liye aik sajda kare, Allah us ke zariye jannat mein us ka aik darja buland karega aur us se aik gunah mita dega."
"1205","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: La haula wa la quwwata illa billah kasrat se kaho, kyunke ye jannat ke khazane mein se hai."
"1206","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke faisle aur taqdeer ke baad meri ummat mein sab se zyada marne wale nazr se marenge."
"1207","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par durood kasrat se bhejo, kyunke Allah ne meri qabr ke paas aik farishta muqarrar kiya hai; phir jab meri ummat ka koi aadmi mujh par durood bhejta hai to wo farishta mujh se kehta hai: Ae Muhammad, falan bin falan ne is waqt aap par durood bheja hai."
"1208","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din mujh par durood kasrat se bhejo, kyunke Juma ke din jo bhi mujh par durood bhejta hai us ka durood mujh par pesh kiya jata hai."
"1209","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din aur Juma ki raat mujh par durood kasrat se bhejo; pas jo mujh par aik durood bhejta hai Allah us par das rehmatein bhejta hai."
"1210","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lazzaton ko khatm karne wali ko kasrat se yaad karo: maut ko."
"1211","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lazzaton ko khatm karne wali ko kasrat se yaad karo: maut ko; kyunke jis ne use rozi ki tangi mein yaad kiya us par kushadagi hui, aur jis ne use kushadagi mein yaad kiya us par tangi hui."
"1212","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: La ilaha illallah ki gawahi kasrat se do, is se pehle ke tumhare aur us ke darmiyan rukawat ho jaye, aur apne marne walon ko ye kalima yaad karao."
"1213","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ke paudon ko kasrat se lagao, kyunke us ka paani meetha hai aur us ki mitti khushbudar hai; pas us ke paudon mein se kasrat se lagao: La haula wa la quwwata illa billah."
"1214","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: La haula wa la quwwata illa billah kasrat se kaho, kyunke ye jannat ke khazanon mein se hai."
"1215","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye jootein kasrat se pehno, kyunke aadmi jab tak joota pehne rehta hai sawaar rehta hai."
"1216","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se izzat wala wo hai jo sab se zyada muttaqi ho."
"1217","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se shareef Yusuf bin Yaqub bin Ishaq bin Ibrahim hain."
"1218","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne baalon ki izzat karo aur un se acha sulook karo."
"1219","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roti ki izzat karo."
"1220","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baalon ki izzat karo."
"1221","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us mein apni kamanein tor do, yaani fitne mein, aur us mein apne rasse kaat do, us mein apne gharon ke andaroni hisson se juray raho, aur us mein Adam ke donon beton mein se behtar ki tarah ho jao."
"1222","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Takleef door kar de, ae logon ke Rab."
"1223","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Takleef door kar de, ae logon ke Rab, ae logon ke Mabood."
"1224","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Takleef door kar de, ae logon ke Rab, tere siwa koi takleef door nahi karta."
"1225","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe chhe par zamanat do, main tumhein jannat ki zamanat deta hun: jab tum mein se ¤ koi baat kare to jhoot na bole, jab us ke paas amanat rakhi jaye to khayanat na kare, jab wada kare to khilaaf na kare; apni nigahein jhukao, apne haath rok lo aur apni sharmgahon ki hifazat karo."
"1226","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara khana naik logon ne khaya, farishton ne tum par durood bheja aur tumhare paas rozedaron ne iftar kiya."
"1227","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har danton wale darinde ka khana haram hai."
"1228","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amal mein se utna karo jitna tum taqat rakhte ho, kyunke Allah nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao; aur Allah taala ke nazdeek sab se pasandeeda amal wo hai jo hamesha ho chahe thora ho."
"1229","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amal mein se utna karo jitna tum taqat rakhte ho, kyunke behtareen amal wo hai jo hamesha ho chahe thora ho."
"1230","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein iman ke lihaaz se sab se kaamil wo hai jo akhlaq mein sab se achcha ho."
"1231","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein iman ke lihaaz se sab se kaamil wo hai jo akhlaq mein sab se achcha ho: wo narm kandhe wala jo mohabbat kare aur jis se mohabbat ki jaye; aur us mein koi bhalayi nahi jo na mohabbat kare na jis se mohabbat ki jaye."
"1232","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein iman ke lihaaz se sab se kaamil wo hai jo akhlaq mein sab se achcha ho; aur tum mein se behtar wo hain jo apni ¤ biwiyon ke liye behtar hon."
"1233","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gaaye ka doodh shifa hai, us ka ghee dawa hai aur us ka gosht marz hai."
"1234","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Naya pehen, achchi zindagi guzar, shaheed mar, aur Allah tujhe duniya aur aakhirat mein aankhon ki thandak ata farmayega. Ye Umar bin Khattab se kaha."
"1235","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed kapre pehno, kyunke wo zyada paak aur achche hain, aur un mein apne murdon ko kafan do."
"1236","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne kapron mein se safed pehno, kyunke wo tumhare kapron mein se behtareen mein se hain, aur un mein apne murdon ko kafan do; aur tumhare surmon mein se behtareen ismid hai jo beenayi tez karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"1237","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma ke din us ghari ko talash karo jis ki umeed rakhi jati hai, asr ke baad se suraj ke ghuroob tak."
"1238","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko Ramazan ki aakhri raat mein talash karo."
"1239","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko Ramazan ke aakhri ashray mein taaq raaton mein talash karo, kyunke maine use dekha tha phir mujhe bhula diya gaya."
"1240","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shab-e-Qadr ko sattaiswein raat mein talash karo."
"1241","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Talash karo chahe lohe ki angoothi hi ho."
"1242","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use aakhri ashray mein talash karo; phir agar tum mein se koi kamzor ho ya aajiz ho to aakhri saat baaqi raaton mein maghloob na ho."
"1243","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use aakhri ashray mein talash karo: nau raatein baaqi hon, saat raatein baaqi hon, paanch raatein baaqi hon, teen raatein baaqi hon ya aakhri raat."
"1244","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use Ramazan ke aakhri ashray mein talash karo: nawein baaqi raat mein, saatwein baaqi mein aur paanchwein baaqi mein."
"1245","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use Ramazan ke aakhri ashray mein talash karo, aur use nawein, saatwein aur paanchwein mein talash karo."
"1246","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Faraiz ko un ke haq-daron se milao; pas jo bach jaye wo sab se qareebi mard rishtedar ke liye hai."
"1247","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne ghar se juray raho."
"1248","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke qadam se juray raho, pas jannat wahin hai."
"1249","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us se juray raho, kyunke jannat us ke qadmon ke neeche hai, yaani walida ke."
"1250","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ya z al-jalaal wal-ikraam ko lazim pakro."
"1251","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne se kufr ke baal utar phenko, phir khatna karao."
"1252","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tabeeb hai."
"1253","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah qazi ke saath hai jab tak wo zulm na kare; phir jab wo zulm kare to Allah us se alag ho jata hai aur shaitan us se jur jata hai."
"1254","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ka Rasool us ke madadgar hain jis ka koi madadgar na ho; aur khaala us ka waaris hai jis ka koi waaris na ho."
"1255","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, apna sab se kushada rizq mujh par mere burhape aur meri umr ke khatme ke waqt kar de."
"1256","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Madina mein us barkat se dogni kar de jo tune Makkah mein rakhi hai."
"1257","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, duniya mein Aal Muhammad ka rizq guzare ke mutabiq kar de."
"1258","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, meri ummat ka khatma tere raaste mein qatl ke zariye kar: nezay aur taa'oon se."
"1259","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mere dil mein noor kar de, meri zaban mein noor kar de, meri beenayi mein noor kar de, meri sama'at mein noor kar de, mere dayen noor kar de, mere bayen noor kar de, mere oopar noor kar de, mere neeche noor kar de, mere aage noor kar de, mere peeche noor kar de, mere nafs mein mere liye noor kar de aur mere liye noor azeem kar de."
"1260","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, meri hifazat Islam ke saath kharay hone ki haalat mein farma, meri hifazat Islam ke saath bethne ki haalat mein farma, meri hifazat Islam ke saath letne ki haalat mein farma, aur mujh par dushman aur haasid ko khush na kar. Ae Allah, ¤ main tujh se har bhalayi ka sawal karta hun jis ke khazane tere haath mein hain, aur teri panah mangta hun har shar se jis ke khazane tere haath mein hain."
"1261","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mujhe miskeen zinda rakh, mujhe miskeen maut de aur mujhe miskeenon ki jamaat mein utha."
"1262","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mera parda dhaanp de, mere darr ko aman de aur mera qarz ada kar de."
"1263","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mere liye mere deen ko durust kar de jo mere muamle ki hifazat hai, mere liye meri duniya ko durust kar de jis mein meri rozi hai, mere liye meri aakhirat ko durust kar de jis mein mera thikana hai; zindagi ko mere liye har bhalayi mein izafe ka zariya bana de aur maut ko mere liye har shar se rahat bana de."
"1264","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, meri khata, meri jahalat, mere muamle mein meri hadd se tajawuz aur jo tu mujh se zyada jaanta hai use bakhsh de. Ae Allah, meri ghalti, mere iraade, meri hansi aur meri sanjeedagi ko bakhsh de, aur ye sab mere paas hai. Ae Allah, jo maine aage bheja aur jo peeche chhora, jo chhupaya aur jo zahir kiya use bakhsh de; Tu aage karne wala hai aur Tu peeche karne wala hai, aur Tu har cheez par qadir hai."
"1265","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mera gunah bakhsh de, mere ghar mein kushadagi kar de aur mere ¤ rizq mein barkat de."
"1266","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mere gunahon aur meri khataon sab ko bakhsh de. Ae Allah, mujhe sambhaal, meri kami poori kar de, mujhe naik aamaal aur akhlaq ki hidayat de; kyunke un ki bhalayi ki hidayat tere siwa koi nahi deta aur un ke bure ko tere siwa koi nahi pherta."
"1267","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rehm kar aur mujhe Rafeeq-e-Aala se mila de."
"1268","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, hamare liye apne khauf mein se utna baant de jo hamare aur teri nafarmaniyon ke darmiyan haail ho, apni itaat mein se utna jo hamein teri jannat tak pahunchaye, yaqeen mein se utna jo ham par duniya ki musibatein aasaan kar de; hamein hamari sama'aton, hamari beenaiyon aur hamari taqat se jab tak hamein zinda rakhe faida de, use hamara waaris bana de, hamara badla us par kar jo ham par zulm kare, us par hamari madad kar jo ham se dushmani kare; hamari musibat ko hamare deen mein na bana, duniya ko hamara sab se bara gham na bana, na hamare ilm ki had, aur ham par use musallat na kar jo ham par rehm na kare."
"1269","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mujhe meri sama'at aur beenayi se faida de yahan tak ke unhein mera waaris bana de, mujhe mere deen mein aur mere jism mein aafiyat de, us par meri madad kar jis ne mujh par zulm kiya yahan tak ke mujhe us mein mera badla dikhaye. Ae Allah, maine apne aap ko tere supurd kiya, apna muamla tere hawale kiya, apni peeth teri taraf lagayi aur apna chehra teri taraf kiya; tujh se bachne ki na koi panah hai na nijaat magar teri taraf; main tere Rasool par iman laya jise tune bheja aur teri kitaab par jo tune naazil ki."
"1270","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Tune meri jaan paida ki aur Tu use wafaat dega; us ki maut aur zindagi tere liye hai; agar Tu use zinda rakhe to us ki hifazat farma, aur agar Tu use maut de to use bakhsh de. Ae Allah, main tujh se aafiyat ka sawal karta hun."
"1271","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram qaraar diya aur use haram banaya; main Madina ko us ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan haram qaraar deta hun ke us mein khoon na bahaya jaye, us mein qitaal ke liye hathyaar na uthaya jaye, us mein darakht na kaata jaye siwaye chaare ke. Ae Allah, hamare Madina mein barkat de; Ae Allah, hamare saa' mein barkat de; Ae Allah, hamare mudd mein barkat de; Ae Allah, barkat ke saath do barkatein kar de. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, Madina ki koi ghaati aur koi raasta nahi magar us par do farishte hain jo us ki hifazat karte hain yahan tak ke tum us tak pahunch jao."
"1272","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Ibrahim tere bande aur tere khaleel thay, unhon ne Makkah walon ke liye barkat ki dua ki; main Muhammad tera banda aur tera Rasool hun, main tujh se Madina walon ke liye dua karta hun ke un ke mudd aur saa' mein barkat de, us se dogni jo tune Makkah walon ke liye barkat ki, barkat ke saath do barkatein."
"1273","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tere paas aik ehad leta hun jo tu kabhi khilaaf nahi karega: main bashar hun, pas jis momin ko maine takleef di, ya use bura kaha, ya use kora mara, ya us par laanat ki, to use us ke liye namaz, zakaat aur qurbat bana de jo use qayamat ke din tere qareeb kare."
"1274","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tujh se paak-daamani aur aafiyat ka sawal karta hun apni duniya mein, apne deen mein, apne ghar walon mein ¤ aur apne maal mein. Ae Allah, mera parda dhaanp de, mere darr ko aman de, meri hifazat mere aage se, mere peeche se, mere dayen se, mere bayen se aur mere oopar se farma; aur teri panah mangta hun is se ke main apne neeche se halaak kiya jaun."
"1275","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tujh se hidayat, taqwa, paak-daamani aur be-niyazi ka sawal karta hun."
"1276","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tujh se har bhalayi ka sawal karta hun, jald aur der wali, jo maine jaani aur jo maine na jaani; aur teri panah mangta hun har shar se, jald aur der wale, jo maine jaana aur jo maine na jaana. Ae Allah, main tujh se us bhalayi ka sawal karta hun jo tujh se tere bande aur tere Nabi ne mangi, aur teri panah mangta hun us shar se jis se tere bande aur tere Nabi ne panah mangi. Ae Allah, main tujh se jannat ka sawal karta hun aur us qaul ya amal ka jo us ke qareeb kare, aur teri panah mangta hun aag se aur us qaul ya amal se jo us ke qareeb kare; aur sawal karta hun ke jo faisla tune mere liye kiya wo bhalayi bana de."
"1277","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tujh se har bhalayi ka sawal karta hun jo maine jaani aur jo maine na jaani, aur teri panah mangta hun har shar se jo maine jaana aur jo maine na jaana."
"1278","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tujh se tere fazl aur teri rehmat ka sawal karta hun, kyunke un ka maalik tere siwa koi nahi."
"1279","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tujh se sawal karta hun aur tere Nabi Muhammad Nabi-ur-Rehmat ke waseele se teri taraf mutawajje hota hun; ae Muhammad, maine tumhare waseele se apne Rab ki taraf apni is haajat mein tawajjuh ki taake mere liye poori ki jaye; ¤ Ae Allah, pas un ki shafa'at mere haq mein qabool farma."
"1280","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri raza ke zariye teri narazi se panah mangta hun, teri maafi ke zariye teri saza se panah mangta hun, aur teri panah mangta hun tujh se; main teri tareef shumar nahi kar sakta, Tu waisa hai jaisi tune apne nafs ki tareef ki hai."
"1281","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun bars, deewangi, korh aur buri beemariyon se."
"1282","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun girne, dabne, doobne aur jalne se; teri panah mangta hun is se ke shaitan mujhe maut ke waqt behka de; teri panah mangta hun is se ke main tere raaste mein peeth pher kar marun; aur teri panah mangta hun is se ke main dasay hue marun."
"1283","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun bhook se, kyunke wo bura saathi hai; aur teri panah mangta hun khayanat se, kyunke wo bura raaz-daar hai."
"1284","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun aajizi, susti, buzdili, bakheeli aur burhape se; teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azab se; teri panah mangta hun aag ke azab se; aur teri panah mangta hun zindagi aur maut ke fitne se."
"1285","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun aajizi, susti, buzdili, bakheeli, burhape, sakht-dili, ghaflat, tang-dasti, zillat aur miskeeni se; teri panah mangta hun faqr, kufr, fisq, jhagre, nifaaq, shohrat aur riya se; aur teri panah mangta hun behre-pan, goongay-pan, deewangi, korh, bars aur buri beemariyon se."
"1286","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun aajizi, susti, buzdili, bakheeli, burhape, qabr ke azab aur Dajjal ke fitne se. Ae Allah, mere nafs ko us ka taqwa de aur use paak kar, Tu use paak karne walon mein sab se behtar hai, Tu us ka dost aur madadgar hai. Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun us ilm se jo nafa na de, us dil se jo na dare, us nafs se jo ser na ho aur us dua se jo qabool na ho."
"1287","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main faqr, kami aur zillat se panah mangta hun; aur teri panah mangta hun is se ke main zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kiya jaye."
"1288","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun susti, burhape, gunah, qarz, qabr ke fitne, qabr ke azab, aag ke fitne, aag ke azab, maal-daari ke fitne ke shar se; teri panah mangta hun faqr ke fitne se; aur teri panah mangta hun Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne se. Ae Allah, meri khataon ko paani, barf aur oolon se dho de, mere dil ko khataon se saaf kar de jaise safed kapra meil se saaf kiya jata hai, aur mere aur meri ¤ khataon ke darmiyan doori kar de jaise tune mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan doori ki hai."
"1289","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun fikr, gham, aajizi, susti, bakheeli, buzdili, qarz ke bojh aur logon ke ghalbe se."
"1290","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun mustaqil ghar mein bure parosi se, kyunke dehati parosi muntaqil ho jata hai."
"1291","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun teri ne'mat ke zawal se, teri aafiyat ke palatne se, teri achanak saza se aur teri tamam naraziyon se."
"1292","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun mere kaan ke shar se, meri aankh ke shar se, meri zaban ke shar se, mere dil ke shar se aur meri shahwat ke shar se."
"1293","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun us ke shar se jo maine kiya aur us ke shar se jo maine nahi kiya."
"1294","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azab se, teri panah mangta hun aag ke azab se, teri panah mangta hun zindagi aur maut ke fitne se, aur teri panah mangta hun Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne se."
"1295","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun us ilm se jo nafa na de, us amal se jo oopar na uthaya jaye ¤ aur us dua se jo suni na jaye."
"1296","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun qarz ke ghalbe, dushman ke ghalbe aur dushmanon ki khushi se."
"1297","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun us dil se jo na dare, us dua se jo suni na jaye, us nafs se jo ser na ho aur us ilm se jo nafa na de; in chaar se teri panah mangta hun."
"1298","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun akhlaq, aamaal, khwahishat aur beemariyon ki buraiyon se."
"1299","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun bure din, buri raat, buri ghari, bure saathi aur mustaqil ghar mein bure parosi se."
"1300","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, meri ummat ke liye us ke sawere mein barkat de."
"1301","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, apne ghaib ke ilm aur makhlooq par apni qudrat ke waseele se mujhe zinda rakh jab tak tu jaane ke zindagi mere liye behtar hai, aur mujhe wafaat de jab tu jaane ke maut mere liye behtar hai. Ae Allah, main tujh se posheeda aur zahir mein tera khauf mangta hun, raza aur ghusse mein ikhlaas ka kalima mangta hun, faqr aur maal-daari mein miyana-ravi mangta hun, na khatm hone wali ne'mat mangta hun, na tootne wali aankhon ki thandak mangta hun, faisle par raza mangta hun, maut ke baad thandi zindagi mangta hun, tere chehre ki taraf dekhne ki lazzat aur tere mulaqat ke shauq ka sawal karta hun, baghair nuqsan dene wali takleef aur baghair gumrah karne wale fitne ke. Ae Allah, hamein iman ki zeenat se aarasta kar aur hamein hidayat dene wale hidayat-yaafta bana de."
"1302","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, aisa hajj jo riya aur shohrat se khaali ho."
"1303","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, ae logon ke Rab, takleef door karne wale, shifa de, Tu Shafi hai, tere siwa koi shafi nahi; aisi shifa de jo beemari na chhore."
"1304","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, ae Jibreel, Mikaeel, Israfeel aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke Rab, ham teri panah mein aate hain aag se."
"1305","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, ae Jibreel aur Mikaeel ke Rab aur Israfeel ke Rab, main teri panah mangta hun aag ki garmi aur qabr ke azab se."
"1306","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, ae hamare Rab, hamein duniya mein bhalayi de aur aakhirat mein bhalayi de aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha."
"1307","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, jaise tune meri surat achchi banayi, mere akhlaq achche kar de."
"1308","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, zindagi to sirf aakhirat ki zindagi hai."
"1309","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tere liye jhuka, tujh par iman laya, tujh par tawakkul kiya, teri taraf ruju kiya aur tere zariye jhagra kiya. Ae Allah, main teri izzat ki panah mein aata hun, tere siwa koi mabood nahi, is se ke Tu mujhe gumrah kare; Tu wo zinda hai jo nahi marta jabke jinn aur insaan marte hain."
"1310","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, mujhe meri sama'at aur beenayi se faida de aur unhein mera waaris bana de, us par meri madad kar jis ne mujh par zulm kiya aur us se mera badla le."
"1311","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, jo tujh par iman laye aur gawahi de ke main tera Rasool hun, to us ke liye apni mulaqat mehboob kar de, us ke faisle ko us par aasaan kar de aur us ke liye duniya kam kar de; aur jo tujh par iman na laye aur gawahi na de ke main tera Rasool hun, to us ke liye apni mulaqat mehboob na kar, us ke faisle ko us par aasaan na kar aur us ke liye duniya zyada kar de."
"1312","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, jo meri ummat ke muamle mein se kisi cheez ka zimmedar bane aur un par sakhti kare to us par sakhti kar; aur jo meri ummat ke muamle mein se kisi cheez ka zimmedar bane aur un se narmi kare to us se narmi kar."
"1313","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum ne nahi dekha ke jab insaan marta hai to us ki nazar uth jati hai? Ye us waqt hota hai jab us ki nazar us ke nafs ke peeche jati hai."
"1314","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum ne nahi dekha tumhare Rab ne kiya farmaya? Us ne farmaya: Mere bandon par main jo ne'mat karta hun, un mein se aik giroh us ke zariye subah ko kafir ho jata hai; kehte hain: sitaron ne kiya aur sitaron ke zariye."
"1315","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum nahi jaante ke Bani Israel ke saathi ko kiya mila? Jab unhein peshaab lagta to wo apne jism ka wo hissa kaat dete jise peshaab lagta tha; pas unhein is se mana kiya gaya to use us ki qabr mein azab diya gaya."
"1316","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya ye us ke baad aik saal nahi thehra? Pas us ne Ramazan paya aur us ke roze rakhe, aur saal mein itne-itne sajde kiye; pas un donon ke darmiyan aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan se zyada doori hai."
"1317","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, tumhara ye beta na tum par zulm karega na tum us par zulm karoge."
"1318","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, agar tum shaam ko ye kehte: Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah mein aata hun us har cheez ke shar se jo us ne paida ki, to tumhein koi nuqsan na pahunchata."
"1319","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, agar tum use kuch na dete to tum par aik jhoot likha jata."
"1320","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, tumhare liye qeemti bistar honge."
"1321","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, agar wo apne maal par zulm se khane ke liye qasam khayega to Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo us se naraaz hoga."
"1322","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, tum se pehle ummatein is waqt tak halak nahi huin jab tak wo is mein mubtala na huin ke Quran ke aik hisse ko doosre se takrate hain; jo halal tha use halal samjho, jo haram tha use haram samjho, aur jo mutashabeh tha us par iman lao."
"1323","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, agar wo kehta: Bismillah, to tumhein kaafi ho jata. Pas jab tum mein se koi khana khaye to kahe: Bismillah; phir agar wo shuru mein Bismillah kehna bhool jaye to kahe: Bismillah awwaluhu wa aakhiruhu."
"1324","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, agar wo shaam ko kehta: Main Allah ke mukammal kalimaat ki panah mein aata hun us har cheez ke shar se jo us ne paida ki, to subah tak use bichchu ka dans na nuqsan pahunchata."
"1325","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, tumhare baad wali qaum tumhare saa' aur tumhare mudd ko nahi paayegi."
"1326","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tumhein nahi pahuncha ke maine us par laanat ki hai jo janwar ke chehre par daagh lagaye ya ¤ us ke chehre par maare?"
"1327","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum raazi nahi ke un ke liye duniya ho aur hamare liye aakhirat ho?"
"1328","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum ne wo nishan nahi dekha jo abhi mujhe nazar aaya? Wo farishton mein se aik farishta hai jo is raat se pehle kabhi zameen par nahi utra tha; us ne apne Rab azza wa jal se ijazat mangi ke mujhe salaam kare aur mujhe khushkhabri de ke Hasan aur Husain jannat ke jawanon ke sardar hain aur Fatima jannat ki auraton ki sardar hain."
"1329","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum nahi jaante ke Islam us se pehle wale ko gira deta hai, hijrat us se pehle wali ko gira deti hai aur hajj us se pehle wale ko gira deta hai?"
"1330","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum nahi jaante ke farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein tasweer ho, aur jo tasweerein banata hai use qayamat ke din azab diya jayega aur kaha jayega: jo tum ne banaya use zinda karo?"
"1331","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum nahi jaante ke tum aur tumhara maal tumhare baap ki kamaayi mein se ho?"
"1332","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum nahi jaante ke aik farishta aasman mein nida karta hai aur kehta hai: Ae Allah, kharch karne wale ke maal ke liye badla kar de aur rokne wale ke maal ke liye tabahi kar de?"
"1333","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya is ke paas kuch nahi tha jis se wo apna sar chhupata? Kiya is ke paas kuch nahi tha jis se wo apne kapre dhota?"
"1334","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum apni qaum ki waadi se nahi guzre jabke wo banjar thi, phir tum us se guzre jabke wo hari-bhari thi, phir tum us se guzre jabke wo banjar thi, phir tum us se guzre jabke wo hari-bhari thi? Allah murdon ko isi tarah zinda karega."
"1335","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, Allah ki qasam main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darne wala aur us se sab se zyada khauf khane wala hun."
"1336","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, Allah ki qasam main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada khauf khane wala aur us se sab se zyada darne wala hun; lekin main roza rakhta hun aur iftar karta hun, namaz parhta hun aur sota hun, aur auraton se nikah karta hun; pas jo meri sunnat se muhn phere wo mujh se nahi."
"1337","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, Allah ki qasam main aasman mein ameen hun aur zameen mein ameen hun."
"1338","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, Allah ki qasam agar Usama londi hoti to main use zewar pehnata aur sanwarta yahan tak ke use kharch karta."
"1339","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, Allah ki qasam agar ye na hota ke qasid qatl nahi kiye jate to main tum donon ki gardanein maar deta."
"1340","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi nahi darta ke jab wo namaz mein apna sar uthaye to us ki ¤ beenayi us ki taraf na laute?"
"1341","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi nahi darta ke jab wo Imam se pehle apna sar uthaye to Allah us ka sar gadhe ka sar bana de ya Allah us ki surat gadhe ki surat bana de?"
"1342","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim ke baare mein to apne saathi ko dekho; Musa ke baare mein wo ghungrale baalon wale gandumi rang ke hain, goya main unhein dekh raha hun ke waadi mein utar rahe hain, surkh oont par talbiya kehte hue jis ki nakeil chhal ki rassi ki hai."
"1343","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mard ke baare mein: wo apna sar khole aur use dhoye yahan tak ke baalon ki jadon tak pahunche; aurat ke baare mein: us par lazim nahi ke use khole, wo apne sar par teen lap bhar paani daale, ye use kaafi hai."
"1344","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baare mein: main apni hatheli se teen baar leta hun aur apne sar par daalta hun, phir apne baaqi jism par bahata hun."
"1345","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baare mein: main apne sar par teen baar bahata hun."
"1346","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baare mein: main tek lagakar nahi khata."
"1347","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Jafar, tum surat aur seerat mein mujh jaise ho; tum Ali, tum mujh se ho aur main tum se hun; tum Zaid, tum hamare bhai aur hamare azaad-karda ho; aur londi apni khaala ke paas hai, kyunke khaala maa hai."
"1348","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Jafar, tumhari surat meri surat jaisi hai aur meri seerat tumhari seerat jaisi hai; tum mujh se ho aur mere darakht se ho. Tum Ali, tum mere damad aur mere beton ke baap ho; main tum se hun aur tum mujh se ho. Tum Zaid, tum mere azaad-karda ho, mujh se ho, meri taraf ho aur logon mein mujhe sab se mehboob ho."
"1349","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ki nishaniyon mein sab se pehli mashriq se nikalne wali aag hai jo logon ko maghrib ki taraf jama karegi; jannat walon ke khane mein sab se pehla machhli ke kaleje ka zaaid hissa hai; bachche ka apne baap aur maa se mushabeh hone ke baare mein: jab mard ka paani aurat ke paani par sabqat kare to bachcha us ki taraf jata hai, aur jab aurat ka paani mard ke paani par sabqat kare to us ki taraf jata hai."
"1350","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag walon ke baare mein jo us ke rehne wale hain: wo us mein na marenge na jiyenge; lekin kuch log jinhein aag ne un ke gunahon se pakra to unhein maut aayi yahan tak ke jab wo koyla ho gaye to shafa'at ki ijazat di gayi; pas unhein jhund-dar-jhund laya gaya aur jannat ki nehron par bichha diya gaya; phir kaha jayega: Ae jannat walon, un par paani bahao; pas wo ugenge jaise daana ugta hai jo sailaab ke jhaag mein hota hai."
"1351","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, khabardar, ae logon, main bashar hun, qareeb hai ke mere ¤ Rab ka qasid mere paas aaye aur main jawab dun; main tum mein do bhaari cheezein chhor raha hun: pehli Allah ki kitaab hai, us mein hidayat aur noor hai; jo us se mazbooti se jura aur use pakra wo hidayat par tha, aur jo us se hata wo gumrah hua; pas Allah taala ki kitaab ko pakro aur us se mazbooti se juro. Aur mere ghar wale: main tumhein mere ghar walon ke baare mein Allah yaad dilata hun, main tumhein mere ghar walon ke baare mein Allah yaad dilata hun."
"1352","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, ae logon, log zyada honge aur Ansaar kam honge yahan tak ke wo logon mein khane mein namak ki manind honge; pas tum mein se jo kisi muamle ka zimmedar bane jis mein wo kisi ko nuqsan pahunchaye aur kisi ko faida de, use un ke naik kaar se qabool karna chahiye aur un ke bad-kaar se darguzar karna chahiye."
"1353","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, sab se sachcha kalaam Allah ki kitaab hai, behtareen hidayat Muhammad ki hidayat hai, buri cheezein nayi ijaad-karda hain, har nayi cheez bid'at hai, har bid'at gumrahi hai aur har gumrahi aag mein hai. Tum par qayamat achanak aa gayi; main aur qayamat is tarah bheje gaye; qayamat ne tum par subah kar di aur tum par shaam kar di. Main har momin ke liye us ke nafs se zyada haq rakhta hun; jo maal chhore wo us ke ghar walon ke liye hai, jo qarz ya be-sahara chhore wo mere supurd hai aur mujh par hai; aur main mominon ka madadgar hun."
"1354","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, Allah ne apni kitaab mein naazil kiya: Ae logon, apne Rab se daro jis ne tumhein aik jaan se paida kiya, aayat ke aakhir tak; Ae iman walon, Allah se daro aur har jaan dekhe ke us ne kal ke liye kiya aage bheja, us ke farman tak: wahi kamyaab hain; ¤ sadqa karo is se pehle ke tum sadqa na kar sako; aadmi apne deenar mein se sadqa kare, aadmi apne dirham mein se sadqa kare, aadmi apne gehun mein se sadqa kare, aadmi apni khajoor mein se sadqa kare, apne jau mein se; sadqe mein se kisi cheez ko haqeer na samjho chahe khajoor ka aadha tukra ho."
"1355","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, tumhara aaj raat ka muamla mujh se chhupa nahi raha, lekin mujhe darr hua ke tum par raat ki namaz farz kar di jayegi aur tum us se aajiz ho jaoge."
"1356","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, un logon ka kiya haal hai jo aisi shartein lagate hain jo Allah ki kitaab mein nahi? Jo shart Allah ki kitaab mein na ho wo baatil hai chahe sau shartein hon; Allah ka faisla zyada haq hai aur Allah ki shart zyada mazboot hai; wila sirf azaad karne wale ke liye hai."
"1357","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, hum jo kaarinda muqarrar karte hain wo hamare paas aata hai aur kehta hai: ye tumhare kaam ka hai aur ye mujhe tohfe mein diya gaya; kiya wo apne baap aur maa ke ghar mein nahi betha ke dekhe ke use tohfa diya jata hai ya nahi? Pas qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, tum mein se jo us mein se kuch khayanat karega wo qayamat ke din use apni gardan par uthaye hue aayega; agar oont hua to use lekar aayega jo bol raha hoga, agar gaaye hui to use lekar aayegi jo daakaar rahi hogi, agar bakri hui to use lekar aayegi jo mein-mein kar rahi hogi; bas maine pahuncha diya."
"1358","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, Allah ki qasam main aik aadmi ko deta hun aur aik aadmi ko chhorta hun, aur jise main chhorta hun wo mujhe us se zyada mehboob hai jise main deta hun; lekin main kuch logon ko deta hun un ke dilon mein be-qarari aur ghabrahat dekh kar, aur kuch logon ko us par chhorta hun jo Allah ne un ke dilon mein be-niyazi aur bhalayi rakhi hai, un mein se Amr bin Taghlib hain."
"1359","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amma ba'd, ae Quraish ki jamaat, tum is muamle ke haq-dar ho jab tak tum Allah ki nafarmani na karo; phir jab tum us ki nafarmani karoge to wo tum par use bhejega jo tumhein chheele jaise ye chhari chheeli jati hai."
"1360","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara apne ghar se Bait-ul-Haraam ka qasd karke nikalna: tumhari sawari jo qadam rakhe us ke badle Allah tumhare liye aik neki likhega aur tum se aik gunah mitayega. Tumhara Arafa mein theherna: Allah azza wa jal duniya ke aasman par nazool farmayega aur un ke saath farishton par fakhr karega aur farmayega: ye mere bande hain jo mere paas bikharay baalon wale ghubaar-aalood aaye hain har gehre raaste se, meri rehmat ki umeed rakhte hain aur mere azab se darte hain, aur unhon ne mujhe nahi dekha; phir agar wo mujhe dekhte to kiya hota? Pas agar tum par Aalij ki ret, ya duniya ke dinon, ya aasman ke qatron jitne gunah hon to Allah unhein tum se dho dega. Tumhara jamron ko kankariyan maarna: wo tumhare liye zakheera hai. Tumhara apna sar mundwana: girne wale har baal ke badle tumhare liye aik neki hai; phir jab tum Baitullah ka tawaaf karoge to apne gunahon se nikal jaoge jaise us din thay jab tumhein tumhari maa ne jana tha."
"1361","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ke fitne ke baare mein: koi Nabi nahi magar us ne apni ummat ko us se daraaya, aur main tumhein us hadith se darata hun jo kisi Nabi ne apni ummat ko nahi sunayi: wo kaana hai aur Allah kaana nahi, us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hai jo har momin parhega. Qabr ke fitne ke baare mein: mere zariye tum aazmaye jaoge aur mere baare mein sawal kiye jaoge; phir jab naik aadmi hoga to ¤ use us ki qabr mein bithaya jayega baghair ghabrahat ke, phir us se kaha jayega: ye aadmi kaun hai jo tum mein tha? Wo kahega: Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, hamare paas Allah ki taraf se wazeh nishaniyan lekar aaye to ham ne un ki tasdeeq ki. Pas us ke liye aag ki taraf aik khirki kholi jayegi aur wo us ki taraf dekhega ke us ka aik hissa doosre ko tor raha hai; phir us se kaha jayega: dekho Allah ne tumhein kis se bachaya. Phir us ke liye jannat ki taraf aik khirki kholi jayegi aur wo us ki raunaq aur jo us mein hai use dekhega; phir us se kaha jayega: us mein se ye tumhara thikana hai. Aur us se kaha jayega: tum yaqeen par thay, us par mare aur us par uthaye jaoge agar Allah ne chaha. Aur jab bura aadmi hoga to use us ki qabr mein ghabraya hua bithaya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: tum kiya kehte thay? Wo kahega: main nahi jaanta. Us se kaha jayega: ye aadmi kaun hai jo tum mein tha? Wo kahega: maine logon ko aik baat kehte suna to maine waisa hi kaha jaisa unhon ne kaha. Pas us ke liye jannat ki taraf se aik khirki kholi jayegi aur wo us ki raunaq aur jo us mein hai use dekhega; phir us se kaha jayega: dekho Allah ne tum se kiya pher diya. Phir us ke liye aag ki taraf aik khirki kholi jayegi aur wo us ki taraf dekhega ke us ka aik hissa doosre ko tor raha hai aur kaha jayega: us mein se ye tumhara thikana hai; tum shak par thay, us par mare aur us par uthaye jaoge agar Allah ne chaha. Phir use azab diya jayega."
"1362","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raaste katne ke baare mein: tum par thori muddat hi guzregi yahan tak ke qafila Makkah ki taraf baghair muhafiz niklega. Tang-dasti ke baare mein: qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum mein se koi apne sadqe ko lekar phirega aur use koi nahi milega jo use qabool kare. Phir tum mein se har aik Allah ke saamne khara hoga, us ke aur us ke darmiyan na parda hoga na tarjuman jo us ke liye tarjuma kare; phir wo us se zaroor kahega: kiya maine tumhein maal nahi diya tha? Wo zaroor kahega: kyun nahi. Phir wo zaroor kahega: kiya maine tumhari taraf Rasool nahi bheja tha? Wo zaroor kahega: kyun nahi. Phir wo apne dayen dekhega to aag ke siwa kuch nahi dekhega, phir apne bayen dekhega to aag ke siwa kuch nahi dekhega; pas tum mein se har aik ¤ aag se bache chahe khajoor ke aadhe tukre se; phir agar na paye to achchi baat se."
"1363","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehl-e-Kitaab ke bartanon ke baare mein jo tum ne zikr kiya: agar tum un ke siwa paao to un mein na khao, aur agar un ke siwa na paao to unhein dho lo aur un mein khao. Jo tum ne apni kaman se shikar kiya aur us par Allah ka naam liya to use khao; jo tum ne apne sikhaye hue kutte se shikar kiya aur us par Allah ka naam liya to khao; aur jo tum ne apne ghair-sikhaye kutte se shikar kiya aur us ka zabeeha pa liya to khao."
"1364","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare aage hauz hai jaise Jarba aur Azruh ke darmiyan fasla hai."
"1365","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin se tum ilaaj karte ho un mein behtareen pachhna lagwana aur samandari qust hai."
"1366","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ko hukm diya gaya hai ke saat haddiyon par sajda kare."
"1367","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rasoolon ko hukm diya gaya ke halal ke siwa na khayein aur naik ke siwa amal na karein."
"1368","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke Khadija ko jannat mein moti ke ghar ki khushkhabri dun jis mein na shor hoga na takleef."
"1369","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke saat haddiyon par sajda karun: peshani, donon haathon, donon ghutnon aur pairon ke kinaron par; aur na kapre sametein na baal."
"1370","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun; phir jab wo ye kahein to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye siwaye us ke haq ke, aur un ka hisab Allah par hai."
"1371","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun, namaz qaim karein aur zakaat dein; phir jab wo ye karein to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye siwaye us ke haq ke, aur un ka hisab Allah par hai."
"1372","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur mujh par aur jo main laya hun us par iman layein; phir jab wo ye karein to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye siwaye us ke haq ke, aur un ka hisab Allah azza wa jal par hai."
"1373","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo kahein La ilaha illallah; pas jo La ilaha illallah kahe us ne mujh se apna maal aur apni jaan bacha li siwaye us ke haq ke, aur us ka hisab Allah par hai."
"1374","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya ke Quran saat haroof par parhun, har aik shafi kaafi hai."
"1375","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe miswaak ka hukm diya gaya yahan tak ke mujhe darr hua ke main be-danton ka ho jaunga."
"1376","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe miswaak ka hukm diya gaya yahan tak ke mujhe darr hua ke wo mujh par likh di jayegi."
"1377","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe miswaak ka hukm diya gaya yahan tak ke mujhe apne danton ka khauf hua."
"1378","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe aik basti ka hukm diya gaya jo bastiyon ko kha jayegi; kehte hain Yasrib hai aur wo Madina hai; wo logon ko nikalti hai jaise bhaathi lohe ke meil ko nikalti hai."
"1379","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad jo tumhein fikr hogi wo tumhara muamla hai; tum par sabr karne walon ke siwa koi sabr nahi karega."
"1380","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamein wuzu poora karne ka hukm diya gaya."
"1381","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamein hukm diya gaya ke namazon ke baad teentees baar tasbeeh, teentees baar hamd aur chauntees baar takbeer kahein."
"1382","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhe hukm diya ke bare ko aage karun."
"1383","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhe miswaak ka hukm diya yahan tak ke maine samjha ke main be-danton ka ho jaunga."
"1384","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhe talbiya mein aawaz buland karne ka hukm diya, kyunke ye hajj ke shaair mein se hai."
"1385","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakriyon ki naak saaf karo, un ke baare ko khushbudar karo aur un ke baare ke kinare mein namaz parho, kyunke wo jannat ke janwaron mein se hain."
"1386","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Moze par teen din masah karo."
"1387","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna kuch maal rok lo, ye tumhare liye behtar hai."
"1388","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne maal apne paas rakho aur unhein kharab na karo; kyunke jis ne ¤ umr-bhar ka atiya diya to wo us ke liye hai jise diya gaya, zindagi aur maut mein aur us ki aulad ke liye."
"1389","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere aage chalo aur meri peeth farishton ke liye chhor do."
"1390","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raaste se takleef hata do, kyunke ye tumhare liye sadqa hai."
"1391","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni zaban ko rok lo."
"1392","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni zaban ko rok lo, tumhara ghar tumhein kaafi ho aur apne gunah par ro."
"1393","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna haath rok lo."
"1394","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Umm-ul-Quran ye hai: saat dohrayi jane wali aur azeem Quran."
"1395","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat roshan chehre aur roshan haath-pair wali hai."
"1396","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ye ummat rehm ki hui ummat hai, us par aakhirat mein azab nahi; us ka azab duniya mein hai: fitne, zalzale, qatl aur museebatein."
"1397","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din meri ummat sajde se roshan chehre wali aur wuzu se roshan haath-pair wali hogi."
"1398","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni qaum ki imamat karo; jo qaum ki imamat kare use halki parhani chahiye, kyunke un mein bara hai, un mein beemar hai, un mein kamzor hai aur un mein haajat-mand hai; phir jab tum mein se koi akele namaz parhe to jaise chahe parhe."
"1399","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari maa, phir tumhari maa, phir tumhari maa, phir tumhare baap, phir jo zyada qareeb ho, phir jo zyada qareeb ho."
"1400","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari maa, tumhare baap, tumhari behan, tumhare bhai aur jo zyada qareeb ho, phir jo zyada qareeb ho."
"1401","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aameen kaho jab parha jaye ke na ghazab kiye gaye par na gumrahon par."
"1402","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel ne Baitullah ke paas meri imamat ki do baar: unhon ne mujhe zuhr parhayi jab suraj dhal gaya aur wo joote ke tasme ke barabar tha; mujhe asr parhayi jab us ka saya us jaisa tha; mujhe maghrib parhayi jab rozedar iftar karta hai; mujhe isha parhayi jab shafaq ghayab hua; mujhe fajr parhayi jab rozedar par khana-peena haram hua. Phir jab agla din hua to unhon ne mujhe zuhr parhayi jab us ka saya us jaisa tha; mujhe asr parhayi jab us ka saya us se dogna tha; mujhe maghrib parhayi jab rozedar iftar karta hai; mujhe isha parhayi raat ke teesre hisse tak; mujhe fajr parhayi aur roshan kiya. Phir meri taraf mutawajje hue aur kaha: Ae Muhammad, ye tum se pehle nabiyon ka waqt hai, aur waqt in donon waqton ke darmiyan hai."
"1403","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke un ki namaz aur un ki sehri par ameen muazzin hain."
"1404","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Thehro yahan tak ke ham raat ko dakhil hon taake bikharay baalon wali kanghi kare aur jis ka shohar ghayab ho wo safayi kare."
"1405","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ham se apna ye parda hata do, kyunke us ki tasweerain meri namaz mein mere saamne aati rehti hain."
"1406","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat ke ameen Abu Ubaida bin Jarrah hain."
"1407","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum bethne ke siwa na mano to raasta dikhao, salaam ka jawab do aur mazloom ki madad karo."
"1408","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum baal rakho to un ki izzat karo."
"1409","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho ke Allah taala aur us ka Rasool tum se mohabbat karein to jab tumhare paas amanat rakhi jaye to ada karo, jab baat karo to sach bolo aur apne parosi se acha sulook karo."
"1410","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho ke tumhara dil narm ho to miskeen ko khilao aur yateem ke sar par haath phero."
"1411","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum par kata-phata kaala ghulam ameer banaya jaye jo tumhein Allah ki kitaab se chalaye to us ki suno aur us ki itaat karo."
"1412","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum us par qadir ho jao to use qatl karo, lekin use aag se na jalao; kyunke aag se azab sirf aag ka Rab deta hai."
"1413","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum apne bhai se khajoor kharido aur use aafat pahunche to tumhare liye ¤ halal nahi ke us se kuch lo; tum apne bhai ka maal na-haq kyun loge?"
"1414","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum raat guzaro to tumhara naara Ha-Meem ho: un ki madad nahi ki jayegi."
"1415","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum Allah se sach bolo to Allah tum se sach karega."
"1416","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum us ki amaarat mein ta'n karo to tum is se pehle us ke baap ki amaarat mein ta'n karte thay. Allah ki qasam wo amaarat ka ahl tha, wo mujhe logon mein sab se mehboob tha, aur ye us ke baad mujhe logon mein sab se mehboob hai; main tumhein us ke baare mein waseeyat karta hun, kyunke wo tumhare nek logon mein se hai, yaani Usama bin Zaid."
"1417","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, agar Tu bakhshe to bahut bakhshta hai, aur tera kaun banda hai jo gunah na kare."
"1418","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to us ki asl rok lo aur use sadqa kar do."
"1419","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum donon chaho to main tumhein dun, lekin maal-daar aur kamane wale taqatwar ke liye us mein koi hissa nahi."
"1420","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to main tumhein amaarat ke baare mein bataun ke wo kiya hai? Us ka awwal malamat hai, us ka doosra nadamat hai aur us ka teesra qayamat ke din azab hai, siwaye us ke jo insaaf kare."
"1421","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main zinda raha to agar Allah ne chaha main apni ummat ko Nafi', Aflah aur Barakah naam rakhne se mana karunga."
"1422","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar us mein se kuch toot-phoot jaye to use nahr karo, phir us ka joota us ke khoon mein dubo kar us ke pehlu par maaro, phir us ke aur logon ke darmiyan chhor do taake wo use khayein."
"1423","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar us mein se kuch toot-phoot jaye aur tumhein us ki maut ka khauf ho to use zibah karo, phir us ka joota us ke khoon mein dubo kar us ke pehlu par maaro; tum us mein se na khao na tumhare saathiyon mein se koi, aur use taqseem kar do."
"1424","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar qayamat qaim ho aur tum mein se kisi ke haath mein pauda ho, phir agar wo taqat rakhe ke wo khara na ho yahan tak ke use laga de to use laga de."
"1425","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum Allah ke raaste mein sabr karne wale, sawab ki umeed rakhne wale, aage barhne wale, peeth na pherne wale qatl kiye jao to Allah tumhare gunah mita dega siwaye qarz ke; Jibreel ne abhi mujh se aisa hi kaha hai."
"1426","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Allah taala kisi cheez ka faisla kare ke wo hogi to wo ho kar rahegi chahe use rok diya jaye."
"1427","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar nahusat kisi cheez mein ho to ghar, aurat aur ghore mein hai."
"1428","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo apne chhote bachchon ke liye kamane nikla to wo Allah ke raaste mein hai; agar wo apne boorhe maa-baap ke liye kamane nikla to wo Allah ke raaste mein hai; agar wo apne aap ko paak rakhne ke liye kamane nikla to wo Allah ke raaste mein hai; aur agar wo dikhawe aur fakhr ke liye kamane nikla to wo shaitan ke raaste mein hai."
"1429","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tumhare paas paani ho jo is raat mashke mein raha ho to hamein pilao, warna ham munh lagakar piyenge."
"1430","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar jin se tum ilaaj karte ho un mein koi bhalayi ho to pachhna lagwana hai."
"1431","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tumhari dawaiyon mein se kisi mein bhalayi ho to seengi lagane wale ke cheere mein, ya shehed ke ghoont mein, ya aag ke daagh mein jo marz ke muwafiq lage; lekin main daagh lagwana pasand nahi karta."
"1432","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo unhein nafa de to wo karein; maine sirf gumaan kiya tha, pas mujhe gumaan par na pakro; lekin jab main tumhein Allah ke baare mein kuch bayan karun to use pakro, kyunke main ¤ Allah par jhoot nahi bolunga."
"1433","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum gunah mein mubtala hui ho to Allah se maghfirat mango aur us ki taraf tauba karo, kyunke gunah se tauba nadamat aur maghfirat hai."
"1434","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum roza rakhne wale ho to ghurra ke dinon ke roze rakho."
"1435","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum roza rakhne wale ho to tum par safed ghurra lazim hai: teerah, chaudah aur pandrah."
"1436","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum Allah ke bande ho to apna tehband ooncha karo."
"1437","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum pehle aisa karte thay ke Faaris aur Room ka kaam karte thay ke wo apne baadshahon par kharay rehte jabke wo bethe hote, to aisa na karo; apne imamon ki pairvi karo: agar wo kharay hokar namaz parhe to kharay hokar parho, agar wo beth kar namaz parhe to beth kar parho."
"1438","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum jannat ke zewar aur us ke resham ko pasand karte ho to use duniya mein na pehno."
"1439","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum bakriyon ke baaron aur oonton ke bethne ki jaghon ke siwa na ¤ paao to bakriyon ke baaron mein namaz parho aur oonton ke bethne ki jaghon mein namaz na parho, kyunke wo shayateen se paida kiye gaye hain."
"1440","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum us ke liye kuch na pao jo use do siwaye jale hue khur ke, to use us ke haath mein de do."
"1441","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum kisi qaum ke paas utro aur wo tumhare liye wo karein jo mehmaan ke liye munasib hai to qabool karo; phir agar wo na karein to un se mehmaan ka haq lo jo un ke liye munasib hai."
"1442","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar tum un ke bartanon ke siwa paao, yaani ehl-e-Kitaab ke, to un mein na khao; aur agar na paao to unhein dho lo aur un mein khao."
"1443","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye ladka zinda raha to umeed hai ke wo burhape ko nahi pahunchega yahan tak ke qayamat qaim ho jaye."
"1444","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo wahi ho to tum us par ghalib nahi aaoge; aur agar wo wahi na ho to use qatl karne mein tumhare liye koi bhalayi nahi."
"1445","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ka apne bhai ko muft dena us ke liye us se behtar hai ke us par ¤ muqarrar lagaan le."
"1446","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Saleem ki Awatik ka beta hun."
"1447","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Abul-Qasim hun; Allah deta hai aur main taqseem karta hun."
"1448","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darne wala aur Allah ki hadon ko sab se zyada jaanne wala hun."
"1449","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bartan barabar bartan aur khana barabar khana hai."
"1450","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main qayamat ke din nabiyon mein sab se zyada pairvi kiye jane wala hun, aur jannat ka darwaza khatkhatane wala sab se pehla hun."
"1451","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Nabi hun, jhoot nahi; main Abdul Muttalib ka beta hun."
"1452","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main duniya aur aakhirat mein Isa bin Maryam se sab se zyada qareeb hun; mere aur un ke darmiyan koi Nabi nahi; ambiya allaati bhai hain, un ki maaein mukhtalif hain aur un ka deen aik hai."
"1453","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Allah ki kitaab mein mominon ka un se zyada haq-dar hun; pas tum mein se jo qarz ya be-sahara chhore to mujhe pukaro, main us ka madadgar hun; aur tum mein se jo maal chhore to us ke maal se us ke qareebi rishtedaron ko ¤ faida ho, jo bhi ho."
"1454","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main mominon ka un ke nafs se zyada haq-dar hun; pas jo momin wafaat paye aur qarz chhore to us ki adayegi mujh par hai, aur jo maal chhore to wo us ke warison ke liye hai."
"1455","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main har momin ka us ke nafs se zyada haq-dar hun; pas jo qarz ya be-sahara chhore to mere supurd hai, jo maal chhore to us ke warison ke liye hai; main us ka madadgar hun jis ka koi madadgar na ho: main us ka maal warasat mein leta hun aur us ke qaidi ko chhurata hun; khaala us ki madadgar hai jis ka koi madadgar na ho: wo us ka maal warasat mein leti hai aur us ki taraf se diyat deti hai."
"1456","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main har momin ka us ke nafs se zyada haq-dar hun; pas jo qarz chhore to mujh par hai, aur jo maal chhore to us ke warison ke liye hai."
"1457","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein shafa'at karne wala sab se pehla hun, aur main nabiyon mein sab se zyada pairvi kiye jane wala hun."
"1458","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein sab se pehla shafi hun; nabiyon mein se kisi Nabi ki utni tasdeeq nahi ki gayi jitni meri ki gayi; nabiyon mein se aik Nabi aisa hai jis ki us ki ummat mein se sirf aik aadmi tasdeeq karega."
"1459","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main sab se pehla hun jo jannat ke darwaze ke halqe ko pakrega aur use khatkhatayega."
"1460","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main us se bezaar hun jo sar mundaye, garaibaan phaare aur kapre phaare."
"1461","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main har us Musalman se bezaar hun jo mushrikon ke darmiyan rehta ho; un donon ki aag aik doosre ko nazar na aaye."
"1462","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main us se jang karunga jis se tum ne jang ki, aur us se sulah karunga jis se tum ne sulah ki."
"1463","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Ibrahim ki dua hun, aur mujh se basharat dene wala aakhri Isa bin Maryam thay."
"1464","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main us ke liye zimmedar hun jo jhagra chhore chahe wo haq par ho, jannat ke kinare mein aik ghar ka; us ke liye jo jhoot chhore chahe mazaq mein ho, jannat ke darmiyan mein aik ghar ka; aur us ke liye jis ke akhlaq achche hon, jannat ke oonche hisse mein aik ghar ka."
"1465","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main us ke liye zimmedar hun jo mujh par iman laye, Islam laye aur hijrat kare: jannat ke ¤ kinare mein aik ghar ka, jannat ke darmiyan mein aik ghar ka aur jannat ke oonche kamron mein aik ghar ka. Aur main us ke liye zimmedar hun jo mujh par iman laye, Islam laye aur Allah ke raaste mein jihaad kare: jannat ke kinare mein aik ghar ka, jannat ke darmiyan mein aik ghar ka aur jannat ke oonche kamron mein aik ghar ka. Pas jo aisa kare wo bhalayi ka koi matlab aur shar se bachne ka koi raasta na chhore; wo mare jahan chahe ke mare."
"1466","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main qayamat ke din logon ka sardar hun; kiya tum jaante ho ye kis wajah se hai? Allah awwalin o aakhirin ko aik maidan mein jama karega, pukaarne wale unhein sunayega, nazar un tak pahunchegi, suraj un se qareeb ho jayega; pas logon ko itna gham aur takleef pahunchegi jo wo bardasht nahi kar sakenge. Log aik doosre se kahenge: kiya tum nahi dekhte jo tumhein pahunch chuka hai? Kiya tum nahi dekhte kaun tumhare Rab ke paas tumhare liye shafa'at kare? Log aik doosre se kahenge: Adam ke paas aao. Pas wo Adam ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Adam, tum hamare baap ho, tum Abul-Bashar ho; Allah ne tumhein apne haath se paida kiya, tum mein apni rooh phunki, farishton ko hukm diya to unhon ne tumhein sajda kiya; hamare liye hamare Rab ke paas shafa'at karo; kiya tum nahi dekhte ham kis mein hain? Kiya tum nahi dekhte jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? Adam un se kahenge: mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab kiya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi kiya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi karega; us ne mujhe darakht se mana kiya tha to maine us ki nafarmani ki; nafsi nafsi nafsi; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; Nuh ke paas jao. Pas wo Nuh ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: tum zameen walon ki taraf pehle Rasool ho, Allah ne tumhein shukr-guzar banda kaha; hamare liye hamare Rab ke paas shafa'at karo; kiya tum nahi dekhte ham kis mein hain? Kiya tum nahi dekhte jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? Nuh un se kahenge: mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab kiya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi kiya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi karega; meri aik dua thi jo maine apni qaum ke khilaaf mangi thi; nafsi nafsi nafsi; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; Ibrahim ke paas jao. Pas wo Ibrahim ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Ibrahim, tum Allah ke Nabi aur zameen walon mein se us ke khaleel ho; hamare liye hamare Rab ke paas shafa'at karo; kiya tum nahi dekhte ham ¤ kis mein hain? Kiya tum nahi dekhte jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? Ibrahim un se kahenge: mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab kiya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi kiya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi karega; maine teen jhoot bole thay; nafsi nafsi nafsi; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; Musa ke paas jao. Pas wo Musa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Musa, tum Allah ke Rasool ho; Allah ne tumhein apni risalaton aur apne kalaam se logon par fazilat di; hamare liye hamare Rab ke paas shafa'at karo; kiya tum nahi dekhte ham kis mein hain? Kiya tum nahi dekhte jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? Wo kahenge: mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab kiya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi kiya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi karega; maine aik jaan qatl ki thi jis ke qatl ka mujhe hukm nahi diya gaya tha; nafsi nafsi nafsi; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; Isa ke paas jao. Pas wo Isa ke paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Isa, tum Allah ke Rasool, us ka kalima jo us ne Maryam ki taraf dala aur us ki taraf se rooh ho; tum ne jhoole mein logon se kalaam kiya; hamare liye hamare Rab ke paas shafa'at karo; kiya tum nahi dekhte ham kis mein hain? Kiya tum nahi dekhte jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? Isa un se kahenge: mere Rab ne aaj itna ghazab kiya hai jitna is se pehle kabhi nahi kiya aur is ke baad kabhi nahi karega; nafsi nafsi nafsi; mere siwa kisi aur ke paas jao; Muhammad ke paas jao. Pas wo mere paas aayenge aur kahenge: Ae Muhammad, tum Allah ke Rasool aur nabiyon ke khaatim ho; Allah ne tumhare agle-pichhle gunah bakhsh diye; hamare liye hamare Rab ke paas shafa'at karo; kiya tum nahi dekhte ham kis mein hain? Kiya tum nahi dekhte jo hamein pahunch chuka hai? Pas main chalunga aur Arsh ke neeche aaunga aur apne Rab ke liye sajde mein girunga; phir Allah mujh par apni tareefon aur us par achchi sana mein se kuch kholega jo us ne mujh se pehle kisi par nahi khola tha; phir kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad, apna sar uthao, mango diya jayega, shafa'at karo qabool ki jayegi. Pas main apna sar uthaunga aur kahunga: Ae mere Rab, meri ummat, meri ummat. Phir kaha jayega: Ae Muhammad, apni ummat mein se jin ka koi hisab nahi unhein jannat ke darwazon mein se dayen darwaze se dakhil karo; aur wo is ke siwa baaqi darwazon mein logon ke shareek hain. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, jannat ke darwazon ke do paton ke darmiyan utna fasla hai jitna Makkah aur Hajar ke darmiyan ya Makkah aur Busra ke darmiyan."
"1467","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main qayamat ke din Aulaad-e-Adam ka sardar hun, sab se pehla hun jis se qabr phategi, sab se pehla shafi hun aur sab se pehla hun jis ki shafa'at qabool ki jayegi."
"1468","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main qayamat ke din Aulaad-e-Adam ka sardar hun aur fakhr nahi; mere haath mein hamd ka jhanda hai aur fakhr nahi; us din Adam aur un ke siwa jo Nabi hai wo mere jhande ke neeche hai; main sab se pehla shafi hun aur sab se pehla hun jis ki shafa'at qabool ki jayegi, aur fakhr nahi."
"1469","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main hauz par tumhara pesh-rou hun."
"1470","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main hauz par tumhara pesh-rou hun, tumhara intezar karunga taake tum mein se kuch aadmi mere saamne laye jayen; phir jab main unhein pehchan lunga to wo mujh se door kheench liye jayenge. Pas main kahunga: Ae mere Rab, mere saathi, mere saathi. Phir kaha jayega: tum nahi jaante unhon ne tumhare baad kiya naya kiya."
"1471","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main hauz par tumhara pesh-rou hun; main kuch logon se jhagrunga phir un par ghalib aaunga aur kahunga: Ae mere Rab, mere saathi, mere saathi. Wo farmayega: tum nahi jaante unhon ne tumhare baad kiya naya kiya."
"1472","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abdul Muttalib hun; Allah taala ne makhlooq ko paida kiya aur mujhe un mein sab se behtar mein rakha, phir unhein do girohon mein kiya aur mujhe behtar giroh mein rakha, phir unhein qabilon mein kiya aur mujhe behtar qabile mein rakha, phir unhein gharon mein kiya aur mujhe behtar ghar mein rakha; pas main tum mein ghar ke lihaaz se sab se behtar hun aur jaan ke lihaaz se sab se behtar hun."
"1473","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Muhammad, Ahmad, Muqaffi, Haashir, Nabi-ut-Tauba aur Nabi-ur-Rehmat hun."
"1474","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main us ka waaris hun jis ka koi waaris na ho: main us ke qaidi ko chhurata hun aur us ka maal warasat mein leta hun; khaala us ki waaris hai jis ka koi waaris na ho: wo us ke qaidi ko chhurati hai aur us ka maal warasat mein leti hai."
"1475","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aur yateem ki kifalat karne wala jannat mein is tarah honge."
"1476","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aur yateem ki kifalat karne wala, us ke liye ya ghair ke liye, jannat mein honge; bewa aur miskeen ke liye daurne wala Allah ke raaste mein jihaad karne wale jaisa hai."
"1477","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use apne subah ke khane par nabeez banao aur apne shaam ke khane par piyo; use apne shaam ke khane par nabeez banao aur apne subah ke khane par piyo; use mashke mein nabeez banao, matkon mein nabeez na banao; kyunke jab wo apne nichorne se der kare to sirka ban jata hai."
"1478","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum apni sawari ke agle hisse ke zyada haq-dar ho mujh se, siwaye is ke ke tum use mere liye kar do."
"1479","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum hamare bhai aur hamare azaad-karda ho. Ye Zaid bin Harisa se kaha."
"1480","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum un ke imam ho; kamzor tareen ke mutabiq karo; aur aisa muazzin rakho jo apni azaan par ujrat na le."
"1481","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum saathi ho aur Allah tabeeb hai."
"1482","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum Allah ke azaad-karda ho aag se. Ye Abu Bakr se kaha."
"1483","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum us ke saath hoge jis se tum ne mohabbat ki."
"1484","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mujh se us manzil par ho jis par Haroon Musa se thay, siwaye is ke ke mere baad koi Nabi nahi."
"1485","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mujh se ho aur main tum se hun. Ye Ali se kaha."
"1486","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum aur tumhara maal tumhare baap ke liye ho."
"1487","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum aur tumhara maal tumhare walid ke liye ho; tumhari auladein tumhari kamaayi mein se sab se achchi hain, pas apni auladon ki kamaayi mein se khao."
"1488","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum apni duniya ke muamle ko zyada jaante ho."
"1489","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum qayamat ke din wuzu poora karne se roshan chehre aur roshan haath-pair wale hoge...... ..."
"1490","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum zameen mein Allah ke gawah ho aur farishte aasman mein Allah ke gawah hain."
"1491","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us ke liye zamanat li hai jo us ke raaste mein nikle, use sirf mujh par iman aur mere Rasoolon ki tasdeeq nikalti hai, ke use us ajr ya ghanimat ke saath lautaye jo us ne payi ya use jannat mein dakhil kare; aur agar meri ummat par mashaqqat ka khauf na hota to main kisi lashkar ke peeche na bethta; main chahunga ke main Allah ke raaste mein qatl kiya jaun phir zinda kiya jaun, phir qatl kiya jaun phir zinda kiya jaun, phir qatl kiya jaun phir zinda kiya jaun."
"1492","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musa ke zamane mein do aadmiyon ne nasab bayan kiya; un mein se aik ne kaha: main falan bin falan hun yahan tak ke us ne nau gine; phir kaha: tum kaun ho, tumhari maa na rahe? Us ne kaha: main falan bin falan bin Islam hun. Pas Allah ne Musa ki taraf wahi ki ke in donon nasab bayan karne walon se kaho: tum jo nau ki taraf nasab jorte ho jo aag mein hain, tum aag mein un ke daswein hoge; tum jo do ki taraf nasab jorte ho jo jannat mein hain, tum jannat mein un ke teesre hoge."
"1493","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jootein pehno, halki safar karo aur ehl-e-Kitaab ki mukhalifat karo."
"1494","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kheencho, ae Bani Abdul Muttalib; agar log tum par tumhari saqayat mein ghalib na aate to main tumhare saath kheenchta."
"1495","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran saat haroof par naazil kiya gaya."
"1496","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran saat darwazon se saat haroof par naazil kiya gaya, sab shafi kaafi hain."
"1497","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim ke saheefe Ramazan ki pehli raat naazil kiye gaye, Tauret Ramazan ki chhe guzarne par naazil ki gayi, Injeel Ramazan ki teerah guzarne par naazil ki gayi, Zaboor Ramazan ki attharah guzarne par naazil ki gayi aur Quran Ramazan ki chaubees guzarne par naazil kiya gaya."
"1498","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par abhi aik surat naazil hui: Allah ke naam se jo Rehman Raheem hai, beshak ham ne tumhein Kausar di, pas apne Rab ke liye namaz parho aur qurbani karo, beshak tumhara dushman hi be-naam hai. Kiya tum jaante ho Kausar kiya hai? Wo aik neher hai jis ka mere Rab ne mujh se wada kiya hai, us par bahut bhalayi hai; wo mera hauz hai jis par qayamat ke din meri ummat aayegi, us ke bartan sitaron ki ginti jitne hain; un mein se aik banda kheench liya jayega to main kahunga: Ae mere Rab, ye meri ummat mein se hai; Wo farmayega: tum nahi jaante unhon ne tumhare baad kiya naya kiya."
"1499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par aayaat naazil huin jin jaisi kabhi nahi dekhi gayin: Kaho main panah mangta hun subah ke Rab ki ¤ aur kaho main panah mangta hun logon ke Rab ki."
"1500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us se utar jao, ham mal'oon ke saath safar nahi karenge; apne aap par bad-dua na karo, apni auladon par bad-dua na karo, apne maalon par bad-dua na karo; aisa na ho ke tum Allah ki taraf se us ghari ko paao jis mein ataa mangi jati hai aur wo tumhare liye qabool kare."
"1501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki madad karo, zaalim ho ya mazloom; agar zaalim ho to use us ke zulm se roko, agar mazloom ho to us ki madad karo."
"1502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki madad karo, zaalim ho ya mazloom. Kaha gaya: main zaalim hone ki haalat mein us ki madad kaise karun? Farmaya: tum use zulm se roko, kyunke yehi us ki madad hai."
"1503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chal do, ae Abu Masood; main tumhein qayamat ke din is haal mein na paun ke tum sadqe ke oonton mein se aik oont apni peeth par liye aao jo bol raha ho aur tum ne us mein khayanat ki ho."
"1504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle walon mein se teen aadmiyon ka giroh chala yahan tak ke unhon ne raat guzarne ke liye ghaar mein panah li aur us mein dakhil hue; pas pahar se aik chattan un par giri aur us ne un par ghaar band kar diya. Unhon ne kaha: tumhein is chattan se sirf ye nijaat dega ke tum Allah se apne naik aamaal ke waseele se dua karo. Un mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Ae Allah, mere boorhe maa-baap thay aur main un se pehle ghar walon aur maal ko shaam ka doodh nahi pilata tha; aik din mujhe kisi cheez ki talash mein door jana para to main ¤ un par shaam ko na lauta yahan tak ke wo so gaye; pas maine un ke liye un ka shaam ka doodh doha aur unhein soya paya; mujhe na-pasand hua ke un se pehle ghar walon ya maal ko shaam ka doodh pilaun; pas main thehra raha jabke pyala mere haath mein tha, un ke jaagne ka intezar karta raha yahan tak ke fajr chamki; phir wo jaage aur unhon ne apna shaam ka doodh piya. Ae Allah, agar maine ye tere chehre ki talash mein kiya tha to ham se is chattan ko hata de jis mein ham hain? Pas wo thori hati ke wo nikal nahi sakte thay. Doosre ne kaha: Ae Allah, meri chacha-zaad behan thi jo mujhe logon mein sab se mehboob thi; maine use us ke nafs par aamada karna chaha to us ne inkar kiya yahan tak ke us par saalon mein se aik saal sakhti ka aaya; pas wo mere paas aayi to maine use aik sau bees deenar diye is par ke wo mere aur apne nafs ke darmiyan rukawat hataye; us ne aisa kiya yahan tak ke jab main us par qadir hua to us ne kaha: tumhare liye halal nahi ke muhr ko us ke haq ke baghair toro; pas main us par waqe hone se dara aur us se phir gaya jabke wo mujhe logon mein sab se mehboob thi, aur jo sona maine use diya tha use chhor diya. Ae Allah, agar maine ye tere chehre ki talash mein kiya tha to ham se is ko hata de jis mein ham hain; pas chattan hati magar wo us se nikal nahi sakte thay. Teesre ne kaha: Ae Allah, maine mazdoor kiraye par liye aur unhein un ki ujrat di siwaye aik aadmi ke jo apna haq chhor kar chala gaya; pas maine us ki ujrat ko barhaya yahan tak ke us se bahut maal ho gaye; phir wo mere paas aik muddat ke baad aaya aur kaha: ae Allah ke bande, mujhe meri ujrat de; maine us se kaha: jo kuch tum dekhte ho tumhari ujrat mein se oont, gaaye, bakriyan aur ghulam sab tumhara hai; us ne kaha: ae Allah ke bande, mujh se mazaq na kar; maine kaha: main tum se mazaq nahi karta; pas us ne sab liya aur hank kar le gaya aur us mein se kuch na chhora. Ae Allah, agar maine ye tere chehre ki talash mein kiya tha to ham se is ko hata de jis mein ham hain; pas chattan hati aur wo chalte hue nikal gaye."
"1505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dekho, tum surkh ya kaale se behtar nahi siwaye is ke ke tum use taqwa se fazilat do."
"1506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bhaiyon ke baare mein dekho, kyunke raza'at bhook se hai."
"1507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ki taraf dekho jo tum se neeche hai, us ki taraf na dekho jo tum se oopar hai; ye zyada laiq hai ke tum Allah ki ne'mat ko haqeer na samjho."
"1508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish ko dekho, un ki baat se lo aur un ke kaam ko chhor do."
"1509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dekho tum us se kahan ho? Kyunke wahi tumhari jannat aur tumhari aag hai."
"1510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhare liye kursuf bayan karta hun, kyunke wo khoon door karta hai."
"1511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaram se chalo yahan tak ke un ke maidan mein utro, phir unhein Islam ki dawat do aur unhein batao jo un par Allah ka haq us mein wajib hai; pas Allah ki qasam agar Allah tumhare zariye aik aadmi ko hidayat de to ye tumhare liye is se behtar hai ke tumhare liye surkh oont hon."
"1512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kharch karo, ae Bilal, aur Arsh wale se kami ka khauf na karo."
"1513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kharch karo aur gin kar na rakho warna Allah tum par gin kar rakhega; aur bandh kar na rakho warna Allah tum par bandh kar rakhega."
"1514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah karo, kyunke main tumhare zariye kasrat par fakhr karunga."
"1515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare nishanaat likhe jate hain."
"1516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Adam teen mittiyon se paida kiye gaye: kaali, safed aur surkh."
"1517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Falan ke ghar wale mere dost nahi; mera dost sirf Allah aur naik momin hain."
"1518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jafar ke ghar wale apne murde ke muamle mein mashghool ho gaye hain, pas un ke liye khana banao."
"1519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein sab se bakheel wo hai jo salaam mein bakheel ho, aur logon mein sab se aajiz wo hai jo dua se aajiz ho."
"1520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mera beta Ibrahim doodh-peete mar gaya; us ke liye do daiyan hain jo ¤ jannat mein us ki raza'at poori karengi."
"1521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim ne Baitullah ko haram qaraar diya aur use aman diya; maine Madina ko us ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan haram qaraar diya: us ki jhaariyan na ukhaari jayen aur us ka shikar na kiya jaye."
"1522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram qaraar diya aur maine us ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan, yaani Madina ko, haram qaraar diya."
"1523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram qaraar diya aur us ke liye dua ki; maine Madina ko haram qaraar diya jaise Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram qaraar diya tha, aur us ke liye us ke mudd aur saa' mein dua ki jaise Ibrahim ne Makkah ke liye dua ki thi."
"1524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Ibrahim ko aag mein dala gaya to zameen mein koi janwar nahi tha magar us ne us se aag bujhayi, siwaye chhipkali ke, kyunke wo us par phoonk rahi thi."
"1525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se azeem neki ye hai ke baap ke chale jane ke baad aadmi us ke doston ke ghar walon se mile."
"1526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iblees apna takht paani par rakhta hai phir apne lashkar bhejta hai; us se manzil mein sab se qareeb us ka sab se bara fitna wala hai: un mein se aik aata hai aur kehta hai: maine aisa-aisa kiya; wo kehta hai: tum ne kuch nahi kiya. Un mein se aik aata hai aur kehta hai: maine use nahi chhora yahan tak ke us ke ¤ aur us ke ghar walon ke darmiyan judayi kar di; pas wo use apne qareeb karta hai aur kehta hai: haan tum ho."
"1527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ko agar garmi lage to kehta hai: uff, aur agar sardi lage to kehta hai: uff."
"1528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mera ye beta sardar hai; umeed hai ke Allah us ke zariye Musalmanon ki do azeem jama'aton ke darmiyan sulah karayega."
"1529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere ye donon bete duniya mein mere do phool hain."
"1530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ke darwaze talwaron ke saayon ke neeche hain."
"1531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sood ke darwaze bahattar gunah hain, un mein sab se kam wo hai jo Islam mein apni maa ke paas aaye."
"1532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aasman ke darwaze suraj ke dhalne tak khole jate hain aur band nahi hote yahan tak ke zuhr parhi jaye; pas main pasand karta hun ke us mein mere liye bhalayi oopar charhe."
"1533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darne wala aur use sab se zyada jaanne wala main hun."
"1534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek tumhare naamon mein sab se mehboob Abdullah aur Abdur Rahman hain."
"1535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhirat mein mujh se sab se zyada mehboob aur mujh se majlis mein sab se qareeb wo honge jo akhlaq mein sab se achche hon; mujh se sab se zyada bughz rakhne wale aur mujh se majlis mein sab se door wo honge jo akhlaq mein sab se bure hon: bahut bolne wale, munh bhar-bhar kar bolne wale aur shekhi maarne wale."
"1536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Uhud pahar ham se mohabbat karta hai aur ham us se mohabbat karte hain."
"1537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi jab apni namaz mein khara hota hai to wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai; us ka Rab us ke aur qible ke darmiyan hai; pas tum mein se koi apne qible ki taraf na thooke, lekin apne bayen ya apne qadam ke neeche thooke."
"1538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi jab namaz ke liye khara hota hai to wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai; pas wo dekhe ke wo kaise sargoshi karta hai?"
"1539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi jab namaz ke liye khara hota hai to shaitan aata hai aur us par khalt-mal kar deta hai yahan tak ke wo nahi jaanta ke us ne kitni parhi? Pas jab tum mein se koi ye paye to beth kar do sajde kare."
"1540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi jab namaz mein hota hai to Allah us ke chehre ke saamne hota hai; pas tum mein se koi namaz mein apne chehre ke saamne na thunke."
"1541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi jab apni namaz mein hota hai to wo apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai; pas na apne saamne thooke na apne dayen, lekin apne bayen aur apne qadam ke neeche thooke."
"1542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ke paas shaitan aata hai aur kehta hai: tumhein kis ne paida kiya? Wo kehta hai: Allah ne. Wo kehta hai: Allah ko kis ne paida kiya? Pas jab tum mein se koi ye paye to kahe: main Allah aur us ke Rasool par iman laya; kyunke ye us se door ho jayega."
"1543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni maa ke pet mein chaalees din nutfa jama kiya jata hai, phir utna hi jam hua khoon hota hai, phir utna hi gosht ka lothra hota hai; phir Allah us ki taraf farishta bhejta hai aur chaar kalimaat ka hukm diya jata hai aur us se kaha jata hai: us ka amal, us ka rizq, us ki umr aur bad-bakht ya khush-bakht likho; phir us mein rooh phunki jati hai. Tum mein se aadmi jannat walon ke amal par amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur us ke darmiyan sirf haath bhar reh jata hai, phir kitaab us par sabqat karti hai aur wo aag walon ke amal par amal karta hai aur aag mein dakhil hota hai. Aur aadmi aag walon ke amal par amal karta hai yahan tak ke us ke aur us ke darmiyan sirf haath bhar rehta hai, phir kitaab us par sabqat karti hai aur wo jannat walon ke amal par amal karta hai aur jannat mein dakhil hota hai."
"1544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya walon ke hasab wo hain jin ki taraf wo jate hain: ye maal."
"1545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apne ghar walon par jab safar se aaye to raat ke awwal mein aana sab se achcha hai."
"1546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne safed baal ko badalne mein sab se achcha mehndi aur katam hai."
"1547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharton mein sab se zyada haq tum par poora karna wo hai jis se tum ne sharmgahein halal kein."
"1548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin par tum ujrat lete ho un mein sab se zyada haq Allah ki kitaab hai."
"1549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara bhai Najashi wafaat pa gaya hai, pas kharay ho aur us par namaz parho."
"1550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara bhai apne qarz se roka gaya hai, pas us ki taraf se ada karo."
"1551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni ummat par mujhe sab se zyada khauf gumrah karne wale imaamon ka hai."
"1552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni ummat par mujhe sab se zyada khauf qaum-e-Loot ke amal ka hai."
"1553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhri zamane mein apni ummat par mujhe sab se zyada khauf sitaron, taqdeer ke jhutlane aur hukmaran ke zulm ka hai."
"1554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni ummat par mujhe sab se zyada khauf har chikni zaban wale munafiq ka hai."
"1555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum par mujhe sab se zyada khauf chhote shirk ka hai: riya. Allah qayamat ke din jab logon ko un ke aamaal ka badla dega farmayega: un ke paas jao jinhein tum duniya mein dikhate thay, dekho kiya tum un ke paas badla paate ho."
"1556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad tum par mujhe sab se zyada khauf har chikni zaban wale munafiq ka hai."
"1557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat walon mein sab se kam darje wala wo aadmi hai jis ka chehra Allah ne aag se jannat ki taraf pher diya aur us ke liye saye wala darakht zahir kiya; wo kahega: ae mere Rab, mujhe is darakht tak aage kar de taake main us ke saye mein hun. Allah farmayega: kiya umeed hai ke tum mujh se is ke siwa mangoge? Wo kahega: nahi, teri izzat ki qasam. Pas Allah use us tak aage kar dega; phir us ke liye saye aur phal wala darakht zahir karega; wo kahega: ae mere Rab, mujhe is darakht tak aage kar de taake main us ke saye mein hun aur us ka phal khaun. Allah farmayega: kiya umeed hai ke agar maine tumhein ye diya to tum mujh se is ke siwa mangoge? Wo kahega: nahi, teri izzat ki qasam. Pas Allah use us tak aage kar dega; phir Allah us ke liye saya, phal aur paani wala doosra darakht zahir karega; wo kahega: ae mere Rab, mujhe is darakht tak aage kar de taake main us ke saye mein hun, us ka phal khaun aur us ka paani piyun. Wo us se farmayega: kiya umeed hai ke agar maine aisa kiya to tum mujh se ¤ is ke siwa mangoge? Wo kahega: nahi, teri izzat ki qasam, main tum se is ke siwa nahi mangunga. Pas Allah use us tak aage kar dega; phir us ke liye jannat ka darwaza zahir hoga; wo kahega: ae mere Rab, mujhe jannat ke darwaze tak aage kar de taake main jannat ke parde ke neeche hun aur us ke rehne walon ko dekhun. Pas Allah use us tak aage kar dega; phir wo jannat aur jo us mein hai use dekhega aur kahega: ae mere Rab, mujhe jannat mein dakhil kar; pas wo jannat mein dakhil hoga. Phir jab wo jannat mein dakhil hoga to kahega: ye mera hai? Allah us se farmayega: tamanna karo; pas wo tamanna karega aur Allah azza wa jal use yaad dilayega: falan-falan cheez mango, yahan tak ke jab us ki tamannayein khatm ho jayengi to Allah farmayega: ye tumhara hai aur is ke das guna. Phir Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega; us par us ki hooron mein se do biwiyan dakhil hongi aur kahengi: tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jis ne tumhein hamare liye zinda kiya aur hamein tumhare liye zinda kiya. Wo kahega: mujh jaisa kisi ko nahi diya gaya. Aur aag walon mein azab mein sab se kam wo hai jise aag ke do joote pehnaye jayenge jin se us ke joote ki garmi se us ka dimagh ubalega."
"1558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheedon ki roohein sabz parindon ke pet mein hain, un ke liye Arsh ke neeche latke hue qandeel hain; wo jannat mein jahan chahein charti hain phir un qandeelon ki taraf laut aati hain. Phir un ka Rab un ki taraf aik baar dekhega aur farmayega: kiya tum kisi cheez ki khwahish karte ho? Wo kahengi: ham kis cheez ki khwahish karein jabke ham jannat mein jahan chahein charte hain? Wo un ke saath teen baar aisa karega; phir jab wo dekhein ke unhein sawal kiye baghair nahi chhora jayega to kahengi: ae hamare Rab, ham chahte hain ke tu hamari roohein hamare jismon mein lauta de yahan tak ke ham duniya ki taraf lautein aur tere raaste mein dobara qatl kiye jayen. Phir jab Wo dekhega ke unhein koi haajat nahi to unhein chhor diya jayega."
"1559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheedon ki roohein sabz parindon mein hain jo jannat ke phalon se khaati hain."
"1560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon ki roohein sabz parindon mein hain jo jannat ke darakhton se khaati hain."
"1561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat walon ki biwiyan apne shoharon ke liye sab se khubsurat aawazon se gayengi jo kisi ne kabhi nahi suni: un ke gaane mein se ¤ ham naik khubsurat auratein hain ... shareef qaum ke shoharon ki biwiyan hain ¤ jo moti-aankhon se dekhti hain ¤ aur un ke gaane mein se ¤ ham hamesha rehne waliyan hain, nahi marengi ... ham aman wali hain, nahi darengi ¤ ham theherne waliyan hain, kooch nahi karengi."
"1562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein aazmaish mein sab se sakht ambiya hain, phir jo un se milte hain, phir jo un se milte hain."
"1563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din azab mein sab se sakht log tasweer banane wale honge."
"1564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke Nabi ke baad is ummat mein haya mein sab se sakht Usman hain."
"1565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In tasweeron wale qayamat ke ¤ din azab diye jayenge aur un se kaha jayega: jo tum ne banaya use zinda karo."
"1566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo sab se achcha tum ne khaya wo tumhari kamaayi mein se hai, aur tumhari auladein tumhari kamaayi mein se hain."
"1567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek gunahon mein sab se azeem wo aadmi hai jo aurat se nikah kare, phir jab us se apni haajat poori kar le to use talaq de aur us ka mehr le jaye; wo aadmi jo mazdoor se kaam le aur us ki ujrat le jaye; aur doosra jo janwar ko be-fayda qatl kare."
"1568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein Musalmanon ke haq mein jurm mein sab se azeem wo hai jo aisi cheez ke baare mein sawal kare jo Musalmanon par haram nahi ki gayi thi, phir wo un par us ke sawal ki wajah se haram ho jaye."
"1569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek buhtan mein sab se azeem log: aik aadmi jo kisi aadmi ki hajw kare aur poori qabile ki hajw kare, aur aik aadmi jo apne baap ka inkar kare aur us ki maa zina kare."
"1570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bandon ke aamaal peer aur jumeraat ko pesh kiye jate hain."
"1571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Allah ke bandon mein sab se afzal hamd karne wale honge."
"1572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin se tum ilaaj karte ho un mein sab se afzal pachhna lagwana aur samandari ¤ qust hai; pas apne bachchon ko dabane se takleef na do."
"1573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din mujh se manzil mein sab se qareeb wo honge jo duniya mein akhlaq mein sab se achche hon."
"1574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ke rehne walon mein sab se kam auratein hongi."
"1575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madina mein kuch log hamare peeche hain; ham ne koi ghaati aur waadi tay nahi ki magar wo uzr se ruke hue hamare saath hain."
"1576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kuch log aag se niklenge jabke wo us mein jal chuke honge siwaye un ke chehron ke nishanaat ke, yahan tak ke wo jannat mein dakhil honge."
"1577","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mein sab se zyada pet bharne wale qayamat ke din sab se zyada bhooke honge."
"1578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mominon mein iman ke lihaaz se sab se kaamil wo hai jo akhlaq mein sab se achcha ho; husn-e-akhlaq roze aur namaz ke darje tak pahunchata hai."
"1579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oont shayateen se paida kiye gaye hain, aur har oont ke peeche ¤ aik shaitan hai."
"1580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ajnabi shuru hua aur ajnabi lautega jaise shuru hua tha; pas ajnabiyon ke liye khushkhabri hai."
"1581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ajnabi shuru hua aur ajnabi lautega jaise shuru hua tha; wo donon masjidon ke darmiyan simat-ta hai jaise saanp apne bil mein simat-ta hai."
"1582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ash'ari jab jihaad mein khaali-haath ho jayen ya Madina mein un ke ghar walon ka khana kam ho jaye to jo un ke paas ho use aik kapre mein kar lete hain phir use aik bartan mein barabar taqseem karte hain; wo mujh se hain aur main un se hun."
"1583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamaal peer aur jumeraat ko uthaye jate hain; pas main pasand karta hun ke mera amal uthaya jaye jabke main roze se hun."
"1584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amanat aadmiyon ke dilon ki jar mein naazil hui, phir Quran naazil hua to unhon ne Quran se seekha aur sunnat se seekha. Aadmi aik neend soyega to amanat us ke dil se kheench li jayegi aur us ka nishan nishan jaisa reh jayega; phir wo aik neend soyega to ¤ amanat us ke dil se kheench li jayegi aur us ka nishan chhale jaisa reh jayega, jaise angara jo tum ne apne pair par lundhaya aur wo phoot para; pas tum use ubhra dekhte ho jabke us mein kuch nahi. Phir log subah ko khareed-farokht karenge aur taqreeban koi amanat ada nahi karega yahan tak ke kaha jayega: falan ke beton mein aik ameen aadmi hai; yahan tak ke aadmi ke baare mein kaha jayega: wo kitna mazboot hai? Wo kitna samajhdar hai? Wo kitna aqalmand hai? Jabke us ke dil mein raayi ke daane barabar iman nahi."
"1585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ameer logon mein bad-gumani talash kare to unhein bigar deta hai."
"1586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ambiya fakhr karenge ke un mein se kis ke saathi us ki ummat mein se zyada hain; pas main umeed rakhta hun ke us din un sab mein sab se zyada main hunga; un mein se har aadmi us din bhare hue hauz par khara hoga, us ke saath laathi hogi, wo apni ummat mein se jise pehchanta hai use bulayega; har ummat ke liye nishan hai jis se un ka Nabi unhein pehchanta hai."
"1587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansaar ne jo un par tha ada kar diya aur jo tum par hai wo baaqi hai; pas un ke naik kaar se qabool karo aur un ke bad-kaar se darguzar karo."
"1588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bartan kisi cheez ko haram nahi karte; pas jo tumhein nazar aaye us mein nabeez banao aur har nashawar se bacho."
"1589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman Madina ki taraf simat-ta hai jaise saanp apne ¤ bil ki taraf simat-ta hai."
"1590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman tum mein se kisi ke andar purana ho jata hai jaise kapra purana ho jata hai; pas Allah taala se sawal karo ke tumhare dilon mein iman ko naya kare."
"1591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Barkat khane ke darmiyan mein utarti hai; pas us ke kinare se khao aur us ke darmiyan se na khao."
"1592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Museebatein mujh se mohabbat karne wale ki taraf us sailaab se tez aati hain jo apni manzil ki taraf hai."
"1593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ghar mein tasweerein hon us mein farishte dakhil nahi hote."
"1594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tajir bad-kaar hain."
"1595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jaza' us se kaafi hai jis se saniya kaafi hoti hai."
"1596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakri ka jaza' us se poora karta hai jis se bakre ka sani poora karta hai."
"1597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Seengon wali seengon wali se qayamat ke din badla legi."
"1598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat teen ki mushtaaq hai: Ali, Ammar aur Salman ki."
"1599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj aur umrah Allah ke raaste mein se hain; Ramazan mein umrah hajj ke barabar hai."
"1600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hasan aur Husain duniya mein mere do phool hain."
"1601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Alhamdulillah, Subhanallah, La ilaha illallah aur Allahu Akbar bande ke gunahon se aise jharte hain jaise is darakht ke patte jharte hain."
"1602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hoor-e-Een jannat mein zaroor gayengi aur kahengi: ¤ ham khubsurat hoorein hain ... shareef shoharon ke liye chhupayi gayin hain."
"1603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haya aur iman donon ikatthe juray hue hain; phir jab un mein se aik uthaya jaye to doosra bhi uthaya jata hai."
"1604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharab angoor ke ras, kishmish, khajoor, gehun, jau aur makayi se hai; main tumhein har nashawar se mana karta hun."
"1605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bhalayi ki taraf rehbari karne wala us ke karne wale jaisa hai."
"1606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal ki bayen aankh miti hui hai, us par jhilli hai, us ki donon aankhon ke darmiyan kafir likha hai."
"1607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dajjal mashriq ki taraf se aik sheher se niklega jise Khurasan kehte hain; us ke peeche aise log honge goya un ke chehre coat ki hui dhaalein hon."
"1608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya meethi hari hai; pas jo us mein se us ke halal se kuch paye to wahi hai jis mein us ke liye barkat hai; kitne Allah aur us ke Rasool ke maal mein ghusne wale hain jin ke liye qayamat ke din aag hai."
"1609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya mal'oon hai, jo us mein hai wo mal'oon hai siwaye Allah ke zikr, us ke saath wale, aalim aur seekhne wale ke."
"1610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deen Allah, us ki kitaab, us ke Rasool, Musalmanon ke imaamon aur un ke aam logon ke liye khair-khwahi hai."
"1611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deen aasaan hai; deen se jo sakhti karega wo us par ghalib aa jayega; pas seedhe raho, qareeb raho, khush ho jao aur subah, shaam aur raat ke kuch hisse se madad lo."
"1612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khwab us par waqe hota hai jis par us ki taabeer ho; us ki misaal us aadmi jaisi hai jo apne pair uthaye aur intezar kare ke kab rakhe; pas jab tum mein se koi khwab dekhe to use sirf khair-khwah ya aalim ko bayan kare."
"1613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apni sawari ke agle hisse, apne bistar ke agle hisse aur apne ghar mein imamat ka zyada haq-dar hai."
"1614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni namaz mein dakhil hota hai to Allah apne chehre se us ki taraf mutawajje hota hai; pas wo us se nahi phirta yahan tak ke wo palat jaye ya bura hadas kare."
"1615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi Imam ke saath namaz parhe yahan tak ke wo laut jaye to us ke liye raat ke qiyam ka sawab likha jata hai."
"1616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni paidaish ki jagah ke siwa mare to us ke liye us ki paidaish ki jagah se us ke nishan ke khatme tak jannat mein naapa jata hai."
"1617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka darja jannat mein buland kiya jata hai to wo kehta hai: ye mere liye kahan se? Kaha jata hai: tumhare bete ke tumhare liye maghfirat mangne se."
"1618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi aisa kalima kehta hai jis mein wo koi harj nahi samajhta aur us ke zariye sattar khizaan aag mein girta hai."
"1619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi Allah taala ki raza ka aisa kalima kehta hai jis ke baare mein wo nahi samajhta ke wo wahan pahunchega jahan pahuncha, to Allah us ke liye us ke zariye qayamat ke din tak apni raza likh deta hai; aur aadmi Allah taala ke ghusse ka aisa kalima kehta hai jis ke baare mein wo nahi samajhta ke wo wahan pahunchega jahan pahuncha, to Allah us par us ke zariye qayamat ke din tak apna ghussa likh deta hai."
"1620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apne husn-e-akhlaq se raat ko qiyam karne wale aur din ko roza rakhne wale ke darjon ko pa leta hai."
"1621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi apne husn-e-akhlaq se raat ko qiyam karne wale aur dopahron mein pyase rehne wale ke darje ko pa leta hai."
"1622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi mujh se cheez mangta hai to main use rokta hun yahan tak ke tum sifarish karo ¤ aur tumhein ajr diya jaye."
"1623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi lambi muddat jannat walon ke amal par amal karta hai phir us ka amal aag walon ke amal par khatm hota hai; aur aadmi lambi muddat aag walon ke amal par amal karta hai phir us ka amal jannat walon ke amal par khatm hota hai."
"1624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi jannat ka amal karta hai logon ko zahir mein jabke wo aag walon mein se hai; aur aadmi aag ka amal karta hai logon ko zahir mein jabke wo jannat walon mein se hai."
"1625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke liye Allah ke paas manzil hoti hai jise wo amal se nahi pahuncha; pas Allah use na-pasandeeda cheez mein aazmata rehta hai yahan tak ke use wahan pahuncha de."
"1626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi laut-ta hai jabke us ke liye us ki namaz ka sirf daswan hissa likha gaya hota hai: us ka nawan, aathwan, saatwan, chhatha, paanchwan, chautha, teesra, aadha."
"1627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat walon mein se aadmi ko khane, peene, shahwat aur jima mein sau aadmiyon ki taqat di jayegi; un mein se aik ki haajat paseena hai jo us ki khaal se behta hai, to us ka pet sukhar jata hai."
"1628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag walon mein se aadmi aag ke liye itna bara kiya jayega yahan tak ke us ki daarhon mein se aik daarh ¤ Uhud jaisi hogi."
"1629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rishtedari Rehman ke daaman ko pakre hue shaakh hai; jo use jore use jorti hai aur jo use kate use kaatti hai."
"1630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rizq bande ko us ki maut se zyada talash karta hai."
"1631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Risalat aur nabuwat munqata ho gayi; pas mere baad koi Rasool aur Nabi nahi; lekin mubashshiraat Musalman aadmi ka khwab hain aur wo nabuwat ke hisson mein se aik hissa hai."
"1632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dam, taweez aur mohabbat ka jadu shirk hain."
"1633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rukn aur Maqaam jannat ke yaaqoot mein se do yaaqoot hain; Allah taala ne un donon ka noor mita diya; agar wo un donon ka noor na mitata to wo mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan roshan karte."
"1634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab rooh qabz ki jati hai to nazar us ke peeche jati hai."
"1635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke das nishaniyan hon: dhuwan, Dajjal, janwar, suraj ka maghrib se tuloo, teen dhansna: ¤ mashriq mein dhansna, maghrib mein dhansna aur Jazeera-tul-Arab mein dhansna, Isa ka nazool, Yajooj Majooj ka khulna aur Adan ki teh se nikalne wali aag jo logon ko hashr ki taraf hankegi; wo un ke saath raat guzaregi jahan wo raat guzarein aur un ke saath dopahar guzaregi jahan wo dopahar guzarein."
"1636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sehri barkat hai jo Allah ne tumhein di hai, pas use na chhoro."
"1637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khush-bakht wo hai jo fitnon se door rakha gaya; aur jo aazmaya gaya aur sabr kiya."
"1638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salaam Allah taala ke naamon mein se aik naam hai, pas use aapas mein phelao."
"1639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Salaam Allah taala ke naamon mein se aik naam hai jo zameen mein rakha gaya, pas aapas mein salaam phelao."
"1640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qarz aadhe sadqe ki manind chalta hai."
"1641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hazir wo dekhta hai jo ghayab nahi dekhta."
"1642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj aur chaand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; unhein ¤ kisi ki maut ya zindagi ke liye gehan nahi lagta; pas jab tum ye dekho to Allah se dua karo, takbeer kaho, namaz parho aur sadqa karo. Ae ummat-e-Muhammad, Allah ki qasam Allah se zyada ghairat wala koi nahi ke us ka banda zina kare ya us ki londi zina kare. Ae ummat-e-Muhammad, Allah ki qasam agar tum jaante jo main jaanta hun to kam hanste aur zyada rote. Ae Allah, kiya maine pahuncha diya?"
"1643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj aur chaand aag mein do bhadke hue bail honge."
"1644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj aur chaand ko kisi ki maut ya zindagi ke liye gehan nahi lagta, lekin ye donon Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain jin se Allah apne bandon ko darata hai; pas jab tum ye dekho to namaz parho aur dua karo yahan tak ke jo tumhein laga hai wo khul jaye."
"1645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mahina untees din ka hota hai."
"1646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Boorha apne nafs par qaabu rakhta hai."
"1647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab shaitan namaz ki azaan sunta hai to us ke liye paadta hua palat-ta hai yahan tak ke apni aawaz na sune; phir jab khamoshi hoti hai to laut kar waswasa dalta hai; phir jab iqamat sunta hai to chala jata hai yahan tak ke apni aawaz na sune; phir jab khamoshi hoti hai to laut kar waswasa dalta hai."
"1648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab shaitan namaz ki azaan sunta hai to chala jata hai yahan tak ke Rauha ke muqaam par ho jata hai."
"1649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan mere saamne aaya aur mujh par zor lagaya taake meri namaz kaat de; pas Allah taala ne mujhe us par qaabu diya aur maine use daba diya; maine irada kiya ke use sutoon se bandh dun yahan tak ke tum subah ko use dekho; phir mujhe Sulaiman ka qaul yaad aaya: Ae mere Rab, mujhe aisi badshahi de jo mere baad kisi ke laiq na ho; pas Allah ne use zaleel karke lauta diya."
"1650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan ne kaha: teri izzat ki qasam ae mere Rab, main tere bandon ko behkata rahunga jab tak un ki roohein un ke jismon mein hain. Rab ne farmaya: meri izzat aur jalaal ki qasam, main unhein bakhshta rahunga jab tak wo mujh se maghfirat mangein."
"1651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan namaz parhne walon ke use poojne se mayoos ho gaya hai, lekin un ke darmiyan uksane mein laga hai."
"1652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan Ibn Adam ke liye us ke raston par betha: us ke liye Islam ke raaste par betha aur kaha: tum Islam laate ho aur apna aur apne baap-dadaon ka deen chhorte ho? Pas us ne us ki nafarmani ki aur Islam laya. Phir us ke liye hijrat ke raaste par betha aur kaha: tum hijrat karte ho aur apni zameen aur aasman chhorte ho? Muhajir ki misaal rassi mein bandhe ghore jaisi hai. Pas us ne us ki nafarmani ki aur hijrat ki. Phir us ke ¤ liye jihaad ke raaste par betha aur kaha: tum jihaad karte ho jo jaan aur maal ki mehnat hai; tum qitaal karoge, qatl kiye jaoge, aurat se nikah kiya jayega aur maal taqseem kiya jayega? Pas us ne us ki nafarmani ki aur jihaad kiya. Pas jo aisa kare to Allah par haq hai ke use jannat mein dakhil kare; jo qatl kiya gaya to Allah par haq hai ke use jannat mein dakhil kare; agar doob gaya to Allah par haq hai ke use jannat mein dakhil kare; agar us ki sawari ne use giraya to Allah par haq hai ke use jannat mein dakhil kare."
"1653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan us khane ko halal samajhta hai jis par Allah ka naam na liya gaya ho; jab ye dehati is ke saath aaya taake us ke zariye halal kare to maine us ka haath pakar liya; ye londi is ke saath aayi taake us ke zariye halal kare to maine us ka haath pakar liya. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, beshak us ka haath mere haath mein hai un donon ke haathon ke saath."
"1654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tum se darta hai, ae Umar."
"1655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tum mein se kisi ke paas us ki namaz mein aata hai aur us par khalt-mal kar deta hai yahan tak ke wo nahi jaanta ke us ne kitni parhi; pas jab tum mein se koi ye paye to salaam se pehle beth kar do sajde kare phir salaam phere."
"1656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tum mein se kisi ke paas aata hai aur kehta hai: aasman ko kis ne paida kiya? Wo kehta hai: Allah ne. Wo kehta hai: zameen ko kis ne paida kiya? Wo kehta hai: Allah ne. Wo kehta hai: Allah ko kis ne paida kiya? Pas jab tum mein se koi ye paye to kahe: main Allah aur us ke Rasool par iman laya."
"1657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tum mein se kisi ke paas aata hai aur kehta hai: tumhein kis ne paida kiya? Wo kehta hai: ¤ Allah ne. Wo kehta hai: Allah ko kis ne paida kiya? Pas jab tum mein se koi ye paye to kahe: main Allah aur us ke Rasoolon par iman laya; kyunke ye us se door ho jayega."
"1658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan Ibn Adam mein khoon ki rawani ki tarah daurta hai."
"1659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan tum mein se kisi ke paas us ke har kaam mein hazir hota hai yahan tak ke us ke khane mein hazir hota hai; pas jab tum mein se kisi ka luqma gir jaye to jo naapaaki us mein ho use saaf kare phir use khaye aur use shaitan ke liye na chhore; phir jab farigh ho to apni ungliyan chaate, kyunke wo nahi jaanta ke us ke khane ke kis hisse mein barkat hai."
"1660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nek logon par sakhti ki jati hai; momin ko kaante ki chubhan se lekar us se oopar jo museebat pahunche, us ke zariye us se gunah mita diya jata hai aur us ke liye darja buland kiya jata hai."
"1661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr pehli chot ke waqt hai."
"1662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Azeem chattan jahannum ke kinare se phenki jayegi aur sattar saal girti rahegi, us ke qaraar tak nahi pahunchegi."
"1663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa hamare liye halal nahi, aur qaum ka azaad-karda unhi mein se hai."
"1664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sadqa Aal Muhammad ke liye munasib nahi, wo logon ka meil hai."
"1665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sach neki ki taraf rehbari karta hai aur neki jannat ki taraf rehbari karti hai; aadmi sach bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke paas siddeeq likha jata hai. Jhoot bad-kaari ki taraf rehbari karta hai aur bad-kaari aag ki taraf rehbari karti hai; aadmi jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke paas kazzaab likha jata hai."
"1666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paak mitti paaki hai jab tak tum paani na pao chahe das hajj tak; phir jab paani pao to use apni khaal se lagao."
"1667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paak mitti Musalman ka wuzu hai chahe das saal paani na paye; phir jab paani paye to use apni khaal se lagaye, kyunke yehi behtar hai."
"1668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch namazein gunahon ko aise door karti hain jaise paani meil ko door karta hai."
"1669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zulm qayamat ke din andhere hain."
"1670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda ghalti se gunah kare to us ke dil mein kaala daagh lagaya jata hai; phir agar wo ruke, maghfirat mange aur tauba kare to us ka dil saaf kiya jata hai; agar wo laute to us mein izafa kiya jata hai yahan tak ke us ke ¤ dil par chha jata hai; yehi wo zang hai jiska Allah taala ne zikr kiya: Hargiz nahi, balke un ke dilon par zang hai jo wo kamate thay."
"1671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda namaz ke liye khara hota hai to us ke tamam gunah laye jate hain aur us ke sar aur kandhon par rakhe jate hain; phir jab wo ruku ya sajda karta hai to us se jhar jate hain."
"1672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda kisi cheez par laanat kare to laanat aasman ki taraf charhti hai aur aasman ke darwaze us ke aage band ho jate hain, phir zameen ki taraf utarti hai aur us ke darwaze us ke aage band ho jate hain, phir dayen-bayen leti hai; phir jab use raasta na mile to us ki taraf laut-ti hai jis par laanat ki gayi; phir agar wo us ka ahl ho warna kehne wale ki taraf laut-ti hai."
"1673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda beemar ho to Allah apne farishton ki taraf wahi karta hai: maine apne bande ko apne bandhanon mein se aik bandhan se bandha hai; agar main use wafaat dun to use bakhsh dunga, agar use aafiyat dun to wo betha jabke us par koi gunah nahi."
"1674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda apne aaqa ki khair-khwahi kare aur apne Rab ki ibadat achchi kare to us ke liye dogna ajr hai."
"1675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab banda apni qabr mein rakha jata hai aur us ke saathi us se laut jate hain yahan tak ke wo un ke jooton ki aahat sunta hai, us ke paas do farishte aate hain aur use bithate hain aur us se kehte hain: is aadmi ke baare mein tum kiya kehte thay? Yaani Muhammad ke baare mein. Momin ke baare mein: wo kehta hai: main gawahi deta hun ke wo Allah ke bande aur us ke Rasool hain; ¤ phir us se kaha jata hai: aag mein apne thikane ko dekho, Allah ne us ke badle tumhein jannat mein thikana diya hai; pas wo donon ko dekhta hai, us ki qabr mein us ke liye sattar haath kushadagi ki jati hai aur us par sabza bhar diya jata hai us din tak jab wo uthaye jayenge. Kafir ya munafiq ke baare mein: us se kaha jata hai: is aadmi ke baare mein tum kiya kehte thay? Wo kehta hai: main nahi jaanta, main wahi kehta tha jo log kehte thay. Pas us se kaha jata hai: na tum ne jaana na tum ne padha. Phir use lohe ke hathore se us ki donon kaanon ke darmiyan aik zarb maari jati hai aur wo cheekhta hai jise us ke qareeb wale sunte hain siwaye jinn o ins ke, aur us par us ki qabr tang ki jati hai yahan tak ke us ki pasliyan aik doosri mein dakhil ho jati hain."
"1676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab momin banda duniya se katne aur aakhirat ki taraf aane mein ho to aasman se safed chehron wale farishte utarte hain goya un ke chehre suraj hain, un ke saath jannat ke kafanon mein se kafan aur jannat ke hunoot mein se hunoot hai, yahan tak ke wo us se nazar ki had tak beth jate hain. Phir Maut ka farishta aata hai yahan tak ke us ke sar ke paas bethta hai aur kehta hai: ae achchi rooh, Allah ki maghfirat aur raza ki taraf nikal. Pas wo nikalti hai aur behti hai jaise mashke ke munh se qatra behta hai; pas wo use pakarta hai, aur jab use pakarta hai to wo use us ke haath mein palak jhapakne tak nahi chhorte yahan tak ke use lete hain aur use us kafan aur us hunoot mein rakhte hain; us se zameen par payi gayi sab se achchi mushk ki khushbu nikalti hai. Pas wo use lekar charhte hain aur farishton ki kisi jama'at par nahi guzarte magar wo kehte hain: ye achchi rooh kiya hai? Wo kehte hain: falan bin falan, un ke un achche naamon se jin se wo duniya mein pukare jate thay, yahan tak ke wo use duniya ke aasman tak le jate hain aur us ke liye khulwaya jata hai to us ke liye khol diya jata hai; har aasman ke muqarrabeen use agle aasman tak rukhsat karte hain yahan tak ke wo saatwein aasman tak pahunchta hai. Phir Allah azza wa jal farmata hai: mere bande ki kitaab Illiyyeen mein likho ¤ aur mere bande ko zameen ki taraf lauta do, kyunke maine unhein us se paida kiya, us mein unhein lautaunga aur us se unhein dobara nikalunga. Pas us ki rooh lautayi jati hai aur us ke paas do farishte aate hain aur use bithate hain aur us se kehte hain: tumhara Rab kaun hai? Wo kehta hai: mera Rab Allah hai. Wo us se kehte hain: tumhara deen kiya hai? Wo kehta hai: mera deen Islam hai. Wo us se kehte hain: ye aadmi kaun hai jo tum mein bheja gaya tha? Wo kehta hai: wo Allah ke Rasool hain. Wo us se kehte hain: tumhara ilm kiya hai? Wo kehta hai: maine Allah ki kitaab padhi aur us par iman laya aur tasdeeq ki. Pas aasman se pukaarne wala pukaarta hai: mere bande ne sach kaha; pas use jannat se bichhao, use jannat se pehnao aur us ke liye jannat ki taraf darwaza khol do. Pas us ke paas us ki khushbu aur us ki khushgawari aati hai, us ki qabr mein us ke liye us ki nazar ki had tak kushadagi ki jati hai. Us ke paas achche chehre wala, achche kapron wala, achchi khushbu wala aadmi aata hai aur kehta hai: tumhein khushkhabri ho us se jo tumhein khush kare; ye tumhara wo din hai jis ka tum se wada kiya jata tha. Wo us se kehta hai: tum kaun ho? Tumhara chehra wo chehra hai jo bhalayi lekar aata hai. Wo kehta hai: main tumhara naik amal hun. Wo kehta hai: ae mere Rab, qayamat qaim kar, ae mere Rab, qayamat qaim kar, taake main apne ghar walon aur apne maal ki taraf lautoon. ¤ Kafir bande ke baare mein: jab wo duniya se katne aur aakhirat ki taraf aane mein ho to aasman se kaale chehron wale farishte utarte hain, un ke saath tat hain; wo us se nazar ki had tak beth jate hain. Phir Maut ka farishta aata hai yahan tak ke us ke sar ke paas bethta hai aur kehta hai: ae khabees rooh, Allah ki narazi aur ghusse ki taraf nikal. Pas wo us ke jism mein bikharti hai aur wo use kheenchta hai jaise geeli oon se seekh kheenchi jati hai; pas wo use pakarta hai, aur jab use pakarta hai to wo use us ke haath mein palak jhapakne tak nahi chhorte yahan tak ke use un taton mein rakhte hain; us se zameen par payi gayi sab se badtareen murdaar ki badbu nikalti hai. Pas wo use lekar charhte hain aur farishton ki kisi jama'at par us ke saath nahi guzarte magar wo kehte hain: ye khabees rooh kiya hai? Wo kehte hain: falan bin falan, un ke un bure naamon se jin se wo duniya mein pukara jata tha. Pas us ke liye khulwaya jata hai aur us ke liye nahi khola jata; phir unhon ne padha: Un ke liye aasman ke darwaze nahi khole jayenge. Phir Allah azza wa jal farmata hai: us ki kitaab neeche ki zameen mein Sijjeen mein likho; pas us ki rooh ¤ phenk kar girayi jati hai. Phir us ki rooh us ke jism mein lautayi jati hai; us ke paas do farishte aate hain aur use bithate hain aur us se kehte hain: tumhara Rab kaun hai? Wo kehta hai: haaye haaye, main nahi jaanta. Wo us se kehte hain: tumhara deen kiya hai? Wo kehta hai: haaye haaye, main nahi jaanta. Wo us se kehte hain: ye aadmi kaun hai jo tum mein bheja gaya tha? Wo kehta hai: haaye haaye, main nahi jaanta. Pas aasman se pukaarne wala pukaarta hai: mere bande ne jhoot kaha; pas use aag se bichhao aur us ke liye aag ki taraf darwaza khol do. Pas us ke paas us ki garmi aur us ki lapet aati hai, us par us ki qabr tang ki jati hai yahan tak ke us ki pasliyan aik doosri mein dakhil ho jati hain. Us ke paas bure chehre wala, bure kapron wala, badbudar aadmi aata hai aur kehta hai: tumhein khushkhabri ho us se jo tumhein naraaz kare; ye tumhara wo din hai jis ka tum se wada kiya jata tha. Wo kehta hai: tum kaun ho? Tumhara chehra wo chehra hai jo burayi lekar aata hai. Wo kehta hai: main tumhara bura amal hun. Wo kehta hai: ae mere Rab, qayamat qaim na kar."
"1677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda apne kharch mein sab par ajr pata hai siwaye imaarat ke."
"1678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda aisa kalima kehta hai jis mein wo wazeh nahi karta aur us ke zariye aag mein utna door girta hai jitna mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan fasla hai."
"1679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din paseena zameen mein sattar haath jayega aur wo logon ke munhon ya un ke kaanon tak pahunchega."
"1680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab ulema apne Rab ke paas hazir honge to Muaz bin Jabal un ke aage pathar ki pheink ke fasle par honge."
"1681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar aadmi ko Allah taala ke izn se lagti hai yahan tak ke wo buland jagah charhta hai phir us se girta hai."
"1682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dagha-baaz ke liye qayamat ke din jhanda gaara jayega aur kaha jayega: khabardar, ye falan bin falan ki dagha hai."
"1683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raan satr hai."
"1684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qabr aakhirat ki manzilon mein pehli hai; phir agar wo us se nijaat paye to jo us ke baad hai us se aasaan hai; agar wo us se nijaat na paye to jo us ke baad hai us se sakht hai."
"1685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dil Allah ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmiyan hain, wo unhein palat-ta hai."
"1686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shareef bin shareef bin shareef Yusuf bin Yaqub bin Ishaq bin Ibrahim hain; agar main qaid mein hota jitna wo rahe phir mere paas qasid aata to main jawab deta. Loot par Allah ki rehmat ho, wo mazboot sahaare ki taraf panah lete thay: unhon ne kaha: kaash mere paas tumhare muqable mein taqat hoti ya main mazboot sahaare ki taraf panah leta. Pas Allah ne us ke baad koi Nabi nahi bheja magar us ki qaum ki bulandi mein."
"1687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ne unhein duniya mein pairon par chalaya wo ¤ qayamat ke din unhein chehron par chalane par qadir hai."
"1688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ne marz utaara us ne shifa utaari."
"1689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ne us ka peena haram kiya us ne us ka bechna haram kiya, yaani sharab ka."
"1690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki zakaat ada nahi karta, qayamat ke din us ke liye us ka maal ganje saanp ki surat mein kiya jayega jis ke donon aankhon par do nukte honge; wo us se chimtega ya use haar pehnayega aur kahega: main tumhara khazana hun, main tumhara khazana hun."
"1691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apni biwi ke paas us ke peeche ke muqaam mein aata hai, Allah qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahi dekhega."
"1692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo chaandi aur sone ke bartanon mein khata ya peeta hai, wo apne pet mein jahannum ki aag undel raha hai."
"1693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo apne kapre takabbur se kheenchta hai, Allah qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahi dekhega."
"1694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo mujh par jhoot bolta hai us ke liye aag mein ghar banaya jata hai."
"1695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo ye tasweerein banate hain unhein qayamat ke din azab diya jayega aur un se kaha jayega: jo tum ne banaya use zinda karo."
"1696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo beri ke darakht kaatte hain un par aag mein un ke saron par undela jayega."
"1697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhare liye aur us ke Rasool ne inkar kiya hai ke tumhare liye logon ke haathon ka meil kiya jaye."
"1698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne us ke baare mein mujh par teen baar inkar kiya hai jo momin ko qatl kare."
"1699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne har bid'at wale par tauba rok di hai."
"1700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne namaz mein naya kiya hai ke tum kalaam na karo siwaye Allah ke zikr aur jo tumhare laiq ho ke tum Allah ke liye khaamoshi se kharay ho."
"1701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Adam ki peeth se Na'man mein Arafa ke din ehad liya aur us ki peeth se har zurrat nikali jo us ne phelayi thi; phir unhein us ke saamne zurron ki tarah bikhra; phir ¤ un se aamne-saamne kalaam kiya aur farmaya: Kiya main tumhara Rab nahi? Unhon ne kaha: kyun nahi."
"1702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Adam ki zurrat us ki peeth se li phir unhein un par gawah banaya: Kiya main tumhara Rab nahi? Unhon ne kaha: kyun nahi. Phir unhein apni hatheliyon mein bahaya aur farmaya: ye jannat mein hain aur ye aag mein hain; jannat wale jannat walon ke amal ke liye aasaan kiye gaye hain aur aag wale aag walon ke amal ke liye aasaan kiye gaye hain."
"1703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe nikah se nikala, zina se nahi nikala."
"1704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ghar walon se mohabbat karta hai to un par narmi dakhil karta hai."
"1705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala kisi bande se mohabbat karta hai to Jibreel ko pukarta hai aur farmata hai: main falan se mohabbat karta hun, pas tum us se mohabbat karo; pas Jibreel us se mohabbat karte hain. Phir aasman mein nida karte hain aur kehte hain: Allah taala falan se mohabbat karta hai, pas tum us se mohabbat karo; pas aasman wale us se mohabbat karte hain. Phir us ke liye zameen mein qabooliyat rakhi jati hai. Aur jab kisi bande se bughz rakhta hai to Jibreel ko pukarta hai aur farmata hai: main falan se bughz rakhta hun, pas tum us se bughz rakho; pas Jibreel us se bughz rakhte hain. Phir aasman walon mein nida karte hain: Allah falan se bughz rakhta hai, pas tum us se bughz rakho; pas wo us se bughz rakhte hain. Phir us ke liye zameen mein nafrat rakhi jati hai."
"1706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi qaum se mohabbat karta hai to unhein aazmata hai; pas jo sabr kare us ke liye sabr hai aur jo be-qarari kare us ke liye be-qarari hai."
"1707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala apne bandon mein se kisi ummat par rehm ka irada karta hai to us ke Nabi ko us se pehle wafaat deta hai aur use us ke liye pesh-rou aur aage aane wala bana deta hai; aur jab kisi ummat ki halaakat ka irada karta hai to use azab deta hai jabke us ka Nabi zinda hota hai; pas use halaak karta hai jabke wo dekh raha hota hai, aur us ki halaakat se us ki aankh thandi karta hai jab unhon ne use jhutlaya aur us ke hukm ki nafarmani ki."
"1708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi cheez ko wadee'at mein rakhe to us ki hifazat karta hai."
"1709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi Nabi ko khana khilaye to wo us ke liye hai jo us ke baad khara ho."
"1710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala apne ghusse ko apne sazawar logon par utaare aur kuch naik logon ki umrein aa jayen to wo un ki halaakat se halaak hote hain, phir wo apni neeyaton aur aamaal par uthaye jayenge."
"1711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala kisi bande par ne'mat kare to pasand karta hai ke ne'mat ka asar us par dekha jaye; tang-dasti aur tang-dasti zahir karne ko na-pasand karta hai; israar karne wale saail se bughz rakhta hai; haya-daar paak-daaman be-niyaz se mohabbat karta hai."
"1712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande par ne'mat kare to pasand karta hai ke apne bande par apni ne'mat ka asar dekhe."
"1713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab qayamat ka din hoga to Allah bandon ke darmiyan faisla karne ke liye utrega jabke har ummat ghutnon par hogi; pas sab se pehle jis se pukara jayega wo aadmi jo Quran jama karta tha, wo aadmi jo Allah ke raaste mein qatl kiya gaya aur bahut maal wala aadmi. Allah qaari se farmayega: kiya maine tumhein wo nahi sikhaya jo maine apne Rasool par naazil kiya? Wo kahega: kyun nahi, ae mere Rab. Wo farmayega: tum ne jo seekha us par kiya amal kiya? Wo kahega: main raat aur din ke auqaat mein us par qaim rehta tha. Allah us se farmayega: tum ne jhoot kaha; farishte us se kahenge: tum ne jhoot kaha. Allah us se farmayega: balke tum ne chaha ke kaha jaye falan qaari hai, aur ye kaha ja chuka. Maal wale ko laya jayega to Allah us se farmayega: kiya maine tum par kushadagi nahi ki thi yahan tak ke maine tumhein kisi ka mohtaaj nahi chhora tha? Wo kahega: kyun nahi, ae mere Rab. Wo farmayega: jo maine tumhein diya us mein tum ne kiya amal kiya? Wo kahega: main sil-e-rehmi karta tha aur sadqa deta tha. Allah us se farmayega: tum ne jhoot kaha; farishte kahenge: tum ne jhoot kaha. Allah farmayega: balke tum ne chaha ke kaha jaye falan sakhi hai, aur ye kaha ja chuka. Jo Allah ke raaste mein qatl kiya gaya use laya jayega to Allah farmayega: tum kis mein qatl kiye gaye? Wo kahega: mujhe tere raaste mein jihaad ka hukm diya gaya to maine qitaal kiya yahan tak ke qatl kiya gaya. Allah us se farmayega: tum ne jhoot kaha; farishte us se kahenge: tum ne jhoot kaha. Allah farmayega: balke tum ne chaha ke kaha jaye falan bahadur hai, aur ye kaha ja chuka. Ae Abu Huraira, ye teen Allah ki makhlooq mein sab se pehle hain jin se qayamat ke din aag bhadkayi jayegi."
"1714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe ijazat di hai ke main murgh ke baare mein bayan karun jis ke pair zameen ko cheer gaye hain aur us ki gardan Arsh ke neeche muri hui hai; wo kehta hai: Tu paak hai, Tu kitna azeem hai; ¤ pas use jawab diya jata hai: wo nahi jaanta jo mujh par jhooti qasam khata hai."
"1715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe pahunchaane wala bhej kar bheja hai, sakhti karne wala bhej kar nahi bheja."
"1716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mere liye Shaam ko mere saamne kiya aur meri peeth ke peeche Yaman kiya aur mujh se farmaya: Ae Muhammad, maine jo tumhare saamne hai use tumhare liye ghanimat aur rizq banaya hai, jo tumhari peeth ke peeche hai use madad banaya hai; Islam barhta rahega aur shirk aur us ke rehne wale ghat-te rahenge yahan tak ke do auratein safar karengi aur sirf zulm se darengi. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, din aur raatein nahi jayengi yahan tak ke ye deen is sitare ke pahunchne tak pahunchega."
"1717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne Ismail ki aulaad mein se Kinana ko muntakhab kiya, Kinana mein se Quraish ko muntakhab kiya, Quraish mein se Bani Hashim ko muntakhab kiya aur mujhe Bani Hashim mein se muntakhab kiya."
"1718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne kalaam mein se chaar ko muntakhab kiya: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah aur Allahu Akbar. Pas jo Subhanallah kahe us ke liye bees nekiyan likhi jayengi aur us se bees gunah mitaye jayenge; jo Allahu Akbar kahe us ke liye aisa hi hai; jo La ilaha illallah kahe us ke liye aisa hi hai; jo apni taraf se Alhamdulillahi Rabbil Aalameen kahe us ke liye tees nekiyan likhi jayengi aur us se tees khataein mitayi jayengi."
"1719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne Ehl-e-Badr par nazar ki aur farmaya: jo ¤ chaho karo, maine tumhein bakhsh diya."
"1720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne har haq-daar ko us ka haq diya hai, pas waaris ke liye waseeyat nahi; bachcha bistar wale ka hai aur zaani ke liye pathar hai."
"1721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhein tumhari wafaat ke waqt tumhare maalon ka teesra hissa tumhare aamaal mein izafe ke liye diya hai."
"1722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne bandon par har din-raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain."
"1723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe hukm diya ke Madina ka naam Tayyiba rakhun."
"1724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Yahya bin Zakariya ko paanch kalimaat ka hukm diya ke wo un par amal karein aur Bani Israel ko hukm dein ke wo un par amal karein; goya unhon ne un mein der ki to Allah ne Isa ki taraf wahi ki: ya wo unhein pahuncha dein ya tum unhein pahuncha do. Pas Isa un ke paas aaye aur un se kaha: tumhein paanch kalimaat ka hukm diya gaya hai ke tum un par amal karo aur Bani Israel ko hukm do ke wo un par amal karein; ya tum unhein pahuncha do ya main unhein pahuncha dun. Unhon ne un se kaha: ae Roohullah, mujhe darr hai ke agar tum mujh par sabqat kar gaye to mujhe azab diya jayega ya mujhe dhansa diya jayega. Pas Yahya ne Bani Israel ko Bait-ul-Maqdis mein jama kiya yahan tak ke masjid bhar gayi; wo chaton par bethe, Allah ki hamd ki aur us ki sana ki, phir kaha: Allah ne mujhe paanch kalimaat ka hukm diya hai ke main un par amal karun aur tumhein hukm dun ke tum un par amal karo. Pehli: Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo; kyunke jo Allah ke saath shirk kare us ki misaal ¤ us aadmi jaisi hai jo apne khaalis maal se sonay ya chaandi se ghulam kharide phir use ghar mein basaye aur kahe: kaam kar aur mere paas la; pas ghulam kaam kare aur us ke aaqa ke siwa ko laaye; tum mein se kaun raazi hai ke us ka ghulam aisa ho? Allah ne tumhein paida kiya aur rizq diya, pas us ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo. ¤ Tumhein namaz ka hukm deta hun; jab tum namaz ke liye kharay ho to idhar-udhar na dekho, kyunke Allah azza wa jal apne chehre se apne bande ki taraf mutawajje hota hai jab tak wo idhar-udhar na dekhe. ¤ Tumhein roze ka hukm deta hun; us ki misaal us aadmi jaisi hai jis ke paas jama'at mein mushk ki thaili ho, wo sab mushk ki khushbu paate hain; rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se achchi hai. ¤ Tumhein sadqe ka hukm deta hun; us ki misaal us aadmi jaisi hai jise dushman ne qaid kiya aur us ke donon haath us ki ¤ gardan se bandh diye aur use pesh kiya taake us ki gardan maarein; pas us ne un se kaha: kiya tumhare liye ye hai ke main apne aap ko tum se fidya de dun? Pas wo thore aur bahut se un se apne aap ka fidya deta raha yahan tak ke us ne apne aap ko chhura liya. Aur tumhein Allah ke zikr ka hukm deta hun kasrat se; us ki misaal us aadmi jaisi hai jis ke peeche dushman tez daudta hua aaya aur wo mazboot qile mein aaya aur us mein apne aap ko mehfooz kiya; banda shaitan se sab se zyada mehfooz tab hota hai jab wo Allah taala ke zikr mein ho. Aur main tumhein paanch ka hukm deta hun jin ka Allah ne mujhe hukm diya hai: jama'at, sunna, itaat, hijrat aur Allah ke raaste mein jihaad; kyunke jo jama'at se baalisht bhar juda hua us ne apni gardan se Islam ka patta utaar diya siwaye is ke ke wo laut aaye; jo jahiliyyat ki dawat de wo jahannum ke eendhan mein se hai chahe wo roza rakhe, namaz parhe aur gumaan kare ke wo Musalman hai; pas Allah ki dawat se pukaro jis se us ne tumhein Musalman momin Allah ke bande kaha hai."
"1725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki: aajizi karo yahan tak ke koi kisi par fakhr na kare aur koi kisi par zulm na kare."
"1726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne meri taraf wahi ki: aajizi karo aur tum mein se koi kisi par zulm na kare."
"1727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki: jo ilm ki talash mein raaste par chale us ke liye jannat ka raasta aasaan kiya jayega; jis ki donon qeemti cheezein le li jayen us par un donon ke badle jannat sabit hogi; ilm mein fazilat ibadat mein fazilat se behtar hai; deen ki bunyaad parhezgaari hai."
"1728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe har surkh aur kaale ki taraf bheja hai; meri madad rob se ki gayi; mere liye maal-e-ghanimat halal kiya gaya; mere liye zameen masjid aur paak karne wali banayi gayi; mujhe qayamat ke din meri ummat ke gunahgaaron ke liye shafa'at di gayi."
"1729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne meri ummat se us se darguzar kiya hai jo un ke seene waswasa dalte hain jab tak wo amal na karein ya kalaam na karein, aur jo un se zabardasti karaya gaya."
"1730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne meri ummat se us se darguzar kiya hai jo un ke nafs baat karein jab tak wo kalaam na karein ya amal na karein."
"1731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne meri wajah se meri ummat se ghalti, bhool aur jo un se zabardasti karaya gaya muaf kiya hai."
"1732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne meri wajah se meri ummat se us se darguzar kiya hai jo un ke seene waswasa dalte hain jab tak wo amal na karein ya kalaam na karein."
"1733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne tum par tumhari wafaat ke waqt tumhare maalon ka teesra hissa sadqa kiya hai aur use tumhare aamaal mein tumhare liye izafa banaya hai."
"1734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tum par tumhare is jama hone mein meharban hua, pas tumhare bure kaar ko tumhare naik kaar ke liye bakhsh diya aur tumhare naik kaar ko jo us ne manga diya; Allah ke naam se kooch karo."
"1735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne sehri aur naap mein barkat rakhi hai."
"1736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne haq ko Umar ki zaban aur us ke dil par rakha hai."
"1737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne poori duniya ko thora banaya hai, aur us mein se sirf thora baaqi hai jaise gadha jis ka saaf paani pi liya gaya aur ganda baaqi raha."
"1738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne is ummat ka azab duniya mein rakha hai: qatl."
"1739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne jo Ibn Adam se nikalta hai use duniya ke liye misaal banaya hai."
"1740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne ye chaand auqaat banaye hain; pas jab tum use dekho to roza rakho aur jab tum use dekho to iftar karo; phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to tees gino."
"1741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala khubsurat hai aur khubsurti ko pasand karta hai."
"1742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala khubsurat hai aur khubsurti ko pasand karta hai; pasand karta hai ke apne bande par apni ne'mat ka asar dekhe; tang-dasti aur tang-dasti zahir karne se bughz rakhta hai."
"1743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala khubsurat hai aur khubsurti ko pasand karta hai; aala akhlaq ko pasand karta hai aur ghatiya ko na-pasand karta hai."
"1744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala sakhi hai, sakhawat ko pasand karta hai, aala akhlaq ko pasand karta hai aur ghatiya ko na-pasand karta hai."
"1745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Makkah se haathi ko roka aur us par Allah ke Rasool aur mominon ko ghalib kiya; khabardar, wo mujh se pehle kisi ke liye halal nahi hui aur mere baad kisi ke liye halal nahi hogi; khabardar, wo mere liye din ke aik hisse mein halal hui; khabardar, ye meri ghari haram hai: us ke kaante na ukhaare jayen, us ke darakht na kaate jayen, us ki giri hui cheez na uthayi jaye siwaye elaan karne wale ke; jis ka koi maqtool qatl kiya gaya to wo donon behtar nazaron mein se hai: ya diyat li jaye ya qisas liya jaye, maqtool ke ghar walon ke liye."
"1746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sharab ko haram kiya, murdaar aur us ki qeemat ko haram kiya, khinzeer aur us ki qeemat ko haram kiya."
"1747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne meri ummat par sharab, juwa, mizr, kooba aur ghubaira ko haram kiya hai, aur mujhe witr ki namaz zyada di hai."
"1748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tum par sharab, juwa, mizr, kooba ko haram kiya hai; har nashawar haram hai."
"1749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne tum par haram kiya hai: maaon ki nafarmani, betiyon ko zinda dafnana, rokna aur mangna; tumhare liye na-pasand kiya hai: qeel-o-qaal, kasrat se sawal aur maal zaya karna."
"1750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujh par aur mere ghar walon par sadqa haram kiya hai."
"1751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Makkah ko us din haram qaraar diya jis din aasman aur zameen paida kiye; pas wo Allah ki hurmat se qayamat ke din tak haram hai; wo mujh se pehle kisi ke liye halal nahi hui aur mere baad kisi ke liye halal nahi hogi; wo mere liye kabhi halal nahi hui siwaye zamane ke aik hisse ke: us ka shikar na bhagaya jaye, us ke kaante na kaate jayen, us ki ghaas na ukhaari jaye, us ki giri hui cheez halal nahi siwaye elaan karne wale ke."
"1752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne raza'at se wo haram kiya hai jo paidaish se haram kiya hai."
"1753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne doodh ke rishte se wo haram kiya hai jo nasab se haram kiya hai."
"1754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne jahan marz paida kiya wahan dawa paida ki; pas ilaaj karo."
"1755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah ne makhlooq ko paida kiya to apne haath se apne nafs par likha: meri rehmat mere ghusse par ghalib hai."
"1756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala haya-daar parda-posh hai, haya aur parda ko pasand karta hai; pas jab tum mein se koi ghusl kare to parda kare."
"1757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala haya-daar sakhi hai, haya karta hai jab aadmi us ki taraf apne haath uthaye ke unhein khaali naakaam lautaye."
"1758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Adam ko paida kiya phir us ki peeth se makhlooq li aur farmaya: ye jannat mein hain aur mujhe parwa nahi, ye aag mein hain aur mujhe parwa nahi."
"1759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne Adam ko mutthi se paida kiya jo us ne poori zameen se li thi; pas Bani Adam zameen ke mutabiq aaye: un mein surkh, safed, kaale aaye aur is ke darmiyan; narm, sakht, khabees, achche aaye aur is ke darmiyan."
"1760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne jannat aur aag ko paida kiya; pas is ke liye rehne wale banaye aur us ke liye rehne wale banaye."
"1761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne makhlooq ko paida kiya yahan tak ke jab apni makhlooq se farigh hua to rishtedari khari hui aur kaha: meh? Us ne kaha: ye qat'a-rehmi se panah mangne wale ka muqaam hai. Us ne farmaya: haan, kiya tum raazi nahi ke main us se milun jo tum se mile aur us se katun jo tum se kate? Us ne kaha: kyun nahi, ae mere Rab. Us ne farmaya: ye tumhare liye hai."
"1762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne marz aur dawa ko paida kiya; pas ilaaj karo aur haram se ilaaj na karo."
"1763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne rehmat ko us din paida kiya jis din use paida kiya: sau rehmatein; pas apne paas ninyanwe rehmatein rok lein aur apni tamam makhlooq mein aik rehmat bheji. Kafir agar wo sab jaane jo Allah ke paas rehmat mein se hai to jannat se mayoos na ho; momin agar wo jaane jo Allah ke paas azab mein se hai to aag se aman na paye."
"1764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne apni makhlooq ko andhere mein paida kiya aur un par apne noor mein se dala; pas jise us din us noor mein se laga wo hidayat paya, jise na laga wo gumrah hua."
"1765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sau rehmatein paida kein; un mein se aik rehmat makhlooq ke darmiyan baanti aur ninyanwe qayamat ke din tak rok lein."
"1766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sau rehmatein paida kein aur apni makhlooq ke darmiyan aik rehmat phelayi; pas wo us ke zariye aik doosre par rehm karte hain; apne paas apne doston ke liye ninyanwe zakheera kein."
"1767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne us din sau rehmatein paida kein jis din aasman aur zameen paida kiye; har rehmat aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan ke barabar hai; pas us mein se zameen mein aik rehmat rakhi; us ke zariye maa apne bachche par, jangli janwar aur parinde aik doosre par rehm karte hain; ninyanwe rok lein; phir jab qayamat ka din hoga to use is rehmat se poora karega."
"1768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah rehm karne wala haya-daar sakhi hai, apne bande se haya karta hai ke wo us ki taraf apne haath uthaye phir un mein bhalayi na rakhe."
"1769","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne is ummat ke liye aasaani pasand ki hai aur us ke liye tangi na-pasand ki hai."
"1770","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah narm hai, narmi ko pasand karta hai, us se raazi hota hai aur us par madad karta hai jo sakhti par madad nahi karta. Pas jab tum in paraye janwaron par sawaar ho to unhein un ki manzilon par utaro; agar zameen banjar ho to un par nijaat pao, kyunke zameen raat mein utni lapeti jati hai jitni din mein nahi lapeti jati; raaste mein parne se bacho, kyunke wo janwaron ka raasta aur saanpon ka thikana hai."
"1771","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala narm hai, narmi ko pasand karta hai aur us par wo deta hai jo sakhti par nahi deta."
"1772","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhein namaz zyada di hai, pas us ki hifazat karo; wo witr hai."
"1773","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mere liye zameen samet di aur maine us ke mashriq aur maghrib dekhe; meri ummat ki badshahi wahan tak pahunchegi jahan tak mere liye sameti gayi; mujhe surkh aur safed donon khazane diye gaye; maine apne Rab se apni ummat ke liye sawal kiya ke wo unhein aam qehet se halaak na kare aur un par un ke siwa dushman musallat na kare jo un ki jad kaat de. Mere Rab azza wa jal ne farmaya: Ae Muhammad, jab main faisla karun to wo lauta nahi jata; maine tumhein tumhari ummat ke liye diya ke main unhein aam qehet se halaak nahi karunga aur un par un ke siwa dushman musallat nahi karunga jo un ki jad kaat de, chahe un par un ke kinaron se jama ho jayen, yahan tak ke un mein se kuch kuch ko fana karein. Main apni ummat par gumrah karne wale imaamon se darta hun; jab meri ummat mein ¤ talwar rakhi jayegi to qayamat ke din tak un se nahi uthayi jayegi. Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke meri ummat ke qabile mushrikon se mil jayen, meri ummat ke qabile buton ko poojein; meri ummat mein tees jhoote honge jo sab gumaan karenge ke wo Nabi hain, main nabiyon ka khaatim hun, mere baad koi Nabi nahi. Meri ummat ka aik giroh haq par zahir rahega aur unhein un ka chhorne wala nuqsan nahi pahunchayega yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aa jaye."
"1774","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala har nigraan se us ke baare mein sawal karega jo us ke supurd kiya gaya: us ne us ki hifazat ki ya use zaya kiya? Yahan tak ke aadmi se us ke ghar walon ke baare mein sawal kiya jayega."
"1775","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne Madina ka naam Taaba rakha hai."
"1776","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah qayamat ke din meri ummat mein se aik aadmi ko tamam makhlooq ke saamne alag karega aur us par ninyanwe daftar phelayega, har daftar nazar ki had jitna; phir farmayega: kiya tum is mein se kuch ka inkar karte ho? Kiya mere likhne wale muhafizon ne tum par zulm kiya? Wo kahega: nahi, ae mere Rab. Wo farmayega: kiya tumhare paas uzr hai? Wo kahega: nahi, ae mere Rab. Wo farmayega: kyun nahi, beshak hamare paas tumhare liye neki hai; aaj tum par koi zulm nahi. Pas aik bitaqa nikala jayega jis mein hai: main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur us ke Rasool hain. Wo farmayega: apne wazn mein hazir ho. Wo kahega: ae mere Rab, in daftaron ke saath ye bitaqa kiya hai? Kaha jayega: tum par zulm nahi kiya jayega. Pas daftar aik palre mein rakhe jayenge aur bitaqa aik palre mein; daftar halke honge ¤ aur bitaqa bhaari hoga; Allah taala ke naam ke saath koi cheez bhaari nahi."
"1777","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala har banane wale aur us ki banayi hui cheez ka banane wala hai."
"1778","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne duniya ko Ibn Adam ke khane ke liye misaal banaya aur Ibn Adam ke khane ko duniya ke liye misaal banaya, chahe use masale lagaye aur namak dalay."
"1779","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala muaf karne wala hai, muafi ko pasand karta hai."
"1780","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe nabiyon par chaar se fazilat di: mujhe tamam logon ki taraf bheja; mere liye aur meri ummat ke liye poori zameen paak karne wali aur masjid banayi; pas meri ummat ka aadmi jahan namaz paye us ke paas us ki masjid hai aur us ke paas us ka paak karne wala hai; meri madad aik mahine ki musafat se rob se ki; mere liye maal-e-ghanimat halal kiye."
"1781","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: ham ne maal namaz qaim karne aur zakaat dene ke liye naazil kiya; agar Ibn Adam ke liye waadi ho to wo chahega ke us ke liye doosri ho; agar us ke liye do waadiyan hon to wo chahega ke un ke liye teesri ho; Ibn Adam ka pet sirf mitti bharti hai; phir Allah us par tawajjuh karta hai jo tauba kare."
"1782","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne farmaya: jo mere wali se dushmani kare us se maine jang ka elaan kiya; mera banda mujh se kisi cheez se qareeb nahi hota jo mujhe us se zyada mehboob ho jo maine us par farz kiya; mera banda nawafil se mujh se qareeb hota rehta hai yahan tak ke main us se mohabbat karun; phir jab main us se mohabbat karun to main us ka kaan hun jis se wo sunta hai, us ki aankh hun jis se wo dekhta hai, us ka haath hun jis se wo pakarta hai aur us ka pair hun jis se wo chalta hai; agar wo mujh se mange to main use zaroor dunga, agar wo mujh se panah mange to main use zaroor panah dunga. Main kisi cheez ke karne mein utna mutaraddid nahi hua jitna momin ki jaan qabz karne mein mutaraddid hua: wo maut ko na-pasand karta hai aur main use naraaz karne ko na-pasand karta hun."
"1783","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne tumhari roohein qabz kein jab chaha aur tum par lautayein jab chaha; ae Bilal, utho aur logon mein namaz ki azaan do."
"1784","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mutthi bhari aur farmaya: ye apni rehmat se jannat ki taraf hai; mutthi bhari aur farmaya: ye aag ki taraf hai aur mujhe parwa nahi."
"1785","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe khaleel banaya hai."
"1786","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne meri ummat ko panah di hai ke wo gumrahi par jama ho."
"1787","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tum se jahiliyyat ka takabbur aur us ka ¤ baapon par fakhr door kar diya hai: muttaqi momin aur bad-kaar bad-bakht. Tum Bani Adam ho aur Adam mitti se hain; log apne fakhr ko aisi qaumon par chhor dein jo jahannum ke koylon mein se koyla hain, warna wo Allah ke nazdeek us gubrili se zyada haqeer honge jo apni naak se gandagi dhakelti hai."
"1788","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne har haq-daar ko us ka haq diya hai, pas waaris ke liye waseeyat nahi."
"1789","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne har haq-daar ko us ka haq diya hai, pas waaris ke liye waseeyat nahi; bachcha bistar wale ka hai aur zaani ke liye pathar hai, un ka hisab Allah par hai. Jo apne baap ke siwa ki taraf mansoob ho ya apne aaqaon ke siwa ki taraf mansoob ho, us par qayamat ke din tak Allah ki lagataar laanat hai. Aurat apne shohar ke ghar mein se kuch kharch na kare siwaye us ke shohar ke izn ke. Kaha gaya: khana bhi nahi? Farmaya: ye hamare maalon mein sab se afzal hai."
"1790","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne use us ke dekhne ke liye lamba kiya hai; pas agar tum par badal chha jaye to ginti poori karo."
"1791","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne us ka ajr us ki neeyat ke mutabiq waqe kiya hai."
"1792","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Jafar ke liye khoon se range hue do par banaye hain jin se wo farishton ke saath urte hain."
"1793","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne aag par us ko haram kiya hai jo La ilaha illallah kahe aur us se Allah ka chehra chahe."
"1794","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne har waaris ke liye meeraas mein se us ka hissa taqseem kiya hai; waaris ke liye waseeyat jaiz nahi; bachcha bistar wale ka hai aur zaani ke liye pathar hai. Jo apne baap ke siwa ki taraf mansoob ho ya apne aaqaon ke siwa ki taraf jhuke un se be-raghbat hokar, us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki laanat hai; Allah us se na badla qabool karega na fidya."
"1795","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne har cheez par ehsaan likha hai; pas jab qatl karo to qatl achcha karo, jab zibah karo to zibah achcha karo; tum mein se har aik apni chhuri tez kare aur apne zabeehe ko rahat de."
"1796","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne nekiyan aur buraiyan likhin phir unhein wazeh kiya; pas jo neki ka irada kare aur use na kare to Allah taala use apne paas poori neki likhta hai; phir agar us ka irada kare aur use kare to Allah taala use apne paas das nekiyon se saat sau guna tak, bahut guna tak likhta hai. Jo burayi ka irada kare aur use na kare to Allah use apne paas poori neki likhta hai; phir agar us ka irada kare aur use kare to Allah taala use aik burayi likhta hai; Allah par halaak hone wale ke siwa koi halaak nahi hota."
"1797","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne Ibn Adam par zina ka us ka hissa likha hai, wo use zaroor payega; pas aankh ka zina dekhna hai, zaban ka zina kalaam hai, nafs tamanna karta hai aur khwahish karta hai, sharmgah us ki tasdeeq karti hai ya takzeeb karti hai."
"1798","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tum par sa'i likhi hai, pas sa'i karo."
"1799","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne aasman aur zameen paida karne se do hazaar saal pehle kitaab likhi aur wo Arsh ke paas hai; us ne us mein se do aayaat naazil kein jin se Surah Baqarah ko khatm kiya; wo teen raaton mein ghar mein nahi parhi jatein ke shaitan us ke qareeb aaye."
"1800","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah sakhi hai, sakhi logon ko pasand karta hai, bakhshish karne wala hai, bakhshish ko pasand karta hai, aala akhlaq ko pasand karta hai aur ghatiya ko na-pasand karta hai."
"1801","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah sakhi hai, sakhawat ko pasand karta hai, aala akhlaq ko pasand karta hai aur ghatiya ko na-pasand karta hai."
"1802","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sharab par laanat ki: us ke nichorne wale, nichorwane wale, peene wale, pilane wale, uthane wale, jis ke liye uthayi jaye, bechne wale, khareedne wale aur us ki qeemat khane wale par."
"1803","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah taala ne makhlooq ko paida kiya to apne haath se apne nafs par likha: meri rehmat mere ghusse par ghalib hai."
"1804","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne hamein hukm nahi diya jo us ne hamein rizq diya ke ham patharon, eenton aur mitti ko kapra pehnayein."
"1805","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne koi Nabi aur khalifa nahi bheja magar us ke do hum-raaz hain: aik hum-raaz use naiki ka hukm deta hai aur burayi se rokta hai, doosra hum-raaz use bigarne mein kami nahi karta; jo bure hum-raaz se bachaya gaya wo bachaya gaya."
"1806","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe sakhti karne wala ya sakhti sehne wala bhej kar nahi bheja, lekin mujhe sikhane wala aasaan karne wala bhej kar bheja hai."
"1807","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne maskh-shuda ke liye nasal aur aulad nahi rakhi; bandar aur khinzeer is se pehle thay."
"1808","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne koi marz nahi rakha magar us ke liye shifa rakhi; pas gaaye ke doodhon ko lazim pakro, kyunke wo har darakht se chugti hain."
"1809","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne koi marz nahi utaara magar us ke liye dawa utaari; jo jaane us ne jaana, jo na jaane us ne na jaana; siwaye Saam ke, wo maut hai."
"1810","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne koi marz nahi utaara magar us ke liye shifa utaari siwaye burhape ke; pas gaaye ke doodhon ko lazim pakro, kyunke wo har darakht se chugti hain."
"1811","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah meri ummat mein mujhe aajiz nahi karega ke wo use aadhe din tak mo'akhkhar kare, paanch sau saal tak."
"1812","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar Allah chahta ke us ki nafarmani na ho to Iblees ko paida na karta."
"1813","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala deen ko bad-kaar aadmi se taqwiyat deta hai."
"1814","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala apne momin bande ko duniya se bachaata hai jabke wo us se mohabbat karta hai, jaise tum apne beemar ko khane-peene se bachate ho, us par khauf khate hue."
"1815","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tum mein se kisi ke liye khajoor aur luqma aise barhata hai jaise tum mein se koi apne bachhere ya oont ke bachche ko barhata hai, yahan tak ke wo Uhud jaisa ho jata hai."
"1816","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala bande se raazi hota hai ke wo luqma khaye ya ghoont piye aur us par Allah ki hamd kare."
"1817","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah kafir ka azab us ke ghar walon ke us par rone se barhata hai."
"1818","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala qayamat ke din bande se sawal karega yahan tak ke us se sawal karega: jab tum ne burayi dekhi to use rokne se tumhein kis ne roka? Phir jab Allah bande ko us ki hujjat sikha dega to wo kahega: ae mere Rab, maine tujh se umeed rakhi aur logon se dara."
"1819","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala Shaban ki pandrahwein raat mein nazar farmata hai aur apni tamam makhlooq ko bakhsh deta hai siwaye mushrik aur bughz rakhne wale ke."
"1820","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah jama'at mein namaz par ta'ajjub karta hai."
"1821","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah bande par ta'ajjub karta hai jab wo kahe: tere siwa koi mabood nahi, maine apne nafs par zulm kiya, pas mere gunah bakhsh de; gunah tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta. Wo farmata hai: mere bande ne jaana ke us ka Rab hai jo bakhshta hai aur saza deta hai."
"1822","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala zaalim ko mohlat deta hai yahan tak ke jab use pakarta hai to use nahi chhorta."
"1823","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala muhsin hai, pas ehsaan karo."
"1824","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah muhsin hai, ehsaan ko pasand karta hai; pas jab qatl karo to qatl achcha karo, jab zibah karo to zibah achcha karo; tum mein se har aik apni chhuri tez kare phir apne zabeehe ko rahat de."
"1825","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala qarz-daar ke saath hai yahan tak ke wo apna qarz ada kare, jab tak us ka qarz us mein na ho jo Allah na-pasand karta hai."
"1826","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah qazi ke saath hai jab tak wo jaan-boojh kar zulm na kare; phir jab wo zulm kare to use us ke nafs ke supurd kar deta hai."
"1827","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala qazi ke saath hai jab tak wo zulm na kare; phir jab wo zulm kare to us se bezaari karta hai aur shaitan us se jur jata hai."
"1828","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala qazi ke saath hai jab tak wo jaan-boojh kar na-haq na kare."
"1829","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala taaq hai aur taaq ko pasand karta hai."
"1830","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taaq hai aur taaq ko pasand karta hai; pas jab dhale se istinja karo to taaq baar karo."
"1831","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala taaq hai aur taaq ko pasand karta hai; pas taaq parho, ae Quran walon."
"1832","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ke Rasool ne sharab, murdaar, khinzeer aur buton ka bechna haram kiya hai."
"1833","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ka Rasool tumhein paltu gadhon ke gosht se mana karte hain, kyunke wo shaitan ke kaam mein se gandagi hain."
"1834","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne haq ko Umar ki zaban par rakha hai jo wo kehta hai."
"1835","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne musafir se roza aur aadhi namaz utha li hai."
"1836","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne meri ummat se ghalti, bhool aur jo un se zabardasti karaya gaya utha liya hai."
"1837","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne rehem par farishta muqarrar kiya hai jo kehta hai: ae mere Rab, nutfa; ae mere Rab, jam hua khoon; ae mere Rab, gosht ka lothra. Phir jab Allah us ki takhleeq ka faisla karna chahe to kehta hai: ae mere Rab, bad-bakht ya khush-bakht? Mard ya aurat? Rizq kiya hai? Umr kiya hai? Pas us ki maa ke pet mein aisa hi likha jata hai."
"1838","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah, us ke farishte, yahan tak ke cheonti apne bil mein aur machhli samandar mein, logon ko bhalayi sikhane wale par durood bhejte hain."
"1839","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ke farishte pehli saf par durood bhejte hain."
"1840","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ke farishte pehli saf par durood bhejte hain; apni saffein seedhi karo, apne kandhon ko barabar karo, apne bhaiyon ke haathon mein narm raho aur khala pur karo, kyunke shaitan tumhare darmiyan dakhil hota hai hazf ke bachche ki tarah."
"1841","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ke farishte agli saf par durood bhejte hain; muazzin ko us ki aawaz ki had tak bakhsh diya jata hai, jo us se sunta hai khushk aur geela us ki tasdeeq karta hai, aur us ke liye utna ajr hai jitna us ke saath namaz parhne wale ka."
"1842","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aur us ke farishte agli saffon par durood bhejte hain."
"1843","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala aur us ke farishte un par durood bhejte hain jo saffein milate hain; jo khaali jagah pur kare Allah us ke zariye us ka darja buland karega."
"1844","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala aur us ke farishte sehri karne walon par durood bhejte hain."
"1845","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah faisla karne wala hai aur us ki taraf faisla hai."
"1846","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala paida karne wala, rokne wala, kushada karne wala, rizq dene wala aur bhaao muqarrar karne wala hai; main umeed rakhta hun ke main Allah se milun aur mujh se koi khoon ya maal mein mazlama na mange jo maine us par kiya ho."
"1847","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Salaam hai; pas jab tum mein se koi namaz mein bethe to kahe: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye, namazein aur paak cheezein; salaam ho tum par ae Nabi, Allah ki rehmat aur us ki barkatein; salaam ho ham par aur Allah ke naik bandon par. Kyunke jab tum ye kahoge to aasman aur zameen mein Allah ke har naik bande ko pahunchegi. Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi ¤ aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad us ke bande aur us ke Rasool hain; phir sawal mein se jo chahe ikhtiyar kare."
"1848","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala meri ummat ko gumrahi par jama nahi karega; Allah ka haath jama'at par hai...."
"1849","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah nafarmani ko pasand nahi karta."
"1850","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah har behaya gustakh ko pasand nahi karta."
"1851","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala apne momin bande ke liye raazi nahi hota ke jab us se zameen walon mein se us ka chuna hua jaye aur wo sabr kare aur sawab ki umeed rakhe to us ke liye jannat se kam sawab ho."
"1852","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala haq se haya nahi karta: auraton ke paas un ke peeche ke muqaam mein na aao."
"1853","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala momin par aik neki mein zulm nahi karta: us par duniya mein diya jata hai aur aakhirat mein sawab diya jata hai. Kafir ke baare mein: us ki nekiyon se use duniya mein khilaya jata hai yahan tak ke jab wo aakhirat ki taraf pahunche to us ke paas koi neki nahi hogi jis par use bhalayi di jaye."
"1854","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ilm ko bandon se kheench kar qabz nahi karta, lekin ilm ko ulema ke qabz se qabz karta hai yahan tak ke jab koi aalim baaqi na rahe to log jaahil sardar bana lenge; pas un se sawal kiya jayega to wo baghair ilm ke fatwa denge; pas wo gumrah honge aur gumrah karenge."
"1855","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah baghair paaki ke namaz aur khayanat ke maal se sadqa qabool nahi karta."
"1856","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala amal mein se sirf wo qabool karta hai jo us ke liye khaalis ho aur us se us ka chehra chaha gaya ho."
"1857","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us qaum ko paak nahi karta jis mein kamzor apna haq taqatwar se na le sake baghair larzish ke."
"1858","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala us qaum ko paak nahi karta jo un mein kamzor ko us ka haq nahi dete."
"1859","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao."
"1860","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala sota nahi aur us ke laiq nahi ke soye; wo tarazu ko jhukata hai aur uthata hai; us ki taraf din ke amal se pehle raat ka amal uthaya jata hai aur raat ke amal se pehle din ka amal; us ka parda noor hai; agar wo use khol de to us ke chehre ki roshni us ki makhlooq mein se jahan tak us ki nazar pahunche use jala de."
"1861","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tum se ilm nahi kheenchta jab us ne tumhein de diya ho kheench kar, lekin ulema ko un ke ilm se qabz karta hai aur jaahil baaqi rehte hain; pas un se sawal kiya jata hai to wo fatwa dete hain aur gumrah hote hain aur gumrah karte hain."
"1862","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala tumhari suraton aur tumhare maalon ko nahi dekhta, lekin wo tumhare dilon aur tumhare aamaal ko dekhta hai."
"1863","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala us ki taraf nahi dekhta jo apna tehband latkata hai."
"1864","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala us ki taraf nahi dekhta jo apna tehband takabbur se kheenchta hai."
"1865","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Hassaan ki Rooh-ul-Qudus se taaid karta hai jab tak wo Allah ke Rasool ki taraf se difa kare."
"1866","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala is deen ki taaid aisi qaumon se karta hai jin ka koi hissa nahi."
"1867","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Arafaat walon se aasman walon par fakhr karta hai aur un se farmata hai: mere in bandon ko dekho jo mere paas bikharay baalon wale ghubaar-aalood aaye hain."
"1868","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala Arafa ki shaam apne farishton par Ehl-e-Arafa se fakhr karta hai aur farmata hai: mere bandon ko dekho jo mere paas bikharay baalon wale ghubaar-aalood aaye hain."
"1869","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala bande ko us mein aazmata hai jo us ne use diya; pas agar wo us par raazi ho jo Allah ne us ke liye taqseem kiya to us mein us ke liye barkat hogi aur use kushada karega; agar wo raazi na ho to us ke liye barkat nahi hogi aur jo us ke liye likha gaya us se zyada nahi hoga."
"1870","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala apne momin bande ko beemari se aazmata hai yahan tak ke us se har gunah mita de."
"1871","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala raat ko apna haath phelata hai taake din ka bura kaam karne wala tauba kare, aur din ko apna haath phelata hai taake raat ka bura kaam karne wala tauba kare, yahan tak ke suraj maghrib se tuloo ho."
"1872","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah qayamat ke din dinon ko un ki haalat par uthayega aur Juma ko roshan chamakdaar uthayega us ke rehne walon ke liye; wo use ghere honge jaise dulhan jo apne shareef ke paas layi jaye; wo un ke liye roshan karega, wo us ki roshni mein chalenge; un ke rang barf jaise safed honge, un ki khushbu mushk jaise phel rahi hogi; wo kaafoor ke paharon mein chalenge; unhein saqalain dekhenge aur ta'ajjub se nazar nahi hatayenge yahan tak ke wo jannat mein dakhil honge; un se koi nahi milega siwaye ehl-e-ehtisaab muazzinon ke."
"1873","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala Yaman se hawa bhejega jo resham se narm hogi; pas jis ke dil mein raayi ke daane barabar iman hoga use nahi chhoregi magar use qabz karegi."
"1874","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala is ummat ke liye har sau saal ke sar par use bhejega jo us ke liye us ka deen naya kare."
"1875","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala mardon mein se us faqeet ko na-pasand karta hai jo apni zaban se aise khelta hai jaise gaaye apni zaban se khelti hai."
"1876","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala israar karne wale saail se bughz rakhta hai."
"1877","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala behaya gustakh se bughz rakhta hai."
"1878","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah har sakht akhlaq wale, maal jama karne wale, bazaaron mein cheekhne wale se bughz rakhta hai jo raat ko murdaar aur din ko gadha hai, duniya ka aalim aur aakhirat ka jaahil hai."
"1879","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala har duniya ke aalim aur aakhirat ke jaahil se bughz rakhta hai."
"1880","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah pasand karta hai ke jab tum mein se koi kaam kare to use mazboot kare."
"1881","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala har muamle mein narmi ko pasand karta hai."
"1882","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala bande ko pasand karta hai: muttaqi, be-niyaz, posheeda."
"1883","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala chheenk ko pasand karta hai aur jamaahi ko na-pasand karta hai."
"1884","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah chheenk ko pasand karta hai aur jamaahi ko na-pasand karta hai; pas jab tum mein se koi chheenke aur Allah ki hamd kare to har Musalman par jo use sune haq hai ke us se kahe: yarhamukallah. Jamaahi ke baare mein: wo shaitan se hai; pas jab tum mein se koi jamaahi le to use rok jitna taqat rakhe; kyunke tum mein se koi jab haa kahe to shaitan us se hansta hai."
"1885","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala pasand karta hai ke us ki rukhsatein di jayen jaise pasand karta hai ke us ke pukhta hukm diye jayen."
"1886","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala pasand karta hai ke us ki rukhsatein di jayen jaise na-pasand karta hai ke us ki nafarmani ki jaye."
"1887","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala pasand karta hai ke apne bande par apni ne'mat ka asar dekhe."
"1888","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala bechne mein narm, khareedne mein narm aur ada karne mein narm ko pasand karta hai."
"1889","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah aala akhlaq ko pasand karta hai aur ghatiya ko na-pasand karta hai."
"1890","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala aala muamlat aur un ke shareef ko pasand karta hai aur ghatiya ko na-pasand karta hai."
"1891","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala kaarigar se pasand karta hai ke jab wo kaam kare to use achcha kare."
"1892","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah apne muamle mein se jo chahe naya karta hai; Allah ne naya kiya hai ke tum namaz mein kalaam na karo."
"1893","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah kuch logon ko aag se nikalega jab un mein se siwaye chehron ke kuch baaqi nahi rahega, phir unhein jannat mein dakhil karega."
"1894","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala momin ko qareeb karega aur us par apna saaya aur logon se apna parda rakhega aur use us ke gunah iqraar karwayega aur farmayega: kiya tum falan gunah jaante ho? Kiya tum falan gunah jaante ho? ¤ Wo kahega: haan, ae mere Rab; yahan tak ke jab wo use us ke gunah iqraar karwayega aur wo apne nafs mein dekhega ke wo halaak ho gaya to farmayega: maine unhein duniya mein tum par chhupaya tha aur main aaj tumhein bakhshta hun. Phir use us ki nekiyon ki kitaab us ke dayen haath mein di jayegi. Kafir aur munafiq ke baare mein: gawah kahenge: ye wo hain jo apne Rab par jhoot bolte thay; khabardar, zaalimon par Allah ki laanat hai."
"1895","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala tumhare liye teen pasand karta hai aur tumhare liye teen na-pasand karta hai; pas tumhare liye pasand karta hai: us ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, Allah ki rassi ko sab mil kar thaamo aur phoot na dalo, us ki khair-khwahi karo jise Allah ne tumhara muamla diya; aur tumhare liye na-pasand karta hai: qeel-o-qaal, kasrat se sawal aur maal zaya karna."
"1896","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala is kitaab se kuch logon ko buland karta hai aur kuch ko gira deta hai."
"1897","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah kafir ka azab us ke ghar walon ke us par kuch rone se barhata hai."
"1898","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Shaban ki pandrahwein raat mein apne bandon par nazar farmata hai aur mominon ko bakhshta hai, kafiron ko mohlat deta hai aur bughz walon ko un ke bughz se chhorta hai yahan tak ke wo use chhor dein."
"1899","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tasweer banane walon ko azab dega jo unhon ne banaya."
"1900","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala qayamat ke din un ko azab dega jo duniya mein logon ko azab dete hain."
"1901","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ghairat farmata hai aur momin bhi ghairat karta hai; aur Allah taala ki ghairat ye hai ke momin us kaam ka irtikab kare jo Allah ne us par haram kiya hai."
"1902","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala sadqa qabool karta hai aur use apne dayen haath mein leta hai, phir use tum mein se aik ke liye parwan charhata hai jaisa tum mein se koi apne bichhre ko parwan charhata hai, yahan tak ke luqma Uhud paharr jaisa ho jata hai."
"1903","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala bande ki tauba qabool karta hai jab tak us ki jaan halq mein na phase."
"1904","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala farmata hai: Jab main duniya mein apne bande ki donon qeemti cheezein yani aankhein le lun to mere paas us ka badla jannat ke siwa kuch nahi."
"1905","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke saath hun; agar wo mere baare mein khair ka gumaan rakhe to khair payega aur agar shar ka gumaan rakhe to shar payega."
"1906","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke saath hun jab tak wo mera zikr kare aur mere zikr se us ke hont harkat karein."
"1907","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala farmata hai: Roza mere liye hai aur main hi us ka badla dunga. Rozedar ke liye do khushiyan hain: jab iftar kare to khush ho aur jab Allah taala se mile to us ke badle par khush ho. Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, rozedar ke munh ki boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada pakeeza hai."
"1908","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala farmata hai: Izzat mera tehband hai aur kibriya meri chadar hai; pas jis ne in donon mein mujh se muqabla kiya use main azab dunga."
"1909","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala farmata hai: Wo banda jis ke jism ko maine sehat di aur us ki rozi mein wusat di, phir us par paanch saal guzar jayen aur wo hajj ke liye meri taraf na aaye to yaqeenan wo mehroom hai."
"1910","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Mera momin banda mere nazdeek har bhalayi ke darje par hai; wo meri tareef karta hai is haal mein ke main us ki jaan us ke pehluon ke darmiyan se nikaal raha hota hun."
"1911","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala jannat walon se farmayega: Ae jannat walo! Wo kahenge: Labbaik ae hamare Rab, tumhari khidmat mein hazir hain, aur bhalayi tere donon haathon mein hai. Farmayega: Kiya tum raazi ho gaye? Wo kahenge: Ham kyun na raazi hon jabke tune hamein wo diya jo apni makhlooq mein se kisi ko nahi diya? Farmayega: Kiya main tumhein is se afzal na dun? Wo kahenge: Ae Rab, is se afzal kiya cheez hai? Farmayega: Main tum par apni raza utarunga, phir is ke baad tum se kabhi naraz nahi hunga."
"1912","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala aag mein sab se halke azab wale se farmayega: Agar tumhare paas zameen mein jo kuch hai us mein se kuch hota to kiya tum use fidya dekar chhutkara lete? Wo kahega: Haan. Farmayega: Maine tum se is se zyada aasaan cheez mangi thi jab tum Adam ki pusht mein thay ke mere saath kisi ko shareek na karna, lekin tum ne inkar kiya aur shirk hi par are rahe."
"1913","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Ae ibn Adam, din ke shuru mein mere liye chaar rakatein parh le, main un ke badle tumhein tumhare din ke aakhir tak kafayat karunga."
"1914","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala farmata hai: Ae ibn Adam, meri ibadat ke liye farigh ho ja, main tumhara seena be-niazi se bhar dunga aur tumhara faqr door kar dunga; aur agar tum aisa na karoge to main tumhare donon haath mashghalon se bhar dunga aur tumhara faqr door nahi karunga."
"1915","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala qayamat ke din farmayega: Mere jalal ki khatir aapas mein mohabbat karne wale kahan hain? Aaj main unhein apne saye mein jagah dunga jis din mere saye ke siwa koi saya nahi hoga."
"1916","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala qayamat ke din farmayega: Ae ibn Adam, main beemar hua to tune meri ayadat nahi ki. Wo kahega: Ae Rab, main teri ayadat kaise karta jabke tu Rabbul Aalamin hai? Farmayega: Kiya tumhein maloom nahi ke mera falan banda beemar hua to tune us ki ayadat nahi ki? Kiya tumhein maloom nahi ke agar tum us ki ayadat karte to mujhe us ke paas pate? Ae ibn Adam, maine tujh se khana manga to tune mujhe nahi khilaya. Wo kahega: Ae Rab, main tujhe kaise khilata jabke tu Rabbul Aalamin hai? Farmayega: Kiya tumhein maloom nahi ke mere falan bande ne tujh se khana manga to tune use nahi khilaya? Kiya tumhein maloom nahi ke agar tum use khilate to us ka sawab mere paas pate? Ae ibn Adam, maine tujh se pani manga to tune mujhe nahi pilaya. Wo kahega: Ae Rab, main tujhe kaise pilata jabke tu Rabbul Aalamin hai? Farmayega: Mere falan bande ne tujh se pani manga ¤ to tune use nahi pilaya; khabardar, agar tum use pilate to us ka sawab mere paas pate."
"1917","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah mohlat deta hai yahan tak ke jab raat ka aadha ya do tihayi hissa guzar jata hai to farmata hai: Mere bande mere siwa kisi se na mangein; jo mujh se dua karega main us ki dua qabool karunga, jo mujh se mange ga main use dunga, jo mujh se maghfirat mange ga main use bakhsh dunga, yahan tak ke fajr tuloo ho jaye."
"1918","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala mohlat deta hai yahan tak ke jab raat ka aakhri tihayi hissa hota hai to aasman-e-duniya ki taraf nuzool farmata hai aur pukaarta hai: Hai koi maghfirat mangne wala? Hai koi tauba karne wala? Hai koi mangne wala? Hai koi dua karne wala? Yahan tak ke fajr phoot padti hai."
"1919","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala madad kharch ke andaze par utarta hai aur sabr museebat ke andaze par utarta hai."
"1920","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah badal ko paida karta hai to wo behtareen kalaam karta hai aur behtareen hansta hai."
"1921","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhein auraton ke paas pichhe se aane se mana farmata hai."
"1922","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhein apne baap-dadaon ki qasmein khane se mana karta hai."
"1923","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhein apne baap-dadaon ki qasmein khane se mana karta hai; pas jo qasam khane wala ho wo Allah ki qasam khaye warna khamosh rahe."
"1924","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhein tumhari maaon ke baare mein teen baar waseeyat karta hai, beshak Allah taala tumhein tumhare baapon ke baare mein do baar waseeyat karta hai, beshak Allah taala tumhein qareeb tar phir qareeb tar rishtedaron ke baare mein waseeyat karta hai."
"1925","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak pani paak karne wala hai, use koi cheez napak nahi karti."
"1926","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak pani par janabat nahi hoti aur use koi cheez napak nahi karti."
"1927","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak pani napak nahi hota."
"1928","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak pani ko koi cheez napak nahi karti."
"1929","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak muazzin ko us ki aawaz ki pahunch tak bakhsh diya jata hai, aur har geeli aur khushk cheez jo us ki aawaz sunti hai us ki tasdeeq karti hai; aur hazir hone wale ke liye pachees darje hain."
"1930","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin jab qabr mein rakha jata hai to us ke paas aik farishta aata hai aur us se kehta hai: ¤ Tum kis ki ibadat karte thay? Pas agar Allah ne use hidayat di to wo kahega: Main Allah ki ibadat karta tha. Wo us se kahega: Tum is shakhs ke baare mein kiya kehte thay? Wo kahega: Wo Allah ke bande aur us ke Rasool hain. Phir us se is ke siwa kuch nahi pucha jayega, aur use us ghar ki taraf le jaya jayega jo aag mein tha to use kaha jayega: Ye tumhara ghar tha jo aag mein tha lekin Allah ne tumhein bachaya aur tum par rehem kiya aur us ke badle tumhein jannat mein ghar de diya. Wo kahega: Mujhe chhoro taake ja kar apne ghar walon ko khushkhabri dun. Us se kaha jayega: Thehre raho. Aur kafir jab qabr mein rakha jata hai to us ke paas aik farishta aata hai aur use jhirkta hai aur us se kehta hai: Tum kis ki ibadat karte thay? Wo kahega: Mujhe maloom nahi. Us se kaha jayega: Na tune jaana na tune parha. Us se kaha jayega: Tum is shakhs ke baare mein kiya kehte thay? Wo kahega: Main wahi kehta tha jo log kehte thay. Pas use donon kanon ke darmiyan lohe ke hatore se mara jayega to wo aisi cheekh marega jise insanon aur jinon ke siwa tamam makhlooq sunegi."
"1931","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin ki jaan us ke pehluon ke darmiyan se is haal mein nikalti hai ke wo Allah taala ki hamd kar raha hota hai."
"1932","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin husn-e-akhlaq se raat ko qayam karne wale aur din ko roza rakhne wale ka darja pa leta hai."
"1933","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin napak nahi hota."
"1934","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin apni talwar aur apni zaban se jihad karta hai."
"1935","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mominon par sakhti ki jati hai kyunke momin ko kaante se lekar us se upar koi takleef aur koi dard nahi pahunchta magar Allah us ke badle us ka aik darja buland karta hai aur us ka aik gunah mita deta hai."
"1936","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak khareed-o-farokht karne wale donon apni bai mein ikhtiyar rakhte hain jab tak wo juda na hon ya bai khayar ki shart par na ho."
"1937","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ki khatir aapas mein mohabbat karne wale Arsh ke saye mein honge."
"1938","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo auratein jo bila-waja khula leti hain aur shoharon se alag hoti hain munafiq hain."
"1939","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat jab aati hai to shaitan ki surat mein aati hai; pas jab tum mein se koi aurat dekhe aur wo use achhi lage to apni biwi ke paas aaye kyunke us ke paas bhi wahi hai jo us ghair aurat ke paas hai."
"1940","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat shaitan ki surat mein aati hai aur shaitan ki surat mein peeth pherti hai; pas jab tum mein se koi aurat dekhe jo use achhi lage to apni biwi ke paas aaye kyunke ye us ke dil mein jo hai use door kar dega."
"1941","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat se us ke deen, us ke maal aur us ke husn ki wajah se nikah kiya jata hai; pas tum deen wali ko ikhtiyar karo, tumhare haath khaak-aalood hon."
"1942","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat pasli se paida ki gayi hai; pas agar tum use seedha karne lago to use tor doge aur agar use chhor do to us mein terhapan bhi hai aur guzare ka saman bhi."
"1943","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat pasli se paida ki gayi hai, wo tumhare liye kabhi aik raaste par seedhi nahi hogi; pas agar tum us se faida uthao to us se faida uthao is haal mein ke us mein terh hai, aur agar tum use seedha karne lago to use tor doge aur us ka torna us ki talaq hai."
"1944","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat pasli se paida ki gayi hai, aur agar tum pasli ko seedha karna chaho to use tor doge; pas us se narmi se guzara karo to us ke saath zindagi guzaroge."
"1945","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat qaum ki taraf se aman ka ehad kar sakti hai, yani Musalmanon ko panah de sakti hai."
"1946","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak lautna Allah ki taraf hai, jannat ya aag ki taraf; hamesha rehna hai baghair maut ke, aur theharna hai baghair kooch ke."
"1947","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mangna kharach hai jis se aadmi apna chehra khurchta hai, siwaye is ke ke aadmi hukmaran se mange ya aise muamle mein mange jis ke baghair guzara na ho."
"1948","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Musalman jab apne Musalman bhai ki ayadat kare to wapas lautne tak jannat ke mewe chunta rehta hai."
"1949","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak seedhi raah par chalne wala Musalman apne husn-e-akhlaq aur apni pakeeza fitrat se Allah ki aayaton ke saath roza rakhne walon aur qayam karne walon ka darja pa leta hai."
"1950","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Musalman ko har us cheez mein ajr diya jata hai jo wo kharch kare siwaye us cheez ke jo wo is mitti yani imarat banane mein lagaye."
"1951","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak namazi apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai, pas use dekhna chahiye ke kin kalimaat se us se sargoshi kar raha hai; aur tum mein se koi dusre par Quran buland aawaz se parh kar jahran na kare."
"1952","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak madad Allah ki taraf se bande ko kharch ke andaze par aati hai aur sabr Allah ki taraf se museebat ke andaze par aata hai."
"1953","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak insaf karne wale Allah ke nazdeek qayamat ke din noor ke mimbaron par Rehman ke dayen taraf honge, aur us ke donon haath dayen hain; ye wo hain jo apne faisle mein, apne ghar walon mein aur jis par unhein ikhtiyar diya gaya us mein insaf karte hain."
"1954","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak zyada maal wale qayamat ke din kam sawab wale honge siwaye us ke jise Allah taala ne khair yani maal diya aur us ne us mein se dayen, bayen, aage aur peechhe kharch kiya aur us mein khair ka kaam kiya."
"1955","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte badalon mein utarte hain aur us muamle ka zikr karte hain jis ka aasman mein faisla hua hota hai, to shaitan baat chura kar sunte hain aur use sun kar kahinon tak pahunchate hain, phir wo us ke saath apni taraf se sau jhoot milate hain."
"1956","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte ilm ke talib ke liye apne par bichhate hain us se khush hokar jo wo talab karta hai."
"1957","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte tum mein se us par laanat karte hain jo apne bhai ki taraf lohe ke hathiyar se ishara kare agarche wo us ka maa-baap se saga bhai ho."
"1958","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte juma ke din masjid ke darwazon par khare hote hain, un ke saath saheefe hote hain, wo aane walon ko likhte hain pehle, dusre, teesre; yahan tak ke jab imam nikalta hai to saheefe lapet diye jate hain."
"1959","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte junbi ke paas hazir nahi hote aur na us ke paas jo khalooq khushbu mein basa ho yahan tak ke wo donon ghusl kar lein."
"1960","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte kafir ke janaze mein khair ke saath hazir nahi hote, aur na zafran mein base hue ke paas aur na junbi ke paas."
"1961","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein but hon ya tasweer ho."
"1962","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein kutta ho."
"1963","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak farishte us ghar mein dakhil nahi hote jis mein kutta ho ya tasweer ho."
"1964","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ki raah mein ghoron par kharch karne wala us shakhs ki tarah hai jo sadqe ke saath apne donon haath phailaye hue ho aur unhein sametta na ho."
"1965","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak murde apni qabron mein azab diye jate hain yahan tak ke janwar un ki aawazein sunte hain."
"1966","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maut ghabrahat wali cheez hai; pas jab tum janaza dekho to khare ho jao."
"1967","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mayyat jab dafan ki jati hai to un ke jooton ki aahat sunti hai jab wo us se peeth pher kar wapas jate hain."
"1968","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mayyat ke paas farishte hazir hote hain; pas agar aadmi naik ho to kehte hain: Nikal ae pakeeza jaan jo pakeeza jism mein thi, tareef ke saath nikal aur rahat, khushbu aur aise Rab ki khushkhabri le jo naraz nahi. Use yehi kaha jata rehta hai yahan tak ke jaan nikal aati hai, phir use aasman ki taraf charhaya jata hai aur us ke liye darwaza kholne ki ijazat mangi jati hai to kaha jata hai: Ye kaun hai? Kaha jata hai: Falan. Kaha jata hai: Pakeeza jaan ko khush aamdeed jo pakeeza jism mein thi; tareef ke saath dakhil ho aur rahat, khushbu aur aise Rab ki khushkhabri le jo naraz nahi. Use yehi kaha jata rehta hai yahan tak ke use us aasman tak pahunchaya jata hai jis mein Allah tabarak wa taala hai. Aur agar aadmi bura ho to kehte hain: Nikal ae khabees jaan jo khabees jism mein thi, mazammat ke saath nikal aur khaulte pani, peep ¤ aur is jaisi dusri qismon ki khushkhabri le. Use yehi kaha jata rehta hai yahan tak ke jaan nikal aati hai, phir use aasman ki taraf charhaya jata hai aur us ke liye ijazat mangi jati hai to kaha jata hai: Ye kaun hai? Kaha jata hai: Falan. Kaha jata hai: Khabees jaan ko khush aamdeed nahi jo khabees jism mein thi; mazammat ke saath wapas laut ja, tere liye aasman ke darwaze nahi khole jayenge. Pas use aasman se phenk diya jata hai phir wo qabr mein pahunchti hai. Pas naik aadmi apni qabr mein bithaya jata hai baghair ghabraye aur baghair dehshat ke, phir us se kaha jata hai: Tum kin logon mein thay? Wo kahega: Main Islam mein tha. Us se kaha jayega: Ye shakhs kaun hai? Wo kahega: Muhammad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jo hamare paas Allah ki taraf se wazeh nishaniyan lekar aaye to ham ne un ki tasdeeq ki. Us se kaha jayega: Kiya tum ne Allah ko dekha hai? Wo kahega: Kisi ke liye jaiz nahi ke Allah ko dekhe. Pas us ke liye aag ki taraf aik jharoka khola jata hai to wo use dekhta hai ke us ka baaz baaz ko tor raha hai; phir us se kaha jayega: Dekho Allah taala ne tumhein kis se bachaya. Phir us ke liye jannat ki taraf aik jharoka khola jata hai to wo us ki raunaq aur jo kuch us mein hai use dekhta hai; phir us se kaha jayega: Ye tumhara thikana hai. Aur us se kaha jayega: Tum yaqeen par thay, usi par mare aur usi par uthaye jaoge in sha Allah. Aur bura aadmi apni qabr mein bithaya jata hai ghabraya hua dehshat-zada; us se kaha jayega: Tum kin mein thay? Wo kahega: Mujhe maloom nahi. Us se kaha jayega: Ye shakhs kaun hai? Wo kahega: Maine logon ko aik baat kehte suna to maine bhi wahi keh di. Pas us ke liye jannat ki taraf aik jharoka khola jata hai to wo us ki raunaq aur jo kuch us mein hai use dekhta hai; phir us se kaha jayega: Dekho Allah ne tum se kiya pher diya. Phir us ke liye aag ki taraf aik jharoka khola jata hai to wo use dekhta hai ke us ka baaz baaz ko tor raha hai; phir kaha jayega: Ye tumhara thikana hai; tum shak par thay, usi par mare aur usi par uthaye jaoge in sha Allah."
"1969","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mayyat ko zinda ke rone se azab diya jata hai."
"1970","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mayyat ko us ke ghar walon ke us par rone se azab diya jata hai."
"1971","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mayyat unhi kapron mein uthaya jayega jin mein wo mara hoga."
"1972","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aag mere qareeb layi gayi yahan tak ke us ki tapish mere chehre ko lagi; pas maine us mein ankri wale ko dekha, aur us ko jis ne baheera untni ke kaan cheere thay, aur Himyar wale ko, aur billi wali aurat ko."
"1973","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log jab zaalim ko dekhein aur us ka haath na pakrein to qareeb hai ke Allah un sab par apni taraf se azab aam kar de."
"1974","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log jab munkar dekhein aur use na badlein to qareeb hai ke Allah un sab par apna azab aam kar de."
"1975","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log namaz parh kar so chuke hain, aur tum jab tak namaz ka intezar karte rahoge namaz hi mein rahoge."
"1976","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log namaz parh kar so gaye hain aur tum jab tak namaz ka intezar karte rahoge namaz mein rahoge; aur agar kamzor ki kamzori aur beemar ki beemari na hoti to main is namaz ko aadhi raat tak moakhar karne ka hukm deta."
"1977","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon ko husn-e-akhlaq se behtar koi cheez nahi di gayi."
"1978","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log qayamat ke din ghutnon ke bal jama honge, har ummat apne nabi ke peechhe hogi; wo kahenge: Ae falan sifarish karo, ae falan sifarish karo, yahan tak ke sifarish Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tak pahunchegi; pas yehi wo din hai jis mein Allah unhein Maqam-e-Mahmood par uthayega."
"1979","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log tumhari taraf hijrat karenge aur tum un ki taraf hijrat nahi karoge. Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, jo shakhs Ansar se mohabbat karega yahan tak ke Allah se mile to wo Allah se is haal mein milega ke Allah us se mohabbat karta hoga; aur jo shakhs Ansar se bughz rakhega yahan tak ke Allah se mile to wo Allah se is haal mein milega ke Allah us se bughz rakhta hoga."
"1980","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nazr kisi cheez ko aage nahi karti aur na peechhe karti; is se sirf bakheel se maal nikalwaya jata hai."
"1981","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nazr ibn Adam ke liye koi aisi cheez qareeb nahi karti jo Allah taala ne us ke liye muqaddar na ki ho, lekin nazr taqdeer ke muwafiq hoti hai to us bakheel se wo maal nikal jata hai jo wo nikalna nahi chahta tha."
"1982","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nazr do qism ki hai; pas jo Allah ke liye ho us ka kaffara use poora karna hai, aur jo shaitan ke liye ho use poora nahi karna aur us par qasam ka kaffara hai."
"1983","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak auratein mardon ki hamsar hain."
"1984","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nutfa rehem mein chaalees raatein rehta hai, phir us par wo farishta chha jata hai jo use banata hai aur kehta hai: Ae Rab, nar ho ya mada? Pas Allah use nar ya mada banata hai. Phir kehta hai: Ae Rab, mukammal ho ya naqis? Pas Allah use mukammal ya naqis banata hai. Phir kehta hai: Ae Rab, us ki rozi kiya ho, us ki umr kiya ho, us ke akhlaq kiya hon? Phir Allah use badbakht ya khushbakht banata hai."
"1985","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak paida ki jane wali jaan ho kar rahegi."
"1986","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak loota hua maal murdar se zyada halal nahi."
"1987","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak loota hua maal halal nahi."
"1988","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Waseela Allah ke paas aik darja hai jis ke upar koi darja nahi; pas Allah se mango ke qayamat ke din mujhe makhlooq mein wo ata kare."
"1989","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aulad bakheel banane wali aur buzdil banane wali hai."
"1990","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aulad bakheel banane wali, buzdil banane wali, jahil banane wali aur ghamgeen banane wali hai."
"1991","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak hijrat munqata nahi hogi jab tak jihad baqi hai."
"1992","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak naik hidayat aur naik waza-qata nabuwat ke sattar hisson mein se aik hissa hain."
"1993","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak naik hidayat, naik waza-qata aur darmiyana rawi nabuwat ke pachees hisson mein se aik hissa hain."
"1994","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak donon haath sajda karte hain jaisa chehra sajda karta hai; pas jab tum mein se koi apna chehra rakhe to apne donon haath rakhe aur jab use uthaye to unhein uthaye."
"1995","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aaj Ashura ka din hai; pas jis ne khaya wo baqi din kuch na khaye, aur jis ne na khaya aur na piya wo roza rakhe."
"1996","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood jab tumhein salam karein to un mein se aik kehta hai: As-saam alaikum; pas tum kaho: Wa alaikum."
"1997","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood tum se salam aur aameen par hasad karte hain."
"1998","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood aur Nasara khizab nahi lagate, pas tum un ki mukhalifat karo."
"1999","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare saamne aik hauz hai jo Jarba aur Azruh ke darmiyani fasle jitna hai; us mein aasman ke taron jaise aabkhore hain; jo us par aaye aur us mein se piye wo is ke baad kabhi pyasa nahi hoga."
"2000","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare saamne aik hauz hai, us ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan Jarba aur Azruh ke darmiyani fasle jitna faasla hai."
"2001","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare saamne sakht charhayi wali ghati hai jise bojh se laade hue paar nahi kar sakenge."
"2002","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare muamle ka mujhe mere baad fikr hai, aur mere baad sirf sabr karne wale hi tum par sabr karenge. Ye apni biwiyon se farmaya."
"2003","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is ummat ka muamla hamesha qareeb rahega yahan tak ke wo bachchon aur taqdeer ke baare mein behes karne lagein."
"2004","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel mein se aik qaum zameen ke janwaron ki surat mein maskh ki gayi, aur main nahi jaanta wo kaun se janwar hain."
"2005","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat qayamat ke din wuzu ke asar se roshan chehre aur roshan haath-pair wali bulayi jayegi.. ..."
"2006","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Umm-e-Mildam yani bukhar ibn Adam ki gandagi nikalta hai jaisa bhatti lohe ki gandagi nikalti hai."
"2007","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein sab se zyada ehsan karne wala mujh par apne maal aur apni sohbat mein Abu Bakr hai; aur agar main kisi ko khaleel banata to Abu Bakr ko khaleel banata, lekin Islam ka bhai-chara hai; masjid mein Abu Bakr ki khirki ke siwa koi khirki baqi nahi rakhi jayegi."
"2008","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat mein se kuch log mere baad aayenge ke un mein se aik ye chahayega ke kaash apne ghar walon aur maal ke badle mera deedar khareed sake."
"2009","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Islam ki sab se mazboot kariyan ye hain ke Allah ki khatir mohabbat karo aur Allah ki khatir bughz rakho."
"2010","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo pehle log jab un mein koi naik aadmi marta to us ki qabr par masjid banate aur us mein wo tasweerein banate; yehi log qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek makhlooq mein sab se bure honge."
"2011","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein Allah ka sab se zyada haqdar wo hai jo unhein salam karne mein pehal kare."
"2012","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujh se sab se zyada qareeb muttaqi log hain, wo jo hon aur jahan ¤ hon."
"2013","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ki pehli nishaniyon mein suraj ka maghrib se tuloo hona aur din charhe logon par dabba-tul-arz ka nikalna hai; pas in donon mein se jo pehle hogi dusri us ke foran baad hogi."
"2014","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din sab se pehle jis ka faisla hoga wo aik aadmi hai jo shaheed hua; use laya jayega aur use apni neimatein pehchanwayi jayengi to wo unhein pehchan lega. Farmayega: Tum ne in mein kiya amal kiya? Wo kahega: Maine teri khatir lara yahan tak ke shaheed ho gaya. Farmayega: Tune jhoot kaha, balke tune is liye lara ke kaha jaye ke bahadur hai, pas kaha ja chuka. Phir us ke baare mein hukm diya jayega to use munh ke bal ghaseeta jayega yahan tak ke aag mein phenk diya jayega. Aur aik aadmi jis ne ilm seekha aur sikhaya aur Quran parha; use laya jayega aur use apni neimatein pehchanwayi jayengi to wo unhein pehchan lega. Farmayega: Tum ne in mein kiya amal kiya? Wo kahega: Maine ilm seekha aur sikhaya aur teri khatir Quran parha. Farmayega: Tune jhoot kaha, balke tune ilm is liye seekha ke kaha jaye aalim hai, aur tune Quran is liye parha ke kaha jaye ke ye qaari hai, pas kaha ja chuka. Phir us ke baare mein hukm diya jayega to use munh ke bal ghaseeta jayega yahan tak ke aag mein phenk diya jayega. Aur aik aadmi jis par Allah ne wusat ki aur use har qism ka maal diya; use laya jayega aur use apni neimatein pehchanwayi jayengi to wo unhein pehchan lega. Farmayega: Tum ne in mein kiya amal kiya? Wo kahega: Maine koi aisa raasta nahi chhora jis mein kharch karna tujhe pasand ho magar teri khatir us mein kharch kiya. Farmayega: Tune jhoot kaha, balke tune is liye kiya ke kaha jaye ke sakhi hai, pas kaha ja chuka. Phir us ke baare mein hukm diya jayega to use munh ke bal ghaseeta jayega phir aag mein phenk diya jayega."
"2015","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak pehli jamaat jo jannat mein dakhil hogi chaudahween raat ke chaand ki surat par hogi, phir jo un ke baad honge aasman mein sab se zyada roshan chamakdar sitare par honge; wo na peshab karenge na pakhana karenge, na thukeinge aur na naak saaf karenge; un ki kanghiyan sone ki hongi, un ka paseena mushk hoga, un ki angeethiyan ood ki hongi aur un ki biwiyan ¤ hoor-e-een hongi; un ke akhlaq aik aadmi ke akhlaq par honge, apne baap Adam ki surat par saath haath lambe qadd mein."
"2016","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehli cheez jo Allah ne paida ki qalam hai; pas use hukm diya to us ne har wo cheez likh di jo hone wali hai."
"2017","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehli cheez jo Allah ne paida ki qalam hai; pas us se farmaya: Likh. Us ne kaha: Kiya likhun? Farmaya: Taqdeer likh, jo ho chuka aur jo hamesha hone wala hai."
"2018","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehli cheez jo Allah ne paida ki qalam hai; pas us se farmaya: Likh. Us ne kaha: Ae Rab, kiya likhun? Farmaya: Har cheez ki taqdeerein likh yahan tak ke qayamat qayam ho; jo is ke baghair mara wo mujh se nahi."
"2019","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak hum apne is din ka aaghaz is se karte hain ke namaz parhein phir wapas aakar qurbani karein; pas jis ne aisa kiya us ne hamari sunnat ko pa liya, aur jis ne is se pehle zibah kiya to wo sirf gosht hai jo us ne apne ghar walon ke liye pehle pesh kiya, wo qurbani mein se kuch nahi."
"2020","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehli cheez jis ka bande se qayamat ke din us ke amal mein se hisab hoga namaz hai; pas agar wo durust hui to wo kamyab aur nijaat pane wala hoga, aur agar wo bigar gayi to wo nakam aur khasaray wala hoga; aur agar fareeze mein kami hui to Rab farmayega: Dekho kiya mere bande ke paas nafl hain? Pas un se fareeze ki kami poori ki jayegi, phir us ka baqi amal isi par hoga."
"2021","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehla faisla jo bandon ke darmiyan hoga khoonon ke baare mein hoga."
"2022","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehli cheez jis ke baare mein bande se qayamat ke din neimaton mein se pucha jayega ye kaha jayega: Kiya ham ne tumhara jism tumhare liye sehat-mand nahi kiya tha aur tumhein thande pani se sairab nahi kiya tha?"
"2023","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare is din ka sab se pehla manasik namaz hai."
"2024","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehle jis ne saibah untniyan chhorin aur buton ki ibadat ki Abu Khuzaa Amr bin Aamir hai, aur maine use aag mein dekha ke wo us mein apni antein ghaseet raha hai."
"2025","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jahiliyyat wale kehte thay ke suraj aur chaand sirf zameen ke kisi bare aadmi ki maut par gehan hote hain; lekin suraj aur chaand na kisi ki maut par gehan hote hain na zindagi par, balke ye donon us ki makhlooq mein se do makhlooq hain jin mein Allah apni makhlooq mein jo chahe naya karta hai; pas in mein se jo bhi gehan ho to namaz parho yahan tak ke saaf ho jaye ya Allah koi naya hukm zahir kare."
"2026","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat wale jannat mein balakhano walon ko aise dekhenge jaisa tum aasman mein sitaron ko dekhte ho."
"2027","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat wale apne upar balakhano walon ko aise dekhenge jaisa tum mashriq ya maghrib mein ufuq mein doobte hue roshan sitare ko dekhte ho, un ke darmiyan fazeelat ke farq ki wajah se."
"2028","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat wale jannat walon ke amal ke liye aasaan kiye gaye hain aur aag wale aag walon ke amal ke liye aasaan kiye gaye hain."
"2029","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat wale us mein khayenge aur piyenge, na thukeinge na peshab karenge, na pakhana karenge aur na naak saaf karenge; lekin un ka wo khana dakaar aur aisa paseena hoga jo mushk ke paseene jaisa hoga; unhein tasbeeh aur tahmeed ka ilham hoga jaisa tumhein saans lene ka ilham hota hai."
"2030","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak unche darjon walon ko un se neeche wale aise dekhenge jaisa tum aasman ke ufuq mein nikalte hue sitare ko dekhte ho; aur beshak Abu Bakr aur Umar un mein se hain aur unhein kitna achha sila milega."
"2031","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak duniya mein bhalayi karne wale aakhirat mein bhalayi wale honge, aur duniya mein burayi wale aakhirat mein burayi wale honge."
"2032","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aag wale royenge yahan tak ke agar un ke aansuon mein kashtiyan chalayi jayen to chal jayen, aur wo khoon royenge."
"2033","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aag mein sab se halke azab wala wo hai jis ke paas aag ¤ ke do joote aur do tasme honge jin se us ka dimagh aise khaulega jaisa deeg khaulti hai; wo samjhega ke us se zyada kisi ko azab nahi, halanke wo sab se halke azab wala hoga."
"2034","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din aag mein sab se halke azab wala wo aadmi hoga jise aag ke do joote pehnaye jayenge jin se qayamat ke din us ka dimagh khaulega."
"2035","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din aag mein sab se halke azab wala wo aadmi hoga jis ke donon pairon ke talwon mein do angare rakhe jayenge jin se us ka dimagh aise khaulega jaisa surahi se deeg khaulti hai."
"2036","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Madina mein kuch qaumein hain; tum ne koi raasta tay nahi kiya, na koi kharch kharch kiya aur na koi wadi paar ki magar wo us mein tumhare saath thay, is haal mein ke wo Madina mein thay aur uzr ne unhein rok rakha tha."
"2037","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Madina mein jinon mein se kuch hain jo Musalman ho chuke hain; pas jab tum un mein se kuch dekho to unhein teen din tak khabardar karo, phir agar is ke baad tumhein kuch zahir ho to use qatl kar do kyunke wo shaitan hai."
"2038","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhein qatl hi kafi hai."
"2039","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere baad meri ummat mein se kuch log honge jo Quran parhenge jo un ke halq se neeche nahi utrega; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaisa teer shikar se nikal jata hai, phir us ki taraf nahi lautenge; wo makhlooq mein sab se bure honge."
"2040","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bilal raat mein azaan deta hai; pas khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn-e-Umm-e-Maktoom azaan de."
"2041","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bilal raat mein azaan deta hai taake tumhare sone wale ko jagaye aur tumhare qayam karne wale ko lautaye."
"2042","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel ikhattar firqon par bate thay aur meri ummat bahattar firqon par bategi, aik ke siwa sab aag mein hongi aur wo jamaat hai."
"2043","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel mein jab kisi ko peshab lagta to use qainchi se kaat-ta tha. Pas jab tum mein se koi peshab karna chahe to apne peshab ke liye jagah talash kare."
"2044","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel ne aik kitab likhi phir us ki pairwi ki aur Taurat ko chhor diya."
"2045","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel jab halak hue to qisse kahaniyan kehne lage."
"2046","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Hisham bin Mughira ne mujh se ijazat mangi ke wo apni beti ka nikah Ali bin Abi Talib se karein; pas main ijazat nahi dunga, phir ijazat nahi dunga, phir ijazat nahi dunga, siwaye is ke ke Abu Talib ka beta chahe ke meri beti ko talaq de aur un ki beti se nikah kare; kyunke wo mere jism ka tukra hai, mujhe wo bechain karti hai jo use bechain kare aur mujhe wo takleef deti hai jo use takleef de."
"2047","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat se pehle harj hoga yani qatl; wo kafiron ka qatl nahi hoga balke ummat ka aapas mein qatl hoga, yahan tak ke aadmi ko us ka bhai milega aur use qatl karega; us zamane walon ki aqlein chheen li jayengi aur un ke badle bhoose jaise log reh jayenge jin mein se aksar samjhenge ke wo kisi cheez par hain halanke wo kisi cheez par nahi honge."
"2048","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat se pehle tees dajjal kazzaab honge."
"2049","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat se pehle andheri raat ke tukron jaise fitne honge; aadmi subah momin hoga aur shaam ko kafir, shaam ko momin hoga aur subah kafir; un mein baitha hua khare se behtar hai, khara chalne wale se behtar hai aur chalne wala daurne wale se behtar hai. Pas apni kamanein tor do, apne rasse kaat do aur apni talwarein patharon par maar do; phir agar tum mein se kisi ke ghar mein dakhil ho to Adam ke donon beton mein se behtar ki tarah ho jao."
"2050","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat se pehle kazzaab honge, pas un se bacho."
"2051","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat se pehle aise din honge jin mein jahalat utregi, ilm uthaya jayega aur harj kasrat se hoga; aur harj qatl hai."
"2052","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel mein teen aadmi thay: bars wala, ganja aur andha. Allah ko manzoor hua ke unhein aazmaye to un ki taraf aik farishta bheja. Wo bars wale ke paas aaya aur kaha: Tumhein sab se zyada kiya pasand hai? Us ne kaha: Achha rang aur achhi khaal; logon ne mujhe na-pasand kiya hai. Pas us ne use hath phera to wo jata raha aur use achha rang aur achhi khaal di gayi. Phir kaha: Tumhein kaun sa maal sab se zyada pasand hai? Us ne kaha: Unt. Pas use das mah ki hamila untni di gayi aur kaha: Allah tumhein is mein barkat de. Aur ganje ke paas aaya aur kaha: Tumhein sab se zyada kiya pasand hai? Us ne kaha: Achhe baal aur ye mujh se jata rahe; logon ne mujhe na-pasand kiya hai. Pas us ne use hath phera to wo jata raha aur use achhe baal diye gaye. Kaha: Phir tumhein kaun sa maal sab se zyada pasand hai? Us ne kaha: Gaayen. Pas use hamila gaaye di aur kaha: Allah tumhein is mein barkat de. Aur andhe ke paas aaya aur kaha: Tumhein sab se zyada kiya pasand hai? Us ne kaha: Allah meri beenayi lautaye ke main us se logon ko dekhun. Pas us ne use hath phera to Allah ne us ki beenayi lautadi. Kaha: Phir tumhein kaun sa maal sab se zyada pasand hai? Us ne kaha: Bakriyan. Pas use bachcha dene wali bakri di; phir in donon ke janwar bache aur is ka bachcha hua, to is ke paas unton ki wadi, is ke paas gaayon ki wadi aur is ke paas bakriyon ki wadi ho gayi. Phir wo bars wale ke paas us ki surat aur hai'at mein aaya aur kaha: Aik miskeen aadmi hun, safar mein mere asbab toot gaye hain; aaj Allah ke siwa phir tumhare siwa mera guzara nahi. Us zaat ke waseele se tum se mangta hun jis ne tumhein ¤ achha rang, achhi khaal aur maal diya, aik unt jis par sawaar hokar apne safar mein pahunch jaaun. Us ne kaha: Huqooq bohat hain. Us ne kaha: Goya main tumhein pehchanta hun; kiya tum bars wale faqeer nahi thay jinhein log na-pasand karte thay phir Allah ne tumhein diya? Us ne kaha: Ye to maine bare baap-dada se wirse mein paya hai. Us ne kaha: Agar tum jhoote ho to Allah tumhein waisa kar de jaisa tum thay. Aur ganje ke paas us ki surat aur hai'at mein aaya aur use waisa hi kaha jaisa is se kaha tha, aur is ne use waisa hi jawab diya jaisa is ne diya tha. Kaha: Agar tum jhoote ho to Allah tumhein waisa kar de jaisa tum thay. Aur andhe ke paas us ki surat aur hai'at mein aaya aur kaha: Aik miskeen aadmi aur musafir hun, safar mein mere asbab toot gaye hain; aaj Allah ke siwa phir tumhare siwa mera guzara nahi. Us zaat ke waseele se tum se mangta hun jis ne tumhari beenayi lautayi, aik bakri jis se apne safar mein pahunch jaaun. Us ne kaha: Main andha tha to Allah ne meri beenayi lautayi aur faqeer tha; pas jo chahe le lo, Allah ki qasam aaj jo kuch Allah ke liye loge us par main tumhein mana nahi karunga. Us ne kaha: Apna maal sambhal rakho, tumhein to aazmaya gaya tha; Allah tum se raazi ho gaya aur tumhare donon sathiyon se naraz ho gaya."
"2053","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Jibreel mere paas aaye jab tum ne dekha to unhon ne mujhe pukara aur tum se chhupaya, to maine unhein jawab diya aur tum se chhupaya; aur wo tumhare paas dakhil nahi hote thay is haal mein ke tum ne kapre utar diye thay, aur maine samjha ke tum so gayin. Pas maine tumhein jagana makrooh samjha aur darra ke tum ghabra jaogi. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak tumhara Rab tumhein hukm deta hai ke ehl-e-Baqee ke paas jao aur un ke liye maghfirat mango."
"2054","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Jibreel har saal mujh se aik baar Quran ka daur karte thay aur is saal unhon ne mujh se do baar daur kiya; aur main nahi samjhta magar ye ke meri maut qareeb aa gayi hai, aur tum mere ghar walon mein sab se pehle mujh se milne wali ho; pas Allah se daro aur sabr karo, kyunke main tumhare liye kitna achha aage jane wala hun."
"2055","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Jibreel ne jab Zamzam ko apni airi se thokar mari to Ismail ki walida ret jama karne lagein; Allah Hajar par rehem kare, agar wo use chhor detin to wo behne wala chashma hota."
"2056","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak achhe ehad ko nibhana iman mein se hai."
"2057","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala par haq hai ke duniya ki jo cheez buland ho use gira de."
"2058","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mera hauz Aila se Adan tak se zyada door hai; wo barf se zyada safed aur doodh ke saath shehed se zyada meetha hai, aur us ke bartan taron ki ginti se zyada hain; aur main logon ko us se aise rokunga jaisa aadmi logon ke unton ko apne hauz se rokta hai. Sahaba ne kaha: Kiya aap us din hamein pehchanenge? Farmaya: Haan, tumhari aik nishani hogi jo ummaton mein se kisi ki nahi hogi; tum mere paas wuzu ke asar se roshan chehre aur roshan haath-pair wale aaoge."
"2059","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mera hauz Aila se Adan tak se zyada door hai. Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, us ke bartan aasman ke taron ki ginti se zyada hain, aur wo doodh se zyada safed aur shehed se zyada meetha hai. Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, main use aise rokunga jaisa aadmi ajnabi unton ko apne hauz se rokta hai. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kiya aap hamein pehchanenge? Farmaya: Haan, tum hauz par mere paas wuzu ke asar se roshan chehre aur roshan haath-pair wale aaoge jo tumhare siwa kisi ke liye nahi honge."
"2060","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mera hauz Adan se Uman-e-Balqa tak hai; us ka pani doodh se zyada safed aur shehed se zyada meetha hai, us ke pyale taron ki ginti mein hain; jis ne us mein se aik ghoont piya wo is ke baad kabhi pyasa nahi hoga. Us par aane walon mein sab se pehle faqeer muhajir honge: paragan-da sar, maile kapre wale, jo aasuda aurtoun se nikah nahi karte aur jin ke liye ¤ darwaze nahi khole jate, jo apne zimme ka haq ada karte hain aur unhein un ka haq nahi diya jata."
"2061","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhara haiz tumhare haath mein nahi."
"2062","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke behtareen bande ehad poora karne wale aur khushbu lagane wale hain."
"2063","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein sab se behtar wo hain jo qarz achhi tarah ada karte hain."
"2064","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tabe'een mein sab se behtar aik aadmi hai jise Uwais kaha jata hai; us ki walida hai jis se wo neki karta hai; agar wo Allah par qasam khaye to Allah use poora kare. Us mein safedi thi; pas use hukm do ke tumhare liye maghfirat mange."
"2065","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mardon ki behtareen khushbu wo hai jis ki boo zahir ho aur rang chhupa ho, aur auraton ki behtareen khushbu wo hai jis ka rang zahir ho aur boo chhupi ho."
"2066","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum seenghi ke liye behtareen din satrahween, unneesween aur ikkeesween tareekh mein lagwate ho."
"2067","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Nabi Dawood alaihis salam apne haath ki kamayi ke siwa nahi khate thay."
"2068","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare khoon aur tumhare maal tum par haram hain jaisa tumhare is din ki hurmat tumhare is mahine mein tumhare is sheher mein hai. Khabardar, jahiliyyat ke har muamle ¤ ko mere donon qadmon ke neeche khatm kiya jata hai, jahiliyyat ke khoon khatm kiye jate hain, aur sab se pehla khoon jo main apne khoonon mein se khatm karta hun Rabeea bin Haris bin Abdul Muttalib ka khoon hai. Aur jahiliyyat ka sood khatm kiya jata hai, aur sab se pehla sood jo main apne soodon mein se khatm karta hun Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib ka sood hai, pas wo sara khatm kiya jata hai. Pas auraton ke baare mein Allah se daro kyunke tum ne unhein Allah ki amanat se liya hai aur un ki sharmgahon ko Allah ke kalime se halal kiya hai; aur beshak tumhara un par haq ye hai ke wo tumhare bichhaune par us ko na aane dein jise tum na-pasand karte ho; phir agar wo aisa karein to unhein halki maar maro jo nishan na dalay, aur un ka tum par haq un ki rozi aur un ka pehnawa dastoor ke mutabiq hai. Aur beshak maine tum mein wo chhor diya hai jise agar tum thaam loge to us ke baad kabhi gumrah nahi hoge: Allah ki kitab. Aur tum se mere baare mein pucha jayega to tum kiya kahoge? Sahaba ne kaha: Ham gawahi dete hain ke aap ne pahuncha diya, ada kar diya aur khair-khwahi ki. Pas farmaya: Ae Allah gawah reh."
"2069","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhara Rab apne bande par taajjub farmata hai jab wo kahe: Ae Rab mere gunah bakhsh de, is haal mein ke wo janta hai ke mere siwa gunah koi nahi bakhshta."
"2070","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhara Rab haya wala kareem hai; use sharm aati hai ke banda us ki taraf apne donon haath phailaye to wo unhein khaali lautaye."
"2071","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere Rab ne meri taraf bheja ke Quran aik harf par parho; to maine us ki taraf lautaya ke meri ummat par aasani karo. Phir us ne meri taraf bheja ke use do harfon par parho; to maine us ki taraf lautaya ke meri ummat par aasani karo. Phir us ne meri taraf bheja ke use saat harfon par parho, aur har ruju ke badle tumhare liye aik sawal hai jo tum mujh se mangoge. Maine kaha: Ae Allah meri ummat ko bakhsh de, ae Allah meri ummat ko bakhsh de; aur teesri ko us din ke liye rok rakha hai jis mein makhlooq meri taraf raghbat karegi, yahan tak ke Ibrahim bhi."
"2072","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Arab mein se kuch aadmi hain ke un mein se aik hadiya deta hai to main use apne paas maujood ke andaze par us ka badla deta hun, phir wo use kam samajhta hai aur mere baare mein narazgi zahir karta rehta hai. Allah ki qasam, is maqam ke baad main Arab mein se kisi aadmi ka hadiya qabool nahi karunga siwaye Quraishi, Ansari, Saqafi ya Dausi ke."
"2073","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak kuch aadmi Allah ke maal mein nahaq kharch karte hain; pas un ke liye qayamat ke din aag hai."
"2074","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aik aadmi ki maut qareeb aayi to jab wo zindagi se na-umeed hua to apne ghar walon ko waseeyat ki ke jab main mar jaaun to mere liye bohat si motee lakriyan jama karna, phir us mein aag jalana yahan tak ke jab wo mera gosht kha jaye aur meri haddiyon tak pahunch kar unhein jhulsa de to unhein lena aur peesna, phir hawa wale din ka intezar karna aur unhein samandar mein bikher dena. Unhon ne waisa hi kiya jaisa unhon ne hukm diya tha. Pas Allah ne use jama kiya aur us se farmaya: Tune aisa kyun kiya? Us ne kaha: Tere darr se. Pas use bakhsh diya."
"2075","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aik aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Allah falan ko nahi bakhshega. Allah ne farmaya: Kaun hai jo mere baare mein qasam khata hai ke main falan ko nahi bakhshunga? Pas beshak maine falan ko bakhsh diya aur tera amal zaya kar diya."
"2076","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aik aadmi ne ninyanwe jaanein qatl kein phir use tauba ka khayal aaya to us ne zameen walon mein sab se zyada aalim ke baare mein pucha. Use aik rahib ka pata diya gaya to wo us ke paas aaya aur kaha ke us ne ninyanwe jaanein qatl ki hain to kiya us ke liye tauba hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To us ne use qatl karkar ¤ sau poori kein. Phir us ne zameen walon mein sab se zyada aalim ke baare mein pucha to use aik aalim aadmi ka pata diya gaya. Us ne kaha ke us ne sau jaanein qatl ki hain to kiya us ke liye tauba hai? Us ne kaha: Haan, aur use tauba se kaun rok sakta hai? Falan falan zameen ki taraf jao kyunke wahan kuch log Allah ki ibadat karte hain, pas un ke saath Allah ki ibadat karo aur apni zameen ki taraf wapas na jao kyunke wo buri zameen hai. Wo chal para yahan tak ke jab aadhe raaste par pahuncha to use maut aa gayi; pas us ke baare mein rehmat ke farishte aur azab ke farishte jhagare. Rehmat ke farishte ne kaha: Ye tauba karke apne dil se Allah ki taraf mutawajje hokar aaya tha. Aur azab ke farishte ne kaha: Is ne kabhi koi khair ka kaam nahi kiya. Pas un ke paas aik farishta aadmi ki surat mein aaya to unhon ne use apne darmiyan faisla karne wala banaya. Us ne kaha: Donon zameenon ke darmiyan naapo, pas wo jis ke zyada qareeb ho usi ka hoga. Unhon ne naapa to use us zameen ke zyada qareeb paya jis ka us ne irada kiya tha; pas rehmat ke farishte ne us ki rooh qabz ki."
"2077","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum se pehle aik aadmi tha jise Allah ne maal diya tha; us ne apne beton se kaha jab maut qareeb aayi: Main tumhare liye kaisa baap tha? Unhon ne kaha: Behtareen baap. Us ne kaha: Maine kabhi koi khair ka kaam nahi kiya; pas jab main mar jaaun to mujhe jala dena, phir mujhe peesna, phir aandhi wale din mein bikher dena. Unhon ne aisa hi kiya. Pas Allah ne use jama kiya aur farmaya: Tumhein kis ne uksaya? Us ne kaha: Tere darr ne. Pas use apni rehmat se mila."
"2078","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aik aadmi ne kabhi koi khair ka kaam nahi kiya tha aur wo logon ko udhar deta tha; wo apne numa'inde se kehta: Jo aasaan ho wo le lo, jo mushkil ho wo chhor do aur darguzar karo, shayad Allah ham se darguzar kare. Phir jab wo mara to Allah ne farmaya: Kiya tune kabhi koi khair ka kaam kiya? Us ne kaha: Nahi, siwaye is ke ke mera aik ladka tha, main logon ko udhar deta tha; jab main use taqaza ke liye bhejta to use kehta: Jo aasaan ho wo le lo, jo mushkil ho wo chhor do aur darguzar karo, shayad Allah ham se darguzar kare. Allah ne farmaya: Maine ¤ tujh se darguzar kiya."
"2079","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum se pehle aik aadmi ke paas maut ka farishta us ki jaan qabz karne aaya to us se kaha: Kiya tune koi khair ka kaam kiya hai? Us ne kaha: Mujhe maloom nahi. Us se kaha: Dekh. Us ne kaha: Mujhe koi cheez maloom nahi siwaye is ke ke main logon se khareed-o-farokht karta tha aur un se narmi karta tha; tangdast ko mohlat deta tha aur khushhaal se darguzar karta tha. Pas Allah ne use jannat mein dakhil kiya."
"2080","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat walon mein se aik aadmi ne apne Rab se kheti ki ijazat mangi to us se farmaya: Kiya tum jo chaho us mein nahi ho? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi, lekin main kheti karna chahta hun. Pas us ne beej boya to palak jhapakne mein us ka ugna, pakna aur katna ho gaya, yahan tak ke paharron jaise dher ho gaye. Pas Allah farmata hai: Lo ae ibn Adam, tumhein koi cheez sairab nahi karti."
"2081","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel mein se aik aadmi ne Bani Israel ke aik aadmi se manga ke use aik hazar deenar udhar de. Us ne kaha: Gawah lao jinhein main gawah banau. Us ne kaha: Allah gawah kafi hai. Us ne kaha: Phir zamin lao. Us ne kaha: Allah zamin kafi hai. Us ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha. Pas us ne muqarrar muddat tak use de diye. Phir wo samandar mein nikla aur apni zaroorat poori ki, phir sawari talash ki jis par sawaar hokar muqarrar waqt par pahunche, lekin use koi sawari na mili. Pas us ne lakri li aur use khokla kiya, phir us mein aik hazar deenar aur apne saathi ki taraf apna khat rakha, phir us ki jagah band ki, phir use samandar ke paas laya aur kaha: Ae Allah, tu janta hai ke maine falanse ek hazar deenar udhar liye thay, us ne mujh se zamin manga to maine kaha: Allah zamin kafi hai, to wo tujh par raazi ho gaya; us ne mujh se gawah manga to maine kaha: Allah gawah kafi hai, to wo tujh par raazi ho gaya; aur maine koshish ki ke sawari paaun jis se use us ka maal bhejun lekin na pa saka, aur main use tere hawale karta hun. Pas us ne use samandar mein phenk diya yahan tak ke wo us mein dakhil ho gayi, phir wo wapas hua is haal mein ke sawari talash karta tha jis se ¤ apne sheher nikle. Phir wo aadmi jis ne use udhar diya tha nikla ke shayad koi sawari us ka maal lekar aayi ho; to us lakri ko paya jis mein maal tha, pas use apne ghar walon ke liye lakri samajh kar le liya. Phir jab use cheera to maal aur khat paya. Phir wo aaya jis ne udhar liya tha aur aik hazar deenar lekar aaya aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, main sawari talash karne mein koshish karta raha taake tumhein tumhara maal pahunchau lekin us sawari se pehle koi sawari na pa saka jis mein aaya hun. Us ne kaha: Kiya tum ne meri taraf kuch bheja tha? Us ne kaha: Tumhein batata hun ke us sawari se pehle mujhe koi sawari na mili jis mein aaya hun. Us ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne tumhari taraf se wo ada kar diya jo tum ne lakri mein bheja tha; pas aik hazar deenar lekar seedhi raah par wapas jao."
"2082","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum se pehle aik aadmi ko phora nikla; jab us ne use takleef di to us ne apni tirkash se teer nikala aur use cheer diya; khoon behna band na hua yahan tak ke wo mar gaya. Pas Allah ne farmaya: Mere bande ne apni jaan ke saath mujh se jaldi ki, maine us par jannat haram kar di."
"2083","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Yaman se tumhare paas aik aadmi aayega jise Uwais kaha jata hai; wo Yaman mein apni walida ke siwa kisi ko nahi chhore ga; us mein safedi thi to us ne Allah se dua ki to Allah ne dirham ki jagah ke barabar ke siwa use door kar diya; pas tum mein se jo use paye use hukm do ke tumhare liye maghfirat mange."
"2084","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Rooh-ul-Qudus tumhare saath hai jab tak tum un se hija karte ho."
"2085","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Rooh-ul-Qudus ne mere dil mein phoonka hai ke koi jaan nahi maregi yahan tak ke apni muddat poori kar le aur apni rozi poori le le; pas Allah se daro aur talab mein ahsand andaz ikhtiyar karo; aur rizq ka dair se milna tum mein se kisi ko is par na uksaye ke use Allah ki nafarmani se talash kare, kyunke Allah ¤ taala ke paas jo hai wo us ki itaat ke siwa hasil nahi hota."
"2086","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Rooh-ul-Qudus hamesha tumhari madad karta rahega jab tak tum Allah aur us ke Rasool ki taraf se difa karte ho. Ye Hassan radiya Allahu anhu se kaha."
"2087","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Zahir hamara dehati hai aur ham us ke shehri hain."
"2088","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qaum ko pilane wala sab se aakhir mein piyega."
"2089","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak SubhanAllah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah aur Allahu Akbar gunahon ko aise jhar dete hain jaisa darakht apne patte jharta hai."
"2090","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Sulaiman bin Dawood ne jab Bait-ul-Maqdis banaya to Allah azza wa jal se teen khaslatein mangein: Allah se aisa faisla manga jo us ke faisle ke muwafiq ho to use diya gaya; Allah se aisi saltanat mangi jo un ke baad kisi ke liye jaiz na ho to use diya gaya; aur Allah se manga jab masjid ki tameer se farigh hue ke jo bhi us mein aaye use sirf us mein namaz parhna laye to use us ke gunah se aise nikale jaisa us din tha jis din us ki maan ne use jana tha. Do to use di gayin aur main umeed rakhta hun ke teesri bhi use di gayi hogi."
"2091","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Quran mein se aik surat tees aayaton wali hai jis ne aik aadmi ki sifarish ki yahan tak ke use bakhsh diya gaya ¤ aur wo ye hai: Wo zaat bare barkat wali hai jis ke haath mein badshahat hai."
"2092","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ki kitab mein se aik surat jo sirf tees aayatein hai us ne aik aadmi ki sifarish ki to use aag se nikala aur jannat mein dakhil kiya."
"2093","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat ki seyahat Allah ki raah mein jihad hai."
"2094","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak bure charwahe zulm karne wale sakht hain."
"2095","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein Allah ke nazdeek qayamat ke din darje mein sab se bura wo hai jise logon ne us ki behayai se bachne ke liye chhor diya ho."
"2096","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat ke shaheed to ye honge: Allah ki raah mein qatl hona shahadat hai, taa'oon se marna shahadat hai, wo aurat jo jama yani hamal ki haalat mein mare shahadat hai, doobna, jalna aur pehlu ke dard se marna shahadat hai."
"2097","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak bayen taraf wala farishta Musalman khata-kar bande se cheh ghari tak qalam uthaye rakhta hai; phir agar wo nadim ho aur Allah se maghfirat mange to use gira deta hai, warna aik likh li jati hai."
"2098","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi ki jamaat mein namaz us ki akele namaz se pachees hisson se zyada hai."
"2099","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aik ka khana donon ko kafi hai, aur donon ka khana teen aur chaar ko kafi hai, aur chaar ka khana paanch aur cheh ko kafi hai."
"2100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi ki namaz ka lamba hona aur us ke khutbe ka chhota hona us ke faqih hone ki nishani hai; pas namaz lambi karo aur khutba chhota karo, aur beshak kuch bayan jadu hai."
"2101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Ashura Allah ke dinon mein se aik din hai; pas jo chahe use roza rakhe aur jo chahe chhor de."
"2102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qabr ka aksar azab peshab se hai; pas us se bacho."
"2103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aik bande ne gunah kiya phir kaha: Ae Rab maine gunah kiya pas use bakhsh de. Us ke Rab ne farmaya: Kiya mera banda janta hai ke us ka aik Rab hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur us par pakarta hai? Maine apne bande ko bakhsh diya. Phir wo raha jitna Allah ne chaha, phir us ne gunah kiya aur kaha: Ae mere Rab maine dusra gunah kiya pas mujhe bakhsh de. Farmaya: Kiya mera banda janta hai ke us ka aik Rab hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur us par pakarta hai? Maine apne bande ko bakhsh diya. Phir us ne gunah kiya aur kaha: Ae Rab maine dusra gunah kiya pas mujhe bakhsh de. Farmaya: Kiya mera banda janta hai ke us ka aik Rab hai jo gunah bakhshta hai aur us par pakarta hai? Maine apne bande ko bakhsh diya, pas wo jo chahe kare."
"2104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Abdullah bin Qais ko Aal-e-Dawood ke mizmaron mein se aik mizmar diya gaya hai."
"2105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Abdullah naik aadmi hai, kaash wo raat mein kasrat se namaz parhta."
"2106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Usman haya wale parde wale hain, un se farishte haya karte hain."
"2107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Usman haya wale aadmi hain, aur mujhe darr hua ke agar maine unhein ijazat di is haal mein ke main us halat par hun to wo mujh tak apni hajat na pahuncha sakenge."
"2108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ka dushman Iblees aag ka shola lekar aaya taake use ¤ mere chehre mein dale; pas maine kaha: Main tujh se Allah ki panah mangta hun, teen baar. Phir maine kaha: Main tujh par Allah ki kaamil laanat karta hun. Wo teen baar peechhe na hata. Phir maine chaha ke use pakar lun; Allah ki qasam, agar hamare bhai Sulaiman ki dua na hoti to wo bandha hua subah karta jis se ehl-e-Madina ke bachche khelte."
"2109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is ummat ka azab us ki duniya mein rakha gaya hai."
"2110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak bare badle ke saath bari aazmaish hai, aur beshak Allah taala jab kisi qaum se mohabbat kare to unhein aazmata hai; pas jo raazi hua us ke liye raza hai aur jo naraz hua us ke liye narazgi hai."
"2111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jinon mein se aik ifreet kal raat mujh par jhapat para taake meri namaz kaat de; pas Allah ne mujhe us par qaboo diya to maine use daba diya aur chaha ke use masjid ke sutunon mein se aik sutun se bandh dun taake tum sab subah use dekho; phir mujhe mere bhai Sulaiman ka qaul yaad aaya ke ae mere Rab mujhe bakhsh de aur mujhe aisi saltanat de jo mere baad kisi ke liye jaiz na ho. Pas Allah ne use zaleel karke lautaya."
"2112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo ilm jis se faida na uthaya jaye aise khazane ki tarah hai jis mein se Allah ki raah mein kharch na kiya jaye."
"2113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi ka chacha us ke baap ke barabar hai."
"2114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak kafir ki khaal ki motayi Jabbar ke haath ke andaze se bayalees haath hai ¤ aur us ki daarh Uhud paharr jaisi hai, aur jahannam mein us ki baithne ki jagah Makkah aur Madina ke darmiyan jitni hai."
"2115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Fatima mere jism ka tukra hai aur mujhe darr hai ke wo apne deen mein aazmaish mein pare; aur main na halal ko haram karta hun na haram ko halal, lekin Allah ki qasam, Rasoolullah ki beti aur Allah ke dushman ki beti aik mard ke neeche kabhi jama nahi hongi."
"2116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Malhama ke din Musalmanon ka markaz Ghouta mein hoga, us sheher ke kinare jise Damishq kaha jata hai jo Sham ke behtareen shehron mein se hai."
"2117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Ayesha ki fazeelat auraton par aisi hai jaisi sareed ki fazeelat baqi khano par hai."
"2118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak faqeer muhajir qayamat ke din ameeron se chaalees saal pehle jannat mein jayenge."
"2119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak falan ne mujhe untni hadiya ki to maine use us ke badle cheh jawan unt diye phir bhi wo naraz raha; pas maine irada kar liya hai ke Quraishi, Ansari, Saqafi ya Dausi ke siwa kisi ka hadiya qabool na karun."
"2120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Juma mein aik ghari hai; jo Musalman banda us mein khara namaz parhta hua Allah se khair mange Allah use ata karta hai."
"2121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein aik darwaza hai jise Rayyan kaha jata hai; us mein se qayamat ke din rozedar dakhil honge, un ke siwa koi us mein se dakhil nahi hoga. Kaha jayega: Rozedar kahan hain? Pas wo khare honge aur us mein se dakhil honge; phir jab wo dakhil ho jayenge to band kar diya jayega aur us mein se koi dakhil nahi hoga."
"2122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein pani ka samandar, shehed ka samandar, doodh ka samandar aur sharab ka samandar hai; phir is ke baad nehrein phootengi."
"2123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein aise bala-khane hain jin ka bahar andar se aur andar bahar se dekha jata hai; Allah taala ne unhein us ke liye tayyar kiya hai jo khana khilaye, narm kalaam kare, lagatar roze rakhe aur raat mein namaz parhe jab log so rahe hon."
"2124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein aik bazaar hai jis mein wo har Juma aayenge; us mein mushk ke teele hain, pas shumali hawa chalegi aur un ke chehron aur kapron mein udayegi to wo husn aur jamal mein barh jayenge. Phir wo apne ghar walon ke paas wapas aayenge is haal mein ke husn aur jamal mein barh chuke honge; un ke ghar wale un se kahenge: Allah ki qasam, tum hamare baad husn aur jamal mein barh gaye ho. Wo kahenge: Aur tum bhi, Allah ki qasam, hamare baad husn aur jamal mein barh gayin ho."
"2125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein aik darakht hai ke tez-raftar tayyar ghore par sawaar us ke saye mein sau saal chale phir bhi use paar na kare."
"2126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein sau darje hain jo Allah ne Allah ki raah mein jihad karne walon ke liye tayyar kiye hain; do darjon ke darmiyan aasman aur zameen jitna faasla hai; pas jab Allah se mango to Firdous mango kyunke wo jannat ka darmiyan aur jannat ka sab se uncha hissa hai, aur us ke upar Rehman ka Arsh hai aur usi se jannat ki nehrein phootti hain."
"2127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein wo hai jo na kisi aankh ne dekha, na kisi kaan ne suna aur na kisi ke dil par us ka khayal guzra."
"2128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak seenghi lagwane mein shifa hai."
"2129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak namaz mein mashghal hai."
"2130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak raat mein aik ghari hai; jo Musalman banda us mein duniya aur aakhirat ke muamle mein se khair mange Allah taala use ata karta hai, aur ye har raat hota hai."
"2131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat mein baarah munafiq hain jo jannat mein dakhil nahi honge aur na ¤ us ki khushbu payenge yahan tak ke unt sui ke naake mein dakhil ho jaye; un mein se aath ke liye dubeela kafi hogi: aag ka chiragh jo un ke kandhon mein zahir hoga yahan tak ke un ke seenon se namudar hoga."
"2132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat mein dhansna, maskh hona aur patharon se marna hoga."
"2133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Saqeef mein aik kazzaab aur aik khoon bahane wala hoga."
"2134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere hauz mein aasman ke taron ki ginti mein aabkhore hain."
"2135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Aaliya ki ajwa khajoor mein shifa hai aur wo subah ke aaghaz se zeher ka tor hai."
"2136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein do khaslatein hain jinhein Allah taala pasand karta hai: burdbari aur tehammul."
"2137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi ke maal mein fitna hai aur us ki biwi aur aulad mein fitna hai."
"2138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere hauz ka andaza Aila se Yaman ke San'a tak jitna hai, aur us mein aasman ke taron ki ginti mein aabkhore hain."
"2139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Quraish amanat wale hain; jo un se thokar ki khwahish rakhe ga Allah use naak ke bal gira dega."
"2140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Quraish jahiliyyat aur museebat ke naye daur wale hain, aur maine chaha ke unhein ata dun aur un ki dil-joi karun. Kiya tum raazi nahi ke log duniya lekar lautein aur tum Rasoolullah ko lekar apne gharon ko lauto? Agar log kisi wadi ya ghati mein chalein to main Ansar ki wadi aur un ki ghati mein chalunga."
"2141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Adam ke dil sab Rehman ki ungliyon mein se do ungliyon ke darmiyan aik dil ki tarah hain, use jahan chahe pherta hai."
"2142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujh par jhoot kisi par jhoot jaisa nahi; pas jis ne mujh par jaan-boojh kar jhoot bola wo aag mein apna thikana bana le."
"2143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Musalman ki haddi ka marne ke baad tootna us ke jeete ji tootne jaisa hai."
"2144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har namaz apne saamne ke gunah mita deti hai."
"2145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare gharon mein rehne wale hain; pas unhein teen baar khabardar karo, phir agar is ke baad tumhein un mein se kuch zahir ho to use qatl kar do."
"2146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak haq wale ke liye bolne ka haq hai."
"2147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har ummat ka aik ameen hota hai aur is ummat ka ameen Abu Ubaida bin Jarrah hai."
"2148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har ummat ki aik aazmaish hoti hai aur meri ummat ki aazmaish maal hai."
"2149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har deen ka aik akhlaq hota hai aur Islam ka akhlaq haya hai."
"2150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har cheez ki haqeeqat hai, aur banda iman ki haqeeqat ko nahi pahunchta yahan tak ke jaan le ke jo use pahuncha wo us se chookne wala nahi tha aur jo us se chooka wo use pahunchne wala nahi tha."
"2151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har cheez ki josh hoti hai aur har josh ki susti hoti hai; pas jo us wala seedha rahe aur darmiyana rawi ikhtiyar kare to us se umeed rakho, aur jis ki taraf ungliyon se ishara kiya jaye to use mat gino."
"2152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har amal ki josh hoti hai aur har josh ki susti hoti hai; pas jis ki susti meri sunnat ki taraf ho wo hidayat pa gaya aur jis ki kisi aur taraf ho wo halak ho gaya."
"2153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har dhokebaaz ke liye qayamat ke din aik jhanda hoga jis se wo us ki pusht ke paas pehchana jayega."
"2154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har nabi ka aik ameen hota hai aur mera ameen Abu Ubaida bin Jarrah hai."
"2155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har nabi ka aik hawari hota hai aur mera hawari Zubair hai."
"2156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har nabi ka aik hauz hota hai aur wo fakhr karenge ke un mein se kis ke paas aane wale zyada hain; aur main umeed rakhta hun ke un mein sab se zyada aane wale mere honge."
"2157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har nabi ki aik dua hoti hai jo us ne apni ummat mein mangi aur us ke liye qabool ki gayi; aur maine apni dua qayamat ke din apni ummat ke liye sifarish ke liye chhupa rakhi hai."
"2158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak har nabi ke nabiyon mein se sarparast hote hain aur mera sarparast mere baap yani Ibrahim aur mere Rab ka khaleel hai."
"2159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare liye wo hai jo tum ne sawab ki niyyat se kharch kiya."
"2160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare liye ajr tumhari mehnat aur tumhare kharch ke andaze par hai."
"2161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare liye har qadam par aik darja hai."
"2162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Islam ki nishaniyan aur minare hain jo raaste ke minaron jaise hain."
"2163","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke liye zameen walon mein se bartan hain, aur tumhare Rab ke bartan us ke naik bandon ke dil hain; aur un mein us ke nazdeek sab se pyare narm aur raqeeq dil hain."
"2164","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke kuch bande hain jinhein wo bandon ke faide ke liye neimaton ke saath khaas karta hai aur un mein qayam rakhta hai jab tak wo kharch karte hain; phir jab wo rokte hain to un se chheen kar ghairon ki taraf pher deta hai."
"2165","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke logon mein se ghar wale hain: ehl-e-Quran Allah wale aur us ke khaas hain."
"2166","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke ninyanwe naam hain, aik kam sau; jis ne unhein yaad kiya wo jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"2167","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke ninyanwe naam hain, aik kam sau; koi unhein yaad nahi karta magar jannat mein dakhil hota hai; aur wo taaq hai, taaq ko pasand karta hai."
"2168","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke kuch bande hain jo logon ko firasat se pehchante hain."
"2169","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke har din aur raat mein aazad kiye jane wale hain; un mein se har bande ke liye qabool hone wali dua hai."
"2170","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke liye har iftar ke waqt aag se aazad kiye jane wale hain, aur ye har raat hota hai."
"2171","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke liye hai jo us ne liya aur usi ke liye hai jo us ne diya, aur har cheez us ke paas muqarrar muddat ke saath hai."
"2172","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke liye sau rehmatein hain; un mein se aik rehmat jinon, insanon, janwaron aur keere-makoron ke darmiyan utari hai; usi se wo aapas mein narmi karte hain, usi se wo aapas mein rehem karte hain aur usi se wehshi janwar apne bachche par shafqat karta hai; aur ninyanwe rehmatein rok rakhi hain jin se qayamat ke din apne bandon par rehem karega."
"2173","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke zameen mein ghoomne wale farishte hain jo logon ke aamaal likhne walo ¤ ke siwa fazil hain; wo raaston mein ghoomte hain aur ehl-e-zikr talash karte hain; phir jab wo aise logon ko pate hain jo Allah ka zikr kar rahe hon to pukarte hain: Apni hajat ki taraf aao. Pas unhein apne paron se duniya ke aasman tak gher lete hain. Phir un ka Rab un se puchta hai is haal mein ke wo un se zyada janne wala hai: Mere bande kiya kehte hain? Wo kehte hain: Wo teri tasbeeh, takbeer, tahmeed aur tamjeed karte hain. Farmata hai: Kiya unhon ne mujhe dekha hai? Wo kehte hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, unhon ne tujhe nahi dekha. Farmata hai: Agar wo mujhe dekhte to kaisa hota? Wo kehte hain: Agar wo tujhe dekhte to teri ibadat mein zyada sakht, teri tamjeed mein zyada aur teri tasbeeh mein zyada hote. Farmata hai: Wo mujh se kiya mangte hain? Wo kehte hain: Wo tujh se jannat mangte hain. Farmata hai: Aur kiya unhon ne use dekha hai? Wo kehte hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam ae Rab, unhon ne use nahi dekha. Farmata hai: Agar wo use dekhte to kaisa hota? Wo kehte hain: Agar wo use dekhte to us ki hirs mein zyada sakht, us ki talab mein zyada aur us mein raghbat mein zyada hote. Farmaya: Wo kis se panah mangte hain? Wo kehte hain: Aag se. Pas Allah farmata hai: Kiya unhon ne use dekha hai? Wo kehte hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam ae Rab, unhon ne use nahi dekha. Farmata hai: Agar wo use dekhte to kaisa hota? Wo kehte hain: Agar wo use dekhte to us se bhaagne mein zyada sakht aur us se darne mein zyada hote. Farmata hai: Pas main tumhein gawah karta hun ke maine unhein bakhsh diya. Phir farishton mein se aik farishta kehta hai: Un mein falan hai jo un mein se nahi, wo to sirf apni hajat ke liye aaya tha. Farmata hai: Ye aise log hain ke un ka humnasheen badbakht nahi hota."
"2174","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke zameen mein ghoomne wale farishte hain jo meri ummat ki taraf se mujhe salam pahunchate hain."
"2175","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ke zameen mein farishte hain jo Bani Adam ki zubanon par wo bolte hain jo aadmi mein khair ya shar mein se hai."
"2176","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taala ka aik farishta hai jise bandon ki sunne ki taqat di gayi hai; jo bhi mujh par durood bhejta hai wo use mujhe pahunchata hai; aur maine apne Rab se manga ke jo banda mujh par aik durood bheje us par us ke das guna durood bheje."
"2177","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tauba ke liye aik darwaza hai jis ke donon paton ke darmiyan mashriq aur maghrib jitna faasla hai; wo band nahi hoga yahan tak ke suraj maghrib se tuloo ho."
"2178","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak namaz ka awwal aur aakhir hai; beshak zuhr ki namaz ka awwal waqt jab suraj dhal jaye aur us ka aakhir waqt jab asr ka waqt dakhil ho; aur beshak asr ka awwal waqt jab us ka waqt dakhil ho aur us ka aakhir waqt jab suraj peela ho jaye; aur beshak maghrib ka awwal waqt jab suraj ghurub ho aur us ka aakhir waqt jab shafaq ghaib ho; aur beshak isha aakhira ka awwal waqt jab shafaq ghaib ho aur us ka aakhir waqt jab aadhi raat ho; aur beshak fajr ka awwal waqt jab fajr tuloo ho aur us ka aakhir waqt jab suraj tuloo ho."
"2179","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak kha kar shukr karne wale ke liye sabr karne wale rozedar jitna ajr hai."
"2180","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qabr ki giraft hai; agar koi us se nijaat pane wala hota to Saad bin Muaz nijaat pate."
"2181","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Quraishi ke liye ghair Quraishi ke do aadmiyon jitni taqat hai."
"2182","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin ke liye jannat mein moti ka aik khaima hoga jo andar se khokla hai, us ki lambayi saath meel hai; momin ke liye us mein ghar wale honge jin par momin phirega aur un mein se koi dusre ko nahi dekhega."
"2183","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maut ke liye ghabrahat hai; pas jab tum janaza dekho to khare ho jao."
"2184","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is pathar ke liye zaban aur donon hont hain jo qayamat ke din us ke liye gawahi denge jis ne use haq ke saath chhua."
"2185","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak in unton ke liye wehshi janwaron jaise bhagne wale hain; pas jab tum par un mein se koi ghalib aaye to us ke saath aisa hi karo."
"2186","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak in gharon ke liye rehne wale hain; pas jab tum un mein se kuch dekho to unhein teen baar khabardar karo; phir agar wo chala jaye to theek warna use qatl kar do kyunke wo kafir hai."
"2187","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak us mein chiknahat hai, yani doodh mein."
"2188","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak us ke liye jannat mein doodh pilane wali hai, yani us ke bete Ibrahim ke liye."
"2189","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere paanch naam hain: main Muhammad hun aur main Ahmad hun aur main Hashir hun jiske qadmon par log jama kiye jayenge, aur main Mahi hun jiske zariye Allah kufr mitayega, aur main Aqib hun."
"2190","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat ke donon paton ke darmiyan chaalees saal ki musafat hai."
"2191","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jo rehem mein muqaddar kiya gaya hai wo hokar rahega."
"2192","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak us ki misal jo burayiyan kare phir nekiyan kare aise aadmi ki misal hai jis par tang zirah thi jis ne use ghont rakha tha, phir us ne aik neki ki to aik kari khul gayi, phir dusri ki to dusri khul gayi, yahan tak ke wo zameen par nikal aaya."
"2193","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak us ki misal jo apne atiye mein wapas le aise kutte ki misal hai jis ne khaya yahan tak ke jab sair hua to qai ki, phir apni qai mein wapas aaya aur use khaya."
"2194","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Hajr-e-Aswad aur Rukn-e-Yamani ko chhuna gunahon ko girawat se girata hai."
"2195","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ibn Adam ka khana duniya ke liye misal banaya gaya hai; agarche use masale aur namak lagaye, phir dekho wo kis mein badalta hai."
"2196","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Dajjal ke saath jab nikle pani aur aag hogi; raha wo jise log aag samjhenge to wo thanda pani hai, aur raha wo jise log thanda pani samjhenge to wo jalane wali aag hai; pas tum mein se jo use paye wo us mein gire jise wo aag samjhe kyunke wo meetha thanda hai."
"2197","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Makkah ko Allah ne haram qaraar diya hai aur logon ne haram qaraar nahi diya; pas kisi aadmi ke liye jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho jaiz nahi ke us mein khoon bahaye aur na us mein darakht kaate. Phir agar koi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke us mein larne ki ijazat se faida uthaye to kaho: Beshak Allah ne apne Rasool ko ijazat di thi aur tumhein ijazat nahi di; aur mujhe sirf din ki aik ghari ijazat di gayi thi, phir aaj us ki hurmat waisi ho gayi jaisi kal thi; aur hazir ghaib tak pahunchaye."
"2198","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere paas aik farishta aaya aur kaha: Beshak tumhara Rab tum se farmata hai: Kiya tum raazi nahi ke tumhari ummat mein se jo tum par durood bheje main us par das durood bhejun, aur jo tum par salam bheje main us par das salam bhejun? Maine kaha: Kyun nahi."
"2199","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ki tazeem mein se Musalman safed-baal wale ka ikram hai, aur Quran uthane wale ka jo us mein ghulu na kare aur na us se door ho, aur insaf karne wale hukmaran ka ikram hai."
"2200","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein sab se zyada mere mehboob tum mein sab se achhe akhlaq wale hain."
"2201","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein sab se zyada mere mehboob aur qayamat ke din mujh se majlis mein sab se zyada qareeb tum mein sab se achhe akhlaq wale hain; aur beshak tum mein sab se zyada mere na-pasandida aur qayamat ke din mujh se sab se zyada door bak-bak karne wale, munh bhar kar bolne wale aur takabbur se bolne wale honge. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, mutafaihiqoon kaun hain? Farmaya: Takabbur karne wale."
"2202","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein Quran ki sab se achhi aawaz wala wo hai jise jab tum suno ke parh raha hai to dekho ke wo Allah se darta hai."
"2203","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se bara sood nahaq Musalman ki izzat mein zyadati karna hai."
"2204","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din sab se sakht azab wale wo honge jo Allah ki makhlooq se mushabehat karte hain."
"2205","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke tum aisi qaum se laroge jo baalon ke joote pehente honge, aur beshak qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke tum aisi qaum se laroge jin ke chehre chaude honge goya un ke chehre kutti hui dhalon jaise hain."
"2206","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke ilm uthaya jayega, jahalat zahir hogi, zina phail jayega, sharab pi jayegi, mard chale jayenge aur auratein baqi rahengi yahan tak ke pachaas auraton ke liye aik nigran hoga."
"2207","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke ilm chhoton se talash kiya jayega."
"2208","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pakeeza jo aadmi ne khaya us ki kamayi hai, aur us ki aulad us ki kamayi mein se hai."
"2209","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se azeem jihad zaalim hukmaran ke paas insaf ki baat kehna hai."
"2210","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se bare buhtan mein se hai ke aadmi apne baap ke siwa ki taraf mansoob ho, ya apni aankhon se wo dikhaye jo unhon ne nahi dekha, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par wo kahe jo unhon ne nahi kaha."
"2211","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se bare buhtan mein se hai ke aadmi khwab mein apni aankh se wo dikhaye jo us ne nahi dekha."
"2212","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare behtareen dinon mein se Juma ka din hai; us mein Adam paida kiye gaye, us mein un ki rooh qabz ki gayi, us mein soor phoonka jayega aur us mein behoshi hogi; pas us mein mujh par kasrat se durood bhejo kyunke tumhara durood mujh par pesh kiya jata hai. Beshak Allah ne zameen par ambiya ke jismon ko khana haram kiya hai."
"2213","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se bare kabeera gunahon mein se Allah ke saath shirk karna, walidain ki nafarmani aur jhooti qasam khana hai; aur jo qasam khane wala Allah ki qasam khaye jo use rokne wali ho phir us mein machhar ¤ ke par ke barabar bhi milawat kare us ke dil mein qayamat ke din tak aik nukta laga diya jayega."
"2214","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sab se bare kabeera gunahon mein se hai ke aadmi apne walidain ko laanat kare: kisi aadmi ke baap ko laanat kare to wo us ke baap ko laanat kare, aur us ki maan ko laanat kare to wo us ki maan ko laanat kare."
"2215","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak kuch bayan jadu hai aur beshak kuch sher hikmat hain."
"2216","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak kuch bayan jadu hai."
"2217","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak gandum se sharab hai, beshak jau se sharab hai, beshak khajoor se sharab hai, beshak kishmish se sharab hai aur beshak shehed se sharab hai; aur main har nasha-aawar se mana karta hun."
"2218","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak darakhton mein se aik darakht hai jis ke patte nahi girte aur wo Musalman ki misal hai; pas mujhe batao wo kaun sa hai? Phir farmaya: Wo khajoor hai."
"2219","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak kuch sher hikmat hain."
"2220","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak angoor se sharab hai, beshak khajoor se sharab hai, beshak shehed se sharab hai, beshak gandum se sharab hai aur beshak jau se sharab hai."
"2221","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ghairat mein se kuch wo hai jise Allah pasand karta hai aur kuch wo hai jise Allah na-pasand karta hai; aur beshak takabbur mein se kuch wo hai jise Allah pasand karta hai aur kuch wo hai jise Allah na-pasand karta hai. Rahi wo ghairat jise Allah pasand karta hai to shak wali jagah mein ghairat hai, aur rahi wo ghairat jise Allah na-pasand karta hai to baghair shak wali jagah mein ghairat hai. Aur raha wo takabbur jise Allah pasand karta hai to aadmi ka larayi mein aur sadqe ke waqt fakhr se chalna hai, aur raha wo takabbur jise Allah na-pasand karta hai to aadmi ka zulm aur fakhr mein fakhr se chalna hai."
"2222","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak fitrat mein se hain: kulli karna, naak mein pani dalna, miswak karna, moonchhein katna, nakhun tarashna, baghal ke baal ukherna, zer-e-naaf baal saaf karna, joron ko dhona, pani se chheente marna aur khatna karna."
"2223","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein se kuch log khair ki kunjiyan aur shar ke taale hain, aur beshak logon mein se kuch log shar ki kunjiyan aur khair ke taale hain; pas khushkhabri us ke liye jise Allah ne khair ki kunjiyan us ke haathon par rakhin, aur kharabi us ke liye jise Allah ne shar ki kunjiyan us ke haathon par rakhin."
"2224","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat mein se aik qaum hai jinhein un ke awwalon ke ajr jaisa diya jayega; wo munkar ko bura janenge."
"2225","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak namaz ke mukammal hone mein se saff seedhi karna hai."
"2226","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein Allah ke nazdeek qayamat ke din sab se bura do chehron wala hai."
"2227","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is ki nasal mein se aik qaum hogi jo Quran parhegi jo un ke halq se neeche nahi utrega; wo ehl-e-Islam ko qatl karenge aur buton walon ko chhor denge; wo Islam se aise nikal jayenge jaisa teer shikar se nikal jata hai; agar main unhein paaun to unhein Aad ke qatl ki tarah qatl karunga."
"2228","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke bandon mein se kuch aise hain ke agar wo Allah par qasam khayen to Allah use poora kare."
"2229","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maghrib ki taraf se aik khula darwaza hai jis ki chaurayi sattar saal hai; wo darwaza hamesha khula rahega yahan tak ke suraj us ki taraf tuloo ho; phir jab us ki taraf se tuloo hoga to us jaan ko us ka iman faida nahi dega jo pehle iman na layi ho ya apne iman mein khair na kamayi ho."
"2230","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jo kuch logon ne pehli nabuwat ke kalaam mein se paya wo ye hai ke jab tujh mein haya na rahe to jo chahe kar."
"2231","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jo momin ke amal aur us ki nekiyon mein se us ki maut ke baad us se milega wo ye hai: ilm jo us ne phailaya, naik aulad jo us ne chhori, Quran ka nuskha jo us ne wirse mein diya, ya masjid jo us ne banayi, ya musafir ke liye ghar jo us ne banaya, ya neher jo us ne jari ki, ya sadqa jo us ne apne maal mein se apni sehat aur zindagi mein nikala jo us ki maut ke baad us se milega."
"2232","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maghfirat ko wajib karne wali cheezein salam phailana aur achhi guftagu hain."
"2233","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare peechhe aise din honge jin mein jahalat utregi, ilm uthaya jayega aur harj yani qatl kasrat se hoga."
"2234","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare peechhe sabr ka zamana hai; us mein thaamne wale ke liye tum mein se pachaas shaheedon ka ajr hai."
"2235","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aurat ki barkat mein se us ke paigham ka aasaan hona, us ke meher ka aasaan hona aur us ke rehem ka aasaan hona hai."
"2236","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se kuch aadmi hain jinhein main kuch nahi deta aur unhein un ke iman ke hawale karta hun; un mein se Furat bin Hayyan hain."
"2237","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak un mein se kisi ko aag takhnon tak pakregi, kisi ko ghutnon tak, kisi ko kamar tak aur kisi ko gardan tak pakregi."
"2238","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Musa ne kaha: Ae Rab, hamein Adam dikha jis ne hamein aur apne aap ko jannat se nikalwaya. Pas Allah ne use Adam dikhaye. Us ne kaha: Tum hamare baap Adam ho? Adam ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tum wahi ho jis mein Allah ne apni rooh mein se phoonka, tumhein saare naam sikhaye aur farishton ko hukm diya to unhon ne tumhein sajda kiya? Us ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tumhein kis ne uksaya ke tum ne hamein aur apne aap ko ¤ jannat se nikalwaya? Adam ne kaha: Tum kaun ho? Us ne kaha: Main Musa hun. Us ne kaha: Tum Bani Israel ke nabi ho jis se Allah ne parde ke peechhe se kalaam kiya aur tumhare aur apne darmiyan apni makhlooq mein se koi rasool nahi rakha? Us ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tum ne ye paya ke wo Allah ki kitab mein mere paida hone se pehle tha? Us ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tum mujhe aisi cheez par malamat kyun karte ho jis mein mujh se pehle Allah ki taraf se taqdeer ho chuki? Pas Adam Musa par ghalib aaye, pas Adam Musa par ghalib aaye."
"2239","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Musa haya wale parde wale aadmi thay, haya ki wajah se un ki khaal mein se kuch nazar nahi aata tha; pas Bani Israel mein se jis ne unhein takleef di unhein takleef di aur kaha: Is ne ye parda is ke siwa nahi kiya ke us ki khaal mein aib hai, ya bars hai ya futaq hai ya koi aafat hai. Aur beshak Allah azza wa jal ne chaha ke unhein us se bari kare jo wo kehte thay; pas aik din akele hue aur apne kapre pathar par rakhe phir ghusl kiya. Phir jab farigh hue to apne kapre lene ke liye aaye to pathar un ka kapra lekar daur para; pas Musa ne apni laathi li aur pathar ka peechha kiya aur kehte jate thay: Mera kapra ae pathar, mera kapra ae pathar! Yahan tak ke Bani Israel ki jamaat tak pahunche to unhon ne unhein nanga dekha jo Allah ki banayi hui sab se khubsurat takhleeq thay, aur unhein us se bari kiya jo wo kehte thay. Pathar khara hua to unhon ne apna kapra liya aur pehna, aur pathar ko apni laathi se maarne lage; Allah ki qasam, pathar mein un ki maar ke asar se teen ya chaar ya paanch nishan hain. Pas yehi Allah taala ka farman hai ke ae iman walo, un ki tarah na ho jo Musa ko takleef dete thay to Allah ne unhein us se bari kiya jo wo kehte thay aur wo Allah ke nazdeek izzat wale thay."
"2240","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri ummat mein se kuch log honge jin ki nishani mundan hai; wo Quran parhenge jo un ke halq se neeche nahi utrega; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaisa teer shikar ¤ se nikal jata hai; wo makhlooq mein sab se bure honge."
"2241","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jinon mein se aik jamaat Madina mein Musalman hui hai; pas jab tum un mein se kisi ko dekho to use teen baar khabardar karo, phir agar is ke baad tumhein use qatl karna zahir ho to teen ke baad use qatl kar do."
"2242","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye donon namazein yani Isha aur Fajr munafiqon par sab se bhari namazein hain; aur agar wo jante jo fazeelat in mein hai to un mein aate agarche ghutnon par ghisat kar. Tum par agli saff lazim hai kyunke wo farishton ki saff jaisi hai; aur agar tum us ki fazeelat jante to us ki taraf daurte. Aur aadmi ki aik aadmi ke saath namaz us ki akele namaz se zyada pakeeza hai, aur us ki do aadmiyon ke saath namaz us ki aik aadmi ke saath namaz se zyada pakeeza hai; aur jo zyada ho wo Allah taala ko zyada mehboob hai."
"2243","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is ne meri talwar kheenchi is haal mein ke main soya hua tha; pas main jaaga to wo us ke haath mein nangi thi. Us ne mujh se kaha: Tumhein mujh se kaun bachayega? Maine kaha: Allah. Pas ye raha wo baitha hua hai."
"2244","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye muamla yani khilafat Quraish mein hai; jo un se dushmani karega Allah use munh ke bal gira dega jab tak wo deen qayam rakhein."
"2245","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye deenar aur dirham tum se pehlon ko halak kar chuke hain; yehi tumhein halak karenge."
"2246","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye deen mazboot hai; pas us mein narmi se dakhil ho."
"2247","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye mahina tum par aa gaya hai aur us mein aik raat hai jo hazar mah se behtar hai; jo us se mehroom raha wo tamam khair se mehroom raha, aur us ki khair se sirf mehroom hi mehroom rehta hai."
"2248","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye taa'oon gandagi aur azab ka bacha-khucha hai jis se aik qaum ko azab diya gaya; pas jab wo kisi zameen mein waqe ho aur tum us mein ho to us se bhaag kar us se na niklo, aur jab wo kisi zameen mein waqe ho aur tum us mein na ho to us mein dakhil na ho."
"2249","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye Quran saat harfon par utara gaya hai; pas us mein se jo aasaan ho parho."
"2250","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai; pas jis ne use haq ke saath liya us ke liye us mein barkat di jayegi, aur jis ne use nafs ki hirs se liya us ke liye us mein barkat nahi di jayegi aur wo us ki tarah hoga jo khata hai aur sair nahi hota; aur upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai."
"2251","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai; pas jis ne use haq ke saath paya us mein barkat di gayi; aur kitne hi apne dil ki khwahish se Allah aur us ke Rasool ke maal mein kharch karne wale hain jin ke liye qayamat ke din aag ke siwa kuch nahi."
"2252","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is masjid mein peshab nahi kiya jata; ye to sirf Allah ke zikr aur namaz ke liye banayi gayi hai."
"2253","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye waba gandagi hai jis se Allah ne tum se pehli ummaton ko halak kiya; aur us mein se kuch zameen mein baqi hai jo kabhi aata hai aur kabhi jata hai; pas jab wo kisi zameen mein waqe ho to us se bhaag kar us se na niklo, aur jab tum us ke baare mein suno ke wo kisi zameen mein hai to us ke paas na jao."
"2254","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye muamla Allah ne Bani Adam ki betiyon par likha hai; pas ghusl karo aur hajj ka ehraam bandho, aur wo karo jo haji karta hai siwaye is ke ke Baitullah ka tawaf na karo aur na namaz parho."
"2255","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye muamla Allah ne Bani Adam ki betiyon par likha hai; pas wo karo jo haji karta hai siwaye is ke ke Baitullah ka tawaf na karo."
"2256","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye us zikr ke kho jane par roya jo wo sunta tha, yani khajoor ka tana."
"2257","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye aik farishta hai jo is raat se pehle kabhi zameen par nahi utra; us ne apne Rab se ijazat mangi ke mujhe salam kare aur mujhe khushkhabri de ke Fatima jannat ki auraton ki sardar hain aur Hasan aur Husain jannat ke jawanon ke sardar hain."
"2258","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye din hai jise Allah ne Musalmanon ke liye eid banaya hai; pas jo Juma ko aaye wo ghusl kare, aur agar khushbu ho to us mein se lagaye; aur tum par miswak lazim hai."
"2259","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye din tha jis ka jahiliyyat wale roza rakhte thay; pas jo chahe use roza rakhe aur jo chahe chhor de, yani Ashura ka din."
"2260","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye nishaniyan jinhein Allah bhejta hai na kisi ki maut ke liye hoti hain na zindagi ke liye, lekin Allah unhein bhejta hai jin se wo apne bandon ko darata hai; pas jab tum un mein se kuch dekho to Allah ke zikr, us se dua aur us se maghfirat ki taraf daudo."
"2261","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye ummat rehem ki gayi ummat hai; us ka azab us ke haathon mein hai; phir jab qayamat ka din hoga to Musalmanon mein se har aadmi ki taraf mushrikon mein se aik aadmi diya jayega aur kaha jayega: Ye aag se tumhara fidya hai."
"2262","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye ummat apni qabron mein aazmayi jayegi; agar ye na hota ke tum dafan karna chhor doge to main Allah se dua karta ke tumhein qabr ke azab mein se sunaye jo main sunta hun. Allah se aag ke azab ki panah mango, Allah se qabr ke azab ki panah mango, Allah se fitnon ki panah mango jo zahir hon aur jo chhupe hon, Allah se Dajjal ke fitne ki panah mango."
"2263","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye tanhayi ki jaghein hazir hone ki jaghein hain; pas jab tum mein se koi pakhane jaye to kahe: Main Allah ki panah mangta hun khabees jinon aur jinnion se."
"2264","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye sadqe logon ke mail-kuchail hain, aur ye Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad ke liye halal nahi."
"2265","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is namaz mein logon ke kalaam mein se kuch durust nahi; ye to sirf tasbeeh, takbeer aur Quran ki tilawat hai."
"2266","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye namaz yani Asr tum se pehlon par pesh ki gayi thi to unhon ne use zaya kiya; pas tum mein se jo aaj us ki hifazat kare us ke liye do guna ajr hoga; aur us ke baad koi namaz nahi yahan tak ke gawah yani sitara tuloo ho."
"2267","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye qabrein apne walon par andhere se bhari hain, aur beshak Allah unhein mere un par durood bhejne se roshan karta hai."
"2268","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye masjidein gandagi ¤ peshab aur pakhane mein se kisi cheez ke liye durust nahi; ye to sirf Quran parhne, Allah ke zikr aur namaz ke liye hain."
"2269","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye aag tumhari dushman hai; pas jab tum so jao to use apni taraf se bujha do."
"2270","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye laitna hai jise Allah taala pasand nahi karta."
"2271","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye laitna hai jise Allah taala na-pasand karta hai, yani pet ke bal laitna."
"2272","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye haiz nahi balke ye rag hai; pas jab haiz peeth phere to ghusl karo aur namaz parho, aur jab aaye to us ke liye namaz chhor do."
"2273","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye kafiron ke kapron mein se hain, pas unhein na pehno, yani kesariya range kapre."
"2274","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye donon meri ummat ke mardon par haram aur auraton ke liye halal hain, yani sona aur resham."
"2275","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tab to tumhara takiya chaura lamba hoga; ye to sirf raat ¤ ka andhera aur din ki roshni hai."
"2276","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Yajooj aur Majooj har din deewar khodte hain yahan tak ke jab qareeb hote hain ke suraj ki kiran dekhein to un ka sardar kehta hai: Wapas jao, kal use khodenge. Pas Allah use pehle se zyada mazboot kar deta hai, yahan tak ke jab un ki muddat pahunche aur Allah chahe ke unhein logon par bheje to wo khodte hain yahan tak ke jab qareeb hote hain ke suraj ki kiran dekhein to un ka sardar kehta hai: Wapas jao, kal use khodenge in sha Allah, aur istisna karte hain. Pas wo us ke paas wapas aate hain to wo waisa hi hota hai jaisa chhora tha; pas wo use khodte hain aur logon par nikalte hain to pani khushk kar dete hain, aur log un se apne qilon mein panah lete hain. Pas wo apne teer aasman ki taraf phenkte hain to wo khoon-aalood jama hua wapas aate hain. Pas wo kehte hain: Ham ne zameen walon ko maghloob kiya aur aasman walon par buland hue. Pas Allah un par un ki gardanon mein keere bhejta hai jo unhein us se maar dete hain. Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, beshak zameen ke janwar un ke gosht aur khoon se mote honge aur khoob doodh denge."
"2277","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ka dayan haath bhara hua hai, kharch use kam nahi karta, raat-din behne wala hai. Kiya tum ne dekha jo us ne aasmanon aur zameen ki takhleeq se kharch kiya? Pas us ne us ke dayen haath mein jo hai use kam nahi kiya; aur us ka Arsh pani par hai, aur us ke dusre haath mein qabza hai jise wo uthata aur girata hai."
"2278","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Peer aur Jumerat ke din Allah un mein har ¤ Musalman ko bakhshta hai siwaye alag-thalag rehne walon ke; farmata hai: Inhein chhoro yahan tak ke sulah kar lein."
"2279","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Juma ka din dinon ka sardar hai aur Allah ke nazdeek sab se azeem hai; wo Allah ke nazdeek Eid-ul-Azha aur Eid-ul-Fitr ke din se bada hai. Us mein paanch khaslatein hain: Allah ne us mein Adam ko paida kiya, Allah ne us mein Adam ko zameen par utara, us mein Allah ne Adam ki rooh qabz ki, us mein aik ghari hai jis mein banda Allah se jo mange wo use ata karta hai jab tak haram na mange, us mein qayamat qayam hogi; aur koi muqarrab farishta, aasman, zameen, hawa, pahar aur samandar nahi magar wo Juma ke din se darta hai ke us mein qayamat qayam ho."
"2280","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham Aal-e-Muhammad hain, hamare liye sadqa halal nahi."
"2281","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham Aal-e-Muhammad hain, hamare liye sadqa halal nahi; aur beshak qaum ka aazad-karda ghulam unhi mein se hai."
"2282","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham ummi ummat hain; na likhte hain na hisab karte hain."
"2283","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham ne angoothi banayi hai aur us mein naqsh kiya hai; pas koi mere naqsh par naqsh na kare."
"2284","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham ne tumhein mana kiya tha ke un ke gosht ko teen ¤ se upar khao taake tum sab ko kafi ho; pas Allah khushhali lekar aaya hai, pas khao, zakheera karo aur tijarat karo. Khabardar, ye din khane-peene aur Allah ke zikr ke din hain."
"2285","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham apne kaam par use muqarrar nahi karenge jo use chahe."
"2286","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham ambiya ki jamaat ko hukm diya gaya hai ke apna iftar jaldi karein aur apni sehri der se karein, aur namaz mein apne dayen haathon ko apne bayen haathon par rakhein."
"2287","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham ambiya ki jamaat ki aankhein soti hain aur hamare dil nahi sote."
"2288","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham ambiya ki jamaat par aazmaish dugni ki jati hai."
"2289","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham khutba de rahe hain; pas jo khutbe ke liye baithna chahe baithe aur jo jana chahe jaye."
"2290","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak hamein mana kiya gaya hai ke hamari sharmgahein dekhi jayen."
"2291","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham Allah ki qasam is kaam par use muqarrar nahi karenge jis ne use manga ¤ aur na use jo us par hirs rakhe."
"2292","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham mushrikon ke khilaf mushrikon se madad nahi lete."
"2293","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham mushrik se madad nahi lete."
"2294","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ham mushrikon se koi cheez qabool nahi karte."
"2295","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak agar tum logon ke aebon ke peechhe paro to unhein bigar doge ya unhein bigarne ke qareeb kar doge."
"2296","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum ehl-e-Kitaab qaum ke paas aa rahe ho; pas sab se pehli cheez jis ki taraf tum unhein bulao Allah ki ibadat ho; phir jab wo Allah ko pehchan lein to unhein batao ke Allah ne un par un ke din aur raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain; phir jab wo karein to unhein batao ke Allah ne un par zakaat farz ki hai jo un ke maalon se li jayegi aur un ke faqiron ko lautayi jayegi; phir jab wo is mein itaat karein to un se lo aur logon ke qeemti maalon se bacho."
"2297","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum ne hamein paanch mein se paanchwa bulaya hai aur ye aadmi hamare peechhe aaya hai; pas agar tum chaho use ijazat do aur agar chaho wo wapas jaye."
"2298","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum ehl-e-Kitaab qaum ke paas aaoge; pas jab un ke paas aao to unhein bulao ke gawahi dein ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain; phir agar wo is mein tumhari itaat karein to unhein batao ke Allah ne un par har din aur raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain; phir agar wo is mein tumhari itaat karein to unhein batao ke Allah ne un par sadqa farz kiya hai jo un ke ameeron se liya jayega aur un ke faqiron ko lautaya jayega; phir agar wo is mein tumhari itaat karein to un ke qeemti maalon se bacho aur mazloom ki bad-dua se daro kyunke us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan koi parda nahi."
"2299","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum us ki tarah ho jo pehle ne kaha tha: Ae Allah mujhe aisa mehboob de jo mujhe meri jaan se zyada mehboob ho."
"2300","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mere baad peechhe rahoge phir naik amal karoge to us se darje aur bulandi mein barhte jaoge; phir shayad tum peechhe raho yahan tak ke tum se kuch qaumein faida uthayen aur dusri tum se nuqsan uthayen. Ae Allah mere sahaba ki hijrat poori kar aur unhein airiyon par wapas na pher; lekin bechara Saad bin Khaula hai."
"2301","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum sattar ummatein poori karte ho, tum un mein sab se behtar aur Allah par sab se izzat wali ho."
"2302","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum jama kiye jaoge paidal aur sawaar, aur tum apne chehron par ghaseete jaoge yahan, aur apne haath se Sham ki taraf ishara kiya."
"2303","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum aisi namaz ka intezar karte ho jis ka tumhare siwa kisi deen wale intezar nahi karte; aur agar meri ummat par bhari na hota to main unhein is ghari namaz parhata."
"2304","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum jald amaarat ki hirs karoge, aur wo qayamat ke din sharmindagi aur hasrat hogi; pas wo doodh pilane wali kitni achhi hai aur doodh chhurane wali kitni buri hai."
"2305","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mere baad tarjeeh aur aise muamlat dekhoge jinhein tum bura janoge; unhein un ka haq do aur Allah se apna haq mango."
"2306","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum apne Rab ko dekhoge jaisa is chaand ko dekhte ho, us ke dekhne mein tumhein dhakka nahi lagega; pas agar tum taqat rakho ke suraj tuloo hone se pehle ki namaz aur us ke ghurub hone se pehle ki namaz par ghalib na aao to karo."
"2307","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum jald Misr fateh karoge aur wo aisi zameen hai jis mein qeeraat kaha jata hai; pas jab use fateh karo to us ke walon se khair ki waseeyat qabool karo kyunke un ke liye zimma aur rishta hai; phir jab tum do aadmiyon ko aik eent ki jagah par jhagarte dekho to us se nikal jao."
"2308","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum kal dushman se miloge; pas tumhara naara Haa-Meem ho ke wo madad nahi diye jayenge."
"2309","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mere baad tarjeeh paoge; pas sabr karo yahan tak ke kal hauz par mujh se milo ¤."
"2310","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum ne apne dehaton ke sookhe aur barish ke apne waqt se peechhe rehne ki shikayat ki hai; aur Allah azza wa jal ne tumhein hukm diya hai aur tum se wada kiya hai ke tumhare liye qabool karega. Sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain jo Aalamin ka Rab hai, bare meherban nihayat rehem wale, qayamat ke din ke malik hain. Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo karta hai jo chahta hai. Ae Allah, tu Allah hai, tere siwa koi mabood nahi, tu ghani hai aur ham faqeer hain; ham par barish utar aur jo tune hamare liye utara use hamare liye taqat aur waqt tak pahunchne ka saman bana."
"2311","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum is muamle ko zabardasti se nahi pa sakoge."
"2312","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum apne Rab azza wa jal ko nahi dekhoge yahan tak ke mar jao."
"2313","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum jab tak namaz ka intezar karte rahoge namaz mein rahoge."
"2314","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum subah apne dushman se milne wale ho, aur iftar tumhare liye zyada taqat wala hai; pas iftar karo."
"2315","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhari muddat guzri hui ummaton mein aisi hai jaisa Asr ki namaz se suraj ghurub hone tak ka waqt; aur beshak tumhari aur Yahood-o-Nasara ki misal aise aadmi ki misal hai jis ne mazdoor rakhe aur kaha: Kaun subah se dopahar tak aik aik qeeraat par kaam karega? Pas Yahood ne kaam kiya. Phir kaha: Kaun dopahar se Asr ki namaz tak aik aik qeeraat par kaam karega? Pas Nasara ne kaam kiya. Phir kaha: Kaun Asr se ¤ suraj ghurub hone tak do do qeeraat par kaam karega? Pas tum wahi ho. Pas Yahood aur Nasara ghusse hue aur kaha: Hamara amal zyada aur sila kam kyun? Farmaya: Kiya maine tumhare haq mein se kuch zulm kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Farmaya: Pas ye mera fazl hai jise chahun dun."
"2316","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main apni ummat par gumrah karne wale imamon se darta hun."
"2317","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tum par apne baad us se darta hun jo tum par duniya ki raunaq aur zeenat mein se khola jayega. Beshak khair shar nahi lati; beshak jo bahar mein ugta hai wo pet phoolne se marta hai ya marne ke qareeb hota hai, siwaye sabz chara khane wale janwar ke; kyunke wo khata hai yahan tak ke jab us ki donon kokhein bhar jati hain to suraj ki taraf munh karta hai, phir gobar karta hai, peshab karta hai phir charta hai. Aur beshak ye maal sabz meetha hai, aur Musalman ka kitna achha saathi hai wo jo use miskeen, yateem aur musafir ko de; pas jis ne use haq ke saath liya aur haq mein rakha to wo kitni achhi madad hai; aur jis ne use ¤ nahaq liya wo us ki tarah hoga jo khata hai aur sair nahi hota, aur wo qayamat ke din us par gawah hoga."
"2318","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Bani Hashim aur Bani Muttalib ko aik cheez samjhta hun; wo ham se juda nahi hue na jahiliyyat mein na Islam mein."
"2319","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jis ki maghfirat ki gayi wo aaraam mein aaya."
"2320","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aamaal bartan ki tarah hain; jab us ka neeche hissa achha ho to upar wala achha hota hai, aur jab us ka neeche hissa bigre to upar wala bigarta hai."
"2321","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam dhaal hai jis ke zariye lara jata hai."
"2322","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam dhaal hai jis ke peechhe lar kar us se bacha jata hai; phir agar wo Allah se darne aur insaf ka hukm de to us ke liye us se ajr hai, aur agar us ke siwa ka hukm de to us par gunah hai."
"2323","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak bai raza-mandi se hai."
"2324","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak deen khair-khwahi hai."
"2325","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak sood udhar mein hai."
"2326","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nahusat teen mein hai: ghore mein, aurat mein aur ghar mein."
"2327","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak itaat maroof mein hai."
"2328","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ilm seekhne se hai aur beshak burdbari tehammul se hai; jo khair talash kare use di jayegi aur jo shar se bache use bachaya jayega."
"2329","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak pani mani se hai."
"2330","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak majlisein amanat se hain."
"2331","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Madina bhatti ki tarah hai jo apni gandagi nikalta hai aur apni pakeezgi chamkata hai."
"2332","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log sau unton ki tarah hain jin mein tum sawari ke qabil mushkil se paoge."
"2333","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak auratein mardon ki hamsar hain."
"2334","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak kharcha aur rehaish aurat ke liye hai jab us ke shohar ke liye us par ruju ho."
"2335","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak witr raat mein hai."
"2336","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wala aazad karne wale ke liye hai."
"2337","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe wuzu ka hukm diya gaya hai jab main namaz ke liye khara hun."
"2338","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun; jab tumhein tumhare deen mein se kisi cheez ka hukm dun to use lo, aur jab tumhein apni raay se kisi cheez ka hukm dun to main sirf bashar hun."
"2339","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun, bhoolta hun jaisa tum bhoolte ho; pas jab tum mein se koi bhoole to baitha hua do sajde kare."
"2340","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun, aankh roti hai aur dil aajizi karta hai, aur ham wo nahi kehte jo Rab ko naraz kare; Allah ki qasam ae Ibrahim, ham tum se ghamgeen hain."
"2341","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tum jaisa bashar hun, aur gumaan khata bhi karta hai aur durust bhi hota hai; lekin jo maine tum se kaha ke Allah ne farmaya to main Allah par jhoot nahi bolunga."
"2342","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun aur tum mere paas jhagra lekar aate ho; pas shayad tum mein se baaz apni hujjat mein baaz se zyada tez-zaban ho to main use suna hua ke mutabiq faisla de dun; pas jis ke liye maine Musalman ke haq ka faisla kiya wo aag ka tukra hai, chahe le ya chhore."
"2343","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun aur maine apne Rab azza wa jal se shart ki hai ke Musalmanon mein se jis bande ko main bura kahun ya gaali dun wo us ke liye pakeezgi aur ajr ho."
"2344","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main khazanchi hun aur deta to Allah hai; pas jise maine apni khush dili se atiya diya us ke liye us mein barkat hogi, aur jise maine nafs ki hirs aur sakht sawal ki wajah se atiya diya wo us khane wale ki tarah hai jo khata hai aur sair nahi hota."
"2345","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main hadiya ki gayi rehmat hun."
"2346","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhare liye walid ke darje par hun, tumhein sikhata hun; pas jab tum mein se koi pakhane jaye to na qible ki taraf munh kare na peeth, aur na apne dayen haath se istinja kare."
"2347","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main pahunchane wala hun aur Allah hidayat deta hai; aur beshak main taqseem karne wala hun aur Allah deta hai."
"2348","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum se pehle wale is liye halak hue ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to use chhor dete aur jab un mein kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qayam karte."
"2349","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main naik akhlaq ko mukammal karne ke liye bheja gaya hun."
"2350","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum aasani karne wale bhejey gaye ho, sakhti karne wale nahi bhejey gaye."
"2351","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe Allah ne pahunchane wala bhejha hai, sakhti karne wala nahi bhejha."
"2352","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhara ghatiyon aur wadiyon mein bikhra hona shaitan ki taraf se hai."
"2353","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak udhar ka badla tareef aur wafa hai."
"2354","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ijazat mangna aankh ki wajah se rakha gaya hai."
"2355","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam dhaal banaya gaya hai; pas jab wo baith kar namaz parhe to baith kar parho, aur jab wo kahe Sami Allahu liman hamidah to kaho: Ae Allah ae hamare Rab tere liye hamd hai. Phir jab zameen walon ka qaul aasman walon ke qaul ke muwafiq ho to us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"2356","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye; pas jab wo khara hokar namaz parhe to khare hokar parho, aur agar baith kar parhe to baith kar parho; aur khare na ho jab wo baitha ho jaisa Faaris wale apne baron se karte hain."
"2357","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye; pas jab takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho, jab uthaye to uthao, jab kahe Sami Allahu liman hamidah to kaho: Ae Allah ae hamare Rab aur tere liye hamd hai, jab sajda kare to sajda karo, aur jab baith kar namaz parhe to sab mil kar baith kar parho."
"2358","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye; pas jab takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho, jab qiraat kare to khamosh raho, aur jab kahe Sami Allahu liman hamidah to kaho: Ae hamare Rab tere liye hamd hai."
"2359","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye; pas jab takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho, jab qiraat kare to khamosh raho, jab kahe Ghair-il-maghzoobi alaihim wa lad-dalleen to kaho: Aameen, jab ruku kare to ruku karo, jab kahe Sami Allahu liman hamidah to kaho: Ae Allah ae hamare Rab aur tere liye hamd hai, jab sajda kare to sajda karo, aur jab baith kar namaz parhe to baith kar parho."
"2360","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairwi ki jaye; pas us par ikhtilaf na karo. Jab takbeer kahe to takbeer kaho, jab ruku kare to ruku karo, jab kahe Sami Allahu liman hamidah to kaho: Ae hamare Rab tere liye hamd hai, jab sajda kare to sajda karo, aur jab baith kar namaz parhe ¤ to sab mil kar baith kar parho."
"2361","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne mujhe ikhtiyar diya aur farmaya ke un ke liye maghfirat mango ya na mango, agar tum un ke liye sattar baar maghfirat mango; aur main sattar par izafa karunga."
"2362","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo Jibreel thay; maine unhein us surat mein jis mein paida kiye gaye in donon baar ke siwa nahi dekha; maine unhein aasman se utarte dekha ke un ki bari takhleeq ne aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan ko gher rakha tha."
"2363","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo rag hai; pas dekho, jab tumhara haiz ka waqt aaye to namaz na parho, phir jab tumhara haiz ka waqt guzar jaye to pakeezgi hasil karo phir aik haiz se dusre haiz tak namaz parho."
"2364","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Khizr ka naam Khizr is liye rakha gaya ke wo safed zameen par baithe to wo un ke neeche sabz hokar harkat karne lagi."
"2365","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak dil ka naam qalb us ke palatne se rakha gaya; beshak dil ki misal jungle mein par ki misal hai jo darakht ki jar mein atki ho, hawa use peeth ke bal pet ke bal palatti hai."
"2366","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Fatima mere jism ka tukra hai; jo use takleef de wo mujhe takleef deta hai aur jo use thakata hai wo mujhe thakata hai."
"2367","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhein kafi tha ke apne donon haathon ko ¤ zameen par marte phir un se apna chehra aur apni hatheliyan ponchhte."
"2368","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak naik humnasheen aur bure humnasheen ki misal mushk uthane wale aur bhatti dhonkne wale ki misal hai; mushk uthane wala ya tumhein dega ya tum us se khareedoge ya us se achhi boo paoge; aur bhatti dhonkne wala ya tumhare kapre jalayega ya tum buri boo paoge."
"2369","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak us ki misal jo namaz parhe is haal mein ke us ka sar bandha ho us ki misal hai jo namaz parhe is haal mein ke wo jakra hua ho."
"2370","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin ki misal jab use kapkapi ya bukhar pahunche aise lohe ki misal hai jo aag mein dakhil ho to us ki gandagi jati rehti hai aur us ki pakeezgi baqi rehti hai."
"2371","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak namaz ki taraf jaldi aane wale ki misal us ki misal hai jo untni hadiya kare, phir jo us ke baad ho wo us ki tarah hai jo gaaye hadiya kare, phir jo us ke baad ho wo us ki tarah hai jo mendha hadiya kare, phir jo us ke baad ho wo us ki tarah hai jo murghi hadiya kare, phir jo us ke baad ho wo us ki tarah hai jo anda hadiya kare."
"2372","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Quran wale ki misal bandhi hui untniyon wale ki misal hai; agar un ki nigehdasht kare to unhein rok lega aur agar unhein chhor de to wo chali jayengi."
"2373","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak momin ki jaan parinda hai jo jannat ke darakhton se khata hai yahan tak ke Allah use us din us ke jism ki taraf uthayega jis din use uthayega."
"2374","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum se pehle wale kitab mein ikhtilaf ki wajah se halak hue."
"2375","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Israel is waqt halak huin jab un ki auraton ne ye apnaya, yani baalon ka jura."
"2376","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye do mutthiyan hain; aik mutthi aag mein aur aik mutthi jannat mein."
"2377","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye sirf chaar mah aur das din hain; tum mein se aik jahiliyyat mein saal ke sar par mengni phenkti thi."
"2378","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye nabi ki tauba hai, yani Surah Saad ka sajda."
"2379","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak log apni niyyaton par uthaye jayenge."
"2380","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Dajjal aik ghusse se niklega jis se wo ghussa hoga."
"2381","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah apne rehem-dil bandon par rehem karta hai."
"2382","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak teen hi boyeinge: aik aadmi jis ke paas zameen hai to wo use bota hai, aik aadmi jise zameen atiya ki gayi to wo di gayi ko bota hai, aur aik aadmi jis ne sona ya chandi se zameen kiraye par li."
"2383","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak larki ke peshab se dhoya jayega aur larke ke peshab par chheente mare jayenge."
"2384","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se aik ko duniya mein kafi hai jitna sawaar ka zad-e-raah ho."
"2385","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhein kafi hai ke apne sar par pani ke teen lap daalo phir baqi jism par pani bahao, phir tum paak ho gayin."
"2386","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maal jama karne mein se tumhein kafi hai khadim aur Allah ki raah mein sawari."
"2387","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak duniya mein resham wahi pehenta hai jis ka ¤ aakhirat mein koi hissa nahi."
"2388","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Allah is ummat ki madad us ke kamzoron se karta hai: un ki dua, un ki namaz aur un ke ikhlas se."
"2389","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak hamare peechhe aik aadmi aaya hai jo hamare saath nahi tha jab hamein bulaya gaya; pas agar tum ijazat do wo dakhil ho."
"2390","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak meri taraf wahi ki gayi hai ke tum qabron mein aazmaye jaoge."
"2391","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Bani Adam mein se har insan teen sau saath joron par paida kiya gaya hai; pas jis ne Allah ki takbeer kahi, Allah ki hamd ki, Allah ki tahleel ki, Allah ki tasbeeh ki, Allah se maghfirat mangi, logon ke raaste se pathar, kaanta ya haddi hatayi, maroof ka hukm diya ya munkar se mana kiya, un teen sau saath joron ki ginti mein, to wo shaam is haal mein karega ke us ne apne aap ko aag se door kar liya."
"2392","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jald phoot aur ikhtilaf hoga; pas jab aisa ho to apni talwar tor do, lakri ki talwar bana lo aur apne ghar mein baitho yahan tak ke tumhare paas ghalat haath ya faisla-kun maut aaye."
"2393","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jald chhoti-chhoti shararatein hongi; pas jo chahe ke is ummat ke muamle ko juda kare is haal mein ke wo jama ho to use talwar se maro wo jo bhi ho."
"2394","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jald aise hukmaran honge jo namaz ko us ke waqton se moakhar karenge; khabardar, namaz us ke waqt par parho phir un ke paas aao; phir agar wo parh chuke hon to tum ne apni namaz mehfooz kar li, aur agar na parhi ho to un ke saath parho to wo nafl hogi."
"2395","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jald tum par aise imam honge jinhein tum pehchanoge aur bura janoge; pas jis ne bura jana wo bari ho gaya aur jis ne na-pasand kiya wo mehfooz raha, lekin jo raazi hua aur pairwi ki wo halak hoga."
"2396","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is ummat mein aisi qaum hogi jo taharat aur dua mein hadd se barhengi."
"2397","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere baad tumhare muamlat ka zimma aise aadmi lenge jo tumhein wo pehchanwayenge jise tum bura jante ho aur tum par wo bura janenge jise tum pehchante ho; pas jo Allah ki nafarmani kare us ki itaat nahi; apne Rab ke saath gumrah na ho."
"2398","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujh par jannat aur aag pesh ki gayin; jannat mere qareeb layi gayi yahan tak ke maine us mein se khosha lena chaha lekin mera haath us se chhota para; aur mujh par aag pesh ki gayi to main darr se peechhe hatne laga ke mujhe gher le; aur maine aik Himyari kali lambi aurat dekhi jo apni billi ki wajah se azab di ja rahi thi jise us ne bandha tha; us ne use khilaya na pilaya aur na chhora ke zameen ke keere-makore se khaye; aur us mein Abu Sumama Amr bin Malik ko dekha jo ¤ aag mein apni antein ghaseet raha tha. Aur beshak wo kehte thay ke suraj aur chaand sirf kisi bare ki maut par gehan hote hain; lekin ye donon Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain jo wo tumhein dikhata hai; pas jab gehan hon to namaz parho yahan tak ke saaf ho jaye."
"2399","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo aag ke halke hisse mein hai, aur agar main na hota to wo sab se neeche darje mein hota, yani Abu Talib."
"2400","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare baap par wo aa gaya hai jis se Allah taala qayamat ke din ki haziri ke liye kisi ko chhorne wala nahi."
"2401","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak us ne jorne wali auraton par laanat ki hai."
"2402","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak koi nabi qabz nahi kiya gaya yahan tak ke us ne jannat mein apna thikana dekha phir use ikhtiyar diya gaya."
"2403","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujh se pehle koi nabi nahi guzra magar us par haq tha ke apni ummat ko wo khair bataye jo wo un ke liye janta ho aur unhein us shar se daraye jo wo un ke liye janta ho; aur beshak tumhari ye ummat, us ki aafiyat us ke awwal mein rakhi gayi hai, aur us ke aakhir ko sakht aazmaish aur aise muamlat pahunchenge jinhein tum bura janoge; fitne aayenge to baaz baaz ko narm karenge; fitna aayega to ¤ momin kahega: Ye meri halakat hai, phir wo khatm ho jayega; phir fitna aayega to momin kahega: Ye hai, ye hai. Pas tum mein se jo chahe ke aag se door kiya jaye aur jannat mein dakhil kiya jaye to us ki maut is haal mein aaye ke wo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho, aur logon ke paas wo lekar aaye jo wo pasand karta hai ke us ke paas laya jaye. Aur jis ne imam se baiat ki aur use apne haath ka sauda aur apne dil ka phal diya to jitna ho sake us ki itaat kare; phir agar dusra aakar us se jhagra kare to dusre ki gardan maro."
"2404","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe tumhein jawab dene se sirf is ne roka ke main namaz parh raha tha."
"2405","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe tumhein jawab dene se sirf is ne roka ke main baghair wuzu tha."
"2406","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak agar namaz mein koi nayi cheez hoti to main tumhein batata, lekin main tum jaisa bashar hun, bhoolta hun jaisa tum bhoolte ho; pas jab main bhoolun to mujhe yaad dilao, aur jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak kare to durust ko talash kare phir us par mukammal kare, phir do sajde kare."
"2407","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din mota-taza bara aadmi aayega jo Allah ke nazdeek machhar ke par ke barabar wazan nahi rakhega."
"2408","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo dawa nahi balke beemari hai, yani sharab."
"2409","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan koi cheez nahi magar janti hai ke main Allah ka Rasool hun siwaye nafarman jinon aur insanon ke."
"2410","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak neend mein kotahi nahi, kotahi to jaagne mein hai; pas jab tum mein se koi namaz bhoole ya us se so jaye to jab yaad aaye use parhe, kal us ke waqt par nahi."
"2411","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nabi ke liye jaiz nahi ke naqsh-o-nigar wale ghar mein dakhil ho."
"2412","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nabi ke liye jaiz nahi ke aankh se ishara kare."
"2413","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak logon mein se koi apni jaan aur maal mein Abu Bakr bin Abi Quhafa se barh kar mujh par ehsan karne wala nahi; aur agar main logon mein se kisi ko khaleel banata to Abu Bakr ko khaleel banata, lekin Islam ki dosti afzal hai; meri taraf se is masjid mein Abu Bakr ki khirki ke siwa har khirki band kar do."
"2414","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak Arabi ghora aisa nahi magar use har fajr ke saath ijazat di jati hai ke do duaein mange; kehta hai: Ae Allah, tune mujhe Bani Adam mein se jise diya un mein se mujhe us ke ghar walon aur maal mein sab se mehboob bana."
"2415","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere dil par parda aata hai aur main din mein sau baar Allah se maghfirat mangta hun."
"2416","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe ghussa aata hai ke tum mein se mangne wale ko dene ke liye kuch na paaun is haal mein ke us ke paas uqiya ya us ke barabar ho; pas us ne israr se manga."
"2417","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jo imam ke saath khara rahe yahan tak ke wo laut jaye us ke liye raat ka qayam likha jayega."
"2418","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jo Allah taala se na mange wo us par ghussa karta hai."
"2419","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak shaadi ke liye waleema zaroori hai."
"2420","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se kisi ki namaz mukammal nahi hoti yahan tak ke wuzu poora kare jaisa Allah ne use hukm diya: apna chehra aur apne haath kuhniyon tak dhoye, apne sar aur apne pair takhnon tak maseh kare, phir Allah ki takbeer kahe, us ki hamd kare, us ki buzrugi bayan kare, aur Quran mein se jo aasaan ho parhe jo Allah ne use sikhaya aur jis ki use ijazat di, phir takbeer kahe aur ruku kare aur apne donon haath apne ghutnon par rakhe aur seedha ho yahan tak ke us ke jor sukoon payen aur dheele hon, phir kahe: Sami Allahu liman hamidah, pas seedha khara ho yahan tak ke har haddi apni jagah le le aur apni peeth seedhi kare, phir takbeer kahe aur sajda kare aur apni peshani zameen par jamaye yahan tak ke us ke jor sukoon payen aur dheele hon, phir takbeer kahe aur apna sar uthaye aur apne bethne ki jagah par baith kar seedha ho ¤ aur apni peeth seedhi kare, phir takbeer kahe aur sajda kare yahan tak ke apna chehra jamaye aur sukoon paye. Tum mein se kisi ki namaz mukammal nahi hoti yahan tak ke aisa kare."
"2421","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jis ummat mein kamzor apna haq baghair hichkichahat liye na le sake wo paak nahi hui."
"2422","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tum se sirf momin mohabbat karega aur tum se sirf munafiq bughz rakhega. Ye Ali se kaha."
"2423","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein sirf Musalman jaan dakhil hogi, aur beshak Allah is deen ki taeed fajir aadmi se bhi karta hai."
"2424","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jannat mein sirf Musalman jaan dakhil hogi, aur Mina ke din khane-peene ke din hain."
"2425","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak aag se azab dena jaiz nahi siwaye aag ke Rab ke."
"2426","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak nabi ke liye jaiz nahi ke us ki aankh mein khayanat ho."
"2427","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is ki nasal se aik qaum niklegi jo Allah ki kitab ¤ geeli yani taza parhegi jo un ke halq se neeche nahi utregi; wo deen se aise nikal jayenge jaisa teer shikar se nikal jata hai; agar main unhein paaun to unhein Samood ke qatl ki tarah qatl karunga."
"2428","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye aman wala haram hai, beshak ye aman wala haram hai, yani Madina."
"2429","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mere baad tum par aise hukmaran honge jinhein cheezein waqt par namaz se mashghool karengi yahan tak ke us ka waqt jata rahega; pas namaz us ke waqt par parho. Aik aadmi ne kaha: Agar main un ke saath paaun to kiya un ke saath parhun? Farmaya: Haan, agar tum chaho."
"2430","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jald fitne honge; khabardar, phir fitna hoga jis mein laita hua baithne wale se behtar hai, baithne wala khare se behtar hai, khara chalne wale se behtar hai aur chalne wala us ki taraf daurne wale se behtar hai. Khabardar, phir jab wo utre ya waqe ho to jis ke paas unt hon wo apne unton se ja mile, jis ke paas bakriyan hon wo apni bakriyon se ja mile, jis ke paas zameen ho wo apni zameen se ja mile; aur jis ke paas in mein se kuch na ho wo apni talwar ka qasd kare aur us ki dhaar ko pathar se koot de, phir nijaat paye agar nijaat ki taqat rakhe. Ae Allah kiya maine pahuncha diya, ae Allah kiya maine pahuncha diya."
"2431","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jald fitna aur phoot aur ikhtilaf hoga; pas jab aisa ho to baitha hua khare se behtar hai, khara chalne wale se behtar hai aur chalne wala daurne wale se behtar hai. Kaha gaya: Batayen agar wo mere ghar mein dakhil ho? Farmaya: Adam ke bete ki tarah ho jao."
"2432","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak jald fitna, phoot aur ikhtilaf hoga; pas jab aisa ho to apni talwar lekar Uhud paharr ke paas jao aur use maro yahan tak ke toot jaye, phir apne ghar mein baitho yahan tak ke tumhare paas ghalat haath ya faisla-kun maut aaye."
"2433","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye raghbat aur darr ki namaz hai; maine us mein Allah se teen khaslatein mangein to mujhe do deen aur aik se mana kiya. Maine us se manga ke tumhein us azab se halak na kare jis se tum se pehlon ko halak kiya to mujhe de di; aur maine us se manga ke tumhare markaz par dushman musallat na kare jo use ukher de to mujhe de di; aur maine us se manga ke tumhein girohon mein na bante aur tum mein se baaz ko baaz ki larayi na chakhaye to mujhe mana kar diya."
"2434","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye pakeeza hai jo mardon ko door karti hai jaisa aag lohe ki gandagi door karti hai."
"2435","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye bare barkat wali hai; wo khane wale ka khana aur beemari ki shifa hai."
"2436","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye dawa nahi balke beemari hai, yani sharab."
"2437","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye napak nahi, ye tum par phirne walon aur phirne waliyon mein se hai, yani billi."
"2438","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye bare barkat wali hai, beshak ye khane wale ka khana hai, yani Zamzam."
"2439","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak is se na kisi ki maut ke liye sitare torte hain na zindagi ke liye, lekin hamara Rab tabarak wa taala jab koi faisla karta hai to Arsh uthane wale tasbeeh karte hain: Tumhare Rab ne kiya farmaya? Pas wo unhein batate hain ke us ne kiya farmaya; phir aasman walon mein se baaz baaz se khabar puchte hain yahan tak ke khabar is duniya ke aasman tak pahunchti hai; phir jinn baat uchak lete hain aur apne doston tak phenkte hain aur unhein teer mare jate hain; pas jo wo us ki surat par layen wo haq hai lekin wo us mein tafreeq karte hain aur us mein izafa karte hain."
"2440","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye donon azab diye ja rahe hain aur kisi bari baat mein azab nahi diye ja rahe; raha aik to wo peshab se nahi bachta tha, aur raha dusra to wo chughli karta phirta tha."
"2441","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak ye donon azab diye ja rahe hain aur kisi bari baat mein azab nahi diye ja rahe; raha aik to use peshab mein azab diya ja raha hai aur raha dusra to use gheebat mein azab diya ja raha hai."
"2442","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo apne se pehle ambiya aur nek logon ke naamon par naam rakhte thay."
"2443","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo apni niyyaton par uthaye jayenge."
"2444","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak wo mujhe behayai se mangne aur bukheel banane ke darmiyan ikhtiyar dete hain, aur main bukheel nahi hun."
"2445","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Allah ki taraf bari hun ke tum mein se mera koi khaleel ho; kyunke Allah ne mujhe khaleel banaya hai jaisa Ibrahim ko khaleel banaya tha; aur agar main apni ummat mein se kisi ko khaleel banata to Abu Bakr ko khaleel banata. Khabardar, beshak tum se pehle wale apne ambiya aur nek logon ki qabron ko masjidein banate thay; khabardar, qabron ko masjidein na banao, main tumhein is se mana karta hun."
"2446","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhein hadees bayan karta hun; pas tum mein se hazir ghaib tak pahunchaye."
"2447","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tum par donon kamzoron: yateem aur aurat ke haq mein sakhti karta hun."
"2448","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Madina ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan ko haram karta hun ke us ki kaantedar jhariyan kaati jayen ya us ka shikar qatl kiya jaye. Madina un ke liye behtar hai kaash wo jante; jo us se be-raghbati se use chhore Allah us mein us se behtar badal dega; aur jo us ki tangi aur mehnat par sabit rahe main qayamat ke din us ke liye sifarshi ya gawah hunga; aur jo ehl-e-Madina mein se kisi ke saath burayi ka irada kare Allah use aag mein aise pighlayega jaisa seesa pighalta hai ya namak pani mein pighalta hai."
"2449","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main wo dekhta hun jo tum nahi dekhte aur wo sunta hun jo tum nahi sunte. Aasman charcharaya aur use charcharana haq hai; us mein chaar ungliyon ki jagah nahi magar farishta Allah taala ke liye sajda karta hua apni peshani rakhe hue hai. Allah ki qasam, agar tum jante jo main janta hun to kam hanste aur zyada rote, aur bichhaunon par auraton se lutf na uthate, aur maidano ki taraf nikalte hue Allah ki taraf girya karte."
"2450","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhein bakriyan aur jungle pasand karte dekhta hun; pas jab tum apni bakriyon ya jungle mein ho aur namaz ke liye azaan do to nida ki aawaz buland karo; kyunke muazzin ki aawaz ki pahunch ko jo jinn, insan, pathar ya koi cheez sunti hai wo qayamat ke din us ke liye gawahi degi."
"2451","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe Laila-tul-Qadr dikhayi gayi phir main use bhula diya gaya; pas use aakhri ashre mein taaq raaton mein talash karo. Aur beshak maine dekha ke main us ki subah pani aur mitti mein sajda kar raha hun."
"2452","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main kuch aadmiyon ko deta hun jo kufr ke naye daur wale hain aur un ki dil-joi karta hun. Kiya tum raazi nahi ke log maalon ke saath jayen aur tum Rasoolullah ke saath apne gharon ko lauto? Allah ki qasam, jo lekar tum lautoge wo us se behtar hai jo lekar wo lautenge. Beshak tum mere baad sakht tarjeeh dekhoge; pas sabr karo yahan tak ke Allah aur us ke Rasool se milo, kyunke main hauz par tumhara pesh-rau hun."
"2453","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Quraish ko deta hun taake un ki dil-joi karun kyunke wo jahiliyyat ¤ ke naye daur wale hain."
"2454","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main aik qaum ko deta hun jin ke terhepan aur ghabrahat se darta hun, aur aik qaum ko us khair aur be-niazi par chhor deta hun jo Allah ne un ke dilon mein rakhi hai; un mein se Amr bin Taghlib hain."
"2455","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe bukhar aata hai jaisa tum mein se do aadmiyon ko aata hai."
"2456","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhare aage pesh-rau hun aur main tum par gawah hun; aur beshak tumhara wada hauz par hai; aur beshak main Allah ki qasam abhi apne hauz ko dekh raha hun; aur beshak mujhe zameen ke khazanon ki kunjiyan di gayin hain; aur beshak main Allah ki qasam tum par nahi darta ke mere baad shirk karoge, lekin main tum par duniya se darta hun ke us mein muqabla karoge."
"2457","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tum mein do khaleefa chhor raha hun: Allah ki kitab jo aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan phaili hui rassi hai, aur meri itrat mere ghar wale; aur ye donon juda nahi honge yahan tak ke hauz par mere paas aayen."
"2458","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tum mein wo chhor raha hun ke agar tum use thaam loge to mere baad kabhi gumrah nahi hoge; aik dusre se bada hai: Allah ki kitab jo aasman se zameen tak phaili hui rassi hai, aur meri itrat mere ghar wale; aur ye donon juda nahi honge yahan tak ke hauz par mere paas aayen; pas dekho tum mere baad in donon mein meri khilafat kaise karte ho."
"2459","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine tumhein Dajjal ke baare mein bayan kiya yahan tak ke darra ke tum na samjhoge. Beshak Maseeh Dajjal chhota-qad, terra-pair, ghungrale-baal, kana hai; us ki aankh miti hui hai, na ubhri hui na gehri. Phir agar tum par ishtibah ho to jaan lo ke tumhara Rab kana nahi aur tum apne Rab ko nahi dekhoge yahan tak ke mar jao."
"2460","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine Madina ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan ko haram kiya hai jaisa Ibrahim ne Makkah ko haram kiya tha."
"2461","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Laila-tul-Qadr batane ke liye nikla tha, aur falan falan ne jhagra kiya to wo utha li gayi; aur shayad ye tumhare liye behtar ho; pas use saat, nau aur paanch mein talash karo."
"2462","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhein aik muamla yaad dila raha hun aur tum par koi harj nahi ke jaldi na karo yahan tak ke apne walidain se mashwara kar lo. Beshak Allah taala ne farmaya ke ae Nabi apni biwiyon se kaho, aayat ke aakhir tak."
"2463","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine Asr mein yaad kiya ke hamare paas sone ki kuch dali thi; pas maine na-pasand kiya ke wo raat guzare, to us ki taqseem ka hukm diya."
"2464","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main kal Yahood ki taraf sawaar hokar jaunga; pas tum mein se jo mere ¤ saath chale wo unhein salam karne mein pehal na kare; phir agar wo tumhein salam karein to kaho: Wa alaikum."
"2465","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine khwab mein dekha goya Jibreel mere sar ke paas aur Mikaeel mere pairon ke paas hain; un mein se aik apne saathi se kehta hai: Us ke liye misal bayan karo. Pas us ne kaha: Sun, tumhara kaan sune aur samajh, tumhara dil samjhe. Beshak tumhari aur tumhari ummat ki misal aise badshah ki misal hai jis ne ghar banaya, phir us mein mahal banaya, phir us mein dastarkhwan lagaya, phir rasool bheja jo logon ko us ke khane ki taraf bulaye; pas un mein se kuch ne rasool ki baat mani aur kuch ne use chhor diya. Pas Allah badshah hai, ghar Islam hai, mahal jannat hai, aur tum ae Muhammad rasool ho; jis ne tumhari baat mani wo Islam mein dakhil hua, jo Islam mein dakhil hua wo jannat mein dakhil hua, aur jo jannat mein dakhil hua us ne jo us mein hai khaya."
"2466","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine raghbat aur darr ki namaz parhi aur Allah se apni ummat ke liye teen mangein to mujhe do deen aur aik se roka. Maine us se manga ke un par apne siwa ka dushman musallat na kare to mujhe de di; aur maine us se manga ke unhein doob kar halak na kare to mujhe de di; aur maine us se manga ke un ki larayi un ke darmiyan na kare to mujh se rok li."
"2467","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main hauz par hun yahan tak ke dekhun tum mein se kaun mere paas aata hai; aur jald kuch log mujh se pehle pakre jayenge to main kahunga: Ae Rab, mujh se aur meri ummat se hain. Kaha jayega: Kiya tum ne mehsoos kiya unhon ne tumhare baad kiya kiya? Allah ki qasam, wo tumhare baad wapas apni airiyon par lautte rahe."
"2468","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main hauz par tumhara pesh-rau hun; jo mere paas se guzre piyega aur jo piyega kabhi pyasa nahi hoga; aur jald mere paas aisi qaumein aayengi jinhein main pehchanta hun aur wo mujhe pehchanti hain ¤ phir mere aur un ke darmiyan haail kar diya jayega. Pas main kahunga: Ye mujh se hain. Kaha jayega: Tum nahi jante unhon ne tumhare baad kiya naya kiya. Pas main kahunga: Doori ho, doori ho us ke liye jis ne mere baad badla."
"2469","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main hauz par tumhara pesh-rau hun aur us ki chaurayi Aila se Juhfa tak jitni hai. Beshak main tum par nahi darta ke mere baad shirk karoge, lekin main tum par duniya se darta hun ke us mein muqabla karoge aur laroge to halak hoge jaisa tum se pehle wale halak hue."
"2470","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine chandi ki angoothi banayi hai aur us par Muhammad Rasoolullah naqsh kiya hai; pas koi mere naqsh par naqsh na kare."
"2471","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bhari ho gaya hun; pas jab main ruku karun to ruku karo, jab uthun to utho, jab sajda karun to sajda karo; aur main kisi aadmi ko na paaun ke wo mujh se ruku ya sajde mein aage barhe."
"2472","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine na-pasand kiya ke Allah ka zikr karun magar pakeezgi par."
"2473","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine tumhein hukm diya tha ke falan falan ko aag se jalao; aur aag se azab dena sirf Allah ke liye hai; pas agar tum unhein pao to qatl kar do."
"2474","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine tumhein mana kiya tha ke qurbani ke gosht ko teen ¤ se siwa khao; pas khao, khilao aur jitna chaho zakheera karo. Aur maine tum se kaha tha ke bartanon mein na nabeez banao: dubba, muzaffat, naqeer aur hantam mein; jo bartan chaaho us mein nabeez banao aur har nasha-aawar se bacho. Aur maine tumhein qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya tha; pas jo ziyarat karna chahe wo ziyarat kare aur behuda baat na kahe."
"2475","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine tumhein qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya tha; pas un ki ziyarat karo taake tumhein ziyarat khair yaad dilaye. Aur main ne tumhein teen ke baad qurbani ke gosht se mana kiya tha; pas khao aur jitna chaho rok rakho. Aur maine tumhein bartanon mein mashroob se mana kiya tha; pas jis bartan mein chaho piyo aur nasha-aawar na piyo."
"2476","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine tumhein teen se upar qurbani ke gosht se mana kiya tha taake tum sab ko kafi ho; pas Allah khair lekar aaya hai, pas khao, sadqa karo aur zakheera karo. Beshak ye din khane-peene aur Allah ke zikr ke din hain."
"2477","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main din mein sattar baar Allah taala ki taraf tauba karta hun."
"2478","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main namaz mein dakhil hota hun is haal mein ke use lamba karna chahta hun, phir bachche ka rona sunta hun to apni namaz mukhtasar kar deta hun, us shadeed bechaini ki wajah se jo main us ki maan ki rone par janta hun."
"2479","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhein apne peechhe se dekhta hun jaisa aage se dekhta hun."
"2480","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main umeed rakhta hun ke tum se juda hun aur tum mein se koi mujh se kisi zulm ka badla na mange jo maine use kiya ho."
"2481","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main umeed rakhta hun ke meri ummat apne Rab ke paas aajiz nahi hogi ke wo unhein aadha din moakhar kare."
"2482","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main umeed rakhta hun ke Badr aur Hudaibiya mein hazir hone walon mein se koi aag mein dakhil nahi hoga in sha Allah."
"2483","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main din mein sattar baar Allah se maghfirat mangta hun."
"2484","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bachche ka rona sunta hun to namaz mukhtasar kar deta hun."
"2485","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main aag se nikalne walo mein sab se aakhir aur jannat mein dakhil hone walo mein sab se aakhir ko janta hun: aik aadmi jise qayamat ke din laya jayega aur kaha jayega: ¤ Us par us ke chhote gunah pesh karo aur us se us ke bare gunah utha lo. Pas us se kaha jayega: Tune falan falan din ye ye kiya aur falan falan din ye ye kiya. Wo kahega: Haan, inkar nahi kar sakega, is haal mein ke wo apne bare gunahon se darta hoga ke us par pesh kiye jayen. Pas us se kaha jayega: Beshak tere liye har burayi ki jagah neki hai. Wo kahega: Ae Rab, maine kuch kaam kiye hain jinhein main yahan nahi dekhta."
"2486","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Ash'ariyon ke qaafle ki aawazon ko Quran se pehchanta hun jab wo raat mein dakhil hote hain, aur raat mein Quran ki aawazon se un ke gharon ko pehchanta hun agarche maine un ke ghar nahi dekhe jab wo din mein utre thay."
"2487","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Makkah mein aik pathar ko janta hun jo mere mab'oos hone se pehle mujhe salam karta tha."
"2488","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main kuch aadmiyon ko deta hun aur use chhor deta hun jo mujhe un se zyada mehboob hai aur use kuch nahi deta, is darr se ke wo aag mein munh ke bal girayen."
"2489","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main aag se nikalne walo mein sab se aakhir aur jannat mein dakhil hone walo mein sab se aakhir ko janta hun: aik aadmi jo aag se ghisat kar niklega to Allah us se farmayega: Jao jannat mein dakhil ho. Wo us ke paas aayega to use khayal hoga ke wo bhari hui hai; pas wapas aakar kahega: Ae Rab, maine use bhari paya. Pas Allah us se farmayega: Jao jannat mein dakhil ho, kyunke tumhare liye duniya aur us ke das guna hain. Wo kahega: Kiya tu mujh se mazaq karta hai halanke tu Badshah hai?"
"2490","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main janta hun ke tum mujh se kab raazi hoti ho aur kab mujh par naraz hoti ho. Jab tum mujh se raazi hoti ho to kehti ho: Nahi, Muhammad ke Rab ki qasam; aur jab mujh par naraz hoti ho to kehti ho: Nahi, Ibrahim ke Rab ki qasam."
"2491","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main aik kalima janta hun ke agar wo use kahe to us se wo jata rahe jo wo pata hai; agar wo kahe: Main Allah ki panah mangta hun shaitan mardood se, to us se wo jata rahe jo wo pata hai."
"2492","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main aik kalima janta hun jo banda apni maut ke waqt kahe to wo us ke aamaal-name ke liye noor hoga, aur beshak us ka jism aur us ki rooh maut ke waqt us se rahat payenge."
"2493","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main namaz ke liye khara hota hun is haal mein ke use lamba karna chahta hun, phir bachche ka rona sunta hun to apni namaz mukhtasar kar deta hun is na-pasand ki wajah se ke us ki maan par mashaqqat dalun."
"2494","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main mazaq karta hun aur haq ke siwa nahi kehta."
"2495","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhein us se darata hun, yani Dajjal se; aur koi nabi nahi magar us ne apni qaum ko us se daraya, aur beshak Nuh ne apni qaum ko us se daraya. Lekin main tum se us ke baare mein aik baat kahunga jo kisi nabi ne apni qaum se nahi kahi: Wo kana hai aur beshak Allah kana nahi."
"2496","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main jinon aur insanon ke shaitanon ko Umar se bhaagte dekhta hun."
"2497","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main apne ghar walon ki taraf lautta hun to khajoor giri hui pata hun apne bichhaune par; pas use uthata hun taake khaun, phir darta hun ke wo sadqa ho to use phenk deta hun."
"2498","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main qayamat ke din apne hauz ke paas hun, ehl-e-Yaman ke liye logon ko rokunga aur unhein apni laathi se marunga yahan tak ke un par beh jaye. Pas us ki chaurayi ke baare mein pucha gaya? Farmaya: Mere maqam se Uman tak; us ka mashroob doodh se zyada safed aur shehed se zyada meetha hai; us mein do parnale girte hain jo use jannat se madad dete hain, aik sone ka aur dusra chandi ka."
"2499","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tum jaisa nahi hun; beshak main raat guzarta hun ke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai."
"2500","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhare liye hauz par pesh-rau hun; pas khabardar, tum mein se koi mere paas na aaye ke mujh se door kiya jaye jaisa bhatka hua unt door kiya jata hai. Pas main kahunga: Ye kis baat par hai? Kaha jayega: Tum nahi jante unhon ne tumhare baad kiya naya kiya. Pas main kahunga: Doori ho."
"2501","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main laanat karne wala bhejha nahi gaya."
"2502","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main laanat karne wala bhejha nahi gaya, main to rehmat bhejha gaya hun."
"2503","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe hukm nahi diya gaya ke logon ke dilon ko khodun aur na un ke pet cheerun."
"2504","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main bhool gaya ke tumhein hukm dun ke donon qarn yani parde ke seengon ko dhanko; kyunke ghar mein koi cheez nahi honi chahiye jo namazi ko mashghool kare."
"2505","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe mushrikon ke makhan se mana kiya gaya hai."
"2506","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak mujhe namaz parhne walon ke qatl se mana kiya gaya hai."
"2507","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Allah ki qasam in sha Allah kisi qasam par qasam nahi khata phir us ke siwa ko behtar dekhta hun magar apni qasam ka kaffara deta hun aur jo behtar hai use karta hun."
"2508","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main Allah ki qasam apne is maqam par kisi aise muamle ke liye khara nahi hua jo tumhein raghbat ya darr se faida de, lekin Tameem Dari mere paas aaya aur mujhe aik khabar sunayi jis ne mujhe dopahar ke aaraam se khushi aur aankh ki thandak ki wajah se rok diya; pas maine chaha ke tum par apne nabi ki khushi phailaun. Khabardar, beshak Tameem Dari ne mujhe bataya ke hawa unhein aise jazeere ki taraf le gayi jise wo nahi jante thay; pas wo kashti ¤ ki chhoti kashtiyon mein baithe yahan tak ke jazeere ki taraf nikle; phir un ka samna ghane baalon wali cheez se hua. Unhon ne us se kaha: Tum kaun ho? Us ne kaha: Main Jassasa hun. Unhon ne kaha: Hamein bata. Us ne kaha: Main tumhein koi cheez nahi bataungi aur na tum se koi cheez puchhungi, lekin is khanqah ko tum ne dekha hai pas us ke paas jao kyunke us mein aik aadmi hai jo tumhein batane aur tum se sunne ka mushtaq hai. Pas wo us ke paas aaye aur us par dakhil hue to un ka samna sakht bandhe hue buddhe se hua jo gham zahir karta hua sakht shikayat karta tha. Us ne un se kaha: Kahan se ho? Unhon ne kaha: Sham se. Us ne kaha: Arab ne kiya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Ham Arab mein se aik qaum hain, kis baare mein puchte ho? Us ne kaha: Is aadmi ne kiya kiya jo tum mein nikla hai? Unhon ne kaha: Khair; us ne qaum se lara to Allah ne use un par ghalib kiya, pas aaj un ka muamla jama hai: un ka mabood aik aur un ka deen aik hai. Us ne kaha: Zughar ke chashme ne kiya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Khair; us se apni kheti ko sairab karte hain aur apne peene ke liye pani lete hain. Us ne kaha: Uman ke kunwen aur Baisan ki khajoor ne kiya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Har saal us ka phal khate hain. Us ne kaha: Tabriya ki jheel ne kiya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Pani ki kasrat se us ke kinare behte hain. Phir us ne teen saansein leen. Phir kaha: Agar main apne is bandhan se chhoot jaaun to koi zameen nahi chhorunga magar usے apne in donon pairon se raundunga siwaye Taiba ke; us par mera koi raasta nahi. Yahan meri khushi khatm hui. Ye Taiba hai; qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, us mein koi tang ya khula raasta, maidan ya pahar nahi magar us par farishta hai jo qayamat ke din tak apni talwar sonte hue hai."
"2509","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main tum se hans-mazaq karun phir bhi haq ke siwa nahi kehta."
"2510","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main ehad ko nahi torta aur na qaasidon ko rokta hun."
"2511","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main nahi janta mere baad tum mein mera rehna kitna hai; pas un donon ki pairwi karo jo mere baad honge: Abu Bakr aur Umar; aur Ammar ki hidayat ko thaam lo, aur Ibn-e-Masood tumhein jo bayan kare use sach mano."
"2512","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main zulm par gawahi nahi deta."
"2513","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main auraton se musafeha nahi karta."
"2514","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak main mushrik ka hadiya qabool nahi karta."
"2515","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nasha-aawar se mana karta hun jo namaz se behosh kare."
"2516","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein jhoot se mana karta hun."
"2517","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein do dinon ke roze se mana karta hun: Fitr aur Azha ke."
"2518","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein us thore se mana karta hun jis ka zyada nasha de."
"2519","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khoon jis se chaho bahao aur us par Allah ka naam lo."
"2520","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Moonchhein khoob kato aur darhiyan barhao."
"2521","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rehman ka Arsh Saad bin Muaz ki maut par hil gaya."
"2522","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushrikon ki hija karo kyunke Rooh-ul-Qudus tumhare saath hai. Ye Hassan se kaha."
"2523","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quraish ki hija karo kyunke wo un par teer barsane se zyada sakht hai."
"2524","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par saat mashkizon se dalo jin ke munh na khole gaye hon, shayad main logon se ehad karun."
"2525","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat wale: be-baal, narm jism, surma lagaye hue; un ki jawani fana nahi hogi aur un ke kapre purane nahi honge."
"2526","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat wale aik sau bees safein honge; assi is ¤ ummat mein se aur chaalees baqi ummaton mein se."
"2527","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat wale wo hain jin ke kaan Allah taala ne logon ki achhi tareef se bhar diye is haal mein ke wo sun rahe hon; aur aag wale wo hain jin ke kaan Allah taala ne logon ki buri tareef se bhar diye is haal mein ke wo sun rahe hon."
"2528","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehl-e-Quran Allah wale aur us ke khaas hain."
"2529","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag wale har sakht-mizaj, mote-taze, takabbur karne wale honge; aur jannat wale kamzor maghloob honge."
"2530","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehl-e-Yaman narm dil, narm fuaad aur itaat mein zyada sunne wale hain."
"2531","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Halka sood us ki tarah hai jo apni maan se nikah kare; aur beshak sab se bara sood aadmi ka apne bhai ki izzat mein zyadati karna hai."
"2532","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag mein sab se halke azab wale Abu Talib honge; wo aag ke do joote pehne honge jin se un ka dimagh khaulega."
"2533","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din aag mein sab se halke azab wala wo aadmi hoga jis ke donon pairon ke talwon mein do angare rakhe jayenge jin se us ka dimagh khaulega."
"2534","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhare liye malik hun ke Allah ne tumhare dil se rehmat chheen li?"
"2535","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum aisa karte ho? Tum par koi harj nahi ke aisa na karo; kyunke koi jaan nahi jise Allah ne nikalna likha ho magar wo nikalne wali hai."
"2536","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fajr se pehle witr parho."
"2537","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Subah hone se pehle witr parho."
"2538","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Witr parho ae ehl-e-Quran; beshak Allah taaq hai, taaq ko pasand karta hai."
"2539","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman ki sab se mazboot kariyan: Allah ki khatir dosti, Allah ki khatir dushmani, Allah ki khatir mohabbat aur Allah azza wa jal ki khatir bughz hain."
"2540","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Talha par wajib ho gaya jab unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath jo kiya so kiya."
"2541","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein waseeyat karta hun ke Allah taala se haya karo jaisa apni qaum ke naik aadmi se haya karte ho."
"2542","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein waseeyat karta hun ke laanat karne wale na bano."
"2543","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein waseeyat karta hun ke Allah taala se daro kyunke wo har cheez ka sar hai; aur tum par jihad lazim hai kyunke wo Islam ki rahebaniyat hai; aur tum par Allah taala ka zikr aur Quran ki tilawat lazim hai kyunke wo aasman mein tumhari rooh aur zameen mein tumhara zikr hai."
"2544","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein waseeyat karta hun ke apne muamle ke chhupe aur khule mein Allah taala se daro; aur jab bura karo to achha karo; aur kisi se koi cheez na mango; aur amanat qabz na karo; aur donon ke darmiyan faisla na karo."
"2545","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein waseeyat karta hun ke Allah taala se daro aur har bulandi par takbeer kaho."
"2546","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein apne sahaba ki waseeyat karta hun, phir un ki jo un ke baad honge; phir jhoot phail jayega yahan tak ke aadmi qasam khayega aur us se qasam nahi mangi jayegi, aur gawah gawahi dega aur us se gawahi nahi mangi jayegi. Khabardar, koi aadmi kisi aurat se tanhayi na kare magar un ka teesra shaitan hoga. Tum par jamaat lazim hai aur phoot se bacho; kyunke shaitan akele ke saath hai aur wo donon se ¤ zyada door hai. Jo jannat ke darmiyan ka khwahish-mand ho wo jamaat ko lazim pakre. Jise us ki neki khush kare aur us ki burayi buri lage pas yehi momin hai."
"2547","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein Ansar ki waseeyat karta hun kyunke wo meri kokh aur meri topi-dan hain; unhon ne jo un par tha ada kar diya aur jo un ke liye hai baqi hai; pas un ke nek kaar se qabool karo aur un ke bura kaar se darguzar karo."
"2548","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein hamsaye ki waseeyat karta hun."
"2549","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main tumhein Allah se darne, sunne aur itaat ki waseeyat karta hun agarche tum par Habshi ghulam muqarrar kiya jaye; kyunke tum mein se jo mere baad jiyega wo jald bohat ikhtilaf dekhega; pas tum par meri sunnat aur hidayat-yafta khulfa-e-rashideen ki sunnat lazim hai, use thaam lo aur use darhon se pakro; aur naye muamlat se bacho kyunke har naya muamla bidat hai aur har bidat gumrahi hai."
"2550","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni nazr poori karo."
"2551","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni nazr poori karo kyunke Allah taala ki nafarmani mein nazr poori nahi hoti aur na us mein jo ibn Adam ke ikhtiyar mein nahi."
"2552","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Ibn-e-Khattab, kiya tum shak mein ho? Ye aisi qaum hai jin ke liye un ki pakeeza cheezein duniya ki zindagi mein jaldi de di gayin."
"2553","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahiliyyat ke ehad poore karo kyunke Islam ne use sakhti mein hi barhaya hai; aur Islam mein naya ehad na karo."
"2554","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya jab ham Allah ki raah mein niklte hain to un mein se aik peechhe rehta hai jis ki bakre ki tarah aawaz hai, un mein se aik ko doodh ka bara pyala diya gaya? Allah ki qasam, main un mein se aik par qadir hunga to use ibrat banaunga."
"2555","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum sab ke paas do kapre hain?"
"2556","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waleema karo agarche bakri ho."
"2557","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ke dost wo hain ke jab dekhe jayen to Allah taala yaad aaye."
"2558","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tumhein maloom nahi Bani Israel ke saathi ko kiya pahuncha? Wo jab unhein peshab mein se kuch lagta to use qainchiyon se kaat-te thay; pas un ke saathi ne unhein mana kiya to use qabr mein azab diya gaya."
"2559","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tumhein maloom nahi maine apne Rab se kiya shart ki? Maine kaha: Ae Allah, main sirf bashar hun; pas Musalmanon mein se jise main laanat karun ya gaali dun use us ke liye pakeezgi aur ajr bana."
"2560","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli nishani suraj ka maghrib se tuloo hona hai."
"2561","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sab se pehle halak hone wale Quraish honge aur Quraish mein sab se pehle halak hone wale mere ghar wale honge."
"2562","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka pehla lashkar jo samandar mein sawaar hoga un par wajib ho gaya, aur meri ummat ka pehla lashkar jo Qaisar ke sheher par hamla karega unhein bakhsh diya gaya."
"2563","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din pehle do fareeq hamsaye honge."
"2564","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli jamaat jo jannat mein dakhil hogi chaudahween raat ke chaand ki surat par hogi aur dusri aasman mein roshan sitare se behtar rang par hogi; un mein se har aadmi ke liye do biwiyan hongi, har biwi par sattar jore honge jin se us ki pindli ka maghz peechhe se dikhega."
"2565","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli jamaat jo jannat mein dakhil hogi chaudahween raat ke chaand ki surat par hogi aur jo un ke naqsh-e-qadam par honge aasman mein sab se zyada roshan chamakdar sitare jaise honge; un ke dil aik aadmi ke dil par honge, un ke darmiyan na ikhtilaf na bughz na hasad; un mein se har aadmi ke liye do biwiyan hongi jin mein se har aik ki pindli ka maghz husn ki wajah se gosht ¤ ke peechhe se dekha jayega; wo subah-shaam Allah ki tasbeeh karenge; wo beemar nahi honge, naak nahi saaf karenge aur na thukeinge; un ke bartan sone-chandi ke honge, un ki kanghiyan sone ki hongi aur un ki angeethiyon ka eendhan ood hoga."
"2566","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli jamaat jo jannat mein dakhil hogi un ki surtein chaudahween raat ke chaand ki surat par hongi; wo us mein na thukeinge na naak saaf karenge na pakhana karenge; us mein un ke bartan sone ke honge, un ki kanghiyan sone-chandi ki hongi, un ki angeethiyan ood ki hongi aur un ka paseena mushk hoga; un mein se har aik ke liye do biwiyan hongi jin ki pindli ka maghz husn ki wajah se gosht ke peechhe se dekha jayega; un ke darmiyan na ikhtilaf na bughz; un ke dil aik dil honge; wo subah-shaam Allah ki tasbeeh karenge."
"2567","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jo jannat wale khayenge machhli ke kaleje ki zyadati hogi."
"2568","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jo logon ko jama karegi aag hogi jo unhein mashriq se maghrib ki taraf hankegi."
"2569","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jo is ummat se uthayi jayegi khushu hoga yahan tak ke tum us mein khushu karne wala na dekho."
"2570","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jo tum apne deen mein se kho doge amanat hogi."
"2571","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jis ka logon se qayamat ke din un ke aamaal mein se hisab hoga namaz hai; hamara Rab azza wa jal apne farishton se farmayega is haal mein ke wo zyada janne wala hai: Mere bande ki namaz mein dekho, kiya use poora kiya ya kam kiya? Phir agar poori hui to us ke liye poori likhi jayegi, aur agar us mein se kuch kam hua to farmayega: Dekho kiya mere bande ke paas nafl hain? Phir agar us ke paas nafl hon to farmayega: Mere bande ka fareeza poora karo; phir aamaal isi par liye jayenge."
"2572","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jis ka bande se hisab hoga namaz hai aur pehla faisla jo logon ke darmiyan hoga khoonon mein hoga."
"2573","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jis ka bande se qayamat ke din hisab hoga namaz hai; phir agar wo durust hui to us ka baqi amal durust hoga aur agar wo bigri to us ka baqi amal bigrega."
"2574","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jis ka bande se qayamat ke din us ki namaz ka hisab hoga; phir agar use poora kiya to us ke liye poori likhi jayegi, aur agar use poora na kiya to Allah apne farishton se farmayega: Dekho kiya tum mere bande ke liye nafl pate ho jin se us ka fareeza poora karo? Phir zakaat isi tarah, phir aamaal usi andaze par liye jayenge."
"2575","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jo logon se uthayi jayegi amanat hogi aur un ke deen mein se aakhir jo baqi rahega namaz hogi; aur kitne hi namaz parhne wale honge jin ka Allah taala ke paas koi hissa nahi hoga."
"2576","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jo logon se uthayi jayegi khushu hoga."
"2577","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehla faisla jo logon ke darmiyan qayamat ke din hoga khoonon mein hoga."
"2578","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli cheez jo shaheed ke khoon mein se bahayi jayegi us ka sara gunah bakhsh diya jayega siwaye qarz ke."
"2579","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehli masjid jo zameen mein rakhi gayi Masjid-e-Haraam hai, phir Masjid-e-Aqsa, aur un ke darmiyan chaalees saal hain; phir is ke baad jahan tumhein namaz paye wahan parho kyunke us mein fazeelat hai."
"2580","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehla jis ne Ibrahim ke deen ko badla Amr bin Luhay bin Qamaa bin Khindaf Abu Khuzaa tha."
"2581","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehla jis ki zaban wazeh Arabi mein kholi gayi Ismail thay is haal mein ke wo chaudah saal ke thay."
"2582","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehla jo meri sunnat badlega Bani Umayya mein se aik aadmi hoga."
"2583","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehla jo qayamat ke din bulaya jayega Adam honge; un ke saamne un ki aulad zahir ki jayegi aur kaha jayega: Ye tumhare baap Adam hain. Wo kahenge: Labbaik wa Saadaik. Farmayega: Apni aulad mein se jahannam ka hissa nikalo. Wo kahenge: Ae Rab, kitne nikalu? Farmayega: Har sau mein se ninyanwe nikalo. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, jab ham mein se har sau mein se ninyanwe ¤ pakre jayen to ham mein se kiya baqi rahega? Farmaya: Beshak meri ummat ummaton mein kaale bail mein safed baal ki tarah hogi."
"2584","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehla jo makhlooq mein se kapraya jayega Ibrahim honge."
"2585","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pehle nabi jo bhejey gaye Nuh thay."
"2586","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushrikon ke bachche jannat walon ke khadim honge."
"2587","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ke dost wo hain ke jab dekhe jayen to Allah taala yaad aaye."
"2588","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya Allah ne tumhare liye wo nahi banaya jis se tum sadqa karo? Beshak har tasbeeh sadqa hai, har takbeer sadqa hai, har tahmeed sadqa hai, har tahleel sadqa hai, maroof ka hukm sadqa hai, munkar se mana karna sadqa hai, aur tum mein se kisi ki sharmgah mein sadqa hai. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kiya ham mein se koi apni khwahish poori kare aur us mein us ke liye ajr ho? Farmaya: Batayen, agar use haram mein rakhta to kiya us par gunah na hota? Pas isi tarah jab use halal mein rakhe to us ke liye ajr hoga."
"2589","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein badbakht tareen logon ke baare mein na bataun, do aadmiyon ke baare mein? Samood ka surkh jis ne untni ki kaanch kaati, aur wo jo tumhein marega ae Ali, is par yahan tak ke is se ye tar ho jaye."
"2590","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise muamle ke baare mein na bataun ke agar tum use lo to unhein pao jo tum se pehle thay aur tumhein wo na payen jo tumhare baad honge, aur tum un se behtar ho jin ke darmiyan tum ho siwaye us ke jo tum jaisa kare? Har namaz ke peechhe taintees baar tasbeeh, tahmeed aur takbeer kaho."
"2591","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein Dajjal ke baare mein hadees na sunau jo mujh se pehle kisi nabi ne apni qaum se nahi sunayi? Wo kana hai; us ke saath jannat aur aag ki misal aayegi; pas wo jise kahega ke ye jannat hai wo aag hogi; aur main tumhein us se darata hun jaisa Nuh ne apni qaum ko us se daraya tha."
"2592","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein Quran ki behtareen surat na bataun: Sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain jo Aalamin ka Rab hai."
"2593","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein behtareen na bataun jis se panah mangne wale panah mangein: Keh do main subah ke Rab ki panah mangta hun, aur keh do main logon ke Rab ki panah mangta hun."
"2594","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aag walon ke baare mein na bataun? Har sakht-mizaj, mote-taze, takabbur karne wale, jama karne wale, rokne wale. Kiya main tumhein jannat walon ke baare mein na bataun? Har miskeen jo agar Allah par qasam khaye to Allah use poora kare."
"2595","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein roze, namaz aur sadqe ke darje se afzal ke baare mein na bataun? Aapas ke taalluqat sudharna; kyunke aapas ke taalluqat ka bigarna mundne wali hai."
"2596","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein udhar mange bakre ke baare mein na bataun? Wo halala karne wala hai; pas Allah ne halala karne wale aur jis ke liye halala kiya jaye us par laanat ki hai."
"2597","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise muamle ke baare mein na bataun ke jab tum use karoge to unhein paoge jo tum se pehle thay aur tum se aage barhoge jo tumhare baad honge? Har namaz ke baad Allah ki hamd, tasbeeh aur takbeer kaho: taintees, taintees aur chauntees."
"2598","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein jannat walon ke baare mein na bataun? Har kamzor daba hua jo agar Allah par qasam khaye to Allah use poora kare. Kiya main tumhein aag walon ke baare mein na bataun? Har sakht, mote-taze, akarne wale, takabbur karne wale."
"2599","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein tumhare behtareen aur bure hukmaranon ke baare mein na bataun? Tumhare behtareen wo hain jin se tum mohabbat karte ho aur wo tum se mohabbat karte hain, tum un ke liye dua karte ho aur wo tumhare liye dua karte hain; aur tumhare bure hukmaran wo hain jin se tum bughz rakhte ho aur wo tum se bughz rakhte hain, tum un par laanat karte ho aur wo tum par laanat karte hain."
"2600","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein behtareen gawahon ke baare mein na bataun? Wo jo apni gawahi lekar aaye is se pehle ke us se mangi jaye."
"2601","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein darje mein behtareen logon ke baare mein na bataun? Aik aadmi jo Allah ki raah mein apne ghore ki lagam thaame hue hai yahan tak ke mare ya qatl kiya jaye; kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jo us ke baad hai? Aik aadmi jo ghati mein alag rehta hai, namaz qayam karta hai, zakaat deta hai aur logon ¤ ke sharon se alag rehta hai; kiya main tumhein bure tareen logon ke baare mein na bataun? Aik aadmi jo Allah ke waseele se mange aur na de."
"2602","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein Ansar ke behtareen gharon ke baare mein na bataun? Bani Najjar ka ghar, phir Bani Abdul Ashhal ka ghar, phir Bani Haris ka ghar, phir Khazraj, phir Bani Saida ka ghar; aur Ansar ke har ghar mein khair hai."
"2603","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein tumhare behtar ko tumhare bure se na bataun? Tumhara behtar wo hai jis ki khair ki umeed ho aur jis ke shar se aman ho; aur tumhara bura wo hai jis ki khair ki umeed na ho aur jis ke shar se aman na ho."
"2604","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein jannat walon mein se tumhare mardon ke baare mein na bataun? Nabi jannat mein hai, shaheed jannat mein hai, siddeeq jannat mein hai, paida hone wala bachcha jannat mein hai, aur wo aadmi jo sheher ke kinare apne bhai ki Allah ki khatir ziyarat kare jannat mein hai; kiya main tumhein jannat walon mein se tumhari auraton ke baare mein na bataun? Mohabbat karne wali, zyada bachche janne wali, laut aane wali jo jab zulm kare to kahe: Mera haath tumhare haath mein hai, neend nahi chakhungi yahan tak ke tum raazi ho jao."
"2605","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aisi cheez ke baare mein na bataun ke jab tum mein se kisi par duniya ke muamle mein se takleef ya museebat utre aur wo us se dua kare to us se khol di jaye? Zun-Noon ki dua: Tere siwa koi mabood nahi, tu paak hai, beshak main zaalimon mein se hun."
"2606","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein munafiq ki namaz ke baare mein na bataun? Ke Asr ko moakhar kare yahan tak ke ¤ jab suraj gaaye ki ojhri jaisi ho jaye to use parhe."
"2607","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jo mere nazdeek tum par Maseeh Dajjal se zyada darr wali cheez hai? Chhupa shirk: ke aadmi khara hokar namaz parhe aur apni namaz ko sanware jo wo kisi aadmi ki nazar se dekhe."
"2608","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jo seene ki jalan door kare? Har mah se teen din ke roze."
"2609","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jis par kal aag haram hogi? Har narm, mulayam, qareeb, aasaan par."
"2610","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein jannat ke darwazon mein se aik darwaze ke baare mein na bataun? La haula wa la quwwata illa billah."
"2611","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise jihad ke baare mein na bataun jis mein kaanta nahi? Baitullah ka hajj."
"2612","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein sayyid-ul-istighfar ke baare mein na bataun? Ae Allah, tu mera Rab hai, tere siwa koi mabood nahi; tune mujhe paida kiya aur main tera banda hun, aur main apne ehad aur wade par hun jitna ho sake; main teri panah mangta hun us shar se jo maine kiya, aur tere saamne teri neimat ka iqraar karta hun aur apne ¤ gunahon ka iqraar karta hun; pas mere gunah bakhsh de, beshak gunah tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta. Use koi shaam ke waqt na kahe phir subah se pehle us par maut aaye magar us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi; aur use subah ke waqt na kahe phir shaam se pehle us par maut aaye magar us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi."
"2613","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise podon ke baare mein na bataun jo is se behtar hain? Kaho: SubhanAllah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar; tumhare liye un mein se har kalime se jannat mein aik darakht lagaya jayega."
"2614","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein Arsh ke neeche se jannat ke khazane mein se aik kalime ke baare mein na bataun? Kaho: La haula wa la quwwata illa billah; pas Allah farmata hai: Mera banda Musalman hua aur farmabardar hua."
"2615","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jo raat ke saath din mein tumhare Allah ke zikr se zyada hai? Kaho: Sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain us ki ginti mein jo us ne paida kiya, sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain us ke bharne mein jo us ne paida kiya, sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain us ki ginti mein jo aasmanon aur zameen mein hai, sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain us ki ginti mein jo us ki kitab ne shumar kiya, sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain us par jo us ki kitab ne shumar kiya, sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain har cheez ki ginti mein, sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain har cheez ke bharne mein; aur Allah ki tasbeeh karo un jaisa; unhein seekho aur apne baad apni aulad ko sikhlao."
"2616","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jo tumhare liye khadim se behtar hai? Jab apna bichhauna pakro to taintees baar Allah ki tasbeeh karo, taintees baar hamd karo aur chauntees baar takbeer kaho."
"2617","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jis se Allah gunahon ko mitata hai aur nekiyon mein izafa karta hai? Na-pasandida haalaton mein wuzu poora karna, masjdon ki taraf kasrat se qadam chalana aur namaz ke baad namaz ka intezar karna."
"2618","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein us ke baare mein na bataun jis se Allah gunahon ko mitata hai aur darje buland karta hai? Na-pasandida haalaton mein wuzu poora karna, masjdon ki taraf kasrat se qadam chalana aur namaz ke baad namaz ka intezar karna; pas yehi sarhad ki nigehbani hai, pas yehi sarhad ki nigehbani hai, pas yehi sarhad ki nigehbani hai."
"2619","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tum donon ko us se behtar na bataun jo tum ne manga? Jab apne bichhaune pakro to chauntees baar Allah ki takbeer kaho, taintees baar Allah ki hamd karo aur taintees baar tasbeeh karo; kyunke ye tumhare liye khadim se behtar hai."
"2620","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main us aadmi se haya na karun jis se farishte haya karte hain, yani Usman."
"2621","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise kalimaat na sikhlaun ke jab tum unhein kaho to Allah tumhein bakhsh de agarche tum bakhshe hue ho? Kaho: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jo buland azeem hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi jo hikmat wala kareem hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, paak hai Allah jo saat aasmanon ka Rab aur azeem Arsh ka Rab hai; sab tareefein Allah ke liye hain jo Aalamin ka Rab hai."
"2622","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise kalimaat na sikhlaun jo tum kaho jab apne bichhaune par jao; phir agar apni raat mein mar jao to fitrat par maro, aur agar subah karo to subah karo is haal mein ke khair pa chuke ho? Kaho: Ae Allah, maine apne aap ko tere hawale kiya, apna chehra teri taraf kiya, apna muamla raghbat aur darr se tere hawale kiya, apni peeth tere hawale ki; tere siwa tujh se koi panah aur nijaat nahi; main teri kitab par iman laya jo tune utari aur tere nabi par jo tune bheja."
"2623","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise kalimaat na sikhlaun jo tum takleef ke waqt kaho? Allah, Allah mera Rab hai, main us ke saath kisi ko shareek nahi karta."
"2624","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise kalimaat na sikhlaun jo tum kaho? SubhanAllah us ki makhlooq ki ginti mein, teen baar; SubhanAllah us ki raza mein, teen baar; SubhanAllah us ke Arsh ke wazan mein, teen baar; SubhanAllah us ke kalimaat ki siyahi mein, teen baar."
"2625","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aise kalimaat na sikhlaun ke agar tum par Sabir paharr jaisa qarz ho to Allah tumhari taraf se ada kare? Kaho: Ae Allah, mujhe apne halal se apne haram se bacha aur mujhe apne fazl se apne siwa se be-niaz kar."
"2626","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein aisi cheez na sikhlaun jis se tum unhein pao jo tum se aage barh gaye aur un se aage barho jo tumhare baad honge, aur tum se koi afzal na ho siwaye us ke jo tum jaisa kare? Har namaz ke baad taintees baar tasbeeh, takbeer aur tahmeed kaho."
"2627","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein jannat walon ke baare mein na bataun? Kamzor maghloob."
"2628","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein sab se bare kabeera gunahon ke baare mein na bataun? Allah ke saath shirk karna, walidain ki nafarmani aur jhooti baat."
"2629","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein tumhare behtareen aamaal ke baare mein na bataun, tumhare Badshah ke nazdeek sab se pakeeza, tumhare darjon mein sab se buland, tumhare liye sone-chandi kharch karne se behtar aur tumhare liye is se behtar ke tum apne dushman se milo to un ki gardanein maro aur wo tumhari gardanein marein? Allah ka zikr."
"2630","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya main tumhein na bataun ke Azah kiya hai? Wo chughli hai, logon ke darmiyan baat phailana."
"2631","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak Abu Falan ke ghar wale mere dost nahi; mera dost to Allah aur naik momin hain."
"2632","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak fitna yahan hai? Jahan se shaitan ka seeng nikalta hai."
"2633","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak quwwat teer-andazi hai; khabardar, beshak quwwat teer-andazi hai; khabardar, beshak ¤ quwwat teer-andazi hai."
"2634","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak Allah jald tumhare liye zameen kholega aur tumhein kharch se kafi kiya jayega; pas tum mein se koi apne teeron se khelne se aajiz na ho."
"2635","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak main har dost ki dosti se bari hun; aur agar main kisi ko khaleel banata to Abu Bakr ko khaleel banata; aur beshak tumhara saathi Allah ka khaleel hai."
"2636","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak Maseeh Dajjal dayen aankh se kana hai goya us ki aankh ubhri hui angur hai. Aur maine aaj raat Kaaba ke paas khwab mein dekha ke gandum-rang aadmi hai jo aadmiyon ke gandum-rang mein sab se khubsurat hai jo tum dekho; us ke kandhon ke darmiyan us ke baal pare hue hain, ghungrale baal wala hai, us ka sar pani tapka raha hai, do aadmiyon ke kandhon par apne donon haath rakhe hue hai aur wo donon ke darmiyan Baitullah ka tawaf kar raha hai. Maine kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Maseeh bin Maryam. Phir maine us ke peechhe aik aadmi dekha ghungrale sakht baal wala, dayen aankh se kana, jo Ibn-e-Qatan se sab se zyada mushabeh hai jo maine dekha, aik aadmi ke kandhon par apne donon haath rakhe hue Baitullah ka tawaf kar raha hai. Maine kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Maseeh Dajjal."
"2637","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak mere Rab ne mujhe hukm diya hai ke tumhein sikhlaun jo tum nahi jante us mein se jo us ne mujhe aaj sikhaya. Har maal jo maine bande ko diya halal hai; aur beshak maine apne bandon ko sab ko seedhe deen par paida kiya; aur beshak un ke paas shaitan aaye aur unhein un ke deen se pher diya, un par wo haram kiya jo maine un ke liye halal kiya tha aur unhein hukm diya ke mere saath wo shareek karein jis ki maine koi daleel nahi utari. Aur beshak Allah ne ¤ zameen walon ki taraf dekha to un se naraz hua, un ke Arab aur Ajam se, siwaye ehl-e-Kitaab mein se bache-hue ke. Aur farmaya: Maine tumhein sirf is liye bheja hai ke tumhein aazmau aur tum se aazmau; aur maine tum par aisi kitab utari hai jise pani nahi dhoe ga, use sote aur jaagte parhoge. Aur beshak Allah ne mujhe hukm diya ke Quraish ko jalau to maine kaha: Ae Rab, tab to wo mera sar kuchal denge aur use roti bana denge. Farmaya: Unhein nikalo jaisa unhon ne tumhein nikala, un se laro ham tumhein izzat denge, kharch karo to ham tum par kharch karenge, lashkar bhejo to ham us jaise paanch bhejenge, tum se itaat karne walon se un se laro jo tumhari nafarmani karein. Aur jannat wale teen hain: insaf karne wala sadqa dene wala taufeeq wala hukmaran, rehem-dil narm-dil aadmi jo har rishtedar aur Musalman ke liye hai, aur pakeezgi ikhtiyar karne wala pakeez-daman bachchon wala. Aur aag wale paanch hain: kamzor jis mein aqal nahi, wo jo tum mein tabedar hain jo ghar aur maal nahi chahte; khayanat karne wala jis ki khwahish chhupi nahi agarche bareek ho magar us mein khayanat karta hai; aur wo aadmi jo subah-shaam is ke siwa nahi hota ke tumhein tumhare ghar walon aur maal mein dhoka deta hai. Aur bukhl, jhoot aur behaya bad-zaban ka zikr kiya."
"2638","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak ghalti ke qatl mein jo amdan jaisa ho kore aur laathi se ho, us mein sau unt hain sakht, un mein se chaalees hamila hain jin ke peton mein un ke bachche hain."
"2639","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak tum sab apne Rab se sargoshi karte ho; pas tum mein se koi dusre ko takleef na de aur qiraat mein baaz baaz par buland na ho."
"2640","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, ye sirf chaar hain: Allah ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, us jaan ko qatl na karo jise Allah ne haram kiya magar haq ke saath, zina na karo aur chori na karo."
"2641","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak tum se pehle ehl-e-Kitaab bahattar millaton par bate thay; aur beshak ye millat tihattar par bategi, bahattar aag mein aur aik jannat mein aur wo jamaat hai. Aur beshak meri ummat mein se aisi qaumein niklengi jin mein ye khwahishein aise daudengi jaisa pagal-pan ka marz apne saathi mein daudta hai; us ki koi rag aur jor baqi nahi rahega magar us mein dakhil hoga."
"2642","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak har dhokebaaz ke liye qayamat ke din us ki dhokebaazi ke andaze par jhanda nasb kiya jayega."
"2643","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak mujhe kitab di gayi hai aur us ke saath us jaisa; khabardar, qareeb hai ke aik sair aadmi apne takht par kahe: Tum par ye Quran lazim hai; pas us mein jo halal pao use halal karo aur us mein jo haram pao use haram karo. Khabardar, tumhare liye ghar ke gadhe ka gosht halal nahi aur na darindon mein se har daant wale ka, aur na ehed wale ki giri hui cheez siwaye is ke ke us ka malik us se be-niaz ho; aur jo kisi qaum ke paas utre to un par lazim hai ke us ki mehmaan-nawazi karein; phir agar wo us ki mehmaan-nawazi na karein to us ke liye hai ke un se zabardasti us ki mehmaan-nawazi jitna le."
"2644","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, beshak main hauz par tumhara pesh-rau hun; aur beshak us ke donon kinaron ke darmiyan Sana aur Aila ke darmiyan jitna faasla hai; goya us mein aabkhore sitare hain."
"2645","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mujhe aman nahi dete halanke main us ka ameen hun jo aasman mein hai? Mere paas ¤ aasman ki khabar subah-shaam aati hai."
"2646","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mujh se is par baiat nahi karte ke Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, paanch namazein qayam karo, zakaat do, suno aur itaat karo, aur logon se koi cheez na mango?"
"2647","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum nahi sunte? Beshak Allah aankh ke aansu se azab nahi deta aur na dil ke gham se, lekin is se azab deta hai, aur apni zaban ki taraf ishara kiya, ya rehem karta hai. Aur beshak mayyat ko us ke ghar walon ke us par rone se azab diya jata hai."
"2648","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum saff nahi bandhte jaisa farishte apne Rab ke paas saff bandhte hain? Pehli saffon se namaz mukammal karte hain aur saff mein mil kar khare hote hain."
"2649","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum taajjub nahi karte ke Allah mujh se Quraish ki gaali aur laanat ko kaise pherta hai? Wo Muzammam ko gaali dete hain aur Muzammam par laanat karte hain halanke main Muhammad hun."
"2650","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum use namla ke kaatne ka dam nahi sikhatin jaisa tum ne use likhna sikhaya hai?"
"2651","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum ne use dhanka nahi agarche us par lakri rakho?"
"2652","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya koi aadmi nahi jo is par sadqa kare aur us ke saath namaz parhe?"
"2653","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya koi aadmi nahi jo ghar walon ko untni atiya de jo subah chara lekar aaye aur shaam chara lekar aaye? Beshak us ka ajr azeem hai."
"2654","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum ne us ka dil nahi cheera taake tum jaan lete ke us ne is wajah se kaha tha ya nahi? Qayamat ke din La ilaha illallah se tumhara kiya bane ga?"
"2655","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, jo ehed wale par zulm kare ya us ka haq kam kare ya use us ki taqat se zyada kaam de ya us se us ki na-khushi se kuch le to main qayamat ke din us ka jhagralu hunga."
"2656","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, kiya qareeb hai ke tum mein se koi aik ya do meel par bakriyon ka rewar rakhe phir us par chara mushkil ho jaye to wo uncha chala jaye, phir Juma aaye to wo na aaye aur us mein hazir na ho, phir Juma aaye to us mein hazir na ho, phir Juma aaye to us mein hazir na ho yahan tak ke us ke dil par mohar laga di jaye."
"2657","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, kiya qareeb hai ke aik aadmi jise meri taraf se hadees pahunche is haal mein ke wo apne takht par tek lagaye hue ho to kahe: Hamare aur tumhare darmiyan Allah ki kitab hai; pas us mein jo halal payen use halal karein aur us mein jo haram payen use haram karein. Aur beshak jo Rasoolullah ne haram kiya wo aisa hai jaisa Allah ne haram kiya."
"2658","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khabardar, koi apne aap ke siwa kisi ko malamat na kare; wo raat guzarta hai is haal mein ke us ke haath mein charbi ¤ ki boo hai."
"2659","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae mere bhaiyo, is din ke liye tayyari karo."
"2660","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi pasand karta hai ke jab apne ghar walon ki taraf laute to teen bare mote hamila unt paye? Pas teen aayatein jinhein tum mein se koi apni namaz mein parhe us ke liye teen bare mote hamila unton se behtar hain."
"2661","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi pasand karta hai ke us ke chehre mein thuka jaye? Beshak tum mein se koi jab qible ki taraf munh kare to wo apne Rab azza wa jal ki taraf munh karta hai aur farishta us ke dayen taraf hai; pas na apne dayen taraf thu ke aur na apne saamne, balke apne bayen taraf ya apne qadam ke neeche thuke; phir agar use jaldi ka muamla pesh aaye to aise thuke, yani apne kapre mein."
"2662","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke namaz mein aage ya peechhe ya apne dayen ya bayen ho jaye, yani nafl mein."
"2663","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke raat mein Quran ka teesra hissa parhe? Pas beshak jis ne raat mein Qul Huwallahu Ahad, Allahus Samad parhi us ne apni raat ka teesra hissa parh liya."
"2664","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke har raat Quran ka teesra hissa parhe? Beshak Allah ne Quran ke teen hisse kiye hain aur Qul Huwallahu Ahad ko Quran ke hisson mein se aik hissa banaya hai."
"2665","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke har din hazar nekiyan kamaye? Allah ki sau baar tasbeeh kare to Allah us ke liye us se hazar nekiyan likhega aur us se us se hazar gunah mitayega."
"2666","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki neki aur badbakhti us ke donon jabron ke darmiyan hai."
"2667","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haan ae Ibn-e-Khattab! Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, shaitan tumhein kabhi kisi raaste par chalta hua nahi payega magar wo tumhare raaste ke siwa dusra raasta ikhtiyar karega."
"2668","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aish-o-aaraam se bacho kyunke Allah ke bande aish-o-aaraam wale nahi hote."
"2669","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh wali se bacho."
"2670","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke sone ke baad raat ki guftagu se bacho kyunke tum nahi jante Allah apni makhlooq mein kiya lane wala hai."
"2671","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har us muamle se bacho jis mein uzr pesh karna pare."
"2672","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hukmaranon ke darwazon se bacho kyunke wo sakht aur utarne wala ho gaya hai."
"2673","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raaste ke darmiyan mein dopahar ko aaraam karne aur us par namaz parhne se bacho kyunke wo sanpon aur darindon ki panah-gah hai; aur us par hajat poori karne se bacho kyunke wo laanat ki jaghein hain."
"2674","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aapas mein tareef se bacho kyunke wo zibah hai."
"2675","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raaston par baithne se bacho; phir agar tum majlison ke baghair na raho to raaste ka haq do: nazar jhukana, takleef door karna, salam ka jawab dena, maroof ka hukm aur munkar se mana karna."
"2676","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Guthli se kankari marne se bacho kyunke wo daant torti hai, aankh phorti hai aur dushman ko zakhmi nahi karti."
"2677","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Auraton ke paas jane se bacho."
"2678","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bukhl se bacho kyunke tum se pehle wale bukhl se halak hue; us ne unhein bukhl ka hukm diya to wo bakheel bane, unhein qata-talluq ka hukm diya to unhon ne qata kiya, unhein behayai ka hukm diya to wo behaya hue."
"2679","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bad-gumani se bacho kyunke bad-gumani sab se jhooti baat hai; aur ¤ jasusi na karo, na tooh mein paro, na muqabla karo, na hasad karo, na bughz rakho, na peeth phero; aur Allah ke bande bhai-bhai ban jao; aur koi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje yahan tak ke wo nikah kare ya chhor de."
"2680","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Deen mein ghulu se bacho kyunke tum se pehle wale deen mein ghulu se halak hue."
"2681","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wisal ke roze se bacho; beshak tum is mein mujh jaise nahi ho; beshak main raat guzarta hun ke mera Rab mujhe khilata aur pilata hai; pas amal mein se utna karo jitna taqat rakho."
"2682","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mazloom ki bad-dua se bacho agarche kafir se ho kyunke us ke aur Allah azza wa jal ke darmiyan koi parda nahi."
"2683","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aapas ke bighar se bacho kyunke wo mundne wali hai."
"2684","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri taraf se kasrat se hadees bayan karne se bacho; pas jis ne mujh par kaha wo haq ya sach kahe; aur jis ne mujh par wo kaha jo maine nahi kaha wo aag mein apna thikana bana le."
"2685","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bai mein kasrat se qasam khane se bacho kyunke wo chalata hai phir mitata hai."
"2686","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhote gunahon se bacho; kyunke chhote gunahon ki misal ¤ aise logon ki misal hai jo wadi ke pait mein utre; phir ye lakri lekar aaya aur ye lakri lekar aaya yahan tak ke unhon ne wo uthaya jis se unhon ne apni roti pakayi; aur beshak chhote gunah jab un ka malik pakra jaye use halak karte hain."
"2687","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhote gunahon se bacho kyunke wo aadmi par jama hote hain yahan tak ke use halak karte hain; jaise aik aadmi khaali zameen mein tha aur qaum ka khana tayyar hua to aik aadmi lakri lekar aaya aur aik aadmi lakri lekar aaya yahan tak ke unhon ne us mein se dher jama kiya aur aag bhar kayi aur us mein jo tha pakaya."
"2688","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In donon badbu-dar sabziyon ko khane se bacho ke hamari masjdon mein dakhil ho; phir agar tumhein unhein khana hi ho to unhein aag se maar kar khatm karo."
"2689","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tashreeq ke din khane-peene aur Allah ke zikr ke din hain."
"2690","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mina ke din khane-peene ke din hain."
"2691","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne janwaron ki peethon ko mimbar banane se bacho; kyunke Allah taala ne unhein tumhare liye is liye musakhkhar kiya hai ke tumhein us sheher tak pahunchayen jahan tum jaan ki mashaqqat ke baghair pahunchne wale nahi thay; aur us ne tumhare liye zameen banayi hai pas us par apni hajtein poori karo."
"2692","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khala se bacho, yani namaz mein."
"2693","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo masjid ka irada kare wo khushbu ke qareeb na jaye."
"2694","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun nikalne wale ke peechhe us ke ghar walon aur maal mein khair se qayam karega to us ke liye nikalne wale ke aadhe ajr jaisa hoga."
"2695","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis ke paas zameen ya khajoor ho wo use na beche yahan tak ke apne shareek par pesh kare."
"2696","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kise us ke waaris ka maal apne maal se zyada mehboob hai? Beshak us ka maal wo hai jo us ne aage bheja aur us ke waaris ka maal wo hai jo us ne peechhe chhora."
"2697","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun pasand karta hai ke har din Buthan ya Aqeeq ki taraf subah jaye aur us mein se do mote taaze safed unt laye baghair gunah aur qata-talluq ke; pas tum mein se koi masjid ki taraf subah jaye aur Allah ki kitab mein se do aayatein seekhe ya parhe to us ke liye do untniyon se behtar hai, teen us ke liye teen se behtar hain, chaar us ke liye chaar se behtar hain, aur un ki ginti mein se unt."
"2698","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi apne bhai se kahe: Kafir, to wo donon mein se aik par lautegi; agar waisa hua jaisa kaha warna usi ki taraf lautegi."
"2699","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi mare is haal mein ke us ke paas kisi aadmi ka maal us ki ain ke saath ho, us ne ¤ us se kuch taqaza kiya ho ya na kiya ho, to wo qarz-khwahon ke barabar hai."
"2700","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo Musalman aadmi kisi Musalman aadmi ko aazad kare to wo aag se us ka fidya hai; us ki har haddi ke badle us ki haddi ka badla hoga. Aur tum mein se jo Musalman aurat kisi Musalman aurat ko aazad kare to wo aag se us ka fidya hai; us ki har haddi ke badle us ki haddi ka badla hoga. Aur tum mein se jo Musalman aadmi do Musalman auraton ko aazad kare to wo donon aag se us ka fidya hain; un donon ki har do haddiyon ke badle us ki haddi ka badla hoga."
"2701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat khushbu lagaye phir nikle aur qaum ke paas se guzre taake wo us ki boo payen to wo zaniya hai, aur har aankh zaniya hai."
"2702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat bakhoor lagaye wo hamare saath aakhri Isha mein hazir na ho."
"2703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat khushbu lagaye phir masjid ki taraf nikle us ki namaz qabool nahi hogi yahan tak ke ghusl kare."
"2704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis aurat ka shohar mar jaye aur wo us ke baad nikah kare to wo us ke aakhri shoharon ke liye hogi."
"2705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat apne sar mein aisa baal barhaye jo us mein se nahi to wo jhoot hai jis mein wo izafa karti hai."
"2706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat apne shohar se baghair kisi takleef ke talaq mange to us par jannat ki khushbu haram hai."
"2707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis aurat ke teen bachche mar jayen wo us ke liye aag se hifaazat honge."
"2708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat apne ghar ke siwa kapre utare to Allah azza wa jal us se apna parda cheer dega."
"2709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat apne wali ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare to us ka nikah baatil hai, us ka nikah baatil hai, us ka nikah baatil hai; phir agar wo us se dakhil ho to us ke liye meher hoga us ke badle jo us ne us ki sharmgah se halal kiya; phir agar wo jhagrein to hukmaran us ka wali hai jis ka wali nahi."
"2710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aurat apne shohar ke ghar ke siwa kapre rakhe to us ne us parde ko cheer diya jo us ke aur Allah azza wa jal ke darmiyan hai."
"2711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo khaal dabaghat ki jaye wo paak ho gayi."
"2712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo bulane wala gumrahi ki taraf bulaye aur us ki pairwi ki jaye to us par un ke gunahon jaisa hoga jo ¤ us ki pairwi karein, aur un ke gunahon mein se kuch kam nahi hoga; aur tum mein se jo bulane wala hidayat ki taraf bulaye aur us ki pairwi ki jaye to us ke liye un ke ajr jaisa hoga jo us ki pairwi karein, aur un ke ajr mein se kuch kam nahi hoga."
"2713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo charwaha apni riaya se dhoka kare wo aag mein hai."
"2714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis aadmi ko Allah ne ilm diya aur us ne use chhupaya to Allah use qayamat ke din aag ki lagam dalega."
"2715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi kisi aadmi ko umra de us ke liye aur us ki aulad ke liye, to wo us ke liye aur us ki aulad mein se jo waaris ho us ke liye wirse mein hogi."
"2716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi kisi aadmi ke liye umra de us ke liye aur us ki aulad ke liye, to wo us ke liye hai jise di gayi, us ki taraf wapas nahi hogi jis ne di."
"2717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi muflis ho aur koi aadmi apna saman us ke paas us ki ain ke saath paye to wo ghairon se us ka zyada haqdar hai."
"2718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi qaum ki imamat kare is haal mein ke wo use na-pasand karte hon to us ki namaz us ke kanon se aage nahi barhegi."
"2719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi saman beche aur apna saman us ki ain ke saath kisi aadmi ke paas paye is haal mein ke wo muflis ho gaya ho aur us ne us ki qeemat mein se kuch qabz na kiya ho to wo us ke liye hai; aur agar us ne us ki qeemat mein se ¤ kuch qabz kiya ho to wo qarz-khwahon ke barabar hai."
"2720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi saman beche phir khareedne wala muflis ho jaye aur bechne wale ne us ki qeemat mein se kuch qabz na kiya ho aur wo apna saman us ki ain ke saath paye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai; aur agar khareedne wala mar jaye to saman wala qarz-khwahon ke barabar hai."
"2721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi nikle ke meri ummat ke darmiyan phoot dale to us ki gardan maro."
"2722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi zameen mein se baalisht bhar zulm kare to Allah taala use paband karega ke use khode yahan tak ke saat zameenon mein se aakhri tak pahunche, phir qayamat ke din use tauq pehnayega yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla ho jaye."
"2723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi aazad ya londi se zina kare to bachcha zina ka bachcha hai, na waaris hoga na us ka waaris hoga."
"2724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi apne wuzu ki taraf khara ho namaz ka irada karke phir apni hatheliyan dhoye to us ka gunah us ki hatheliyon se pehle qatre ke saath utrega; phir jab apna chehra dhoye to us ka gunah us ki samaat aur basarat se pehle qatre ke saath utrega; phir jab apne donon haath kuhniyon tak aur apne donon pair takhnon tak dhoye to har gunah se mehfooz ho jayega jo us ke liye hai aur har khata se, us din ki hai'at jaisa jis din us ki maan ne use jana tha ¤. Phir jab namaz ke liye khara ho to Allah azza wa jal use us se aik darja buland karega; aur agar baithe to mehfooz baitha."
"2725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo aadmi apni sharmgah chhue to wuzu kare, aur tum mein se jo aurat apni sharmgah chhue to wuzu kare."
"2726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo Musalman aadmi kisi Musalman aadmi ko aazad kare to beshak Allah taala us ki har haddi ke badle use aazad karne wale ki har haddi se aag se bachao banayega; aur tum mein se jo aurat kisi Musalman aurat ko aazad kare to beshak Allah taala us ki har haddi ke badle use aazad karne wali ki har haddi se qayamat ke din aag se bachao banayega."
"2727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo Musalman aadmi kisi Musalman aadmi ko kafir kahe, phir agar wo kafir hua to theek warna wo khud kafir hoga."
"2728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis aadmi ko maine apne ghusse mein gaali di ya laanat ki, kyunke main Adam ki aulad mein se hun, ghussa karta hun jaisa tum ghussa karte ho, aur beshak mujhe Allah ne Aalamin ke liye rehmat bhejha hai, to use un ke liye qayamat ke din namaz banaunga."
"2729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo bachcha hajj kare phir bulooghat ko pahunche to us par dusra hajj lazim hai; aur tum mein se jo dehati hajj kare phir hijrat kare to us par dusra hajj lazim hai; aur tum mein se jo ghulam hajj kare phir aazad kiya jaye to us par dusra hajj lazim hai."
"2730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo mehmaan qaum ke paas utre aur mehmaan subah mehroom ho to us ke liye hai ke ¤ apni mehmaan-nawazi ke andaze par le le aur us par koi harj nahi."
"2731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo ghulam apne aaqaon se bhaage wo kafir hua yahan tak ke un ki taraf wapas aaye."
"2732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo ghulam us mein se kuch paye jis se Allah ne mana kiya phir us par us ki hadd qayam ki jaye to Allah us gunah ko mita dega."
"2733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo ghulam apne ghar walon ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare wo badkaar hai."
"2734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo ghulam apne aaqaon ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare wo zaani hai."
"2735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo ghulam sau uqiya par mukatib ho aur das uqiya ke siwa ada kare wo ghulam hai; aur tum mein se jo ghulam sau deenar par mukatib ho aur das deenar ke siwa ada kare wo ghulam hai."
"2736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo ghulam apne bhaagne mein mare wo aag mein dakhil hoga agarche Allah taala ki raah mein qatl kiya gaya ho."
"2737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis basti mein aao aur us mein thehro to us mein tumhara hissa hai; aur tum mein se jo basti Allah aur us ke Rasool ki nafarmani kare to us ka khums Allah aur us ke Rasool ke liye hai, phir wo tumhare liye hai."
"2738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo qaum baithe aur bethna lamba kare phir Allah taala ka zikr karne ya apne nabi par durood bhejne se pehle muntashir ho to un par Allah ki taraf se naraazgi hogi; agar chahe unhein azab de aur agar chahe unhein bakhsh de."
"2739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo Musalman Allah ki raah mein teer phenke aur wo khata kare ya lag jaye to us ke liye ajr mein se hai jaise gardan jo us ne Aulad-e-Ismail mein se aazad ki; aur tum mein se jo aadmi Allah ki raah mein burha ho wo us ke liye noor hai; aur tum mein se jo aadmi kisi Musalman aadmi ko aazad kare to aazad karne wale ka har uzv aazad hone wale ke har uzv ke badle aag se fidya hai; aur tum mein se jo aadmi khara ho is haal mein ke namaz ka irada kare aur wuzu ko us ki jagahon tak pahunchaye to har gunah aur khata se mehfooz ho jayega jo us ke liye hai; phir agar namaz ke liye khara ho to Allah taala use us se aik darja buland karega, aur agar lete to mehfooz leta."
"2740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jis Musalman ke liye chaar khair ki gawahi dein Allah use jannat mein dakhil karega, ya teen ya do."
"2741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo do Musalman milein aur un mein se aik apne saathi ka haath pakre aur musafeha karein aur dono mil kar Allah taala ki hamd karein to juda honge is haal mein ke un ke darmiyan koi gunah nahi hoga."
"2742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, Allah se daro aur talab mein ahsand andaz ikhtiyar karo; kyunke koi jaan nahi maregi yahan tak ke apni rozi poori kar le agarche us se dair ho; pas Allah se daro aur talab mein ahsand andaz ikhtiyar karo; jo halal hai lo aur jo haram hai chhoro."
"2743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, jab ye din ho to ghusl karo ¤ aur tum mein se har aik apne paas maujood behtareen tel aur khushbu lagaye."
"2744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, beshak Allah pakeeza hai, pakeeza ke siwa qabool nahi karta; aur beshak Allah ne mominon ko us ka hukm diya jis ka rasoolon ko hukm diya tha. Farmaya ke ae rasoolo, pakeeza cheezon mein se khao aur naik amal karo, beshak main janta hun jo tum karte ho. Aur farmaya ke ae iman walo, us pakeeza mein se khao jo ham ne tumhein diya. Phir us aadmi ka zikr kiya jo safar lamba kare, paragan-da ghubaar-aalood ho, apne donon haath aasman ki taraf phailaye: Ae Rab, ae Rab; is haal mein ke us ka khana haram, peena haram, pehnawa haram aur haram se pala gaya ho; pas use kaise qabool kiya jayega."
"2745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, beshak mere tum mein bhai aur dost thay; aur beshak main Allah ki taraf bari hun ke tum mein mera koi khaleel ho; aur agar main apni ummat mein se kisi ko khaleel banata to Abu Bakr ko khaleel banata. Aur beshak mere Rab ne mujhe khaleel banaya hai jaisa Ibrahim ko khaleel banaya tha. Khabardar, beshak tum se pehle wale apne ambiya aur nek logon ki qabron ko masjidein banate thay; khabardar, qabron ko masjidein na banao, main tumhein is se mana karta hun."
"2746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, beshak nabuwat ki khushkhabriyon mein se siwaye naik khwab ke kuch baqi nahi raha jo Musalman dekhe ya us ke liye dekha jaye. Khabardar, beshak mujhe ruku ya sajde mein Quran parhne se mana kiya gaya hai; raha ruku to us mein Rab ki buzrugi bayan karo, raha sajda to us mein dua mein koshish karo kyunke laiq hai ke tumhare liye qabool ki jaye."
"2747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, tum par darmiyana rawi lazim hai, tum par darmiyana rawi lazim hai; kyunke Allah taala nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao."
"2748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, maine tum mein wo chhor diya hai ke agar tum use loge to kabhi gumrah nahi hoge: Allah ki kitab aur meri itrat mere ghar wale."
"2749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, tumhara ye karna hamesha raha yahan tak ke maine samjha ke tum par farz ki jayegi; pas tum par apne gharon mein namaz lazim hai kyunke aadmi ki behtareen namaz us ke ghar mein hai siwaye farz namaz ke."
"2750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae logo, dushman se milne ki tamanna na karo aur Allah se aafiyat mango; phir jab un se milo to sabr karo aur jaan lo ke jannat talwaron ke saaye tale hai. Ae Allah, kitab utarne wale, badal chalane wale, girohon ko shikast dene wale, unhein shikast de aur un par hamari madad kar."
"2751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lene wala aur dene wala sood mein barabar hain."
"2752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ab maidan garam ho gaya."
"2753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ab us ki khaal par thandak aa gayi."
"2754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ab ham un par hamla karenge aur wo ham par hamla nahi karenge."
"2755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nishaniyan dhage mein piroi hui motiyon ki tarah hain; pas dhaga toot gaya to baaz baaz ke peechhe aayengi."
"2756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Surah Baqara ki aakhri do aayatein; jis ne unhein raat mein parha wo use kafi hongi."
"2757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Imam Quraish mein se honge: un ke naik hukmaran un ke naikon par aur un ke fajir hukmaran un ke fajiron par; aur agar tum par Quraish Habshi kata-naak ghulam muqarrar karein to us ke liye suno aur itaat karo jab tak tum mein se koi apne Islam aur apni gardan marne ke darmiyan ikhtiyar na diya jaye; phir agar use apne ¤ Islam aur apni gardan marne ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya jaye to apni gardan aage kare."
"2758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Imam Quraish mein se honge aur un ke liye tum par haq hai aur tumhare liye un jaisa hai, jab tak wo rehem mangein to rehem karein, jab faisla karein to insaf karein aur jab ehad karein to wafa karein; pas un mein se jo aisa na kare us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki laanat hai; us se na badla qabool hoga na insaf."
"2759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masid se zyada door phir zyada door azeem ajr wala hai."
"2760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Unt apne walon ke liye izzat hain, bakriyan barkat hain aur khair ghoro ki peshaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak bandhi hui hai."
"2761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ismid aankh ko jila deta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"2762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ehsan ye hai ke Allah ki ibadat karo goya tum use dekhte ho; phir agar tum use nahi dekhte to wo tumhein dekhta hai."
"2763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chaar behnein: Maimuna, Umm-e-Fazl, Salma aur Asma bint Umais jo un ki maan ki taraf se behn hain, mominat hain."
"2764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Azaan unnees kalime hai aur iqamat satrah kalime hai."
"2765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Donon kaan sar mein se hain."
"2766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen Allah ki zameen hai aur bande Allah ke bande hain; jis ne murda zameen zinda ki wo us ke liye hai."
"2767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saari zameen masjid hai siwaye qabrastan aur hammam ke."
"2768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Roohein jama kiye gaye lashkar hain; un mein se jo aapas mein pehchan rakhein ulfat karti hain aur jo aapas mein anjaan hon ikhtilaf karti hain."
"2769","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband aadhi pindli tak ya takhnon tak hai; is se neeche mein koi khair nahi."
"2770","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tehband, qameez aur amame mein latkana; jis ne in mein se kuch takabbur se latkaya Allah qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahi dekhega."
"2771","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ijazat mangna teen baar hai; phir agar tumhein ijazat di jaye warna wapas jao."
"2772","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Istijmar taaq hai, jamron ko kankari marna taaq hai, Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai taaq hai, tawaf taaq hai; aur jab tum mein se koi istijmar kare to taaq se istijmar kare."
"2773","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Istinja teen patharon se hai jin mein gobar nahi."
"2774","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam: namaz qayam karna, zakaat dena, Baitullah ka hajj karna, Ramazan ke mahine ke roze rakhna aur janabat se ghusl karna hai."
"2775","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ye hai ke gawahi do ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, namaz qayam karo, zakaat do, Ramazan ke roze rakho aur Baitullah ka hajj karo agar us ki taraf raaste ki taqat rakho."
"2776","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ye hai ke Allah ki ibadat karo aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karo, namaz qayam karo, farz zakaat do, Ramazan ke roze rakho aur Baitullah ka hajj karo."
"2777","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam use gira deta hai jo us se pehle tha."
"2778","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam buland hota hai aur us par buland nahi hua jata."
"2779","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Daant barabar hain, samne ka daant aur daarh barabar hain."
"2780","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Daant barabar hain, paanch paanch."
"2781","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shar-pasandi shar hai."
"2782","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ungliyan barabar hain, das das unt."
"2783","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ungliyan barabar hain, un sab mein das unt hain."
"2784","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ungliyan barabar hain aur daant barabar hain, samne ka daant aur daarh barabar hain, ye aur ye barabar hain, yani angootha aur chhoti ungli."
"2785","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zyada maal wale qayamat ke din neeche wale honge siwaye us ke jo maal se aise aise kahe aur use pakeeza se kamaye."
"2786","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Imam zamin hai; phir agar wo achha kare to us ke liye aur un ke liye hai, aur agar bura kare to us par hai aur un par nahi."
"2787","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Imam zamin hai aur muazzin ameen hai. Ae Allah, imamon ko hidayat de aur muazzinon ko bakhsh de."
"2788","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hukmaran Quraish mein se honge jab tak wo tum mein teen par amal karein: jab un se rehem manga jaye to rehem karein, jab taqseem karein to barabari karein aur jab faisla karein to insaf karein."
"2789","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Muamla is se zyada tez hai."
"2790","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ambiya apni qabron mein zinda hain, namaz parhte hain."
"2791","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar naara hain aur log lihaaf hain; aur agar log kisi wadi ya ghati ka rukh karein aur Ansar kisi wadi ka rukh karein to main Ansar ki wadi mein chalunga; aur agar hijrat na hoti to main Ansar mein se aik aadmi hota."
"2792","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar meri kokh aur meri topi-dan hain; aur beshak log zyada honge aur wo kam honge; pas un ke nek kaar se qabool karo aur un ke bura kaar se darguzar karo."
"2793","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar, Muzaina, Juhaina, Ghifar, Ashja aur jo Bani Abd-ud-Dar mein se ho, logon ke baghair dost hain; aur Allah aur us ka Rasool un ka dost hai."
"2794","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Haath teen hain: Allah ka haath sab se uncha, dene wale ka haath jo us ke baad hai aur mangne wale ka haath sab se neeche; pas fazil do aur apne aap se aajiz na ho."
"2795","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman: sabr aur narmi hai."
"2796","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman: ye hai ke Allah par, us ke farishton par, us ki kitab par, us se milne par, us ke rasoolon par iman lao aur aakhri uthaye jane par iman lao."
"2797","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman: ye hai ke Allah par, us ke farishton par, us ki kitabon par, us ke rasoolon par, aakhirat ke din par iman lao aur taqdeer ke khair aur shar par iman lao."
"2798","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman: ye hai ke Allah par, us ke farishton par, us ki kitabon par, us ke rasoolon par iman lao, jannat aur aag par, tarazu par iman lao, maut ke baad uthaye jane par iman lao aur taqdeer ke khair aur shar par iman lao."
"2799","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman sattar se kuch upar darwaze hain; us ka sab se adna raaste se takleef door karna hai aur us ka sab se uncha La ilaha illallah kehna hai."
"2800","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman sattar se kuch upar shaakhein hain; us ka sab se afzal La ilaha illallah kehna hai aur us ka sab se adna raaste se takleef door karna hai; aur haya iman mein se aik shaakh hai."
"2801","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman saath se kuch upar shaakhein hain aur haya iman mein se aik shaakh hai."
"2802","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman dhoke se qatl ko rokta hai; momin dhoke se qatl nahi karta."
"2803","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman Yaman ki taraf hai."
"2804","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman Yaman ki taraf hai; khabardar, beshak sakhti aur dilon ki motayi unton ki dumon ki jadon ke paas khet walon mein hai jahan se shaitan ke do seeng nikalte hain, Rabeea aur Muzar mein."
"2805","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman Yaman ki taraf hai aur fitna yahan aur yahan hai jahan se shaitan ka seeng nikalta hai."
"2806","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iman Yaman ki taraf hai aur kufr mashriq ki taraf hai; sukoon bakri walon ke liye hai, fakhr aur riya khet walon mein hai jo ghoro aur oon wale hain ¤. Maseeh aayega; jab wo Uhud ke peechhe aaye to farishte us ka chehra Sham ki taraf pher denge aur wahin wo halak hoga."
"2807","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dayen phir dayen."
"2808","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dayen wale, dayen wale, dayen wale."
"2809","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghair-shadi-shuda aurat apne aap ki zyada haqdar hai apne wali se; aur kunwari se us ke aap ke baare mein ijazat li jayegi aur us ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai."
